window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3301,"title":"Chapter 3301 - World-Shaking Battle (Part Three)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","Experts who had never comprehended the principles of space-time were unable to sense the existence of other principles in this world of space-time. Naturally, the amount of principle energy they could mobilize would be greatly reduced, and their battle prowess would be weakened to a certain extent.","However, it must be known that amongst the experts from both camps, the experts from the Temporal Temple had all comprehended the principles of space-time. Their battle prowess in this world of space-time would be able to display better. As for the experts from the three great Saint Realms...only a few of them had truly comprehended the principles of time and space, and their battle power would be weakened to a certain extent.","This could reduce the gap between the powers of both sides to a large extent.","It was like a powerful domain technique, which could suppress the other side’s power and at the same time increase the other side’s power.","The difference was that domain techniques or true treasures could be used to fight with other domain true treasures of the same level, making it impossible for both sides to gain an advantage.","However, the reincarnation world created by the Mountain River Map could directly change the world and change the surrounding environment. There was no way to use other methods to counter such a technique. The three great Saint Realms could not do anything about it, they could not do anything about it either.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what a great method!”","“This world of spacetime is of great help to us.”","“Haha, everyone, let’s kill them!”","After the Principles Masters on the side of the Temporal Temple felt the wonders of this world of spacetime, they were overjoyed and their morale soared. Originally, the Temporal Temple had been at an absolute disadvantage in the battle, but because of the appearance of the spacetime world, the gap between the two sides became even again.","That’s right, it was equal.","The use of the Samsara world in this battle was almost comparable to the use of the ten Principles Masters.","However, after using the Samsara world and changing the situation on the battlefield, Jian Wushuang’s expression was still extremely cold. His narrow eyes faintly flickered with a fierce light. He slowly extended his right hand to the back with a clang, the Blood Mountain Sword had already been unsheathed, and an extraordinary aura swept out from his body.","Jian Wushuang’s saint-level aura was too conspicuous on the battlefield that was filled with rule masters.","Almost the moment Jian Wushuang revealed his aura, a large number of people had already looked at him.","“What is Heavenly Sword Marquis planning to do?”","“He revealed his aura and pulled out his magic weapon. Is Heavenly Sword Marquis planning to fight his way into the battlefield?”","“Fight his way into the battlefield?”","“He is overestimating himself. After all, he is only an Immortal Saint. Although he defeated a Principles Master before, that Principles Master had just made a breakthrough and had only mastered one part of the power of will. But now, the weakest people in the battle are experts in the second void realm who have mastered two parts of the power of will. There are even experts in the third and fourth void realms. Under such circumstances, if he stupidly charged into the battlefield, he would be courting death!”","“That’s right. Now, the experts of the Temporal Temple are blocking the experts of the three Saint Realms for him. He only needs to continue to activate the experts of the temporal world to assist the Temporal Temple. However, if he rushes into the battlefield, the experts of the Temporal Temple will no longer be able to take care of him. Instead, this will give the three Saint Realms a chance to kill him.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis shouldn’t be so stupid, right?”","The experts watching the battle outside the Saha Island were all discussing.","However, just as they were talking about this, suddenly... Jian Wushuang, who was in the center of the battlefield and under the protection of the experts of the Temporal Temple, suddenly moved and directly dashed forward.","This scene made the experts watching the battle widen their eyes.","“Is Heavenly Sword Marquis really crazy?”","“He’s an Immortal Saint. Does he really want to participate in the battle?”","“He’s courting death. He’s courting death!”","Many experts said one after another.","Even the experts from the Temporal Temple were shocked by Jian Wushuang’s sudden action.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“Kid, don’t be rash!”","Ba Cang and Master Hunyuan shouted at the same time. As for Temple Master Bai Xing, she could not pay attention to this because she was in a fierce battle with Star River Master. Otherwise, she would be angry.","However, their shouting was obviously over. Jian Wushuang had appeared on the battlefield in front of him.","His appearance made the eight Principles Masters of the three Saint Realms on the battlefield overjoyed.","“Haha, this kid didn’t hide among the experts of the Temporal Temple. How could he stupidly rush in front of us?”","“Humph, since he wants to die, then he can’t blame us.”","“Seven Leaves, Calamity, you two are the closest to him. Come and kill him immediately. The rest of you, stop the Temporal Temple!”","The eight Principles Masters from the three Saint Realms immediately divided their tasks.","Six of them were responsible for keeping the experts from the Temporal Temple busy, while Seven Leaves and Calamity took the opportunity to attack Jian Wushuang.","Seven Leaves had comprehended one principle and opened his own heaven and earth mystic realm. He was an expert in the second realm of the void.","As for Calamity, he had comprehended two rules at the same time and reached the third realm of void.","The two people attacked one after the other.","“Haha, boy, die!” Seven Leaves appeared in front of Jian Wushuang first, he held a double-edged axe in his hand. The double-edged axe was red as if it had just been taken out of lava. The shadow of the axe moved, and a hot and violent aura filled the sky.","Whoosh!","The axe shadow slashed out, and the hot power evaporated the air in front of him, forming a red light shadow that slashed toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang raised his head. When he saw the axe shadow, his pupils constricted, and his divine power surged. He immediately used his life magic power.","“Wushuang Sword manual, Xi Xiang!”","Facing the attack of an expert in the second realm of the void, Jian Wushuang did not show any fancy moves. He directly used his most powerful attack to meet the attack.","Bang!","A low collision sound was heard, accompanied by a large amount of red flames that spread out in all directions.","Jian Wushuang lowered his arm slightly and took a step back. However, the attack of the Seven Leaves had already disintegrated, and his hand movements had also stopped temporarily.","Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed and disappeared in front of Seven Leaves. When he reappeared, he was already behind Seven Leaves.","“Bloody blade swordsmanship, first move of blood drop!”","A streak of blood-red light flashed in the void like a drop of blood. It was so cold that seven leaf master could not help but change his expression.","Seven Leaves was a Principles Master in the second realm of the void. Naturally, he could see through Jian Wushuang’s shadowless escape technique and knew that Jian Wushuang was behind him. However, the speed of Jian Wushuang’s blood drop swordsmanship was too fast!"]},{"number":3302,"title":"Chapter 3302 - Earth-Shattering Battle (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","_________","Swish!","The dazzling blood light was incredibly fast.","Seven Leaves could only barely swing his axe backward, barely colliding with the blood light. After a sound of collision, Seven Leaves directly retreated to the nearby void.","Jian Wushuang and seven leaf master had a head-on confrontation. In a short moment, Seven Leaves was sent flying.","However, before Jian Wushuang could be happy, Calamity appeared in front of him with a golden long staff in his hand. It was so powerful...an aura that was even stronger than Seven Leaves came pressing down from the Calamity’s body. The power of the golden long staff in his hand suddenly soared.","Like a golden thunderbolt, it crushed everything in front of it and smashed toward Jian Wushuang’s head.","“The third realm of the Void Realm?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and glanced at Calamity.","If it was just the second realm of the Void Realm, he could easily deal with it with his own strength and life divine power. However, the third realm of the Void Realm was enough for Jian Wushuang to show his trump card.","“Heaven-cleaving skill!”","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang immediately performed the heaven-cleaving skill.","In an instant, the supreme life pressure, which came from a perfect life form, swept out from Jian Wushuang’s body and swept in all directions.","This supreme life pressure immediately pressed on the body of Calamity.","“What is this?” Calamity’s expression suddenly changed. He had already performed the golden long staff, but its power was greatly weakened in an instant.","Jian Wushuang had also attacked.","“Peerless sword technique, Emperor’s blood kill!”","Whoosh!","A shocking blood-red sword shadow, with the power of Jian Wushuang’s two wills and the monstrous power of the heaven-cleaving skill, directly attacked. As soon as the Sword Shadow appeared...all of a sudden, the surrounding space-time froze. Then, endless space-time pressure crazily pressed toward Calamity.","The pressure of space-time and the pressure of an ultimate life form were superimposed on each other!","Calamity felt as if a huge mountain weighing hundreds of millions of kilograms had suddenly appeared on his body, causing his movements to slow down. Meanwhile, the golden long rod that he used was already weakened to a certain extent, at this moment, it actually weakened quite a bit.","In the end, that shocking blood-colored sword shadow finally collided head-on with the ‘golden thunderbolt’ that he used.","The Principles Master of the three realms of the void was supposed to crush the Immortal Saint in a head-on collision, but...bang!","After the loud sound, Calamity’s body shook violently.","“How is this possible?”","Calamity roared, but then he felt a sweet taste in his throat. He spat out a mouthful of blood and retreated backward.","Calamity and Jian Wushuang collided head-on, but Calamity was crushed and spat out blood?","“How could this be?”","“Impossible, this is impossible!”","“My God, what did I see?”","“An Immortal Saint sent Seven Leaves of the void second realm flying, but now he’s beaten Calamity of the void third realm into vomiting blood with one sword strike? Are you kidding me?”","“Is Heavenly Sword Marquis really just an Immortal Saint?”","The experts watching the battle outside the Saha Island were in a daze. Their eyes were wide open in disbelief.","They were already very shocked when they found out that Jian Wushuang had defeated Silver Wolf in the Blood Wave Realm.","However, although Silver Wolf was also a Principles Master, he had just made a breakthrough and had only grasped one part of the power of his will. When they thought of Jian Wushuang’s heaven-defying ability to cross realms, they could barely accept it.","But now...Calamity was a Principles Master in the three realms of the void. He had grasped three parts of the power of his will at the same time, which was far beyond Silver Wolf’s ability. However, Calamity was struck by Jian Wushuang’s sword until he vomited blood?","How strong was Heavenly Sword Marquis?","Everyone was in a state of shock, but at this moment, a sudden change occurred!","“Look, look at the sky!”","A sudden exclamation exploded in the void, causing many experts present to raise their heads.","Jian Wushuang also sensed something and looked up at the void above.","In the void above, the scroll world created by the Mountain River Map still existed, but in the center of the scroll world, or more accurately, in the upper part of the scroll world, a vast and surging power began to condense.","This power contained a supreme aura, as if it wanted to dominate everything in the world!","A supreme will had also descended!","When they sensed this will’s power, countless experts present were stunned!","“Heavenly Dao! It’s the Heavenly Dao!”","“The power of the Heavenly Dao’s will?”","“The supreme power of the Heavenly Dao’s will has actually descended?”","The hearts of many experts surged with great waves.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao had always been an extremely special existence. It represented the Heavenly Dao and ruled over everything.","For example, behind the three great Saint Realms, there were figures with the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao.","And in the Divine Beginning Realm, whenever an existence that the Heavenly Dao could not tolerate appeared, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao would appear and wipe them out. However, there were too few existences that the Heavenly Dao could not tolerate, therefore, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao rarely took the initiative to condense.","However, now that the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao had arrived, and the power condensed was unprecedented, it was clear that there was an existence on the battlefield that the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao could not tolerate and had to be eliminated.","And this existence was undoubtedly Jian Wushuang!","Boom! Crack!","A deafening sound reverberated in the void. The experts present felt as if their eardrums were about to burst completely.","Heaven and earth had also been forcefully cracked open. A giant electric snake with a diameter of 100 meters descended from the nine heavens.","This electric snake was born for destruction.","It represented the supreme will of the Heavenly Dao!","It represented the power to wipe out everything!","It also represented the heavenly punishment!","Boom!","The void shattered and collapsed crazily. Jian Wushuang stood at the center of the battlefield while the destructive electric snake directly rushed toward him.","“The power of the will of heaven...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes shone with an endless cold light. When the electric snake appeared above his head, he smiled coldly, and an indomitable fighting spirit soared into the sky.","Jian Wushuang raised the Blood Mountain Sword in his hands at the same time, and endless divine power gathered crazily in his hands.","At this moment, he felt an unprecedented calmness in his heart.","It was not the first time he faced the power of the will of heaven. Previously, he could only escape in a sorry state, but this time, he would not escape!","“Since heaven wants to kill me, I will kill this heaven!”"]},{"number":3303,"title":"Chapter 3303 - Earth-Shattering Battle (Part Five)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","_______","Whoosh!","The Heaven-cleaving skill was used again!","The Heaven-cleaving skill, in the name of Heaven-cleaving, eliminated the Heavenly Dao. This was the purpose of this divine power.","Countless years ago, Jian Wushuang’s master Xuan Yi had galloped through heaven and earth, vowing to kill this heaven. The Heaven-cleaving skill he had created was not only to use the innate advantage of his perfect life as much as possible! At the same time, this divine power was specifically aimed at the first level of the power of the will of heaven!","If the Heaven-cleaving skill was used to fight against a cultivator, it was enough to give Jian Wushuang an additional portion of the power of the will.","However, if Jian Wushuang was fighting against the heaven, the Heaven-cleaving skill would improve his strength far more than a portion of the power of the will could compare to!","Boom!","The sword light directly cut into the giant electric snake with a diameter of 100 meters. A large amount of electric light frantically spread out in all directions, but the electric snake was directly cut by the sword light from the center, this by the will of the will of the heavenly power of the terrifying electric snake, a moment will collapse.","But the sword shadow is not reduced, directly cut to the top of the endless void.","There, the will of the Heavenly Dao condensed power, but with the sword light cut, weng! World turbulence, a huge devour all of the vortex appeared out of thin air.","The vortex swallowed up all the power, only slowly dissipated after a long time, and that piece of void has completely calmed down, the supreme will of the heavenly power has disappeared.","“Disappeared? Disappeared?”","“The power of the will of the Heavenly Dao was defeated by a frontal attack?”","“The power of the will of the Heavenly Dao was defeated by a frontal attack? Only an expert of the fifth level of the void could do that, right?”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis has the battle strength of the fifth level of the Void? How is that possible?”","Countless people cried out in surprise. They did not dare to believe the scene in front of them.","The power of the will of the Heavenly Dao did not pose much of a threat to some powerful Principles Masters. After all, the will of the Heavenly Dao itself had too many restrictions. However, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao represented the punishment of the heavens...to defeat the power of the will of heaven head-on, it indeed required the strength of the fifth void realm.","However, what everyone present did not know was that although Jian Wushuang did not have the battle strength of the fifth void realm, his Heaven-cleaving skill specifically targeted the power of the will of heaven. With Jian Wushuang’s current strength...although he still could not fully unleash the power of the Heaven-cleaving skill, even if he only used a part of it, with his current battle strength that was no less than the third void realm, it was enough to disperse the power of the will of heaven.","“Fortunately, my strength has greatly increased in the Blood Wave Temple, and my divine power has also increased a lot. Previously, every time I used the Heaven-cleaving skill, it was a huge burden for me and I could not use it again in a short period of time. But now, it is much easier for me to use the Heaven-cleaving skill. After a big battle, I can barely use it a few times,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","After the power of the will of heaven was dispersed, Jian Wushuang looked at the surrounding battlefield again.","“Kill!”","With a low roar, Jian Wushuang directly used the shadowless escape art and moved freely in the battlefield.","The shadowless escape art was shadowless and traceless, which was extremely strange.","Although everyone present was powerful and could sense his presence, his position changed surprisingly quickly. In addition to this big battle, it was a large-scale chaotic battle, with experts from both sides fighting fiercely, in such a situation, it was absolutely terrifying to have an assassin among them.","“Be careful!”","“Be careful of Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“Bastard, think of a way to kill him!”","Many experts from the three Saint Realms were shocked and furious.","They originally had the advantage in numbers, but because of Jian Wushuang’s spacetime world, the gap between the two sides was completely closed. At this time, Jian Wushuang relied on his own assassination ability to wantonly assassinate on the battlefield, it made the experts of the three Saint Realms feel threatened.","Their original goal was to kill Jian Wushuang, but now, it was difficult for them to find an opportunity to kill Jian Wushuang. If one or two people attacked alone, they could not do anything to Jian Wushuang.","It could be said that because of Jian Wushuang’s attack, the situation of the battle began to favor the Temporal Temple’s side.","However, the situation only lasted for a short while before Jian Wushuang was faced with a crisis.","“Little guy, you have entered the battlefield unscrupulously. Don’t you think too little of the three Saint Realms?” A gentle voice rang out, and a black-robed figure had unknowingly arrived beside Jian Wushuang.","Upon hearing this voice, Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted. “The Sky Nether Master?”","That was right, it was Sky Nether Master.","Sky Nether Master, Star River Master, and eight treasures master led the experts to kill Jian Wushuang. Star River Master and Temple Master Bai Xing fought fiercely, while eight treasures master fought with Ba Cang. Only he...was not a suitable opponent.","After all, among the experts from the Temporal Temple, only Ba Cang, an expert of the fifth void realm, was here. The other strongest Master Hunyuan was only at the peak of the fourth void realm. As the battle began...Sky Nether Master first fought with Master Hunyuan. With the help of the spacetime world, Master Hunyuan was able to hold on for a while. However, this was because Sky Nether Master had not used his full strength.","Not long after Jian Wushuang rushed into the battlefield, Sky Nether Master immediately broke away from Master Hunyuan and approached Jian Wushuang.","Seeing the Sky Nether Master coming to Jian Wushuang’s side, the experts of the three Saint Realms were naturally overjoyed. On the other hand, the people of the Temporal Temple changed their expressions.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, retreat!” Ba Cang immediately shouted.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, come to me!” Chaos Master also shouted. In the current battlefield, only he could spare his hands to barely block the Sky Nether Master. Jian Wushuang’s best choice was to approach him.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang dashed toward Master Hunyuan.","Seeing this, Sky Nether Master smiled evilly. “Do you want to retreat now? Is it too late?”","Whoosh!","A black shadow whistled through the void. Like a ghost, Sky Nether Master appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. At the same time, his shriveled right hand slowly stretched out and turned into a sharp claw, it was continuously magnified in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Jian Wushuang instantly sensed the difference in strength between the two. He could not resist the claw at all.","Seeing that the Sky Nether Master’s sharp claw was about to grab his head, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. A crystal pearl had appeared in his hand out of nowhere. The surface of the pearl contained a layer of special power.","Jian Wushuang exerted force with his wrist and directly crushed the pearl. In an instant, a surge of power burst out from the exploded pearl!","...."]},{"number":3304,"title":"Chapter 3304 - World-Shaking Battle (Part Six)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","Splash!","A large amount of water mist spread out from the pearl. The water mist covered heaven and the earth and contained an extremely strange power. It swept out crazily in the surroundings.","The sharp claws of the Sky Nether Master were about to touch Jian Wushuang, but because of the appearance of the water mist, the sharp claws seemed to be grabbing onto a ball of cotton. There was no point of force, and the water mist spread crazily, in the blink of an eye, half of the battlefield was filled with mist, forming a huge world of mist.","“This is...” The Sky Nether Master looked at the mist world around him and his pupils shrank. “Shuiyun?”","“Humph, Boy, I didn’t expect you to have some relationship with Palace Master Shuiyun of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. Unfortunately, it’s useless. If Palace Master Shuiyun’s original body was here, I would be a little afraid. But now, it’s only a part of the power left in his special treasure. How can it hurt me and him?”","Sky Nether Master smiled coldly, and a large amount of dark light immediately rose from his body.","Under the guidance of Jian Wushuang, the vast and majestic the world of Shuiyun was...that it crazily swept toward Sky Nether Master. In the blink of an eye, it completely enveloped him because the water fog was dangerous to block, no one knew what happened in the center of the Shuiyun World. Everyone present could only hear a low rumble coming from the Shuiyun World.","After a while, the sounds disappeared, and the huge water mist world slowly began to dissipate, revealing the scene inside.","Sky Nether Master stood in the void that was previously covered by the water mist. However, his expression was a little gloomy, and his robes were also damaged. He looked a little miserable.","“As expected of the famous secret technique of Palace Master Shuiyun. The power of this Shuiyun World is really amazing.” Sky Nether Master was secretly amazed.","Palace Master Shuiyun of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was at the peak of the five void realms like him. However, Palace Master Shuiyun had obtained a powerful secret skill, the Shuiyun World. With this secret skill...Palace Master Shuiyun could fight an expert of the six void realms head-on. In terms of overall strength, he was naturally stronger than him.","For example, even if Palace Master Shuiyun’s original body had not been present, the Shuiyun World that he had left in the bead still made him quite embarrassed in a short period of time.","While the master was trapped in the Shuiyun World, Jian Wushuang had found an opportunity to join hands with Master Hunyuan.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you really have a lot of trump cards. Previously, you took out the Universe Supreme Treasure, the Mountain River Map, and now, you even took out a treasure that contains the attack of Palace Master Shuiyun.” Hunyuan master looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Not bad.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance thought highly of him. They had let him enter the Heaven-cleaving Mystic Realm and later found out that he was in a dangerous situation. They had specially given him some life-saving methods, including two beads and a purple bamboo leaf, now, he had only used one of the beads.","In terms of life-saving trump cards, he still had a lot of them.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, step back a little. Leave the Sky Nether Master to me,” Master Hunyuan said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He knew that with his current strength, he could at most face an expert at the third realm of the void. But against an expert at the peak of the fifth realm of the enlightenment realm like the Sky Nether Master, he was nothing, he could only flee in embarrassment.","“Sky Nether Master, I’ll be your opponent!” Master Hunyuan fluttered his robe and stood in front of the Sky Nether Master.","“You think you can stop me?” The Sky Nether Master smiled coldly. Previously, he had not used his full strength, which was why the Sky Nether Master could barely hold him back. But now...","“Get lost!”","With a sharp whistle, the Sky Nether Master’s body suddenly expanded. He was originally the size of a normal human, but in the blink of an eye, he had transformed into a boundless divine eagle. The Divine Eagle’s body was pitch-black, and its feathers were as sharp as blades, the surroundings were also surrounded by pitch-black world-destroying lightning.","Xiu!","The Divine Eagle pounced down fiercely as if it was hunting its prey. Its two sharp claws clawed out at the same time, and its frenzied fingertips swept through the void, causing the air to produce the sound of being torn apart.","“Not good!” Master Hunyuan’s expression changed. The instant the Divine Eagle pounced down, he had already felt a power that made him feel suffocated. This power was clearly not something he could withstand.","Bang!","With a loud sound, Hunyuan’s body trembled. That sharp claw seemed to want to tear his divine body apart. At the same time, a large amount of black world-destroying lightning from that sharp claw came toward him, in an instant, it covered his entire body.","Crackling thunder rumbled. Master Hunyuan’s divine body was also heavily injured at this moment. Blood flowed out from his mouth.","“Hoooooo!”","The Condor let out a strange laugh, and then a huge force hit down like a mountain, sending the whole figure of Master Hunyuan flying.","In the process of exchanging blows with the Sky Nether Master and Master Hunyuan who was at the pinnacle of the four states of the Void, was actually sent flying by the Sky Nether Master.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, die!”","The Black Divine Eagle, which had sent Master Hunyuan flying, shot toward Jian Wushuang with killing intent in its eyes.","“Sh*t!” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","He did not expect that Master Hunyuan would be sent flying so easily by Sky Nether Master. Without Master Hunyuan’s protection, he would not be able to face Sky Nether Master alone.","However, Jian Wushuang had been through countless storms. Even when he was in danger, he did not panic at all. Instead, he was absolutely calm, when he saw that the Black Divine Eagle was approaching him without any obstruction, he immediately took out the second bead.","The first bead was refined by Palace Master Shuiyun.","The second bead came from Palace Master Askance!","As the black figure got closer and closer, Jian Wushuang was about to crush the bead, but at this moment...","“Sky Nether, you have been an old man for God knows how many years, but you actually attacked a little guy at the level of Immortal Saint. Aren’t you going too far?” A slightly evil voice suddenly sounded on the battlefield.","The Black Divine Eagle that was originally charging over at high speed immediately stopped the moment it heard this voice. The Divine Eagle dissipated and revealed the gaze of the Sky Nether Master once again. However, at this moment, the expression of the Sky Nether Master had become exceptionally grave, his eyes were also staring fixedly at the person who had appeared in front of him.","This person was a strange old man with a scarlet cape. The old man’s face was thin, and he had a hooked nose. His eyes were very small, just like the eyes of a mouse. Moreover, his eyes were slightly narrowed, giving off an extremely shrewd appearance, the evil smile on the old man’s lips made his entire person seem even more evil.","“Argh!”","Sky Nether Master’s voice was low and deep, and deep fear was revealed from the depths of his eyes!","...."]},{"number":3305,"title":"Chapter 3305 - World-Shaking Battle (Part Seven)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","_____","On the battlefield, the two camps were in a heated battle. However, when the weird old man with the scarlet cape appeared on the battlefield, the huge battlefield suddenly quieted down.","Countless gazes were focused on the weird old man. Most of them were shocked.","“Elder Dark Bone, it’s Elder Dark Bone!”","“It’s him?”","“This old monster is said to be from the same era as the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple, and the heavenly ancestor. He has lived for so many years, and it was said that he had gone to the depths of the universe battlefield to explore. I didn’t expect that he would still stay in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“What is this old monster doing here?”","Exclamations sounded from the crowd around the battlefield.","Elder Dark Bone, who was wearing a scarlet cape, looked around the crowd with his small eyes. He heard the discussions around the battlefield, and the smile on his face grew wider. “I didn’t expect that after so many years, there would still be people who know my name. It’s really rare.”","“Elder Dark Bone.” Sky Nether Master looked straight at him. “Today’s matter is a competition between our three great Saint Realms and the Temporal Temple. It shouldn’t have anything to do with you, right?”","“It doesn’t matter. Indeed, it doesn’t have anything to do with me. Unfortunately, although I don’t want to interfere, I can’t overpower my disciple’s every request.” Elder Dark Bone revealed a helpless expression. His gaze was looking at a corner outside the battlefield, Di Hao, Qian Hongzi, Duan Lang, and other experts from the Temporal Temple were standing there. However, there was one other person besides them.","“Your disciple?” The Sky Nether Master was stunned. He followed Elder Dark Bone’s gaze and looked at the figure.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing behind Elder Dark Bone, immediately looked over. He raised his eyebrows when he saw him.","The person whom Elder Dark Bone was looking at was the Underworld Emperor, who had befriended Jian Wushuang in the Blood Wave Realm!","“Haha, Brother Heavenly Marquis, I owe you a favor. Now, you can return it to me.” A proud smile appeared on Underworld Emperor’s face as his voice spread.","“Underworld Emperor’s master is Elder Dark Bone?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Previously, he had obtained the second Blood Wave Token in the Blood Wave Realm. At that time, Underworld Emperor had given him a favor in exchange for the token. At that time, Jian Wushuang also learned that Underworld Emperor had an extraordinary master behind him, even the Temporal Temple would not dare to underestimate this master.","It was because of this that Temple Master Bai Xing had asked him to agree to the exchange with the Underworld Emperor.","Now, Jian Wushuang finally met the Underworld Emperor’s master, Elder Dark Bone!","Although Jian Wushuang had never heard of Elder Dark Bone before and did not know how strong he was, but he was also called Underworld Bone Master, just from the importance that Temple Master Bai Xing placed on him...Jian Wushuang could guess that Elder Dark Bone must be very powerful. Otherwise, Elder Dark Bone would not be so fearful of him.","“I have lived for so many years and have no family in this world. I don’t even have any good friends. Not long ago, I finally took a fancy to a little guy and accepted him as my personal disciple. It can be said that this little guy is my only family in this world. Therefore, I doted on this little guy,” Elder Dark Bone said with a wicked smile.","“This kid, Heavenly Sword Marquis, has helped my disciple in the Blood Wave Realm and made him owe him a favor. Of course, I have to pay him back. Sky Nether, if you want to kill him, you have to go through me!”","Sky Nether Master’s face suddenly turned ugly.","Among the three experts of the Saint Realm, only he had the time to kill Jian Wushuang. Although the Temporal Temple was blocked, he did not care even if Hunyuan Master appeared, but now, the appearance of Elder Dark Bone...","Elder Dark Bone was an old monster from the same era as the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor. Not long ago, when the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor had not reached the supreme level...Elder Dark Bone was worthy of his name.","Even Sky Nether Master, who had reached the sixth realm of the Void Realm, would be suppressed by such an extraordinary existence.","“Elder Dark Bone, although I really don’t want to fight with you, Heavenly Sword Marquis must die. Therefore, I can only come to you for advice.” Sky Nether Master’s expression was solemn, he had forcefully mustered his courage to say these words.","“Very good. Coincidentally, it has been a long time since I last fought. Let’s warm up today.” Elder Dark Bone smiled slightly, appearing calm and collected.","“Kill!” Sky Nether Master did not waste any more words and directly attacked.","Screech!","The huge black godly eagle once again appeared between heaven and earth. The surface of the godly eagle’s body was surrounded by a large amount of world-destroying lightning. It swooped down and appeared in front of Elder Dark Bone in the blink of an eye. A sharp claw slashed out like lightning, it was incomparably swift and fierce.","Elder Dark Bone had his hands behind his back. It was only when the sharp claw was about to touch his godly body that he slowly stretched out his hand and casually waved it.","This wave was like chasing away a fly. It did not seem to contain much power, but after he waved his hand, hu!","A gust of wind suddenly whistled.","This gust of wind easily shattered the space, and it also blew away the power condensed by the black godly eagle at the first moment. The attack of Sky Nether Master was directly disintegrated, and even the black godly eagle that he had formed was directly dispersed, Sky Nether Master’s figure once again appeared in heaven and earth, but the depths of his eyes were filled with shock.","It was not just him, but all the experts watching the battle in the surroundings were greatly shocked.","“With a casual wave of his hand, Sky Nether Master’s attack was directly disintegrated, and even the black godly eagle that Sky Nether Master had formed with his secret technique was directly dissipated?”","“This, what kind of technique is this?”","“It’s too powerful. The Sky Nether is like a baby in front of him!”","“This is Elder Dark Bone. Although he is only at the peak of the sixth realm of the Void Realm, his strength and skills are unfathomable. It is said that even if he meets the three masters of the Saint Realm, he can barely hold on for a while in a one-on-one situation. But to kill him, even the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple, and the Heaven Ancestor can’t do it themselves!”","Around the battlefield, many experts were amazed.","Jian Wushuang was also shocked.","“No wonder Temple Master Bai Xing said that Underworld Emperor’s favor was worth a Blood Wave Token. His master is so powerful!” Jian Wushuang murmured.","He was glad that he had agreed to exchange conditions with Underworld Emperor and made friends with him, so he had such a powerful ally in this battle.","...."]},{"number":3306,"title":"Chapter 3306 - Earth-Shattering Battle (Part Eight)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","________","On the battlefield, because of the appearance of Elder Dark Bone, he had completely suppressed the Sky Nether Master, so no one from the three Saint Realms had the time to deal with Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, Jian Wushuang relied on the shadowless escape art and the assassination method of the bloody sword art to move freely on the battlefield, which brought great trouble to the rule masters of the three Saint Realms.","The situation on the battlefield was once again in a stalemate.","“The people of the three Saint Realms have been stalled. If this situation continues, the three Saint Realms will probably come back empty-handed again.”","“There’s no other way. The three Saint Realms are already very clever and have sent out many experts. The Temporal Temple could not completely block them, but who would have thought that Heavenly Sword Marquis would have a treasure like the Mountain River Map, which greatly improved the strength of the experts of the Temporal Temple. The appearance of Elder Dark Bone is probably beyond the expectations of the three Saint Realms.”","“No, I don’t think it’s that simple. When the three Saint Realms decided to make their move, they must have already made preparations. Naturally, they have their own ways to deal with this situation. Just wait and see. The methods of the three Saint Realms are definitely not that simple.”","“Right, I think so too. After all, they are the three Saint Realms!”","The surrounding experts casually chatted and expressed their own views on the current situation.","Some people felt that the three great Saint Realms had exhausted all their tricks, but more people felt that the three great Saint Realms had more tricks up their sleeves.","As expected, not long after Elder Dark Bone appeared on the battlefield, the stalemate on the battlefield was once again broken by someone.","“Keke ~ ~ ~ Everyone from the three great Saint Realms, I wonder if we are too late?” A sinister and evil laughter suddenly sounded from the void next to the battlefield. Everyone looked over when they heard the sound and immediately saw the void, a total of eight figures were rushing over.","The eight figures were all covered in black robes, and their appearances could not be seen. However, from the aura they emitted, it seemed that these eight people were all Principles Masters, and their strength was extraordinary, especially the person in the lead...the aura emitted from their bodies was not much weaker than that of Sky Nether Master and Eight Treasures Master, who were at the pinnacle of the five states of the void.","“Hmph, you guys came just in time, huh?” Sky Nether Master glanced at the eight figures as he tried his best to defend against Elder Dark Bone’s attack.","“Haha, I’m sorry. I met with some matters on the way and was delayed. However, everyone, don’t worry. Since the Sect Master has already agreed to act, he won’t go back on his words.” The black-robed man in the lead laughed strangely.","“Sect Master?” Everyone present was stunned before they immediately understood.","“The Sorcerer God Sect!”","“It’s the Sorcerer God Sect!”","“Good heavens, even the Sorcerer God Sect has interfered. Moreover, it seems like the Sorcerer God Sect has reached some sort of agreement with the three great Saint Realms. This time, the Sorcerer God Sect is standing on the side of the three great Saint Realms and is also here for Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","After knowing the identity of the person who came, the crowd around the battlefield once again burst into an uproar.","Although the Sorcerer God Sect was far from being as powerful and terrifying as the three Great Freedom Alliance and the three great Saint Realms in the Divine Beginning Realm, the Sorcerer God Sect’s methods were brilliant, and they also had terrifying strength...they had always been an existence that the experts from all the forces in the Divine Beginning Realm were deeply afraid of.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, almost no force or expert was willing to deal with the Sorcerer God Sect.","But now, the experts of the Sorcerer God Sect had also rushed to the battlefield and stood in the camp of the three great Saint Realms.","And just as the eight experts of the Sorcerer God Sect had arrived at the battlefield...nine figures with thick auras were also rushing over from the void on the other side.","Among the nine figures, six of them were women. They were all extremely beautiful, especially the two in the lead. One was extremely beautiful and charming, while the other was demure and enchanting like a saintess, however, at this moment, the eyes of the two beautiful women were bursting with a shocking killing intent.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, give me back my sixth sister’s life!”","A cold, low voice reverberated between the heaven and earth. From the low voice alone, everyone knew that the person was also coming to kill Jian Wushuang.","“I know that enchanting woman in red. She’s the Third Princess of the Nine-tail Clan, Da Yu. Next to her is her sister, Da Su!”","“The Nine-tail Clan, one of the four great divine clans? Why are they here? And they want to Kill Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“It’s the Nine Palace Saintess. The Nine-tail Clan is here for her!”","“Nine Palace Saintess?”","At the mention of her name, all the experts present came to a sudden realization.","In the Blood Wave Realm, Jian Wushuang killed the Nine Palace Saintess, who was ranked fifth on the True Saint List and became famous in the Divine Beginning Realm. At that time, many people guessed that she was from the Nine-tailed Clan, however, the Nine Palace Saintess herself did not admit it, so the introduction of the Nine Palace Saintess on the True Saint List had always been suspected of being from the Nine-tailed Clan.","Judging from the current situation, the Nine Temple Saintess was not only a member of the Nine-tail Clan, but also the Sixth Princess of the Nine-tail Clan!","The princess was the daughter of the Grandmaster of the Nine-tail Clan. No wonder the Nine-tail Clan had come to kill her.","“Sorry to trouble you.” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","After killing the Nine Temple Saintess, he had learned through Miss Xiao’er that the Nine Temple Saintess was the daughter of the Grandmaster of the Nine-tail Clan. He had guessed that the Nine-tail Clan would definitely seek revenge on him, however, he did not expect the Nine-tailed Clan to be so fast. Moreover, they just happened to catch up with the three great Saint Realms.","Now, because of the arrival of many experts from the Sorcerer God Sect and the Nine-tailed Clan, the situation on the battlefield immediately changed dramatically.","“Everyone from the Nine-tailed Clan, the Sorcerer God Sect and the three great Saint Realms are responsible for tangling the Temporal Temple. As for Heavenly Sword Marquis, I’ll leave him to you to kill. How about it?” The black-robed leader of the Sorcerer God Sect said.","“Okay,” Da Yu agreed without thinking. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, die!”","Boom!","A monstrous aura suddenly swept out. Nine powerful Principles Masters of the nine clans rushed into the battlefield and immediately charged toward Jian Wushuang, although there were no experts in the five void realms who were as powerful as the Heaven Underworld Master or the Eight Treasures Master, the two leaders, Da Yu and Da Su, were in the four void realms.","Especially Da Yu, who had reached the peak of the fourth void realm.","In addition to the other experts in the second and third void realm, this battle strength was obviously not something Jian Wushuang could withstand alone.","Buzz!","Heaven and earth shook. Before the experts of the Nine-tailed Clan arrived in front of Jian Wushuang, a majestic power had already enveloped him.","“Soul attack?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","The Nine-tailed Clan was best at charm and soul!","...."]},{"number":3307,"title":"Chapter 3307 - Earth-Shattering Battle (Part Nine)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","________","“Oh no!” Jian Wushuang’s face suddenly changed.","If it was just a simple soul attack, Jian Wushuang would not take it to heart.","His physique was special, so any soul attack would be ineffective against him. Even if it completely destroyed his soul, he could instantly repair it.","However, if his opponent’s soul attack was accompanied by the charm skill, it would be completely different.","The charm skill was not aimed at the human soul, but at the consciousness!","Jian Wushuang had experienced the charm skill of the Nine-tailed Clan. Previously, in the Blood Wave Realm, the charm skill of the Nine Palace Saintess alone could not affect him. But now, the charm skill was used by Da Yu, who had reached the fourth realm of the void, the charm was many times stronger than the charm of the Nine Temples Saintess.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s state of mind was very strong, under the charm of Da Yu, his state of mind was shaken and his consciousness was about to fall into a daze.","But before his consciousness fell into a daze, he had already taken out the second bead. As the bead broke, the shocking power contained in it immediately burst out.","Of the two beads that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance had given him, one was refined by Palace Lord Shuiyun and had already been used up by him. As for the current bead, it was refined by Palace Lord Askance.","Palace Lord Askance was ranked second among the three Palace Lords of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. In terms of strength, he was even stronger than Palace Lord Shuiyun.","Furthermore, Palace Lord Shuiyun’s strongest secret art, the Shuiyun World, more or less had the effect of trapping and entangling the enemy. Its true might was not particularly powerful, but Palace Lord Askance was famous for his absolute offensive techniques.","Rumble ~ ~ ~","The world trembled as endless black air waves surged up. These black air waves were like rolling devil clouds.","These devil clouds crazily gathered together, forming an extremely enormous devil might.","The devil might was imposing, suppressing everything in the surroundings. And in the center of this devil might, a black devil god that was thirty feet tall was condensed.","“What is this?”","“What a terrifying demonic aura. Isn’t this pressure a little too strong?”","“I’ve seen this Demonic God before. This is the heaven-seeking Demonic God, one of the three Palace Masters of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. It’s the heaven-seeking Demonic God’s famous ultimate move!”","“Heaven-seeking Demonic God? This is the heaven-seeking Demonic God?”","“What a good fellow. Previously, it was Palace Master Shuiyun’s famous ultimate move. Now, it’s the heaven-seeking palace master’s famous ultimate move. What is the relationship between Heavenly Sword Marquis and the Three Palace Masters of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance?”","The experts spectating the battle were all staring in shock at the Black Demonic God that appeared in the middle of the battlefield.","Askance Palace Lord was named after him. This move was even more famous than Shuiyun Palace Lord’s Shuiyun world.","“Askance Palace Lord?” Da Yu, Da Su, and the Principles Masters of the nine-tailed race all frowned as they looked at the Black Demonic God.","Askheaven Empyrean was a peak existence that they did not have the qualifications to interact with.","“Hmph, how about Askheaven Fiendcelestial? You killed my sixth sister. Even if Askheaven Empyrean from the Heaven-cleaving Alliance were to personally come, you will still die!” Da Yu’s voice was cold, her eyes suffused a demonic green light. This green light burst forth like a green sun that illuminated the entire world.","Suddenly, the green light turned into a huge green light beam and shot directly at the Asura Demon God.","“This move...” Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly.","He had seen the same move from the Nine Temples Saintess, but the power of this move was obviously much stronger.","It was not surprising that this move should be the inheritance secret skill of the Nine-tailed Clan. Just like Jian Wushuang was a member of the ancient clan in his previous life, some of the ancient clan’s inheritance secret skills were very powerful.","The Nine-tailed Clan was ranked as one of the four great divine clans as well as the ancient clan, so their strength was naturally extraordinary. The inheritance secret skill of the Nine-tailed Clan, of course, was not weaker than that of the ancient clan, the power of this inheritance secret skill was so strong that it could even pose a threat to some experts of the five void realms.","However, the one standing in front of Da Yu was Askance Demon God, the famous move of Askance Palace Master.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had regained his consciousness. He looked at the green beam of light and his eyes flashed. He immediately began to guide Asura Demon God.","“Break!”","With a low roar, Asura Demon God, who was three meters tall, looked cold and emotionless. Under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, Asura Demon God threw a punch forward.","This punch was extremely brutal and contained endless demonic power. In an instant, it smashed into the green light.","Boom!","The void trembled. Without any suspense, the green light was smashed into pieces and spread out in all directions.","Then Asura Demon God took another step forward and threw another punch. This punch was aimed at all the people of the Nine-tail Clan.","“Attack together!” Da Yu growled.","Immediately, nine experts from the nine-tailed race, including Da Yu and Da Su, took action to block the punch.","However, under the punch that contained demonic might, the nine figures retreated explosively.","With just one punch, the nine Principles Masters from the nine-tailed race were sent flying. This was the strongest heaven-seeking fiendcelestial of the heaven-seeking palatial lord!","“So strong!”","“This is Askance Sky Demon God!”","“Too strong!”","“The power of one punch is actually so terrifying?”","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle could not help but exclaim in amazement when they saw the scene on the battlefield.","The nine-tailed race members had already steadied themselves, but most of them had ugly expressions on their faces.","“Is this the Askance Sky Demon God that mother mentioned? He is really strong,” Da Su said in a deep voice.","“He is very strong. However, this heaven-seeking Fiendcelestial is merely a technique left behind by the heaven-seeking Palace Lord. It is not something that the heaven-seeking Palace Lord can personally use. Although its might is equally powerful, every time the heaven-seeking Fiendcelestial uses an attack, it consumes a large amount of energy. The energy that this heaven-seeking Fiendcelestial has condensed is not much. At most, it can only use a few more attacks before its energy is completely depleted!”","“We don’t need to fight it head-on. We just need to force it to use up its strength,” said Da Yu.","Everyone from the Nine-tailed Clan nodded.","“Let’s go!”","Soon, the nine members of the Nine-tailed Clan attacked again. Jian Wushuang had no choice but to lead the Asura Demon God to fight.","However, just as Da Yu had said, the Asura Demon God was only one of the skills left in the pearl by Palace Master Asura. As the number of attacks increased, the power of the Asura Demon God would be depleted, it would not last long.","Without Askance Demon God, it would be difficult for him to deal with the Nine-tailed Clan alone.","However, there was good news. While Jian Wushuang was fighting the Nine-tailed Clan with Askance Demon God, Temple Master Bai Xing secretly told him that reinforcements from the Temporal Temple were coming!","...."]},{"number":3308,"title":"Chapter 3308 - Earth-Shattering Battle (Part Ten)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","The Temporal Temple also had reinforcements. They were the 10-man team of Master Lin Guang, who had just returned to the Divine Beginning Realm and had been exploring the universe battlefield.","After receiving the message from Temple Master Bai Xing, Master Lin Guang rushed to the Saha Island as fast as he could.","While the battle was still in its climax, Jian Wushuang had stopped the Nine-tailed Clan members with the help of Asura Demon God. Lin Guang Master’s ten-man team finally arrived at the battlefield.","This ten-man team had been to the universe battlefield before. The universe battlefield was so dangerous that ordinary Principles Masters did not dare to go there. Only Principles Masters who had reached the third realm of the Void Realm dared to go there, only when they formed a team with others would they dare to go to the universe battlefield.","Thus, Lin Guang Master’s 10-man team was generally made up of Principles Masters who had reached the third level of the Void Realm and above. There were also three who had reached the fourth level of the Void Realm, especially Lin Guang Master, who was in the lead. His strength was not any weaker than Ba Cang’s, he was an expert of the fifth level of the Void Realm.","The appearance of the ten-man team on the battlefield changed the situation once again.","After Jian Wushuang’s Asura Demon God’s power was completely exhausted, Lin Guang Master and the other two Principles Masters of the fourth realm of the void came to him.","“Little guy, go to the back. Leave the Nine-tailed Clan to us,” Lin Guang Master, who had silver hair and a graceful figure, said gently.","“Thank you, Master Lin Guang.” Jian Wushuang nodded gratefully and immediately retreated.","“Where do you think you’re going?” Da Yu and Da Su of the Nine-tail Clan looked grim. They were about to give chase...","“Haha, your opponents are us,” Master Lin Guang laughed. Two other experts of the void fourth realm from his team followed him. Although there were only three of them...they were able to easily stop the nine-tailed Principles Master of the nine-tailed race.","No matter what methods the nine-tailed race used, they were unable to get rid of Lin Guang Master and the other two.","On the other battlefield, the intense battle between Star River Master and Bai Xing Hall Master was nearing its end.","“Scram!”","With a low shout, Bai Xing Hall master clapped his hands. Space-time, fire, and earth — three types of principle energy stirred wildly at this moment, condensing into a three-colored phoenix in the blink of an eye, this three-colored phoenix did not emit the slightest bit of power. This was the perfect embodiment of Palace Master Bai Xing’s control over all his energy.","After which, this three-colored phoenix opened its mouth and directly collided with the Star River Master in front of it.","This collision shattered the boundless darkness where Star River Master was. A muffled groan suddenly sounded in the boundless darkness. Immediately after, Star River Master’s somewhat miserable figure shot out from the boundless darkness.","After a long while, the Star River Lord’s figure finally regained his footing. His face also carried a trace of paleness as he gritted his teeth and stared fixedly at the Bai Xing Hall Master, “Star River, you’re really something. After all these years, although your fighting style is still the same as before, your use of the rules has risen to a higher level than before. In particular, you’ve also made a new breakthrough in your ultimate move. You’re really something.”","“Hmph, do you think that after all these years, I really haven’t improved at all?” Palace Master Bai Xing sneered.","Many years ago, she had fought with Star River Master. At that time, she had just broken through to the sixth level of the void, but she had relied on her advantage in terms of realm to forcefully suppress Star River Master. And after so many years...Star River Master had also broken through to the sixth level of the void, but her strength had also increased quite a bit. It was just that she had not shown it at the beginning.","“With Heavenly Sword Marquis’ spacetime world and Elder Dark Bone rushing over to help, now that Lin Guang Master’s ten-man team has also arrived at the battlefield, just their current combat strength alone is enough to deal with the three great Saint Realms, the Sorcerer God Sect, and the Nine-tailed Clan. It Won’t be long before those four old fellows from Quiet Moon Abyss also arrive at the battlefield. When that time comes, the overall situation will be set! Temple Master Bai Xing clenched his fists.","The Temporal Temple was at an absolute disadvantage in this battle.","After all, they were fighting against the three Saint Realms at the same time, so their battle strength was not proportional to each other at the beginning.","However, Jian Wushuang had a universe supreme treasure like the Mountain River Map in his hands, and he could also use the spacetime world. When the spacetime world appeared, it was comparable to the battle strength of more than a dozen Principles Masters, which equaled the battle strength of both sides.","Then, Elder Dark Bone appeared, and Jian Wushuang’s own trump card was also very powerful. The three Saint Realms were unable to kill him at the first moment until now. Lin Guang Master’s team had arrived, now, if the three Saint Realms did not have any other backup plans, then the spacetime temple was already confident of victory in this battle.","“Galaxy, it seems that this time, the three Saint Realms will return empty-handed.” Temple Master Bai Xing sneered and stared at Galaxy Master.","“Hmph, the battle isn’t over yet. That Heavenly Sword Marquis is still trapped by us. Isn’t it too early for you to say this?” Star River Master snorted.","“Oh, is that so?” Palace Master Bai Xing suddenly gave a strange smile. She had already received the message that the four masters of Tranquil Moon Abyss had arrived!","Hu!","A gust of violent wind suddenly swept across the battlefield.","The violent wind swept across, containing a majestic power. It actually directly blew the weaker Principles Masters on the battlefield to the side.","Even the stronger Principles Masters were only barely able to stand firm under the violent wind.","The violent wind swept across the entire battlefield, causing the fierce battle between the two camps to stop. Only then did the violent wind slowly calm down.","After the violent wind calmed down, everyone immediately looked over, only to discover that four more figures had appeared in the middle of the battlefield.","These four figures were from left to right. The first was a short hunchbacked old man. This hunchbacked old man’s gaze was cold, and there was a cold smile at the corner of his mouth. His body was also surrounded by a strange layer of black fog, the black fog also emitted a stench that made people shudder.","The second person had white hair and white eyebrows. His eyebrows were extremely long, and they were so long that they reached his chin. His eyes were very small, and his gaze was turbid. His expression was also extremely cold as if he did not care about anything in his surroundings at all. What was worth noting was that...there was a dark red dot between his brows. This dark red dot seemed to contain an endless divine might.","The third person looked like a child. He was about the size of a child and looked about the same as an eight or nine-year-old child. His skin was fair and his hair was tied into a small braid. On his chubby face, there was a playful smile, his gaze swept across the crowd with incomparable craftiness. Anyone who was swept by his gaze felt as if they were being targeted by a devil.","The last person was an old woman wearing a silver robe and holding a walking stick with the head of a snake. This old woman’s body was covered with traces of hiding.. Her body was also filled with a deathly aura, as though she could die at any moment."]},{"number":3309,"title":"Chapter 3309 - The Four Ancient Immortals","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","The short, skinny, hunchbacked old man, the white-haired, white-browed, indifferent middle-aged man, the fair-skinned, tender-looking boy, and the lifeless old woman, all four of them were extremely strange, and when these four people gathered together, it was extremely strange.","However, when these four people appeared on the battlefield, the huge battlefield immediately quieted down.","Whether it was the Principles Masters from the two camps on the battlefield or the many experts watching the battle from outside the battlefield, they all looked at these four people with shocked expressions.","Among the many experts, most of them did not know who these four people were, so they had doubts and curiosity in their hearts.","However, there were still a few people on the field who recognized these four people at once.","However, because they recognized them and knew their identities, they were even more shocked!","“Four ancient immortals! They are four ancient immortals!”","“Oh my God, it’s these four old monsters?”","“The four ancient immortals who followed the Temporal Temple and roamed the Divine Beginning Realm billions of years ago are still alive?”","“It’s one thing for them to be alive, but why are they still in the Divine Beginning Realm? With their strength, they should have ventured into the depths of the universe battlefield!”","Exclamations suddenly rang out in the world.","Those experts who had not recognized the four before heard the words, “Four ancient immortals!” From the exclamations, and the entire crowd was completely shocked!","“Four ancient immortals?” Even Jian Wushuang was shocked.","He had not been in the third firmament for long, so he did not know much about the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm. He should not have known about such an ancient existence, but the four ancient immortals were from the Temporal Temple, they had left something in the True Martial Mystic Realm of the temporal island, so Jian Wushuang knew about their existence.","The four ancient immortals, like Elder Dark Bone, were experts from the same era as the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heaven Ancestor.","The Temporal Temple had created the Temporal Temple with great means and fought everywhere. It had a large number of experts under its command, and the four ancient immortals were the strongest and most famous, any one of them was at the level of the six void realms, and almost all of them were at the peak of the six void realms.","To put it bluntly, in terms of strength, any one of them was stronger than the Bai Xing Hall master and the Galaxy Lord. The only one who could contend against them in a one-on-one fight, and perhaps even slightly stronger than them...was Elder Dark Bone.","However, although Elder Dark Bone was strong, he was only one person. On the other hand, the four ancient immortals were four people. Moreover, the four of them had fought together under the Temporal Temple back then, and their relationship was very close, at that time, the Temporal Temple Master had specially researched a set of joint attack array formation for them. Once this joint attack array formation appeared, it was completely capable of sweeping away Principles Masters.","Even old monster abyssal bone could only retreat in front of the four of them.","There were even rumors in the outside world that if the four ancient immortals joined forces, they would have the ability to fight head-on even if they encountered a Saint Realm master. Although this was only a rumor and had not been confirmed, since there was such a rumor...then even if the four ancient immortals could not reach this point, it would not be too far off.","In the center of the battlefield, after clearly seeing the identity of the person who came, the expressions of the experts from the three great Saint Realms all became unsightly.","“The four ancient immortals are actually the four of them!” Galaxy Master’s expression was gloomy.","“We are in big trouble. Any one of these four old monsters is an existence at the peak of the six states of the void. In a one-on-one fight, none of us are a match for them. And if the four of them join forces, they might be able to completely wipe us out.” Sky Nether Master also secretly gritted his teeth.","“It’s a pity that almost all of the top experts of our three great Saint Realms have gone to the universe battlefield to explore. It’s really hard to find an existence in the Divine Beginning Realm that can fight against the four ancient immortals.” Eight Treasures Master frowned.","The three great Saint Realms were also the overlords of the Divine Beginning Realm. Their foundation and strength were naturally not much weaker than the Temporal Temple.","However, whether it was the three great Saint Realms or the top forces of the Divine Beginning Realm, very few of the truly top experts would always stay in the Divine Beginning Realm. Most of the top experts would choose to go to the universe battlefield after their strength reached a certain level, they would choose to venture into the universe battlefield.","This kind of adventure was not going to the periphery of the Divine Beginning Realm. They could return at any time. Most of the top experts would choose to venture deeper into the universe battlefield, into those unknown territories, once they ventured into the depths of the universe battlefield to explore, it would be very difficult for them to return within a short period of time. There were even some who ventured deeper into the universe and never returned.","Almost all of the top Principles Masters of the three great saint domains had gone to the depths of the universe battlefield. Otherwise, with the foundations of the three great Saint Realms, they would be able to send out experts who could contend against the four ancient immortals.","“Four ancient immortals, haha, long time no see. The four of you old geezers haven’t died yet?” Hearty laughter suddenly rang out on the battlefield.","On the battlefield right now, the only person who dared to speak to the four ancient immortals in such a manner was naturally Elder Dark Bone.","“Dark Bone? You actually appeared here as well, and from the looks of it, you’re standing on the side of my Temporal Temple. This is truly rare.” Among the four ancient immortals, the ancient woman slowly spoke.","“This old man also doesn’t wish to have anything to do with your Temporal Temple, but that disciple of mine has pleaded repeatedly, and this old man is helpless.” Elder Dark Bone said.","“No matter what, since you’re on my Temporal Temple’s side today, our Temporal Temple will naturally remember this favor,” the weathered old woman said and then turned her head, she looked at the experts of the three great Saint Realms.","“Three great Saint Realms!”","A cold voice came out of the weathered old woman’s mouth, “You’re the publicly acknowledged overlord of the Divine Beginning Realm, but you’ve gone through so much trouble to kill a little guy who’s only at the level of an Immortal Saint. Aren’t you going a bit too far? Do you really think that our Temporal Temple has no one?”","“Tsk tsk, those three cowardly fellows from the three great Saint Realms. They actually dare to suppress our Temporal Temple while Lord Temple Master has been roaming the universe battlefield all year round. They are really bold.” The fair-skinned boy let out a bewitching laugh.","“The actions of the three great Saint Realms over the past few years are indeed a little too much.” The cold middle-aged man with white hair and white eyebrows said in a low voice.","The simple words of the three men were like the words of a knife, stabbing into the hearts of the experts of the three Saint Realms.","Indeed, Jian Wushuang was only an Immortal Saint, but what the three Saint Realms had done was a little too much.","“Well, let’s talk about it later. Take the little guy named Heavenly Sword Marquis away from here first, and then we’ll settle the score with the three Saint Realms later,” the short hunchbacked elder said coldly.","...."]},{"number":3310,"title":"Chapter 3310 - Arrived in Person","paragraphs":["——","“Little guy, come with us.” The short hunchbacked elder glanced at Jian Wushuang, completely ignoring the experts of the three Saint Realms, the Sorceror God Sect, and the Nine-tailed Clan. The four of them turned around, apparently intending to leave.","The experts of the three Saint Realms looked at each other, but no one dared to stop them.","Even the Star River Master, the Sky Nether Master, and the Eight Treasures Master were frowning, but they had no intention of stopping them.","They knew very well that since the four ancient immortals had arrived, the experts present were no match for them. They could not stop the four ancient immortals from doing anything. The four ancient immortals wanted to take Jian Wushuang away, they could only watch helplessly.","However, just when everyone thought that the four ancient immortals were going to take Jian Wushuang away and the battle ended, the four ancient immortals focused their eyes and raised their heads almost at the same time, looking at the void in front of them.","A white light appeared out of nowhere. This white light was extremely dense and dazzling. It was like a huge white sun. It was warm and gave people an extremely gentle feeling.","Soon after, a human figure slowly stepped out from within this white light.","This was a barefooted bald man dressed in a white robe. This bald man’s expression was gentle and gave off an incomparably amiable feeling. His eyes were also filled with kindness.","He slowly stepped out from within the white light. There was not any earth-shaking might from his body. It was as if he was an ordinary person standing in the air.","However, the appearance of this white-robed bald man caused the expressions of the four ancient immortals to become unusually solemn.","Elder Dark Bone, who was not far away, saw this white-robed bald man and his face could not help but darken. “He actually came?”","When the many experts watching the battle around the battlefield saw this white-robed bald man’s appearance and the unique feeling he gave them, they instantly understood the identity of this person.","“Saint Realm, Saint Realm Master!”","“There’s no mistake. Only a Saint Realm master can have such a unique and superior feeling!”","“A Saint Realm Master is here? Oh my God!”","The entire world was in an uproar.","When the experts from the life and death sacred region saw him, a hint of fanaticism flashed in their eyes. Then, they all knelt down and said, “Greetings, Saint Master!”","Saint Master!","The Saint Master of the life and Death Saint Realm, one of the three Saint Realms, had arrived in person!","“A Saint Realm Master?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly, but he was not too surprised.","He knew very well that his perfect life level was a threat to the three Saint Realms. This time, the three Saint Realms did not hesitate to fight the Temporal Temple to kill him, so they must have been fully prepared, moreover, Jian Wushuang had guessed that the masters of the Saint Realm would be present in person.","Now it seemed that it was true.","“Four ancient immortals, long time no see.” A gentle voice came out of the white-robed bald man’s mouth. Every word of the white-robed bald man seemed to contain a supreme truth, which made people admire him.","“Including thunder.” The four ancient immortals stared fixedly at the white-robed bald man. They no longer had the calmness and calmness they had before.","Saint Realm Lords were supreme existences at the peak of the Divine Beginning Realm. In the Divine Beginning Realm, Saint Realm lords were the representative of invincibility.","Even the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Heavenly Ancestor did not dare to underestimate these three Saint Realm Lords in the Divine Beginning Realm.","As for Saint Realm Masters, they naturally stood above ordinary Principles Masters. Even though the four ancient immortals were all peak existences of the six realms of the void, they were still far inferior compared to Saint Realm Masters.","“Seems like the secret hidden within this little fellow has already reached an earth-shaking level. He actually made you, a Saint Realm Master, personally appear.” The aged old woman spoke in a low voice.","“This seat doesn’t have any grudges with this little fellow. Unfortunately, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao must kill him. This seat is only following orders,” the white-robed bald man said with a smile.","“Following orders?” The surrounding people were startled, but they soon felt relieved.","Although Saint Realm Masters were high and mighty, in fact, many people knew that the reason these three Saint Realm Masters were so powerful was mainly because of the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao, the combat strength of these three Saint Realm Masters was actually not very strong. In terms of realms, they were probably only at the sixth level of the Void Realm. However, it was precisely because of the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao that their combat strength far surpassed the sixth level of the Void Realm.","“Four ancient immortals, make it convenient for this seat to kill that little fellow. This way, this seat will be able to report back.” The white-robed bald man smiled.","His luck was very calm, as though he was really asking for it.","“I’m sorry. No matter what, this little fellow is also a member of my Temporal Temple. The four of us old fellows can’t just hand him over to you.” The old woman said.","“Oh, is that so? That’s a pity.” The white-robed bald man sighed lightly, but then, he raised his head and smiled warmly as well. “Since the four of you won’t allow it, this seat can only kill the four of you first before going to kill him.”","“Hehe, that’s easy for you to say, but I don’t know if you have the ability to do so.” The old woman sneered.","“Kuo Lei, your tone is a little too arrogant.” The cold middle-aged man said coldly, “It’s not like the four of us haven’t fought with you many years ago. At that time, you couldn’t do anything to us. But now, do you think we are afraid of you?”","“Kuo Lei, if you want to fight, we can accompany you. It just so happens that it has been many years since we last fought,” the short hunchbacked old man said.","“Keke, I’m also very curious. After so many years, have you, a timid fellow like a mouse, improved in strength?” The young boy strangely laughed.","“I will let you guys get what you want.” The white-robed bald man laughed, but a fierce glint flashed across his eyes.","Weng weng! An endless white light suddenly swept out from his body.","This white light was warm and shone in the void, causing the entire world to be in a vast white environment. The white-robed bald man was in the center of this world. His body trembled slightly, and he directly rose to a height of 30 meters, an incomparably holy aura that caused people to worship him spread out from his body.","The moment this aura appeared, it immediately caused countless experts in the surroundings to reveal terrified expressions. They could not help but look at the white-robed bald man. In their eyes...this white-robed bald man seemed to have transformed into the ruler of the world, causing them to involuntarily want to kneel down and worship him.","Plop, plop!","The weaker undying saints in the surroundings of the battlefield had already knelt down, while the stronger Immortal Saints and the Principles Masters were forcefully supporting themselves.."]},{"number":3311,"title":"Chapter 3311 - God Puppet","paragraphs":["——","“Too terrifying. Is this a Saint Realm Master?”","“We don’t even need to make a move. Just the formless power is enough to make us unable to resist. Even I can’t help but want to kneel down.” The Underworld Emperor’s face was flushed red, he muttered.","He was already a true Principles Master. However, as he stood outside the battlefield, he had the urge to kneel down towards the white-robed bald man, one could imagine how much pressure the Immortal Saints who were weaker than him had to endure.","It could be said that those who could still stand on the battlefield were already considered quite impressive.","“This lightning is still the same. He likes to use his power to oppress others,” the young boy said coldly.","“After all, he is a Saint Realm Master. None of us are a match for him in a one-on-one fight. Let’s use that move directly,” the old woman said.","“Alright.” The other three nodded.","In the next moment, the short hunchbacked old man waved his hand, and a golden light suddenly flashed and appeared.","This golden light was actually a golden-armored figure. It was over ten meters tall, and its entire body was covered in golden armor. Only a pair of eyes could be seen, but it was currently closed.","This golden-armored figure appeared in front of the four ancient immortals. At first, it did not emit any aura or might, but after the four ancient immortals moved and directly merged into the golden-armored figure...the golden-armored figure immediately came to life, and his eyes, which had been closed the entire time, suddenly opened!","The instant he opened his eyes, a sharp golden light, like two golden lightning bolts, pierced through the air and shone on the white-robed bald man. At the same time, a terrifying aura that caused everyone present to feel suffocated rose up from the golden-armored figure, the golden-armored figure also rose up.","When the many experts present felt this terrifying aura, their eyes were wide open.","“How, how is this possible?”","“This aura is too strong, too strong!”","“I feel that it’s much stronger than the aura of a Saint Realm Master. How, how can there be such a powerful aura?”","Many gazes filled with shock and disbelief turned towards the golden-armored figure.","Even the experts of the Temporal Temple, who were on the same side as the four ancient immortals, could not help but be terrified.","“Is this the strongest technique of the four ancient immortals?” Jian Wushuang stood not far behind the golden-armored figure and looked at the golden-armored figure in front of him, his heart filled with shock.","In his perception, the aura of the golden-armored figure had indeed surpassed that of the white-robed bald man.","The four ancient immortals were the four strongest war generals under the command of spacetime. Back then, they had followed the Temporal Temple Master to create the great Temporal Temple.","And the Temporal Temple Master had specially created a joint attack array for them. The most important part of this joint attack array was to jointly control this golden-armored figure.","It could be said that this golden-armored figure was indeed the strongest technique of the four ancient immortals.","Its power was naturally extraordinary as well.","However, unlike the other experts present, the white-robed bald man merely smiled faintly when he sensed the aura emitted by this golden-armored figure.","“Ruler-level god puppet, the Temporal Temple Master really has nothing to say to the four of you. He actually gave this thing to you to control. Unfortunately, although this god puppet’s power is world-shaking, the four of you are too weak.”","“The last time we met, the four of you worked together to control this god puppet, but you could only use about 10% of its power. Now that so many years have passed, I wonder if your control over this god puppet has improved a little.”","The white-robed bald man still appeared relaxed and content. He was not affected at all by the powerful aura of the golden-armored figure.","“Hmph. You’ll know whether or not you’ve improved.” The old woman’s voice rang out from within the golden-armored puppet. As soon as she finished speaking, the ten-meter-tall golden-armored puppet suddenly leapt forward.","Boom!","The void beneath the golden-armored puppet’s feet exploded, and its enormous body instantly appeared in front of the white-robed bald man. A dazzling golden light suddenly lit up, a golden spear appeared in the golden-armored puppet’s hand.","Xiu!","The sound of air being torn apart rang out, and the golden spear suddenly stabbed out explosively, bringing with it a destructive might.","The spear stabbed out, and in an instant, the void in front of them shattered, scattering in all directions. A massive spatial black hole appeared in front of everyone, but what was shocking was that the diameter of this spatial black hole was actually...! It was hundreds of meters!","“How is this possible!”","“Isn’t this too exaggerated?”","“A space black hole with a diameter of hundreds of meters. This is the most stable third sky in the space of the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“Unbelievable!”","Countless exclamations sounded at the same time.","Many people were frightened by the huge space black hole in front of them.","A black hole in space could only be formed by completely shattering space. However, this was the Divine Beginning Realm, not some special mystic realms or small-scale realms. Because of the existence of the Heavenly Dao, the space here...was extremely stable. For an ordinary Principles Master, even if he used his full strength, it would be very difficult to cause a piece of space to collapse. Only Principles Masters who had reached the fifth or sixth level of the void could barely tear apart space.","However, even for Principles Masters who had reached the sixth level of the void, their full strength could only tear apart a piece of space at most. At most, a space hole of a few meters or even ten meters would appear. This was already the limit.","But now, a casual attack was able to create a space black hole of a few hundred meters in diameter. The power of this attack was too terrifying.","“Hehe, interesting.”","Seeing the golden spear thrusting towards him, the white-robed bald man merely smiled faintly. His entire body was bathed in white light, and his warm palm was stretched out at this moment, without any fancy moves, his palm actually directly grabbed toward the golden spear.","“What?”","“Such a terrifying spear, using your hand to grab it?”","“What kind of joke is this!”","Everyone was stunned by this action of the white robed bald man.","Very quickly, the white robed bald man’s palm grabbed onto the tip of the golden spear. At the instant his palm made contact with the golden spear, boom!","The sky collapsed and the earth split apart. Endless might frantically spread out in all directions.","The space black hole that had originally formed a few hundred meters in size was instantly magnified by more than twice at this moment. Furthermore, an inconceivable devouring power also erupted from within the space black hole, it was crazily devouring everything around it.","The entire Saha Island had been torn apart due to the previous battle. However, at least the land was still there. Now...the Apocalypse had arrived!","...."]},{"number":3312,"title":"Chapter 3312 - Another One Arrived","paragraphs":["_______________","Boom!","The power mercilessly bombarded the land below. The entire Saha Island, the many landmasses that were still floating on the surface of the water, all crumbled at this moment. In the blink of an eye, the entire Saha Island had already disappeared completely.","At the same time, that shocking power also affected the surrounding void space.","“Retreat, retreat quickly!”","“Run quickly, or we’ll die!”","“This power is too terrifying, run quickly!”","Those experts who were close to the golden-armored god puppet and the white-robed bald man, Life and Death Saint Master, immediately retreated frantically.","They were very clear that the battle between the golden-armored god puppet and Life and Death Saint Master had completely exceeded the scope of Principles Master, and it was not something they could get involved in. Once they were affected by the shockwaves, the weaker Principles Masters...it was very likely that they would be directly killed. Even the stronger Principles Masters did not dare to easily withstand the aftershocks.","In the center of that shocking power, the palm of the Life and Death Saint Master had already grabbed the tip of the golden spear. However, not long after they made contact, the Life and Death Saint Master let out a soft exclamation and immediately released his palm, at the same time, he took two steps back.","“Haha, it seems that this seat has been too careless. After so many years, your four ancient immortals’ control over this god puppet has increased by quite a bit compared to before. Previously, you could only barely unleash 10% of its power, but now, even though you can only unleash less than 20% of its power, it’s still very close.” Life and Death Saint Master continued to smile warmly.","Even though he had suffered a small loss because he had been too arrogant in the face-to-face confrontation, he did not mind it at all.","“Again!”","Life and Death Saint Master waved his hand. Originally, there was only white light pervading his body, but at this moment, a large amount of black light suddenly surged out. The black and white light were incomparably dazzling, and under Life and Death Saint Master’s control...the black and white light perfectly merged together and formed a huge life and death picture. The white represented life, while the black represented death!","Life and Death Saint Master pointed from afar.","Bang!","This huge life and death picture directly crushed towards the golden-armored god puppet. At this moment, everyone around felt unprecedented pressure. This pressure caused everyone present to be unable to breathe.","“Break!”","A stern cry was emitted from within the golden-armored puppet. Immediately, the power of the golden spear suddenly soared. It was clearly a long spear, but at this moment, it had directly transformed into a resplendent golden star, it also carried a power that far surpassed that of a Principles Master as it collided against the life and death diagram.","Bang!","The collision between the two was still as earth-shaking as before. It was even more intense than the previous collision, but the result was completely different.","After the collision, although the life-death pattern was pushed back, the golden-armored puppet was also pushed back immediately. Even the surrounding power and aura were weakened a lot. obviously...the golden-armored puppet was crushed by the collision.","“Bai Xing, let’s stall him. Take the little guy and go!” The old woman’s voice came from the golden-armored puppet. As soon as she finished her words, the golden-armored puppet attacked the Life and Death Saint Master again.","“Go!”","Temple Master Bai Xing did not hesitate at all. As soon as they gave the order, the experts from the Temporal Temple surrounded Jian Wushuang and rushed toward the nearby void.","Although the void was still confined by spacetime, it only prevented them from teleporting and teleporting. They could still escape normally.","The experts of the three Saint Realms, the Sorceror God Sect, and the Nine-tailed Clan would not let them escape, so they immediately began to block them.","However, with the presence of the super expert, Elder Dark Bone, the experts of the Temporal Temple could run amok. No one in the three Saint Realms could compete with Elder Dark Bone, as long as the people of the Temporal Temple could protect Jian Wushuang and help him break out of the space-time confinement, he could use space-time teleportation to leave.","“Kuo Lei, the little guy is about to escape. Why aren’t you worried at all?” The old woman’s voice sounded again from the golden puppet.","“Worried? Why should I be worried?” The Life and Death Saint Master continued to smile. “Do you really think the little guy can escape? What a joke.”","Hearing this, the four ancient immortals in the golden-armored puppet frowned.","“Hehe, I’m afraid you don’t know that I’m not the only one here.” The Life and Death Saint Master said with a faint smile.","As soon as he said this, the four ancient immortals’ expressions changed drastically.","In the void on the other side, Jian Wushuang, escorted by the Temporal Temple and Elder Dark Bone, was about to break out of the space-time imprisonment. However, at this moment...a figure suddenly appeared in front of them.","It was a middle-aged man in purple armor, with his arms crossed and his body emitting endless Demonic Qi.","The middle-aged man’s face was cold, and his eyes were cold and aloof as if all living beings were ants in his eyes.","The appearance of the purple-armored demon lord instantly made everyone in the Temporal Temple stop in their tracks. Even Elder Dark Bone stopped in the void at this moment. Elder Dark Bone raised his head and looked at the purple-armored demon lord, his pupils constricted.","“This person...”","“The same feeling, the same feeling as the Life and Death Saint Master!”","“Could it be another Saint Master?”","Many experts from the Temporal Temple looked at the person in front of them in shock.","“Greetings, Saint Master!”","The Principles Masters from the Flame Saint Realm from the three great Saint Realms bowed fervently when they saw this person. From their greetings, they could instantly confirm the identity of this person.","“Flame Saint Master!”","“As expected, another Saint Realm Master!”","“Oh my God!”","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle were shocked again.","Two of the three Saint Realm Masters from the Divine Beginning Realm had arrived on the battlefield at this moment, and their goal was only for one person, an Immortal Saint, and that person was Jian Wushuang!","“Damn it!”","Temple Master Bai Xing’s eyes darkened as he looked at Elder Dark Bone. “Dark Bone, with your strength, can you fight against the Flame Saint Master?”","“Fight?” Elder Dark Bone smiled bitterly. “A master of the Saint Realm is a master of the Saint Realm after all. Although I’m confident that I can survive in his hands, it’s impossible for me to fight him head-on. At most, I can only hold him off for a while.”","“It’s enough to hold him off for a moment. I’ve already received a message from the Hall Master. The Hall Master has already returned to the edge of the Divine Beginning Realm. With his use of time and space, he only needs 15 minutes at most to arrive here!” Palace Master Bai Xing said seriously.."]},{"number":3313,"title":"Chapter 3313 - Bamboo Leaf","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Temporal Temple Master?” Elder Dark Bone was stunned.","“Temple Master?” The experts of the Temporal Temple were overjoyed.","“Temple Master has returned to the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked at Temple Master Bai Xing.","As far as he knew, Temporal Temple Master had been adventuring in the universe battlefield for a long time. The last time he came back from the universe battlefield was millions of years ago.","“The Palace Master has indeed returned to the Divine Beginning Realm. In fact, he had already decided to come back. It’s just that his previous location in the universe battlefield was quite far from the Divine Beginning Realm. In addition, he encountered some things on the way, so he was delayed for some time. This time, after the collision with the three great Saint Realms, I sent a message to the Palace Master early in the morning, and the Palace Master returned as fast as he could,” said Bai Xing Palace Master.","“That’s great!”","“The Palace Master’s strength is monstrous. If he comes, the three great Saint Realms will not dare to be arrogant!”","“Right, as long as the Palace Master arrives, we don’t need to be afraid of the three great Saint Realm Masters.”","Many experts of the Temporal Temple were excited.","The Temporal Temple Master had single-handedly created the Temporal Temple. He was the absolute overlord of the Divine Beginning Realm!","Moreover, the Temporal Temple master was different from the three Saint Realm Masters of the three great holy regions. The three Saint Realm Masters had the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao, which was why they had the strength that surpassed the Principles Masters, however, the Temporal Temple Master, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, and the Heavenly Ancestor had their own cultivation base that exceeded the scope of the Principles Masters.","In terms of strength and ability, the Temporal Temple master was far stronger than the masters of the Saint Realm.","This was also why it was rumored that a Saint Realm master would be inferior to an existence like Temporal Temple Master.","In the current situation, although there were already two Saint Realm Masters in the three Saint Realms, as long as Temporal Temple Master arrived, the three Saint Realms would not be able to do anything to Jian Wushuang.","“Temple Master, it will take 15 minutes to get here. As for the Flame Saint Realm, Dark Bone, I can only hope that you can delay him as much as possible,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“I’ll do my best,” Dark Bone said with a serious expression, “But let me be clear. Although I’ll try my best to stop the Flame Saint Master, I’ll leave this place as soon as I’m under too much pressure and my life is threatened.”","“Of course, we only hope you can do your best, but we don’t dare to force you if you die,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","Elder Dark Bone only helped Jian Wushuang because his disciple, Underworld Emperor, owed him a favor.","However, there was a limit to this favor. It was already very rare that Elder Dark Bone was willing to help. Jian Wushuang and the people of the Temporal Temple did not expect him to risk his life for them.","“Flame Saint Master, long time no see.” Elder Dark Bone looked at the Flame Saint Master in front of him.","“Dark Bone? Are you sure you want to get involved in this?” Flame Saint Master’s gaze was cold as he glanced at Elder Dark Bone.","“I originally didn’t want to get involved, but that disciple of mine owes this little fellow a favor. You also know that I’ve lived for so long, and it wasn’t easy for me to take in such a disciple.” Elder Dark Bone laughed.","“Very good. Then this battle, I’ll take care of you as well.” Flame Saint Master said coldly, “I’ll kill Dark Bone. As for Heavenly Sword Marquis, I’ll leave him to you!”","“No problem.” A cold voice suddenly sounded from the other side of the void. When everyone looked over, they found that a woman in blood-red clothes had appeared in the empty void.","Although this woman in blood-red clothes was not considered very beautiful, the ruler-like temperament that she had had for a long time was enough to make people submit to her.","“Another Saint Realm Master?”","“Three Saint Realm Masters from the three great Saint Realms are all here!”","“Tsk tsk, this is a scene that is rarely seen in billions of years.”","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle had already become numb to the shock.","All they could think about now was how fortunate they were to be here and be able to see a scene that was rarely seen in billions of years.","“This is bad!”","The hearts of the experts from the Temporal Temple jolted.","“Everyone, although I have some tricks that can barely hold off a Saint Realm Master, I don’t have the ability to deal with two Saint Realm Masters at the same time.” Elder Dark Bone’s voice became anxious.","He was confident that he could survive if he fought against a Saint Realm Master alone. However, he was not confident that he could survive if he fought against two Saint Realm Masters at the same time.","If the Temporal Temple needed him to fight against two Saint Realm Masters at the same time, he would not hesitate to leave because it was impossible.","At this time, Jian Wushuang, who had been protected by the experts of the Temporal Temple, finally spoke.","“Senior Dark Bone,” Jian Wushuang looked at Elder Dark Bone and said, “Don’t worry, senior. You just need to think of a way to stall the Flame Saint Master. As for Destruction Saint Master, leave him to me.”","“Leave him to you?” Elder Dark Bone was stunned.","Many experts of the Temporal Temple also looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","A master of the Saint Realm, the most terrifying existence in the Divine Beginning Realm, even an expert at the peak of the six void realms did not have the courage to confront a master of the Saint Realm head-on. Elder Dark Bone only had the ability to fight a Saint Realm Master because he had lived for too long and had too many tricks up his sleeve, that was why he had the ability to fight a Saint Realm Master for a short while.","But now, Jian Wushuang, an Immortal Saint, said he would fight a Saint Realm Master?","Although Jian Wushuang had displayed extraordinary strength and skills in the previous battle, it was still too incredible for him to fight a Saint Realm Master alone.","Under the astonished and doubtful gazes of the surrounding people, Jian Wushuang flipped his hand and took out a purple bamboo leaf.","At first glance, the purple bamboo leaf looked ordinary. It only had a special purple halo around its surface. However, the moment they saw the purple bamboo leaf, the experts of the Temporal Temple...their pupils constricted.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, this bamboo leaf is...” Temple Master Bai Xing looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","Because she had vaguely felt a suffocating aura from the purple bamboo leaf.","“The Heaven-cleaving Alliance gave me this bamboo leaf.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance had given him three things at once. Two of them were made by Palace Master Shuiyun and Palace Master Askance, which contained the magic power of the two palace masters, these two pearls had been used during the battle.","The last thing was the purple bamboo leaf in Jian Wushuang’s hand. It was also the most precious life-saving item among the three!","...."]},{"number":3314,"title":"Chapter 3314 - Consciousness Doppelganger","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“When Elder Mo Shan gave me this bamboo leaf, he said that as long as I use it in the Divine Beginning Realm, it can almost save my life, but I don’t know if it’s true.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a light, his palm had already exerted force, and a trace of divine power seeped into the bamboo leaf.","As the divine power seeped in, Jian Wushuang could immediately sense the power hidden in the bamboo leaf that he could guide.","“So that’s how it is?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He had already understood what was inside the bamboo leaf.","Buzz, buzz, the world shook. Under the deliberate guidance of Jian Wushuang, a surge of power slowly surged out from the bamboo leaf. This power gathered in the void, and in the blink of an eye, it formed a human figure.","It was a two-meter-tall burly man. He wore scarlet armor and his skin was dark. In his narrow eyes, a pair of gem-like eyes swept over. When his gaze swept over, the world was overshadowed.","Most importantly, it was the domineering aura of the burly man.","This domineering aura was unparalleled. It was as if the entire universe was under his feet, and all living things in the world should submit to his feet.","This domineering aura was simply too shocking.","Among the many experts present, the one with the strongest domineering aura should be Ba Cang!","However, Ba Cang was only at the fifth level of the void. Regardless of whether it was his strength or the domineering aura on his body, he was far, far inferior to this burly man.","When this middle-aged man appeared and that domineering aura swept out crazily, the countless experts present had already fixed their gazes on this burly man. Even the Flame Saint Master and the Destruction Saint Master who had arrived...all of them looked at the burly man.","“This person...”","“Who is he? Why does it feel like his strength isn’t any weaker than the three Great Saint Realm Masters? No, not only is he not weak, he seems to be even stronger than the three Great Saint Realm Masters!”","“In terms of aura alone, he is indeed stronger than the three Great Saint Realm Masters. In the Divine Beginning Realm, the only ones stronger than the three Great Saint Realm Masters are the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, the Temporal Temple Master, and the Heavenly Ancestor. Who is this person in front of us?”","“What a terrifying domineering aura. This domineering aura is definitely the strongest I’ve ever seen. Among the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, Temporal Temple Master, and Heavenly Ancestor, the only one with unparalleled domineering aura is...the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master!”","“This person is the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master!”","“Oh my God, even the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master is here!”","“Crazy, crazy!”","“What’s going on?”","Countless exclamations rose and fell in the sky. The experts present were so shocked that they could not speak.","They only felt that today’s battle was too crazy, too crazy!","There was nothing they could do. From the start of the battle until now, the experts that appeared were more and more shocking. Until now, experts like Elder Dark Bone and the four ancient immortals were nothing, because even the three Saint Realm Masters had appeared! Even the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had appeared!","Especially the appearance of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, which made people tremble.","It must be known that among the three great Freedom Alliances, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was the strongest, and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master had been regarded by many people as the strongest expert in the Divine Beginning Realm for a long time.","Now, the number one expert of the Divine Beginning Realm had actually appeared in front of them!","How could they not be shocked?","Contrary to the shock of the experts present, the expressions of the three great Saint Realms were not good.","“Including Lei, Destruction, Flame Saint Master...in order to kill a little Saint Realm fellow, the three of you attacked at the same time. You really have some ability.” The incomparably domineering and burly man, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, had a cold look in his eyes, he swept his gaze across the three Saint Realm Masters.","The Life and Death Saint Master, including Lei, was currently in a heated battle with the golden-armored puppet of the four ancient immortals. He had no time to care about this. However, the two of them were facing the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance head-on.","“Leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance!” The eyes of the Destruction Saint Master narrowed slightly as he stared at the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance.","“Jiu Moyi?” The face of the Flame Saint Master darkened slightly.","The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was called Jiu Moyi. Only very few people in the Divine Beginning Realm knew his real name, but the three great Saint Realm Masters knew it.","“Leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, this matter has nothing to do with the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, right?” Saint Master Destruction said.","“Who said it has nothing to do with it?” The leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance said seriously, “You should know that Heavenly Sword Marquis is also a heaven-rank member of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, and he has been to the Heaven-cleaving Mystic Realm before. He is quite close to the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. If you want to kill him now, of course, you have to get the consent of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance and my consent.”","“In the Divine Beginning Realm, who do the three Saint Realms need to ask for permission to kill? What a joke!” Flame Saint Master’s voice was cold.","“Leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, you should be just an avatar, right?” Destruction Saint Master looked over. “Although your original body didn’t go to the universe battlefield, it has been there for a long time and hasn’t been able to escape. The three holy realms already know this. At most, you can only come as an avatar. What can a mere avatar do?”","Hearing this, the surrounding spectators were all enlightened.","They really thought that the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s original body had come, but now it seemed that it was just a consciousness clone.","As everyone knew, a consciousness clone could only have about 30-40% of the original body’s strength.","However, just 30-40% of the consciousness clone’s aura was already so strong. If the Heaven-cleaving Alliance’s original body came personally, how strong would it be?","“Elder Mo Shan said that as long as I use this bamboo leaf, I can almost stay alive in the Divine Beginning Realm. He used two words, which means that there might be some changes. For example, I’m afraid this bamboo leaf can’t completely protect my life when facing three masters of the Saint Realm at the same time.” Jian Wushuang understood.","The purple bamboo leaf given to him by the Heaven-cleaving Alliance was extraordinary. It contained a consciousness clone of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","With this consciousness clone, no matter what kind of crisis he encountered in the Divine Beginning Realm, he should be able to resolve it. However, it was not absolute.","After all, the crisis he was facing now was truly unique!","Three great Saint Realm Masters had arrived at the same time. With such a situation, if it was just a consciousness clone of the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, there was indeed no absolute guarantee.","But fortunately, other than the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master’s consciousness clone, he also had Elder Dark Bone and the four ancient immortals as helpers.. Elder Dark Bone could barely hold back the Destruction Saint Master while the four ancient immortals blocked the Life and Death Saint Master, as long as the Heaven-cleaving Alliance’s consciousness clone dealt with the Destruction Saint Master, it would be enough."]},{"number":3315,"title":"Chapter 3315 - Unforeseen Circumstances","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Elder Dark Bone, you just need to think of a way to stall Flame Saint Master. As for Destruction Saint Master, let the consciousness avatar of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master handle him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Elder Dark Bone nodded slightly.","“Although I’m only a consciousness avatar and can only exert 30% of my original strength, I’m more than enough to deal with a mere Destruction Saint Master,” the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master said in a low voice. “Destruction Saint Master, come here and die!”","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was extremely domineering. He moved his body and instantly swept up a terrifying air current to suppress the void in front of him.","The space instantly exploded and a huge heaven and earth storm formed out of thin air. In this heaven and earth storm, the consciousness clone of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master was already fighting with Destruction Saint Master, while on the other side...Elder Dark Bone was also fighting with Flame Saint Master.","A terrifying power swept out. Jian Wushuang, the experts of the Temporal Temple, and the three Saint Realm camps had long retreated to the edge of the battlefield. They knew very well that a battle of this level was not something they could be involved in.","“Humph, do you think you can protect Heavenly Sword Marquis by stopping the three of us? Dream on!”","In the middle of the battlefield, the cold snort of Flame Saint Master suddenly came out. “Flame Divine Guard, Kill Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“Flame Divine Guard?” Temple Master Bai Xing’s expression changed.","In the front of the battlefield, four figures covered in flames suddenly rushed out.","These four figures were like four inferno demon gods, carrying shocking demonic power and crazily attacking Jian Wushuang.","When the four inferno demon gods attacked, the experts of the three Saint Realms, the Sorceror God Sect, and the Nine-tailed Clan also attacked.","A chaotic battle broke out again.","“We’re in big trouble!” Temple Master Bai Xing looked at the four flame demon gods at the front with an ugly expression.","“Flame Divine Guards? Flame Saint Master actually brought four Flame Divine Guards with him?” Ba Cang clenched his teeth.","“Temple Master, what are these Flame Divine Guards?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","“Flame Divine Guards, as the name implies, are the guards around the Flame Saint Master. They are human cultivators, but they have been specially refined to become half-human and half-puppet monsters. In the Flame Saint Master, the Flame Divine Guards only obey the orders of the Flame Saint Master. There are many times when the Flame Saint Master is not convenient to deal with things personally, so most of them are dealt with by the Flame Divine Guards under his command. The strength of the Flame Divine Guards is generally very high!”","“Under normal circumstances, a single Flame Divine Guard is an existence at the fifth level of the void. However, these four Flame Divine Guards before us can transform into Blazing Inferno devil gods that are covered in flames. This clearly shows that they have already reached the peak of the fifth level of the void!” Palace Master Bai Xing’s voice was low.","“In terms of strength, even though our Temporal Temple is as far away as Master Lin Guang’s ten-man team, it still can’t compare to the three great saint-level factions. Previously, it was only because of Elder Dark Bone’s existence that we were able to hold back several peak-level saint-level experts. But now, Elder Dark Bone is fighting with the sacred master of Fire, and the three great saint-level factions have four more Flame Divine Guards. This battle prowess completely surpasses ours.” Ba Cang said.","“Drag it out, we can only think of a way to drag it out!” Temple Master Bai Xing’s voice was cold as he looked around. “Everyone, try to drag it out as long as possible. As long as we can drag it out until the Temple Master arrives, this crisis will be resolved!”","“Drag it out, drag it out!”","“Do not engage in a head-on battle!”","“Be careful, protect Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","The many experts of the Temporal Temple had already seen the situation clearly at this moment.","The situation was more dangerous than before, and the gap in strength between the two sides was even greater. Especially the four Flame Divine Guards, who had been entangled by the experts of the three Saint Realms, these four Flame Divine Guards could run amok on the battlefield.","No one could stop them.","The four Flame Divine Guards were not hindered at all and directly charged at Jian Wushuang.","“Haha, Heavenly Sword Marquis, I’ll see if you’re still alive!” At the same time, the Sky Nether Master and several people from the Sorceror God Sect were also charging toward Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted. “The gap between the strength of the lineup is too big. I can’t rely on the experts of the Temporal Temple to stop them for me. I can only rely on myself!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his hands and secretly sent a message, “Senior Blood Wave, I need your help.”","“Little guy, I’ve seen your current situation. If you want to resolve this crisis, you need a lot of help. The biggest help I can give you now is to give you all the remaining power in the Blood Wave Realm so that you can reach a new level in a short time. But the price is that my Blood Wave Realm will collapse. From now on, I can’t give you any more help in this realm!”","“In addition, the power you are given by force will be a great burden to you. You must try your best to resist the backlash of this power. Otherwise, if you are not careful, your divine body will directly collapse. Even if you are a perfect level life form, you will still be unable to withstand it and may die. So, you have to think carefully.” Blood Wave immediately replied.","“I’m in a critical situation now. I can only fight. There’s no need to think too much about it,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Well, get ready. The power...is coming!” Blood Wave’s voice sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","On the surface of the sea, the originally completely collapsed Saha Island had completely collapsed. However, no one noticed that there was still a small piece of land on the surface of the sea that was intact, even if there was a strong shockwave that affected the small piece of land, it did not cause much damage to the land.","The reason for this was that there was a special magic array on the land, which was connected to the Blood Wave Realm!","At this moment, as the sound of Blood Wave rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind, a vast power suddenly surged out from the small piece of land.","Hualala! An endless blood-red light swept out from the formation of the land. The blood-red light was extremely dazzling and instantly illuminated the world, causing the entire world to sink into the color of blood.","The blood-red light spread out, and a suffocating power spread out, causing the entire battlefield to fall into a short period of silence.","Many experts on the battlefield looked at this sudden change in surprise.","Except for Jian Wushuang, no one knew why the blood light spread out. No one knew why the sudden change happened.","However, under everyone’s shocked gaze, the surging blood light directly covered Jian Wushuang. In the blink of an eye, it had covered Jian Wushuang and formed a blood cocoon that could be seen with the naked eye!","...."]},{"number":3316,"title":"Chapter 3316 - The Power of a Sword","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“What is this?”","On the battlefield, the experts from both sides saw the blood cocoon and were puzzled.","“This is caused by Heavenly Sword Marquis again. What is he doing?” Star River Master frowned.","Since the beginning of the battle, there had been many changes on the battlefield, many of which were caused by Jian Wushuang alone. Although Jian Wushuang’s strength...was not taken seriously by Star River Master, he was still afraid of his trump cards and methods.","For example, Jian Wushuang took out the Mountain River Map universe supreme treasure and guided the strongest moves of Palace Master Shuiyun and Palace Master Askance.","Just now, he even guided the consciousness avatar of Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","Jian Wushuang had too many methods.","Now, the sudden change and the appearance of the blood cocoon clearly had something to do with Jian Wushuang.","“Humph, who cares what tricks he has? No matter how powerful he is, he can’t possibly have the battle strength above the sixth realm of the void all of a sudden. If we all attack together, he’ll die!” The Sky Nether Master snorted, in an instant, he and the four divine flame guards charged out.","Buzz! The blood light that filled the sky slowly dissipated, and the blood cocoon gradually disappeared. Jian Wushuang’s figure was once again revealed to everyone.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang did not seem to have changed at first glance. However, only Jian Wushuang knew how much he had changed compared to just now.","“This power...” Jian Wushuang held his hands. He could feel the unparalleled power that had appeared in his body.","This power was too strong, too strong.","It was so strong that Jian Wushuang did not know how strong it was. However, he knew that he was hundreds, thousands of times stronger than before!","“I have a feeling that I can easily kill the Principles Master now,” Jian Wushuang murmured. He looked at the four flame divine guards in front of him, the Sky Nether Master and the others had already arrived in front of him.","“Boy, die!” The Sky Nether Master’s killing intent was shocking.","Although the four flame divine guards did not speak, their bodies were covered in flames. As they attacked, the suffocating hot aura swept toward Jian wushuang.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, be careful!”","“Retreat!”","Not far away, Temple Master Bai Xing and Ba Cang shouted at the same time.","However, Jian Wushuang did not have any intention of retreating.","“Come on, let me see how strong I am now.” Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head, and a fierce light flashed in his eyes. His body also trembled. At this moment, a terrifying aura that could make heaven and earth submit suddenly erupted from Jian Wushuang’s body.","This aura immediately suppressed the flame divine guard, and the others in front of him.","“What?” Sky Nether Master’s expression changed greatly.","Jian Wushuang had already made his move.","Clang!","Blood Mountain Sword was unsheathed, and a shocking sword essence condensed in his hand.","“I feel that this space seems to be very weak now?” Jian Wushuang muttered, and the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand directly swept out.","The sword edge swept across the void, and the solid space was cut open like a piece of paper. What was frightening was that Jian Wushuang’s sword did not just barely cut open the space, but after it was cut open...the sword shadow continued to sweep down.","The space crack became bigger and bigger, and in the blink of an eye, it had spread to more than 100 meters!","With a casual swing of his sword, he sliced open a spatial crack that was over a hundred meters wide. His sword shadow also became incomparably huge. In an instant, it swept over the bodies of the four flame divine guards, Sky Nether Master, and the others.","Chi!","It was as if the sound of a blade entering one’s body rang out. The raging flames surrounding the bodies of the four flame divine guards were instantly extinguished. Their devil might also completely dissipated, and their bodies had already been cut into two halves.","Then the power of the sword light did not decrease, the same scene also appeared in the Sky Nether Master and with the Sky Nether Master to kill a few Principles Masters.","“No!”","The Sky Nether Master only had time to let out a roar, and his body had already split into two. After his body split, his consciousness also began to be annihilated. His immortal body, under this sword, did not make any difference.","Buzz!","The sword light completely dissipated, that was cut hundreds of meters of space cracks began to slowly converge.","But on the way, the four flame divine guards, as well as the Sky Nether Master and a few other principles, have died on the spot!","The power of a sword, so terrible!","...","Silence!","The battlefield, where the two sides had fought fiercely, fell into a dead silence at this moment.","Other than the sound of the intense battle between the three Saint Realm Masters, the four ancient Immortals, the consciousness incarnation of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and Elder Dark Bone, the other places were completely silent!","Whether it was the Temporal Temple or the three Saint Realm camps, as well as the countless experts who were watching the battle, their eyes were wide open as they watched this scene in disbelief.","Unbelievable!","The scene before them was indeed unbelievable!","It was almost impossible to happen!","“What did I just see?”","“That Heavenly Sword Marquis killed four flame divine guards with a single sword strike, and he even killed the Sky Nether Master?”","“It’s fake. This is an illusion. Who cast this illusion on us?”","“This, this is really not an illusion?”","Countless experts murmured. They knew that what they saw was not an illusion, but they still did not want to believe what they had seen.","Because it was too incredible.","Heavenly Sword Marquis was, after all, just an immortal saint. They could barely accept the fact that he was able to challenge experts in the second and third realms of the void realm by relying on his tyrannical means, then, Jian Wushuang took out his many trump cards, causing the battle to go from bad to worse. They could tolerate this. After all, a trump card did not represent Jian Wushuang’s own strength.","But now...he killed four flame divine guards and the Sky Nether Master with one sword strike. No one could accept this.","After all, the four flame divine guards and the nether master were all at the peak of the fifth realm of the void. Even experts at the peak of the sixth realm of the void could hardly kill them in a one-on-one fight, not to mention killing all of them with a single sword.","This was definitely not something that a Principles Master could do. If one wanted to achieve even the slightest bit of this, they would at least need the combat strength of a Saint Realm Master!","No, even a Saint Realm Master might not be able to do it!","“Above the Saint Realm Master, is it the legendary...ruler level?” Palace Master Bai Xing asked in astonishment.","...."]},{"number":3317,"title":"Chapter 3317 - Other Fortuitous Encounters?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","_______________","This place was inside the Blood Wave Realm.","At the end of the boundless darkness, the consciousness of blood wave stood there. He could only watch as the boundless darkness around him started to end, and the dark space started to crack, at the same time, the entire Blood Wave Realm also started to collapse crazily.","Even the blood wave palace... The Land of opportunity that countless undying Saints longed for, the complete Heavenly Dao that had formed a stable cycle earlier had lost its past glory. A large number of law energies began to become chaotic, it became violent. Gradually, the complete Heavenly Dao cycle shattered. This also meant that the final opportunity within the Blood Wave Realm had vanished.","The entire Blood Wave Realm was about to be completely destroyed.","“The Blood Wave Realm that has existed for so many years is finally about to disappear.” Blood Wave’s consciousness watched everything quietly. His heart was extremely calm, and there was not the slightest ripple. “To be able to find and help a perfect-grade life form, the destruction of the Blood Wave Realm is worth it.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, this power of yours is forcefully bestowed upon you by the Blood Wave Realm. Furthermore, this power is ultimately not yours. Therefore, while you are controlling this power, this power is also continuously draining. Before long, it will be completely exhausted. Therefore, you have to seize this opportunity. I have already done my best to help you. As for whether you can escape this crisis, it is up to you!”","“Kid, remember this. You’re already a member of the Life Palace. If you’re strong enough, you must go to the deepest part of the universe. You must go to the Life Palace. There’s a special life form like you that must complete the mission!”","“Remember this!”","While Blood Wave was talking, his body was fading away. After he finished speaking, his body completely disappeared.","At this moment, the Blood Wave Realm was completely destroyed. From then on, there would no longer be an opportunity like the Blood Wave Realm in the Divine Beginning Realm.","...","“Thank you, Elder Blood Wave!”","Jian Wushuang was still standing on the battlefield. He had received Blood Wave’s final message and was filled with gratitude. Then, he raised his head and looked around the battlefield. Because of the explosion of his sword just now...everyone was shocked. The experts from both sides, who had been standing together again, were now separated again.","Everyone’s eyes were on him. The experts from the three Saint Realms, the Sorceror God Sect, and the Nine-tailed Clan all wanted to kill him, but no one dared to attack him again because Jian Wushuang’s sword just now...had shocked everyone.","No one knew whether Jian Wushuang could use that attack again.","“Eh?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed, and he looked at the battlefield next to him.","It was the battle between Elder Dark Bone and Flame Saint Master.","Flame Saint Master was a real master of the Saint Realm. Although Elder Dark Bone was very old, powerful, and had many skills, he was still far from a real master of the Saint Realm, he only relied on his special skills to barely tangle with Flame Saint Master.","But now, he was in a very dangerous situation.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang rushed into the battlefield in a flash and appeared beside Elder Dark Bone.","“Elder Dark Bone, you go down and recover. Leave Flame Saint Master to me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Leave him to you?” Elder Dark Bone frowned and looked at Jian Wushuang.","He had noticed that Jian Wushuang had killed four divine flame guards and Sky Nether Master with one sword strike while he was fighting with the Flame Saint Master. Moreover, he was standing beside Jian Wushuang now, he could feel the shocking aura from Jian Wushuang and nodded immediately. “Okay, be careful!”","With that, Elder Dark Bone retreated to the side.","In the void, Jian Wushuang and Flame Saint Master were separated by a distance. Yaoyao was holding her sword.","Jian Wushuang held his sword with one hand. The aura from his body was far superior to that of a Principles Master.","As for Flame Saint Master, he was completely immersed in the sea of flames. He was the absolute flame dominator. His pupils contracted and released an astonishing killing intent","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how did you get this power?” The Flame Saint Master stared at Jian Wushuang. He did not believe that this power belonged to Jian Wushuang, even though he was a perfect-grade life-form, he was someone who even feared the power of the will of heaven and had to be killed. However, no matter how heaven-defying he was, he could not possess such tyrannical power at the level of a saint.","“Can you guess?” Jian Wushuang gave a strange smile.","“Humph, in the Divine Beginning Realm, there are no more than five people who can possess such power. However, even if they have such power, they can’t pour it into your body and let you control it. The people who can do this must be beyond the scope of the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“You just came out of the Blood Wave Realm, and you got a great opportunity in the Blood Wave Realm. Your strength has improved greatly, and you can fight against an expert of the third realm of the void with the Immortal Saint Realm. Therefore, you must have had other opportunities in the Blood Wave Realm. Your power must be related to the Blood Wave Realm!”","“Yes!” Flame Saint Master said in a deep voice.","Flame Saint Master was indeed very prepared. He directly guessed that Jian Wushuang’s power was related to the Blood Wave Realm.","Upon hearing Flame Saint Master’s words, the surrounding experts who were watching the battle were all stunned.","“Blood Wave Realm?”","“Did Heavenly Sword Marquis encounter other opportunities in the Blood Wave Realm?”","“It’s very possible. Otherwise, how could he become so powerful after coming out of the Blood Wave Realm? He is clearly an Immortal Saint, but he can actually fight against a Principles Master of the three void realms. Even if he had great ability beyond his realm, it’s impossible for him to be so powerful.”","“Tsk, tsk. This Heavenly Sword Marquis is really blessed. I wonder what he has gained in the Blood Wave Realm.”","Voices of discussion spread throughout the void.","Jian Wushuang, however, smiled faintly, “Flame Saint Master, you’re indeed very smart, but it’s useless. I Won’t waste any more words with you. I’ve long known that you three masters of the Saint Realm are extremely powerful. Today, I’d like to experience it.”","“Just you?” Flame Saint Master looked down at Jian Wushuang.","“Just me.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but his eyes became cold.","“Senior Blood Wave is right. Although I have extremely powerful strength now, it’s too much for my divine body. It’s also constantly flowing. Just when I used that sword move, I felt the divine power in my body surging, as if it was going to explode completely. I can’t hold on for long in my current state. Before the power in my body disappears, I must at least find out how big the gap is between me and the three masters of the Saint Realm!”","...."]},{"number":3318,"title":"Chapter 3318 - Battle Flame Saint Master","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Let’s fight!”","With a low roar, Jian Wushuang rushed out.","“You’re courting death!”","The Flame Saint Master was extremely powerful. The moment he saw Jian Wushuang, he waved his hand.","Boom! A scorching aura surged out. A huge sea of fire appeared in the void in front of the Flame Saint Master. In this sea of fire, scorching scarlet-golden flames were burning fiercely, the space was easily burned. When the surrounding experts saw the scarlet-golden sea of fire, they could not help but shudder.","They felt that even a wisp of scarlet-golden flames from the scarlet-golden sea of fire could easily burn a Principles Master to ashes. But now, this huge sea of fire...it covered Jian Wushuang completely.","“Break!”","The sea of fire attacked. Jian Wushuang spat out a word and slashed down with his Blood Mountain Sword.","This sword was not very powerful, but at the moment it was slashed...","Whoosh!","The sword light instantly passed through the entire sea of fire.","A path had been cut open in the huge sea of fire, and a large amount of scarlet-gold flame swept out in all directions.","In the split path of the sea of fire, a figure flashed past, and Jian Wushuang appeared in front of Flame Saint Master.","“Ninth firmament illusionary sword realm!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","There were nine sword glows, each of which was extremely fast and carried a shocking power as they slashed toward Flame Saint Master.","Flame Saint Master’s eyes were cold as he wielded the long golden staff in his hand.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","A series of clanging sounds rang out as the two collided nine times in an instant.","After the nine collisions, the flames on Flame Saint Master’s body had dimmed significantly. His body also retreated rapidly. On the other hand, Jian Wushuang did not stop at all.","“In terms of power, I’m stronger than him!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled.","After the first exchange, he had already realized that he was stronger than Flame Saint Master purely in terms of power.","“Ruler-level!” Flame Saint Master narrowed his eyes and stared at Jian Wushuang. “This kid really has the power of a ruler. Although I have the power of the will of heaven, there is still a gap between me and a ruler-level. However, this kid only has strength, but in terms of his absolute arts and techniques, he can’t be compared to a real ruler!”","“As long as I’m not stupid enough to fight him head-on, I can easily crush him!”","A cold light flashed in Flame Saint Master’s eyes. In the next moment, the sea of scarlet-gold fire swept toward Jian Wushuang again.","However, under the guidance of Flame Saint Master, the sea of scarlet-gold fire seemed to come to life and was completely ‘alive’.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Golden-red pillars of fire extended out from the sea of fire. Each pillar of fire was like a chain, crazily attacking Jian Wushuang from all directions. Jian Wushuang immediately brandished his sword to defend himself.","Although he could directly defeat these golden-red pillars of fire with the power of his swordsmanship, there were many of them. Moreover, they were very fast and flexible. One of them was defeated, more fire pillars immediately formed around Jian Wushuang, forcing him into a very difficult situation.","While Jian Wushuang was completely suppressed by the fire pillars, a strange figure suddenly appeared behind him. It was the Flame Saint Master, who had already merged into the sea of fire, the Flame Saint Master waved the long red-gold staff with one hand, and in an instant, it smashed toward Jian Wushuang’s divine body like a bolt of golden lightning.","“Oh no!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He had already sensed the astonishing power coming from behind him. He immediately turned around and blocked the Blood Mountain Sword with great difficulty, ignoring the strikes of the scarlet-gold fire pillars in front of him.","Bang!","With a loud sound, both of Jian Wushuang’s arms went numb, and his body shook. His Qi and blood churned, and he retreated in a sorry state. It took him a long time to regain his balance.","“Haha, boy, although you have obtained a power comparable to that of a ruler through the Blood Wave Realm, you only have the power of your own body. Your comprehension of the principles, the understanding of the Dao, and the skills you have created are still at the level of the Immortal Saint. It’s like having a peerless sword that can cut through iron like mud, but in the hands of an infant, you can’t use it!”","“You only have your strength now, but you can’t use it perfectly. Under such circumstances, it’s easy for me to kill you!” Flame Saint Master sneered, he merged into the crimson-gold sea of fire again.","The crimson-gold sea of fire surged toward Jian Wushuang again.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened as he looked around coldly. “Flame Saint Master is right. Although I have invincible power above the Principles Master, I can’t use it fully with my strength...”","“I can’t compete with Flame Saint Master. I can only rely on brute force to suppress him!”","Jian Wushuang had already made up his mind. Just as the scarlet-gold sea of fire was sweeping toward him, he suddenly retreated.","While he was retreating, a series of special hand seals were struck out.","“Mountain River Map...Mountain River as palm, nine regions as seal!”","“True Emperor Seal!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes burst with a fierce light.","Boom!","The world suddenly shook.","In the highest part of the sky, the scroll world formed by the Mountain River Map had always existed. At this moment, a supreme power slowly condensed from the scroll world.","This power could only be described as shocking.","The moment this power began to condense, the countless experts watching the battle below all raised their heads in horror.","At this moment, they felt a terrifying power that terrified them, as if they were about to be completely annihilated by the power!","Then, a huge handprint slowly descended from the scroll world.","Nine-region seal!","It was one of the secret skills of the Mountain River Map.","The Mountain River Map was a top-tier universe supreme treasure, and its secret skill was extremely powerful. It was only because Jian Wushuang was too weak before, he could not fully display the power of these secret skills.","But now it was different. Although his realm was not very high, the power he had now was at the ruler level!"]},{"number":3319,"title":"Chapter 3319 - Supreme Seal","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","________","A huge handprint slowly appeared in the scroll world, as if it was going to destroy the world.","The True Emperor Seal of the nine-region seal!","This handprint directly crushed toward the void where Jian Wushuang was. Of course, the entire True Emperor Seal was under Jian Wushuang’s control, so this handprint naturally could not hurt Jian Wushuang, however, it crushed the golden-red sea of fire around him.","Boom!","Under the pressure of the True Emperor Seal, the golden-red sea of fire seemed to be completely extinguished, and endless flames swept out in all directions.","Finally, the power of the True Emperor Seal was completely exhausted, and the palm slowly disappeared from the world. However, although there were still some flames around Jian Wushuang, the sea of fire no longer existed.","“Buzz!” In the void not far away, Flame Saint Master’s figure condensed again. He glanced at the scroll world and his eyes darkened. “Nine-region seal?”","Flame Saint Master knew about the nine-region seal.","After all, the Mountain River Map was one of the most important battle strength of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect when the three Saint Realms destroyed the Seven Star Mysterious Sect during the world-ending war. However, it was Xuan Yi who controlled the map at that time!","“Flame Saint Master, you’re right. It’s difficult for me to fully display my current strength with my own skills, but I can do it with the help of the Mountain River Map!” Jian Wushuang stared at Flame Saint Master. “Since you know about the nine-region seal, you should be able to see that I just used the True Emperor Seal. Now, try my supreme seal again!”","Jian Wushuang looked into the cave. The terrifying power on his body condensed again, and one special seal after another was struck out.","Rumble! The world shook, and in the scroll world at the top, a stronger power began to condense again.","The nine-region seal had the strongest three seals: divine emperor, true emperor, and supreme seal!","The True Emperor Seal that Jian Wushuang just used was only the second move of the nine-region seal.","The supreme seal was the most powerful manifestation of the secret skill of the nine regions seal.","Boom!","Another huge handprint extended from the scroll world. This handprint covered the sky and seemed to cover everything below.","All the experts under this handprint, whether they were Immortal Saints or Principles Masters, were terrified at this moment.","The terrifying power contained within this hand seal was not something that even the lords of edicts could come into contact with. Even if dozens or even hundreds of them were gathered together, they probably would not be able to face such incredible power.","“An autarch seal. Hmph. It’s been many years since I’ve encountered one.” Flame Saint Master stood beneath the enormous hand seal, staring upward with an abnormally cold gaze. “I just don’t know who is stronger and who is weaker than the paragon seal that your master used back then!”","A large amount of flames surged from Flame Saint Master’s body. These flames contained endless darkness and coldness.","Hua la la, the void collapsed.","Flame Saint Master had not attacked yet, but that formless power had already caused the surrounding void to explode.","In his hand, the golden staff suddenly expanded in size, as if it had turned into a heavenly pillar. In an instant, it stabbed toward the huge hand seal above.","Boom!","The huge hand seal had a hole in its center, but it was unable to completely pierce through the hand seal. The huge hand seal continued to press down on the golden staff and continued to cover the Flame Saint Master.","“Rise!”","Flame Saint Master shouted, and an even more violent purple-gold flame suddenly surged in the world.","In terms of power level, this purple-gold flame was clearly stronger than the scarlet-gold flame that Flame Saint Master had used previously.","Endless purple-gold flame condensed, and in the blink of an eye, it formed a huge flame demon god.","This flame demon god was a thousand feet long true treasure, and it had four huge and thick arms. After it was formed, it let out a crazy roar, and its four arms directly lifted up to support the huge hand seal that was slowly crushing over.","No matter how powerful the palm was, it could not suppress it any further.","“Break for me!”","The eyes of Flame Saint Master lit up, and the huge blazing flame demonic god opened its mouth and roared. At the same time, a purplish-gold light of destruction erupted from the mouth of the blazing flame demonic god, directly piercing through the palm. The huge palm...finally began to collapse, and a large amount of power began to spread in all directions.","“Haha, Heavenly Sword Marquis, it seems that the power of your nine-region seal is still not as powerful as your Master Xuan Yi’s?","“Your master used the supreme seal to crush us with absolute superiority.” Flame Saint Master laughed heartily.","Jian Wushuang’s face was cold and unmoved.","He knew very well that the current him could not be compared to his master at his peak?","When his master Xuan Yi was at his peak, he had created the Heaven-cleaving technique and was an invincible existence that could fight against heaven and earth. He was able to crush the three masters of the Saint Realm by himself, moreover, his master’s grasp of the mountain and River Society Map had long reached the limit.","On the other hand, he was only an Immortal Saint. It was only because of the help of Blood Wave that he was able to possess the power of a ruler for a short period of time. Other than this power, the current him...he could not compare to his master at all.","His control of the mountain and river map was also the same. Although he had used the supreme seal, it was still not the strongest power.","“Flame Saint Master, it’s too early for you to be happy.” Jian Wushuang stared at Flame Saint Master with a cold gaze. “In addition to the mountain and river map, I also obtained a very unique divine ability in the Heaven-cleaving Mystic Realm of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. I was too weak before and could not use the real power of this divine ability. Now, I can use you to test this divine ability of mine.”","As soon as Jian Wushuang’s voice fell, a large amount of power of the Samsara principles rose from his body.","The Samsara principles...his comprehension of the Samsara principles had only reached the limit of the Immortal Saint, and he had not completely comprehended it. Logically, under such circumstances, he should not be able to unleash the true power of the six paths of reincarnation secret skill, it was impossible for him to unleash the true power of this secret skill.","Jian Wushuang was very clear on this point. However, the six paths of reincarnation secret skill was too powerful. In addition, Jian Wushuang’s strength and power had already reached the overlord level. Relying on such power to use the six paths of reincarnation secret skill...it would definitely be very terrifying.","Of course, the most critical problem was that among the many techniques Jian Wushuang had, only the secret skill in the Mountain River Map and the six paths of reincarnation secret skill were qualified to threaten the Flame Saint Master.","...."]},{"number":3320,"title":"Chapter 3320 - Hungry Ghost Dao","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","__________","“Six paths of reincarnation, Hell Dao, extreme cold hell!”","With a wave of Jian Wushuang’s hand...","Buzz!","Divine power burst out.","The space in the vast world was completely frozen, followed by cracking sounds, and the void exploded inch by inch!","This burst of void can not be a powerful force directly red open or torn, but at the moment spread around the terrible cold, directly frozen space burst.","Even a stable space like the Divine Beginning Realm could be frozen to the point of bursting. One could imagine just how intense this cold that filled heaven and earth was.","Cold hell, it is cold to the extreme!","When Jian Wushuang was still weak, the power of this move was not too terrifying. However, Jian Wushuang still relied on this move to kill a rank seven True Saint despite being only a rank four True Saint.","Now, he used the same move. However, Jian Wushuang’s power was now at the ruler level. Even though his comprehension of the reincarnation principles was not very strong, this move was still extremely terrifying.","“This, this is too cold!”","“We are already far away from the battlefield, but I still feel so cold. It’s as if my soul is going to be completely frozen. I wonder how cold the center of the battlefield is!”","“Such a terrible cold. I’m afraid that any rule master who enters the area will be instantly frozen into an ice sculpture.”","The experts watching the battle in the surroundings could already sense the extreme cold in the air ahead, and their hearts were filled with shock.","Flame Saint Master, who was at the center of the battlefield, was naturally facing the corrosion of this extreme cold. However, Flame Saint Master only smiled coldly. “Corrosion of cold? I have to say that this technique of yours is indeed extraordinary, but it’s a pity that you used the wrong person.”","As soon as Flame Saint Master finished speaking, raging flames immediately surged around him. These flames were still purple-gold in color and burned the space crazily, releasing an incredible temperature.","Flame Saint Master was famous for his flames in the Divine Beginning Realm.","His many methods contained terrifying flames that could burn everything.","If Jian Wushuang’s extreme cold hell was extremely cold, then the flames around Flame Saint Master were extremely hot and violent. The two were completely opposite, but they could contend against each other.","Now, a large amount of purple-gold flames swept up around the Flame Saint Master, crazily resisting the erosion of the surrounding coldness. The Flame Saint Master, who was in the middle of the flames, was not affected at all.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was not too surprised.","The first two levels of the hell Dao, the extreme hot hell and the extreme cold hell, were only the most shallow two of the six secret skills of reincarnation. It was normal that they could not do anything to the Flame Saint Master.","Buzz. With a thought from Jian Wushuang, the cold air in the sky disappeared and was replaced by boundless darkness.","Yes, it was darkness. The darkness was boundless and there was no light at all. It was like a boundless void.","The Flame Saint Master had completely fallen into the boundless dark void. As for Jian Wushuang, he stood outside the boundless dark void and quietly watched the scene inside.","Hell Dao...lonely hell!","This move was aimed at Jian Wushuang’s state of mind and consciousness. Previously, he had used it in the Blood Wave Realm and almost made thunder god, who was much stronger than him, fall into madness. Now, it was Flame Saint Master who was facing this move.","“Haha! You want to affect my state of mind? How ridiculous!”","Flame Saint Master, who had fallen into the lonely hell, suddenly let out a hearty laugh. His body trembled slightly and he did not use any other means. However, the boundless darkness around him had begun to retreat crazily, in just a moment, it had completely disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s lonely hell had completely disintegrated.","“As expected of a master of the Saint Realm. He was the supreme overlord of the Divine Beginning Realm countless years ago. After living for so many years, his state of mind has long been unshakable. My lonely hell can not affect him at all.” Jian Wushuang sighed secretly.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you still have some tricks up your sleeve. Go ahead and use them.” Flame Saint Master looked at Jian Wushuang with a sneer.","“As you wish.” Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. Vast power began to gather in his body again.","“The six paths of reincarnation, hell alone, can’t affect Flame Saint Master. In that case, it’s up to the hungry ghost path!”","The first path of the six paths of reincarnation was the hell path.","The second path was the hungry ghost path!","The hungry ghost path was much more terrifying than the hell path. Jian Wushuang had not been able to master it before he entered the Blood Wave Realm. However, after his trip to the Blood Wave Realm, his strength had greatly increased, and his comprehension of the Samsara principles had also greatly improved. This move...he could barely use it.","“Hell’s gate, open!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly pointed to the void next to him, and a large amount of the power of the Samsara principles swept out in an instant.","The void was originally very calm, but under Jian Wushuang’s finger, the void began to tremble slowly.","The trembling became more and more intense. Gradually, a crack slowly appeared in the center of the void, and an extremely unique aura was emitted from the crack.","This aura seemed to come from the demon abyss. It was extremely cold and evil.","The evil made everyone present frown.","As the crack grew larger, it was as if a void door had been opened.","The already shocking evil aura reached its peak at this moment.","“Evil ghost Dao, descend!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light.","Roar!","A low roar that seemed to come from hell suddenly sounded from the other end of the void gate. The roar directly shook the souls of countless experts present. The moment they heard the low roar, all the experts present...felt their scalps go numb.","Then, under everyone’s gaze, a sharp blood-red claw suddenly stretched out from the other end of the void gate and grabbed the void gate around it, it was obvious that it wanted to struggle out of the void gate.","Soon, the body of a gigantic monster with an extremely strange structure appeared before everyone’s eyes.","This monster had an incomparably huge head, but its body was extremely thin and weak. Its entire body was covered in blood, and its two palms were at least a hundred feet long. The most eye-catching part was on the head of this monster! It had no nose, no ears, only a bloody mouth and a scarlet eye that almost took up half of its face!","Your extreme coldness and evil aura was emitted from this monster, and at this moment, it made people shudder!"]},{"number":3321,"title":"Chapter 3321 - Yimo","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Roar!”","The monster had completely broken free from the void gate and appeared in the center of the battlefield. With a roar, the world shook.","The surrounding experts looked at the monster in horror.","“What, what is this?”","“What an evil aura. It’s the first time I’ve seen such an evil aura.”","“Is this also the work of Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“What method did he use?!”","Exclamations sounded in the air.","“Is this the Yimo from the universe void?” Jian Wushuang looked at the monster in horror.","The six paths of reincarnation and the third level of the Dao of Hell were all special attacks.","The hungry ghost path was a special summoning skill that could summon evil spirits for its own use.","Of course, the evil spirits summoned by the hungry ghost path could not be the evil spirits in the Samsara Hell. Instead, it summoned an extremely terrifying creature, the Yimo, which was active in the vast universe void!","The Yimo...this name was very common in the Divine Beginning Realm. Although the experts of the Divine Beginning Realm had adventured in the universe battlefield, most of them only roamed around and had never really entered the deepest part of the universe, Yimo only existed in the deepest part of the universe, and it was very rare. Even those experts who roamed in the deepest part of the universe all year round rarely encountered it. Therefore, the Divine Beginning Realm had never interacted with the Yimo, they did not know what the Yimo was.","Jian Wushuang only learned about the existence of the Yimo after he mastered the hungry ghost path.","Moreover, the Yimo in the void of the universe was born for destruction. They were extremely evil, and their living desire was to destroy all living things they encountered. However, the hungry ghost path could forcibly control a Yimo and pass through the void gate, it could summon it to the battlefield where it was and listen to its orders.","For example, the Yimo that had struggled out of the void gate now completely listened to Jian Wushuang’s orders.","“The Yimo is born for destruction and is extremely terrifying. I wonder how strong the Yimo that I have summoned through the hungry ghost path is?” Jian Wushuang had a trace of anticipation in his heart. He immediately pointed with his right hand and gave the order, “Kill him!”","“Roar!”","The Yimo immediately roared in response to Jian Wushuang’s order. The next moment, whoosh! The huge body of the Yimo suddenly rushed out.","It was such a huge body, but the surrounding spectators could not see it clearly.","It was as if the Yimo had disappeared into thin air.","“It’s too fast!”","“What kind of speed is this?”","“It’s actually this fast?”","Countless experts widened their eyes.","Even the Flame Saint Master was shocked by the speed that the Yimo had unleashed. This was because before he could react, the Yimo had already appeared before him, furthermore, that sharp scarlet claw had already clawed at his head.","An endless evil aura rushed over. The Flame Saint Master’s body immediately surged with endless purple-gold flames, crazily sweeping toward the Yimo in front of him. However, under the attack of the Yimo’s claw, the purple-gold flames immediately dissipated, the sharp claw was not hindered in the slightest, and continued to claw toward Flame Saint Master.","“Scram!”","Flame Saint Master let out a low growl, and the scarlet-gold long rod in his hand fiercely smashed out. His shocking might instantly reached its peak.","Dang!","The scarlet-gold long rod and the Yimo’s sharp claw collided head-on. After a low collision sound, the Yimo’s figure rolled backwards explosively, but Flame Saint Master himself also retreated continuously!","“Amazing!”","“It’s actually on par with Flame Saint Master?”","“What kind of monster is this? How can it be so powerful? Is there such a terrifying monster in the Divine Beginning Realm?”","The onlookers could not help exclaiming in surprise.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes also lit up. “As expected of a Yimo born for destruction. Its strength is really terrifying. It’s not at all like Flame Saint Master. Moreover, the most terrifying thing about the Yimo is not its attack, but its speed!”","As expected, after a head-on clash, the Yimo’s speed completely erupted.","Sou! Sou! Sou! Sou!","The huge body of the Yimo could be seen crazily moving about in the void. It clearly had such a huge body and should have been extremely eye-catching. However, when the body of the Yimo moved, the surrounding experts who were watching the battle...including those Principles Masters, none of them could see the body of the Yimo clearly.","They could barely see a blood shadow moving freely in the void.","While this blood shadow moved freely in the void, it also attacked the Flame Saint Master time and time again.","The Yimo’s attacking methods were very terrifying. It could not only rely on the sharp claws of its two hands to launch attacks. Its feet, its huge body, its mouth, its eyes, everything on its body...it could use deadly attacks.","The Yimo that was born to destroy the world could not be compared to the beasts or fierce beasts in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","The Yimo’s body flashed and attacked crazily again and again. Each attack was extremely fast and violent, containing the power to destroy the world. Even the Flame Saint Master did not dare to resist the Yimo’s attack, he could only try his best to resist.","However, the Flame Saint Master could not keep up with the Yimo’s speed at all. Facing the crazy attack of the Yimo, he could only defend himself, but he did not have any ability to counterattack. In just a moment, the sacred master of fire was attacked by the Yimo, he was already in a terrible state.","“Bastard, where did this monster come from? How could it be so terrifying?!” The Flame Saint Master gritted his teeth, and his face turned red. He was a Saint Realm Master, one of the strongest existences in the Divine Beginning Realm, but in front of so many experts...how could he be suppressed by a monster from god-knows-where? Of course, this made him angry.","However, no matter how angry he was, he had to admit that this monster’s strength was too terrifying. In a one-on-one fight, he was indeed no match for this monster.","Even this monster could not do anything to it, let alone kill Jian Wushuang.","“Damn it!”","Flame Saint Master cursed in his heart, but he suddenly retreated. While retreating, Flame Saint Master looked at the void beside him. “Sorcerer God, how long do you plan to wait? Hurry up and lend me a hand!”","Flame Saint Master’s voice echoed throughout the battlefield.","Hearing this, all the experts present were stunned.","“Sorcerer God?”","“Is it the sect master of the Sorcerer God Sect?”","“The Sect Master of the Sorcerer God Sect is here too?”","Another wave of exclamations sounded on the battlefield.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted. He immediately looked toward the void where Flame Saint Master was looking at. A dark figure slowly emerged, and at the same time, an extremely powerful aura began to spread, gradually, it spread throughout the world.","...."]},{"number":3322,"title":"Chapter 3322 - Sorcerer God","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","The person who came was an old man in a black robe. His face was gaunt as if he was just skin and bones. There was a pair of cold and strange pupils in his eye sockets that seemed to be about to sink in, and they were also emitting a faint green light, it was as if ghostly flames were dancing slowly, and a cold, strange, and evil aura spread out from his body. Anyone who met his gaze would shudder from the depths of their souls.","The moment they saw the black-robed old man, the first thought that came to everyone’s mind was fear and terror.","And this black-robed old man was the infamous sect master of the Sorcerer God Sect in the Divine Beginning Realm...the Sorcerer God!","The Sorcerer God commanded the Sorcerer God Sect. In terms of overall strength, the Sorcerer God Sect was not much weaker than one of the great Saint Realms. As the most powerful Sorcerer God, in terms of individual strength...it had always been rumored that he was not inferior to the three great Saint Realm Masters. However, this Sorcerer God was too mysterious and rarely fought personally, so no one knew exactly how strong he was.","But now, this Sorcerer God had appeared in person. Although he had not fought yet, judging from the aura he emitted, his strength should not be weaker than the three Saint Realm Masters.","“Keke, Flame Saint Master, we’ve known each other for so long, but this is the first time I’ve seen you being forced into such a sorry state. Moreover, you’ve been forced into such a sorry state by a little fellow at the Saint Realm.” The black-robed old man Sorcerer God’s gaze emitted a strange light as he looked at Flame Saint Master, a strange hoarse laugh also came out from his mouth.","“Hmph, don’t just stand there and say it like it’s nothing. If you have the ability, why don’t you come and exchange blows with this demon and see if your situation is much better than mine?” Flame Saint Master snorted coldly.","Sorcerer God raised his eyebrows and smiled. “That’s true. After all, the one you’re facing is the most terrifying Yimo in the universe void. It’s normal for it to be forced into such a sorry state.”","“Yimo?” Flame Saint Master immediately looked over. “Sorcerer God, do you know the origin of this demon?”","“I have heard of it, but this is also the first time I have seen it. It is just as the rumors say. Yimo is purely born for destruction. Its speed is extremely fast and its offensive ability is extremely strong. Moreover, its self-healing and recovery ability is also the most terrifying. Even the weakest Yimo is extremely powerful. There is only one way to kill a Yimo, and that is to forcefully use a tyrannical attack to completely crush this Yimo, not giving it a chance to heal itself!” Sorcerer God’s voice was deep.","“I don’t know how Heavenly Sword Marquis managed to get a Yimo to fight for him. However, the Yimo he got hasn’t reached that level yet. In addition, this is the Divine beginning Realm, so even a Yimo would be suppressed by the power of the will of heaven. Its strength might not be able to reach its limit, so it’s not impossible to kill it.”","As the Sorcerer God spoke, Jian Wushuang, who was not far away, narrowed his eyes.","The Yimo should have never interacted with the Divine Beginning Realm. Almost no one in the Divine Beginning Realm knew about the origin of the Yimo, such as the three masters of the Saint Realm. However, the Sorcerer God knew about the origin of the Yimo, moreover, he knew about the innate advantages of the Yimo, as well as its weaknesses, which surprised Jian Wushuang.","“Sorcerer God, since you know so much about this monster, it’s easy to deal with it. Let’s work together and kill this Yimo first, then we’ll kill Heavenly Sword Marquis,” said Flame Saint Master.","“Okay, but it’s still what I said before. If there’s a chance, it’s best to keep the corpse of Heavenly Sword Marquis. If not, I’ll force a few drops of essence blood out of his body,” said Sorcerer God.","“As long as Heavenly Sword Marquis is dead, whether we can keep his corpse or refine essence blood will depend on your own ability,” Flame Saint Master said.","“Haha, then let’s do it.” The Sorcerer God laughed and moved directly.","He did not immediately attack Jian Wushuang, but directly went to find the Yimo.","“Roar!”","The Yimo let out a terrifying roar. It had received Jian Wushuang’s order to tear the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God into pieces. Therefore, when the Sorcerer God approached it, it turned around and clawed at it.","This claw easily tore apart heaven and earth.","“Haha, I’d like to see how powerful the legendary Yimo is.” The Sorcerer God laughed loudly. Facing the sharp claws of the Yimo, he had no intention of dodging. He let the Yimo’s sharp claws pass by him.","Swish!","The sharp claws did not touch any substance. The Sorcerer God’s body began to transform. In the blink of an eye, more than a dozen figures of the Sorcerer God appeared around the Yimo. Each figure seemed to be real, even Jian Wushuang could not tell which of these figures was the Sorcerer God’s original body.","As for the Yimo, it was completely enraged by the Sorcerer God. It roared crazily and attacked the figures of the Sorcerer God, but none of the attacks actually hit the Sorcerer God’s original body.","“Keke, it’s just as the rumors say. Although the Yimo is powerful, its intelligence is very low.” The Sorcerer God shook his head and laughed. Suddenly, among the dozens of figures formed by the Sorcerer God...one of the figures behind the Yimo suddenly stretched out his hand. A sharp spear that carried a gloomy and cold aura pierced into the Yimo’s body and directly pierced out from the other end of the Yimo’s body.","After being pierced by the spear, the intense pain made the Yimo more angry and irritable, and it became crazier and crazier. However, the onlookers noticed that although the Yimo became crazier...its speed actually began to slow down.","Yes, it became slower.","Logically speaking, the crazier the Yimo was, the stronger and faster it would be. However, it was obviously not like that now.","“No, that spear just now was not that simple.” Jian Wushuang frowned. He had already guessed the reason. “Is it poison?”","“Haha, my ability to fight head-on is not very strong. However, no one in the Divine Beginning Realm can match me in using poison. The blood voodoo poison that I personally refined is the pride of my life. If it was an adult Yimo with peak strength, it might be able to ignore my blood voodoo poison. However, this Yimo clearly has not reached such a level.” The Sorcerer God sneered.","The Sorcerer God Sect was famous for all kinds of strange and cold methods. When it came to using poison, the Sorcerer God Sect was also famous in the Divine Beginning Realm.","The Sorcerer God was the patriarch of the Sorcerer God Sect. When it came to using poison, perhaps no one in the Divine Beginning Realm could compare to him.","His spear just now seemed to have simply pierced through the body of the Yimo.. The Yimo had already used its self-healing ability to repair itself, but the blood voodoo poison had already been left in the Yimo’s body."]},{"number":3323,"title":"Chapter 3323 - Nine Dragons Killing the Heavens","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","There was no doubt that the Yimo was very terrifying.","Whether it was its killing methods, speed, and self-healing ability, it was very terrifying. Except for its low intelligence, it had almost no weaknesses.","However, the Yimo that Jian Wushuang had summoned through the hungry ghost path was not at its peak. Its strength had not yet reached its peak, and it was not so invulnerable. Now, it was being corroded by the Sorcerer God’s blood voodoo poison, the internal part of the Yimo’s body was greatly affected. Its strength and speed were greatly weakened.","As time passed, the weakening continued to increase.","Originally, the Yimo that Jian Wushuang had summoned could suppress the Flame Saint Master head-on. However, under the continuous corrosion of the blood voodoo poison, it could no longer keep up with the Flame Saint Master’s speed. In addition, the Sorcerer God was also attacking from the side, the Yimo was completely crushed. If its self-healing ability had not been greatly affected, the Yimo would have probably been killed by the Flame Saint Master’s powerful attack.","“This Yimo no longer has any battle strength.” Jian Wushuang sighed lightly and then waved his hand. In the void next to the Yimo, the void gate appeared again, and the Yimo received Jian Wushuang’s order, it rushed toward the void gate and wanted to leave the battlefield.","“You want to leave?” The Sorcerer God’s pupils shrank when he saw this. “It’s not easy to meet a Yimo. How can I let you leave so easily?”","The Sorcerer God’s speed reached its peak. Before the Yimo was about to step into the void gate, the long spear in his hand burst out with endless dark light. It directly stabbed the Yimo’s arm and then slashed with force, one of the Yimo’s sharp claws was actually torn off by him.","After which, the Sorcerer God waved his hand and kept the sharp claw into his interspatial ring. Although the Yimo had lost a claw, its body was not obstructed. It still rushed into the void gate...it disappeared along with the void gate.","“Sorcerer God, are you interested in this monster?” Flame Saint Master stood beside the Sorcerer God and could not help but ask.","“Haha, it’s rare to meet a mantis demon, so I left a claw as a memento,” the Sorcerer God said casually.","It seemed that he really did it casually, and Flame Saint Master did not ask too much.","“Well, this mantis demon has been dealt with. Next, it’s Heavenly Sword Marquis’s turn!” Flame Saint Master’s eyes flashed with strong killing intent.","The Sorcerer God stared at Jian Wushuang with a strange light.","“Kill!”","Flame Saint Master shouted. The purplish-gold flames covering his body formed a huge purplish-gold sea of fire and surged toward Jian Wushuang, Flame Saint Master’s aura also reached its peak. He held the long scarlet-gold staff in one hand and charged toward Jian Wushuang.","As for the Sorcerer God, he moved slightly and silently approached Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s face darkened slightly.","“After using the nine-region seal, the frigid hell, and the lonely hell consecutively, more than half of the power that Elder Blood Wave gave me has been consumed. Now, I have to face both Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God at the same time...I have no choice but to use the last move!” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","In the sky above, the huge scroll world shook slightly as if it was responding to Jian Wushuang.","“Mountain River map...nine-dragon heaven-killing formation, open!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. The remaining power in his body had been used up by one-third at this moment.","Boom!","The world shook violently. In the scroll world above, the nine huge continents in the scroll world were bursting with dazzling golden light!","These nine continents were the vast nine regions that existed within the Mountain River Map!","Nine regions were originally the nine worlds of outstanding people, but later on, they were forcefully refined and placed into the Mountain River Map. Not only were these nine regions vast and tyrannical, but most importantly, each of the nine regions had already formed a dragon spirit!","The nine dragon spirits and the nine regions had always been trapped within the Mountain River Map.","The Mountain River Map was a top-tier universal treasure, and the secret skill contained in it was extremely powerful.","From the beginning of the nine provinces seal to the thousand treasures great world, they were all unique and powerful secret skills.","However, Jian Wushuang had come into contact with the nine provinces seal and the thousand treasures great world a long time ago. Although he had not been able to unleash the true power of these two secret skills, at least he could use them through the Mountain River Map, however, the Mountain River Map did not contain only these two secret skills.","On the contrary, the nine-region seal and the thousand treasures great world were the two simpler secret skills in the Mountain River Map, and the threshold for cultivating these two secret skills was not high.","However, there were more powerful secret skills in the Mountain River Map that required a very high threshold to cultivate. This secret skill was the formation contained in the Mountain River Map...the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation!","This was the most terrifying killing move of the map. It was much more terrifying than the nine-region seal and the thousand treasures great world.","Jian Wushuang was too weak before and had not been able to master this move. It was not until his strength improved greatly in the Blood Wave Realm that he finally reached the threshold to cultivate this secret skill, therefore, when he knew that there was an inescapable net outside the Blood Wave Realm, he deliberately found Blood Wave and asked him to delay it for three days.","During these three days, he had been focused on researching this killing move, and in these three days, he had successfully grasped this move.","And now, with the help of Blood Wave, he temporarily possessed the power of a ruler, and he could fully unleash the power of this move.","“Roar!”","A dragon’s roar suddenly sounded from the scroll world in the nine heavens.","The sound shook the heaven and earth.","The countless experts present, including Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God, all raised their heads and looked up. They could see that among the nine continents that were emitting golden light in the scroll world above...the golden light that erupted from one of the continents was the most dazzling.","And under everyone’s gaze, this towering continent also began to slowly materialize.","Materialize!","This continent seemed to have come to life completely. It was originally a huge and majestic continent, but in a moment, it actually slowly turned into a huge object!","This was a dragon!","A five-clawed golden dragon with a body that was hundreds of thousands of feet long and covered in golden scales!","It had a noble and majestic body, and it also had a life aura that surpassed all living creatures.","It appeared from the scroll world and directly descended into the world.","Nine dragon heaven-killing formation, nine dragon spirits that had been transformed from the nine regions, had now descended!","“One dragon heaven-killing formation!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with killing intent, and the 10,000-meter golden dragon that had descended into the world instantly attacked.","...."]},{"number":3324,"title":"Chapter 3324 - Fight to the Death","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","Hong!","The five-clawed golden dragon moved, and as if the sky was falling and the earth was splitting, its terrifying power directly pressed down on Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God.","The dozens of figures that Sorcerer God had transformed into had always existed even though the Yimo had already entered the gate of void space. However, at this moment, it was only the moment when the golden dragon’s power pressed down on them, the figures immediately dissipated.","“Be careful. This is the terrifying secret skill, nine dragons heaven-killing formation, which is carried by the top-tier universe treasure, the Mountain River Map. I’ve experienced the power of this secret skill before. It’s very terrifying,” Flame Saint Master reminded.","During the world-ending war countless years ago, Xuan Yi had used the nine dragons heaven-killing formation to kill everyone with the Mountain River Map. However, Xuan Yi had driven six golden dragons from the map at that time!","Six golden dragons were enough to destroy the world. Jian Wushuang had only driven one golden dragon, which was not as powerful as Xuan Yi, but it was still very powerful.","“Let’s attack together!”","Endless purple-gold flames burst out of Flame Saint Master’s body, and his divine body rose to a height of 100 feet. He had completely turned into a purple-gold flame war god. He held the long scarlet-gold staff in both hands and raised it high.","At the instant he raised it, a terrifying might immediately began to gather crazily, and in the blink of an eye, it had already gathered to its peak.","As for the Sorcerer God, he was skilled in using poison and all sorts of underhanded methods, but a head-on confrontation was not something he was good at. However, he still held the long spear in his hands tightly, and an endless icy aura gathered within the long spear, it made the long spear seem as if it had turned into a dark star.","At the instant that the 100,000 feet tall golden dragon attacked, the flame sacred master’s golden-red long rod and the Sorcerer God’s long spear that seemed to have turned into a dark star immediately attacked.","Bang!","The huge golden-red long rod directly smashed toward the golden dragon’s head, and the long spear that looked like a dark star directly pierced towards the golden dragon’s neck.","Bang! Bang!","Two deafening sounds were heard in succession.","Although the mighty power of the 30,000-meter golden dragon was earth-shaking, it could not withstand the powerful attacks of the two masters of the Saint Realm. It collapsed at this moment, and the overwhelming power spread wildly in all directions.","The golden dragon collapsed, but the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God were not any better. Both of them were hit by the terrifying impact of the golden dragon, and they staggered and retreated crazily, especially the Sorcerer God, who was not good at head-on collisions, he looked even more miserable.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted secretly, “After all, I haven’t mastered the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation for a long time, and I’m not very familiar with the use of the dragon spirit. If I could have more time before this battle and get more familiar with it, my use of the dragon spirit would definitely be 70 to 80 percent stronger than it is now!”","Jian Wushuang was helpless about this.","In the Blood Wave Realm, he had asked Blood Wave to buy him three days to barely master the move of the nine-dragon heaven-killing formation.","However, he had only mastered it in the beginning and had not had the time to really practice it.","It was his first time awakening the dragon spirit in the Mountain River Map, so his use of the dragon spirit was very shallow, and he could not fully exert the strength of the dragon spirit.","“In addition, although I have the power of a ruler, I can’t use it by myself. Plus, the backlash from the power is so strong that I can’t use it well. Otherwise, the dragon spirit will be stronger.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","The nine-dragon heaven-killing formation was the real killer move in the map. Its power was earth-shaking, but it was far from the standard of his master.","After all, his master relied on his own strength to sweep the world.","“I just used up a lot of the power given by Elder Blood Wave. Now I only have 20% of my remaining power.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. “20% of my power is not enough for me to use any more tricks. I have to fight to the death!”","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head and poured all of his remaining power, including 99% of his divine power, into the Mountain River Map. At this moment, the golden light on the nine continents, which had gradually dimmed, became dazzling again.","Buzz! Buzz!","Heaven and earth shook, and two towering continents in the scroll world began to transform at the same time.","In the blink of an eye, the two towering continents transformed into two golden dragons.","The golden five-clawed dragon, which was also 30,000 meters tall, also had an earth-shaking and terrifying power. The two golden dragons that had transformed were even stronger than the golden dragon that Jian Wushuang had transformed into earlier, their power was even stronger.","After all, this was the first time Jian Wushuang had awakened the dragon spirit, so he was not very familiar with controlling it.","However, this was the second time he had awakened the dragon spirit. Although he was still not very familiar with it, it was definitely slightly stronger than before.","Under the shocked gazes of the surrounding experts, the two 30,000-meter-tall golden dragons slowly emerged from the scroll world. The two terrifying powers pressed down on everyone present.","Upon seeing the two 30,000-meter-tall golden dragons, the expressions of Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God became extremely solemn.","“This kid can actually use two dragons to kill the heavens?” Flame Saint Master narrowed his eyes slightly.","“Just now, just one golden dragon was enough to put so much pressure on us. Now, there are two golden dragons, and both of them are much stronger than the previous one. Flame Saint Master, are you confident in blocking this attack?” Sorcerer God looked at Flame Saint Master.","Flame Saint Master did not answer. Obviously, he was not confident.","“Two dragons killing the heaven is the limit of my ability. Flame Saint Master, Sorcerer God, I’d like to see if you two can still withstand it.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold, but he suddenly waved his hand. “Go!”","Boom!","The world trembled, and the two 30,000-meter-long golden dragons instantly burst out under Jian Wushuang’s guidance.","Two terrifying forces pressed down crazily. In front of these two forces, any power seemed so weak and insignificant.","Faced with these Golden Dragons, both the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God could only try their best to resist.","The Flame Saint Master held the long golden stick in his hands at the same time and used his most powerful stick.","The Sorcerer God’s spear turned into a dark meteor this time and shot out with terrifying penetrating power.","In the blink of an eye, the two sides collided.","...."]},{"number":3325,"title":"Chapter 3325 - Heavy Injuries","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","Boom!","Terrifying booms sounded like continuous waves, resounding in the ears of many experts.","The countless experts watching the battle, including the Principles Masters with different strengths, were all shocked by the scene in front of them.","The two golden dragons clashed with the strongest attacks of Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God.","Such a collision was rarely seen in billions of years.","“Look, look over there!”","“Space wormhole, what a big space wormhole!”","“This, this should be more than 10,000 meters, right?”","Everyone was dumbstruck as they looked at the space wormhole with a diameter of more than 10,000 meters that appeared in the center.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, the space that was the most stable directly blasted out a space wormhole with a diameter of more than 10,000 meters. What kind of concept was this?","To put it bluntly, even if it was a head-on battle between masters of the Saint Realm, it would be difficult to create such a big scene in the early stage.","Although Jian Wushuang was only an Immortal Saint, the astonishing power he displayed now completely exceeded everyone’s understanding.","Rumble! The terrifying power finally began to weaken. A large amount of power formed a shock wave and began to spread out in the surroundings.","Although the spectating experts were extremely far away from this battlefield, at this moment, they were still knocked about by the shockwave. Only the law masters could barely stand.","“This is the might of a Saint Realm Master, a ruler.” Elder Dark Bones stood together with the experts from the Temporal Temple. But at this moment, even he could not help but exclaim in admiration.","Although he was the most powerful Principles Master, he could even fight against a master of the Saint Realm.","But he could barely hold on for a moment. Once the master of the Saint Realm unleashed his full strength, he would be crushed and could only think of ways to save his life.","The battle in front of him was beyond his control.","Whether it was the Flame Saint Master, the Sorcerer God, or Jian Wushuang, who had used some unknown method to unleash his monstrous battle strength, they were far beyond his reach.","Especially Jian Wushuang!","“He can fight against two masters of the Saint Realm at the same time. This Heavenly Sword Marquis...” Elder Dark Bones sighed secretly.","Soon, the power in the center of the battlefield completely dissipated, and the scene in the void was gradually revealed to everyone.","Seeing the scene in the void, the countless experts watching the battle were all stunned.","Jian Wushuang, the Flame Saint Master, and the Sorcerer God were still standing in the void.","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale, without a trace of blood. His aura was extremely weak as if it would be completely cut off at any time. From his body, at all.","The audience could understand Jian Wushuang’s current state.","After all, when Jian Wushuang used two dragons to kill heaven, they could see that he had reached his limit. He had used almost all of his strength to use this move. After using it, he would definitely fall into weakness, he would no longer have any battle strength.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang’s current state was very normal.","The ones who truly shocked everyone present were the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God.","These two people...","First, they looked at the Flame Saint Master.","The Flame Saint Master had already returned to his normal size. His body was still covered in a layer of purple-gold flames, but this layer of purple-gold flames was much dimmer than before. The Flame Saint Master’s face was also quite pale, there was still a trace of blood at the corner of his mouth. Clearly, Flame Saint Master had been injured by the impact of the two 100,000 feet tall golden dragons during the collision just now!","Moreover, judging from the aura on his body that was much weaker than before, his injuries were not light.","Looking at the Sorcerer God, who was not good at head-on collisions, his injuries were clearly even more severe than Flame Saint Master’s!","The Sorcerer God’s withered and old face was now twisted together. The corner of his mouth and the black robe on his body was covered in blood, and the strange airflow around him had also been completely restrained. He was still standing in the Void! However, his body was slightly trembling. As for the aura on his body, it was at least half weaker than before!","“I-injured?”","“The Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God, these two supreme existences, are actually injured?”","“Two great Saint Realm Masters working together were actually injured by an Immortal Saint head-on, and both of them were heavily injured?”","“How is this possible?”","“Not only did he fight against two Saint Realm Masters with his own strength, but he even heavily injured two Saint Realm Masters. Is this Heavenly Sword Marquis even human?”","Shocked, shocked, and incredulous voices were heard from the crowd.","Even the Principles Masters from the two camps looked at each other in disbelief.","“This little fellow actually injured Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God?” Temple Master Bai Xing sucked in a breath of cold air.","“Unbelievable, simply unbelievable!” Ba Cang said in a low voice.","“This little fellow is indeed a little too abnormal.” Lin Guang Master added.","On the other two battlefields, Life and Death Saint Master, the four ancient immortals, and Destruction Saint Master, who was still engaged in a fierce battle with the consciousness avatar of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, also saw this scene. Huge waves of emotions surged in their hearts.","“This kid is too abnormal. If he doesn’t think about it today, it’s almost impossible for us three Saint Realms to kill him in the future!” Life and Death Saint Master changed from his usual gentle face to a cold one.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis has used up all of his divine power and is now at the end of his life. This is the best time to kill him. Flame Saint Master, Sorcerer God, why don’t you two hurry up and do it?” Destruction Saint Master immediately urged.","As Destruction Saint Master had said, Jian Wushuang was already at the end of his rope.","Although Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God had been severely injured by Jian Wushuang’s two dragons killing the heaven, they were still able to retain their battle strength. At this time, they would certainly not let go of the opportunity to kill Jian Wushuang.","“Boy, die!”","The Flame Saint Master did not hesitate at all. The scarlet-gold long staff in his hand carried an earth-shaking power as he furiously attacked Jian Wushuang.","“Flame Saint Master, try to keep his body as long as possible.” The Sorcerer God also immediately attacked. However, the Sorcerer God only used poison. It was obvious that he did not want to hurt Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Faced with the attacks of the two masters of the Saint Realm, Jian Wushuang indeed did not have any strength to resist at this moment.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang smiled. His smile was a little strange. Although his consciousness was in a blurry state due to the crazy backlash from the previous power, he still saw the silver-haired old man who appeared out of nowhere behind Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God.","The silver-haired old man also slowly extended his finger.","...."]},{"number":3326,"title":"Chapter 3326 - The Palace Lord Had Arrived","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Halt!”","A deep and deep voice suddenly sounded in the vast world.","All the experts present heard this voice.","In the next moment, the entire space-time froze, and the experts present all fell into a frozen state.","It must be known that because more and more experts participated in this battle, and their strength became more and more terrifying, the area of this battle was incomparably vast, and the spectators were quite far away from the battlefield.","But at this moment, the already vast battlefield, in addition to the large area of space-time around the battlefield, all sank into a state of stagnation.","All the Immortal Saints and Principles Masters who were watching the battle were motionless at this moment.","As for Flame Saint Master and Sorcerer God, who were attacking Jian Wushuang, they suddenly stopped in the void.","“This is...” Flame Saint Master’s body trembled slightly. As a Saint Realm Master, he was still able to keep his thoughts under the time-space freeze. Although his body was greatly hindered, he could still move.","As for the Sorcerer God, Life and Death Saint Master, and Destruction Saint Master, they were naturally not too affected.","However, when they sensed the spacetime freezing, they knew that that person had already rushed to the battlefield.","“Temporal Temple Master?” Life and Death Saint Master could not be bothered to deal with the four ancient immortals in front of him. Instead, he turned his head to look at the silver-haired old man.","“This is troublesome.” The Destruction Saint Master’s expression sank.","“Temple Master!” The four ancient immortals within the golden-armored puppet were not affected by the spacetime freeze. They instantly saw the existence of the silver-haired old man and were overjoyed.","“Spacetime, you came at the right time. If you hadn’t come, I wouldn’t have been able to protect that little fellow.” An indifferent voice came from the consciousness clone of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master.","The consciousness clone of the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance had been fighting with the Destruction Saint Master, but it was just a clone after all. During the battle, his divine power was constantly dissipating, now, this consciousness clone was on the verge of dissipating.","“Heaven-cleaving Alliance, thank you very much this time.” The Temporal Temple Master glanced at the consciousness clone of the leader of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance.","“I’m only helping that little guy. I never thought of helping your Temporal Temple. Don’t flatter yourself.” The consciousness avatar of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master sneered, “Alright, since your original body is here in person, I won’t care about what happens next. Clean up this mess yourself.”","After the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master finished speaking, his body shook and his consciousness avatar disappeared from this world.","After the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master left, the Temporal Temple Master looked at the three Saint Realm Masters.","“The three Saint Realms, and...Sorcerer God Sect!”","“Hehe, I have been wandering in the universe battlefield for millions of years, and I haven’t come back. Now that I have come back, I see this scene. It seems that you three Saint Realms have taken care of my Temporal Temple during my absence.” Although the Temporal Temple Master had a smile on his face, however, there was a trace of coldness in his smile.","The three masters of the Saint Realm and the Sorcerer God had gathered together, and the three masters of the Saint Realm looked quite upset.","“Although Temporal Temple Master is at the ruler level, he is still in the Divine Beginning Realm. He is more or less limited by the power of the will of heaven. His battle strength is probably equal to ours. Now that the consciousness avatar of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master has disappeared, the four of us working together can completely ignore Temporal Temple Master,” The Sorcerer God secretly transmitted his voice.","He was still greedy for Jian Wushuang’s divine body and the blood essence in his body.","“Humph, it’s not as simple as you think.” Flame Saint Master replied in a low voice, “Although Temporal Temple Master is not much stronger than us in the Divine Beginning Realm, his use of time and space is beyond our imagination. With him in front of us, there’s nothing we can do.”","“Right. The three of us have already experienced how difficult the Temporal Temple Master is to deal with. If he is willing, he can completely not fight with the three of us. He can just use his time and space technique to fool the three of us. He can even use his time and space technique to send us to several different time and space. And he can enter any time and space to fight us one-on-one. We are definitely not his match!” Life and Death Saint Master said.","“Any one of the three strongest rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm is extremely terrifying. The Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master is extremely powerful, and his consciousness avatar alone is enough to fight against any one of us. If his true body were here, he would be able to fight against all three of us at the same time.”","“The Temporal Temple Master’s use of time and space is extremely strange. As for the Heavenly Ancestor, his methods are also unfathomable. Since any of their true bodies are here and they want to protect Heavenly Sword Marquis, there’s nothing we can do,” the Destruction God said in a low voice.","The three masters of the Saint Realm were also helpless at this moment.","If other experts were here, they would not care too much. But now, it was Temporal Temple Master’s original body!","Temporal Temple Master was not only extremely powerful, but he also relied on his own strength to become a ruler. Most importantly, Temporal Temple Master’s use of time and space was so powerful that it had reached an incredible level.","Since Temporal Temple Master was present, it was absolutely impossible for them to continue fighting. It was also impossible for them to kill Jian Wushuang, even though Jian Wushuang’s consciousness had already fallen into a faint state, he was completely unable to resist.","In other words, the three Saint Realm Masters had set up such an inescapable net and arranged so many means. Even the three of them, as well as the Sorcerer God, had personally attacked four Saint Realm Masters, however, they still failed to kill Jian Wushuang.","This made the three masters of the Saint Realm feel aggrieved and ashamed.","However, no matter how aggrieved they were, they could do nothing against the Temporal Temple Master.","“Temporal Temple Master, with your experience, you should know that killing this little guy was not our intention.” The Life and Death Saint Master looked at the Temporal Temple Master.","“Of course, I know this. The three of you are just its lackeys.” The Temporal Temple Master sneered.","“Lackeys?”","This title made the three Saint Realm Masters’ faces even more unsightly, but they did not refute it.","The Life and Death Saint Master continued, “Since you know our intention, you should be clear that this little guy can not be kept. You’d better not protect him.. Don’t forget that the world-ending war was the best example. However, the one who disappeared in the last war was the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, and this time, it might be the Temporal Temple!”"]},{"number":3327,"title":"Chapter 3327 - The Dust Has Settled","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","The Life and Death Saint Master’s voice was cold, and the threat in his words was obvious.","“Are you trying to scare me?” The Temporal Temple Master glanced at the Life and Death Saint Master.","“I don’t dare, I’m just stating the facts. Although your Temporal Temple is strong, it shouldn’t be comparable to the Invincible Overlord Seven Star Mysterious Sect, right?” The Life and Death Saint Master said coldly.","“It can’t be compared to them. However, our Temporal Temple has some methods that the Seven Star Mysterious Sect couldn’t compare to. It’s even better. If we want to recreate the world-ending war, we have to see if it still has the ability and courage,” The Temporal Temple Saint Master said mockingly, “Life and Death Saint Master, Destruction Saint Master, Flame Saint Master, and Sorcerer God, I’ll remember what happened today. I’ll come back to settle the score with you guys in the future.”","“We’ll be waiting for you at any time.” The three Saint Masters were not afraid at all.","Although they could not do anything to the Temporal Temple Master, the Temporal Temple Master could not do anything to the three of them in the Divine Beginning Realm.","However, the Sorcerer God’s expression changed slightly, but he did not say anything.","“Bai Xing!”","The Temporal Temple Master glanced at the void next to him.","That void was where the experts of the Temporal Temple gathered.","While the entire world was in a state of space-time stagnation, this void was not affected at all.","The experts of the Temporal Temple had been keeping a clear mind and were able to move freely.","Hearing Temporal Temple Master’s call, Temple Master Bai Xing immediately went forward and said, “Temple Master.”","“Take the little guy and let’s go,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes.” Temple Master Bai Xing immediately stepped forward and took Jian Wushuang, who had fallen into a coma.","With a wave of Temporal Temple Master’s hand, a space passage appeared out of thin air.","Many experts of the Temporal Temple directly stepped into the space passage and disappeared.","As for Temporal Temple Master, he had also stepped into the space passage with half a foot, but he suddenly withdrew his foot.","“I almost forgot something.” Temporal Temple Master looked around and waved his hand.","Xiu!","A streak of light rushed toward him at an incredible speed, and in the blink of an eye, it landed in his hand.","On a closer look, it was a purple-gold command flag. It was the golden flag of painting sky!","Temporal Temple Master had a golden flag of painting sky, and the one that flew into his hand was Green Rock Master’s.","“The golden sky painting flag is a true treasure in the field of time and space. It’s better for the palace to keep it.” Temporal Temple Master smiled and wiped Green Rock Master’s consciousness from the golden sky painting flag, then, he put it into his interspatial ring.","After that, Temporal Temple Master stepped into the space tunnel again.","The three Saint Realm Masters and Sorcerer God watched the space tunnel slowly shrink, but they did not want to stop it at all.","After the Temporal Temple Master left, the world that had been frozen in time and space finally began to flow again.","The many experts in this world also regained their consciousness.","However, after they regained their consciousness, they were all at a loss.","“What happened?”","“What happened just now?”","“What about Heavenly Sword Marquis? Where did the experts of the Temporal Temple go?”","“There are no experts from the Temporal Temple. What’s going on?”","The experts who were stuck in the state of time-space stagnation had their consciousness completely cut off.","They had no idea what had just happened.","They did not even know that they had been stuck in the state of time-space stagnation and that their consciousness had been suspended for a period of time.","But very quickly, they reacted.","“It’s time freeze! All of us fell into a time freeze just now, and our consciousness fell into a time freeze!”","“Time freeze? Making all of us fall into a time freeze? How, how is this possible!”","“Who cast time freeze?”","Everyone was still a little dazed.","But at this time, Elder Dark Bone frowned, he said solemnly, “Spacetime stagnation is a technique that can only be used after one has grasped the principles of spacetime to a certain extent. However, the area that this technique can cover and the degree of influence it can have on an expert depends on this person’s strength!”","“And if we want spacetime stagnation to completely cover our current world and cause all of us to fall into spacetime stagnation, this person’s use of spacetime must definitely reach the peak of perfection. and in the entire Divine Beginning Realm, there is only one person who has such attainments in spacetime, and that is...the Temporal Temple Master!”","“Temporal Temple Master?”","“Temporal Temple Master?”","“The Temporal Temple Master just came?”","Everyone cried out in surprise, but they soon understood.","Indeed, under the situation just now, only Temporal Temple Master could completely turn the situation around, while everyone was in a daze. “Let’s leave together with the experts of the Temporal Temple and Jian Wushuang.”","“Temporal Temple Master, his use of spacetime is getting more and more profound. Even I can’t avoid the spacetime stagnation.” Elder Dark Bone sighed quietly.","He could at least tangle with a Saint Realm Master, but he had also fallen into the spacetime stagnation just now. To be able to resist the spacetime stagnation of Temporal Temple Master, one must at least have the battle strength of a Saint Realm Master.","“That Heavenly Sword Marquis and the experts of the Temporal Temple have already left with the Temporal Temple Master. So, this battle should end here, right?” A Principles Master suddenly said.","His words caused the surrounding experts to agree with him.","“It should be over!”","“The battle is finally over!”","“This battle...although the two sides haven’t fought to a true victory or defeat, this process is really soul-stirring.”","Countless experts were sighing and praising the earth-shattering battle just now.","This battle’s level was too high, and there were too many peak experts participating in it.","It was fine if they were ordinary masters of laws, but experts at the sixth stage of the void realm like Elder Dark Bone and the four ancient immortals were rarely seen on normal days, not to mention the three great Saint Realm Masters, Sorcerer God, and the consciousness clone of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, as well as the Temporal Temple Master.","In short, this battle was earth-shattering!","At the same time, the one who shocked all the experts present was Jian Wushuang.","That person was Jian Wushuang!","He was just an Immortal Saint, but he had attracted so many experts from the three Saint Realms, the Sorcerer God Sect, and the Nine-tailed Clan to hunt him down. After a fierce battle, so many top experts still failed to kill him?","Especially when Jian Wushuang controlled the power given by Blood Wave and directly fought against the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God, it was even more shocking!","After all, the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God, two masters of the Saint Realm, were seriously injured by Jian Wushuang.","Who would have thought that a mere Immortal Saint could reach such a level?","Without a doubt, after this battle, no matter what happened next, Jian Wushuang was bound to become a true legend in the Divine Beginning Realm!","...."]},{"number":3328,"title":"Chapter 3328 - Ruler of Chaos","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","On Saha Island, that shocking battle had finally come to an end.","The process and result of this battle were personally witnessed by many top experts. It spread like a violent storm across the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","The entire Divine Beginning Realm was shaken by this battle!","There were even people who specially named this battle the battle of the Heavenly Sword Marquis. This was because the true protagonist of this battle was Heavenly Sword Marquis. Moreover, this Heavenly Sword Marquis was the most dazzling person in this battle, he was the most incredible existence.","He refreshed the understanding of all experts toward the Immortal Saint.","No one had ever thought that an Immortal Saint could be this powerful.","However, although the heat of the battle had lasted for a long time, it gradually subsided as time went by.","The Divine Beginning Realm also regained its calm.","In a flash, 20 years had passed since the end of the battle.","On Saha Island, a large amount of gray airflow surrounded the independent space-time, covering every corner of this space-time.","In the center of this space-time, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness finally began to slowly wake up.","“What am I...”","Jian Wushuang lay on a black crystal that emitted a strange aura, and his eyes had already opened to look around.","He wanted to stand up at once, but a feeling of powerlessness immediately arose in his body. His body moved, and he was in extreme pain.","As for his divine power, he did not have any left, just like an ordinary person.","“Little guy, you’re awake.” A calm and gentle voice came from the side.","Jian Wushuang immediately saw the silver-haired elder standing beside the black crystal.","“Greetings, Temple Master.” Jian Wushuang could only speak, but he could not stand up and bow.","“Since you can see my identity at a glance, it seems that your consciousness has not been affected,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“How long have I been in a coma?” Jian Wushuang asked.","He remembered that he had used up all the power that Blood Wave had given him during the battle, including 99% of his divine power. Then that power had rebounded crazily, causing his consciousness to fall into a coma, what happened next was completely unknown to him.","“It hasn’t been long, just 20 years,” The Temporal Temple Master said.","“20 years?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he smiled bitterly. “I’ve been in a coma for 20 years, and it will take more time for my body to recover to its peak condition.”","“Little guy, just be content.” Temporal Temple Master smiled. “Don’t forget that in the previous battle, you were forcibly imbued with a power comparable to that of a ruler. That level of power was only yours. If it had been any other cultivator, it would have been some clan experts with powerful divine bodies, or even some ordinary special lifeforms. The principles would have been that they would have been forced to explode, and they would have died without a doubt!”","“Although your injury is very serious and you need a long time to recover, at least your life is saved, and it won’t affect your overall foundation and consciousness. This is the best result, what else are you not satisfied with?”","“Uh...” Jian Wushuang was stunned, and then he smiled helplessly.","Indeed, before Blood Wave gave him the power, he had told him about the risks he had to take to obtain the power.","The risks were too great.","Ordinary cultivators and even some lower-level special life forms could not withstand the power at all and could only be stuffed to death.","However, because he was a perfect level life form, he forcefully endured it. He just needed some time to recover. Of course, he was much better.","“The power of a ruler...” Jian Wushuang still recalled the power he had in that battle.","That power was so strong that it could make one’s hair stand on end!","“Unfortunately, that power doesn’t really belong to me.” Jian Wushuang could not help sighing.","“What’s a pity? With your potential and talent, it won’t be difficult for you to have the power of a ruler in the future.” Temporal Temple Master looked over.","Jian Wushuang smiled, then he said, “Temple Master, I’ve been curious about what the ruler level is. How can you reach the ruler level? And how can the three masters of the divine realm in the Divine Beginning Realm compare to the ruler level?”","Jian Wushuang knew that above the Principles Master was the ruler level!","However, he was very unfamiliar with the ruler level. He did not know how to be considered a ruler level.","“The ruler-level is just a short name. The true name of this level is the ruler of chaos!”","“As the name implies, the ruler of chaos is the ruler of a Primal Chaos World. It can also be said to be the ruler of the Primal Chaos World. For example, our Divine Beginning Realm is a complete Primal Chaos World. And the ruler of chaos is equivalent to the strongest overlord in this Primal Chaos World. It can be said that he is the strongest existence in this world.”","“Even in the vast universe, the ruler-level is a true expert, enough to dominate the universe.”","“As for how to become a ruler-level, as well as the difference between a ruler-level and a Principles Master, it’s actually very easy to understand.”","The Temporal Temple Master patiently explained.","“Little fellow, you’ve been in the third sky for quite some time already, and the level you’ve come into contact with is also very high. You should already understand the level division between Principles Masters. From the first level of the void to the six levels of the void, these six levels are all determined by the will power they control. For example, the six levels of the void have six portions of the will power.”","“Most experts who have reached the sixth realm of the void have already fused three rules. Compared to the Principles Masters of the sixth realm of the void, a ruler-level expert only needs to fuse four principles.”","“You can become a chaos ruler by fusing four rules?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. He clearly felt that this process was too simple.","“Little guy, you may think that it’s easy to fuse four principles, but it’s actually very difficult. It’s very difficult to fuse principles. The more principles you fuse, the more difficult it will be. For example, if a Principles Master has finally fused two principles, the difficulty of fusing the third rule will be tens to hundreds of times more difficult than fusing two principles!”","“As for fusing four principles, it’s tens to hundreds of times more difficult than fusing three principles!","“It’s thousands to tens of thousands of times more difficult than fusing two principles. Do you understand the concept?” Temporal Temple Master looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","Jian Wushuang was a little dumbfounded.","...."]},{"number":3329,"title":"Chapter 3329 - Charm","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Thousands, maybe tens of thousands of times harder?”","Jian Wushuang was also shocked by the number.","He has now begun to deal with the fusion of the principles, but he is now only delving into the space-time and reincarnation of the two principles fusion.","But even if it was just the fusion of two principles, it was still extremely difficult in his eyes. Even if because of the opportunity within the Blood Wave Temple, he had already reached the threshold of the fusion of these two principles, but he wanted to completely fuse them successfully, he still needed a certain amount of fortuitous encounters and a large amount of time.","This was also because he had obtained the fortuitous encounters in Blood Wave Temple to begin with. In addition, his comprehension ability was exceptionally high.","However, to ordinary cultivators, fusing the two principles was already as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","Of the many Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm, there were very few who had truly fused the principles. Moreover, the reason why they were able to fuse the principles was because they had experienced countless years and relied on a large amount of time to slowly study them, only then did they fuse successfully.","Fusing two principles was just like that. It was thousands to tens of thousands of times more difficult than fusing two principles...this concept was truly frightening.","“It is precisely because fusing four principles is too difficult that rulers are so rare. For example, the Divine Beginning Realm only gave birth to a few more rulers because it was born for too long. Under normal circumstances, the Primal Chaos World would only give birth to a ruler after billions of years. For example, the closest ruler that was born in the Divine Beginning Realm was also 1.8 billion years ago.” The Temporal Temple continued to explain.","“Of course, the birth of a ruler is extremely difficult, but as long as one becomes a ruler, there will be a qualitative change. The power of the will alone... Once the four rules are fused, the power of the will will be hundreds of times stronger than the Principles Masters of the six void realms who have fused the three principles. The two are completely incomparable, not to mention the other aspects such as divine power and divine body.”","“His willpower alone is hundreds of times stronger than the Six Void Realms?” Jian Wushuang was shocked, but then he frowned and said, “Since the chaos ruler is so much stronger than the Principles Master, why can’t I sense it in the previous battle? There’s also Elder Dark Bone. He’s only in the six void realms, but he can still fight against a Saint Realm Master.”","“That’s not hard to understand.” Temporal Temple Master smiled. “First of all, you have to understand that a master of the Saint Realm is a master of the Saint Realm, and they are not rulers. They are just three of the six realms of the void who are lucky enough to obtain the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao. They can’t be compared to a real ruler. As for why they can be on the same level as a ruler, that’s because they are in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“In the Divine Beginning Realm, because of the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao, all rulers who have reached the ruler realm will be greatly restricted here. They can only display 10-20% of their power at most. But even so, in a one-on-one fight, any ruler can crush these three masters of the Saint Realm.”","“Because of this, rulers like us rarely stay in the Divine Beginning Realm. Because the restrictions here are too big, we can’t open our hands and feet. So, for a long time, I choose to wander in the universe battlefield. In the universe battlefield, my power will not be restricted at all. That’s how I feel at ease.”","“However, if the three masters of the Saint Realm left the Divine Beginning Realm and went to the universe battlefield, they would not be strengthened by the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao. Instead, their strength would be weakened to the level of the six void realms and they would be even weaker than a ruler. Therefore, the three masters of the Saint Realm in the Divine Beginning Realm have never left the Divine Beginning Realm since they became masters of the Saint Realm.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","He had heard some rumors that the top experts in the Divine Beginning Realm looked down on the three masters of the Saint Realm. Now it seemed that they had their reasons for looking down on them.","Once the three masters of the Saint Realm left the Divine Beginning Realm, their battle strength might not even be as strong as those top experts of the six void realms.","“Oh, I’ll give this back to you.” Temporal Temple Master suddenly flipped his hand and took out a scroll that emitted an ancient aura.","This scroll was the Mountain River Map.","Looking at the Mountain River Map, Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred.","Previously, he had used all his strength to use the two dragons killing the heaven to heavily injure the Flame Saint Realm and the Sorcerer God. But after using it, his consciousness fell into a scheme and he quickly passed out, not only did he not know what happened next, but he also did not know what happened next. He did not even have time to take back the Mountain River Map that had always existed in the void above him.","However, the Temporal Temple Master brought back his Mountain River Map when he left.","“Thank you, Temple Master,” Jian Wushuang quickly thanked him.","The Temporal Temple Master asked directly, “Little guy, who is Xuan Yi to you?”","Jian Wushuang was shocked, but he answered truthfully, “He is my master.”","“As expected.” Temporal Temple Master stroked his beard and was not surprised.","“Temple Master knows my master?” Jian Wushuang looked at Temporal Temple Master.","“Sort of.” Temporal Temple Master smiled. “Your master is a very important figure. Long ago, his existence shocked the entire Divine Beginning Realm. As the Temple Master of the Temporal Temple, I naturally have dealings with him.”","“Although I haven’t had much contact with your master, I can tell that he is a very charismatic person.”","“Charismatic?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, he is unconventional, open-minded, and loyal. He can force people in desperate situations to drink and talk, and he can sacrifice himself for his good friend. He is clearly a top overlord of the Divine Beginning Realm, but he can lower himself to talk to some weak cultivators as equals...” The Temporal Temple Master said, there was also a strange smile on his face.","“Of course, what I really admire about him is his strength and his spirit. Facing thousands of soldiers and countless experts, he didn’t retreat even an inch. He fought against all living things!","“To be honest, in all my years of dominating the world, no one has ever impressed me from the bottom of my heart. Your master is the first.”","Hearing the words of the Temporal Temple Master, Jian Wushuang was extremely shocked.","He suddenly remembered a scroll he had seen by chance. In the scroll, his master, Xuan Yi, faced countless experts alone. He was already at the end of his rope, but his expression did not change. He fought to the death!","The battle was so dark that his master had used up his last bit of strength and blood.","Just like what the Temporal Temple Master had said, it was a kind of spirit.","A spirit that could fight the world and look down on all living things!","In the Divine Beginning Realm, other than his master, there was probably no one else who had this kind of spirit!","...."]},{"number":3330,"title":"Chapter 3330 - Origin of the Great War","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","——","“Temple Master, since you know my master, you should know the origin of the great war, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","He had too many questions about the great War.","In that battle, Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed, and his master died. It could be said that the entire situation of the Divine Beginning Realm was completely changed.","However, Jian Wushuang did not know the origin of the battle or why it had erupted. Neither had his master told him about it.","“I do know something about the origin of the battle.” Temporal Temple Master looked at Jian Wushuang and pondered for a moment before continuing, “Forget it. Now that you’re dealing with a Saint Realm Master, you’re qualified to know about it.”","“The origin of that battle was because of your Master Xuan Yi!”","“Your master is not only powerful- but also has a very high level of life and great potential. However, his life level is extremely fearful of the power of the will of heaven, which is completely unacceptable to the will of heaven.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He knew this very well.","He was also a perfect level life-form, and the Heavenly Dao will of the Divine Beginning Realm could not tolerate his existence. It had personally come to kill him countless times, and it had even made the three Saint Realms kill him at all costs.","“Your master was not tolerated by the Heavenly Dao. This is the true origin of the battle. However, your master had already passed through the weak stage and reached the peak of the Principles Master. His battle strength was comparable to that of an ordinary ruler, or even stronger. Moreover, before the battle broke out, your master was about to completely integrate four principles to become a ruler.”","“Think about it. Before he broke through to the ruler realm, your master was already stronger than an ordinary ruler. How strong would he be when he becomes a ruler?” Temporal Temple Master asked.","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Through the conversation just now, Jian Wushuang had already understood the huge gap between a Principles Master and a ruler.","However, under such circumstances, his master was still able to fight against a ruler and even surpass an ordinary ruler. Apart from the huge innate advantage brought by his life level, his master must have some extraordinary strength and means.","Under such circumstances, if his master broke through to become a ruler, his battle strength would definitely reach an even more incredible level.","“Unfortunately, the power of the will of heaven seems to know that your master will breakthrough to become a ruler soon, so it launched the world-ending war before your master became a ruler!” Temporal Temple Master said.","“The scale of the war was incredible!","“After all, not only is your master strong, but most importantly, he is also one of the founders of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. In the past, the three founders of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect all had the combat strength of a ruler, and their experts were as numerous as clouds. They were publicly recognized as the number one force in the Divine Beginning Realm. In front of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, even our Temporal Temple Master, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, and the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect had to bow their heads.”","Jian Wushuang could not help feeling excited.","At its peak, the Seven Stars Mysterious Sect was definitely the supreme overlord of the Divine Beginning Realm. It was not something that the three great Freedom Alliance and three great Saint Realms could compare to. Just the three founders and three rulers alone...it was enough to hold everyone in awe.","“At that time, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao could only be mobilized by the three great Saint Realms. However, it was impossible for the three great Saint Realms to kill Xuan Yi by relying on the three masters of the Saint Realm. Therefore, the three great saint realms began to lobby the top forces in the Third Heaven!”","“The top forces, such as the four divine clans and the Octagonal Heaven Sect, had suffered losses under the Seven Star Mysterious Sect due to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s strong influence and the small-scale competition. Therefore, they could not help feeling jealous and resentful. This time, the three Saint Realms brought the will of heaven with them. Together with a series of threats and inducements, it was easy to pull them into a major alliance!” Temporal Temple Master said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned. “Temple Master, according to what you said, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had three masters and so many experts. Even if the three Saint Realms and the top forces in the Third Heaven joined forces, they might not be able to fight against the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, right?”","“You’re right. Even if the three Saint Realms and so many forces joined forces, the odds of winning against the Seven Star Mysterious Sect are still slim. No one in the three Saint Realms can fight against the three masters alone. The reason why the three Saint Realms dared to attack was that they had the help of experts from the universe,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “An expert from the universe came to help? Not an expert from the Divine Beginning Realm? Someone from the outside world?”","“Yes.” Temporal Temple Master nodded. “There were several experts who came from the universe, and each of them had the battle strength of a ruler. Most importantly, they brought a unique supreme treasure!”","“Supreme treasure? What supreme treasure?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“A spear with special power is the one that killed your master. Otherwise, even if a few rulers joined hands, they could at most suppress your master, but they would not be able to kill him,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","A perfect-grade life-form had extremely strong life-saving abilities and endless divine power.","Under normal circumstances, since his Master Xuan Yi already had the battle strength of a ruler, as long as his strength was not completely crushed, it was almost impossible for the opponent to kill him, even if there were several of them working together, it was also difficult to do so.","But if the opponent used that extremely special treasure...","“Spear! Spear!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly focused! He had already remembered the scene he had seen when his master was surrounded by countless experts. It was the spear that had pierced his master’s chest, making him look like a desperate situation!","“With the help of those foreign masters, he had completely surpassed the Seven Star Mysterious Sect in terms of strength at the highest level. Therefore, the world-ending war broke out. Although I did not participate in the earth-shattering battle, I watched from afar. In that battle, your master, Xuan Yi, was ultimately suppressed by those foreign masters. In the end, he was killed by the spear.","“However, your master is indeed very powerful. Even before he died, he still used his power to forcefully devour the divine powers of countless experts on the battlefield and set up heaven sealing formation to completely seal off the Seven Star divine territory where the Seven Star Mysterious Sect used to be.”","...."]},{"number":3331,"title":"Chapter 3331 - External Threats","paragraphs":["——","Jian Wushuang had already fallen silent.","Although he did not know the origin and process of the battle, he had long known the outcome of the battle.","In that battle, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was defeated and the entire Seven Star Divine Realm was reduced to ruins. Countless experts fell and fell asleep. Fortunately, at the last moment...his Master Xuan Yi used a heaven-reaching method to completely seal the entire Seven Star Divine Realm. Only then did he preserve the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s inheritance, and at the same time, he created a chance for the Seven Star Mysterious Sect to turn the tables.","And he was also born in the Seven Star Divine Realm that was completely sealed.","“After that battle, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect completely became history, and the three great Divine Realms replaced the position of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, becoming the new overlord of the Divine Beginning Realm. They even surpassed our three great Freedom Alliance. However, that was also because the few overlords from outside were still in the Divine Beginning Realm.”","“Not long after the battle ended, the foreign overlords left. The three Saint Realms did not have real overlords, so they were not as intimidating as before. Therefore, the three Freedom Alliances were on equal footing with the three Saint Realms. To a certain extent, the three Freedom Alliances were stronger than the three Saint Realms,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","After his conversation with the Temporal Temple Master, he had learned more about the world-ending war.","However, there were also questions, such as why the power of the will of heaven could not tolerate their existence. Was it simply because of their lives?","Also, why did those foreign rulers come and even brought special treasures that could kill his master, Xuan Yi?","He could not explain these questions, and Temporal Temple Master obviously did not know. He could only wait for his strength to grow in the future and then slowly explore.","“Little guy, you are Xuan Yi’s disciple. If I’m not wrong, your life level should be equal to your master’s. Aren’t you the legendary perfect level life?” Temporal Temple Master looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Senior, do you know about the perfect level life form?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise.","“Of course. I have been in the universe battlefield for many years, so I have some knowledge. I have heard about the classification of the special life forms, and the perfect level life form is known as the supreme life form. Even in the vast universe, such a life form is as rare as a phoenix feather or a qilin horn.”","“Under normal circumstances, it is only possible for a perfect level life-form to appear in thousands of chaos worlds. No one in the Divine Beginning Realm had a perfect life-form before your master. It is reasonable for a perfect level life-form to suddenly appear. However, you and your master were obviously born in the Divine Beginning Realm, and they were both perfect level life-forms. This is a little unbelievable.” Temporal Temple Master’s expression was a little strange.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat.","His master and he were both at the perfect level of life, and they were both born in the Divine Beginning Realm.","But the difference was that his master had created his perfect level life with great magic power!","Temporal Temple Master would never have thought of this, and Jian Wushuang did not intend to say it out loud. After all, it would be too shocking to say that someone had created a perfect level life.","“Although I don’t know why you can have a perfect-grade life-form, you will inevitably face the same situation as your master. That is...the heavenly axiom will not allow it! This can be seen from the three Saint Realms’ repeated attacks on you and the arrival of the power of the heavenly axiom’s will,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded solemnly.","“In the previous battle, the three Saint Realms had set up an inescapable net to kill you. Even the three masters of the Saint Realm and the Sorcerer God had personally come to kill you, but they were still unable to kill you. This means that the three Saint Realms’ power alone will not be able to do anything to you, so...” Temporal Temple Master’s expression became solemn.","“Temple Master, are you saying that there will also be a ruler-level expert from the outside world who will come to the Divine Beginning Realm to kill me?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s hard to say, but there is a possibility,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang’s heart also became heavy.","He knew very well that his current strength was at most at the third realm of the void realm. Even if he used many trump cards, he would only be able to fight against the fourth realm of the void realm. However, if he fought against a Saint Realm Master or even a ruler-level expert...he would not be able to resist at all.","The reason why he was able to fight against the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God in that battle was because he had received the power given to him by Blood Wave. Blood Wave had given him the power at the cost of the collapse of the Blood Wave Realm. After giving him the power once...there was absolutely no way to give him the power a second time. He could only rely on himself.","“Even my master, who was at his peak, could only die in the face of the attacks of several rulers from the outside world. Compared to my master now, I’m definitely not a bit inferior.” Jian Wushuang frowned, he felt tremendous pressure.","“Little guy, don’t be too nervous. First of all, there might not be any masters from the outside world arriving. Second, even if the masters from the outside world know of your existence and want to kill you, it will take them a long time to arrive at the Divine Beginning Realm from their own chaotic world.”","“If I’m not mistaken, it will take at least thousands of years or even tens of thousands of years for the overlords to reach the Divine Beginning Realm. It might even take hundreds of thousands of years for them to arrive. Such a long period of time should be enough for you to do a lot of things,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief.","If the overlords from the outside world could reach the Divine Beginning Realm in just a few decades or hundreds of years, there was really nothing he could do.","However, if it was a long time, tens of thousands of years would be a lot of opportunities for him.","Tens of thousands of years was already a long time for Jian Wushuang.","After all, it had only been a thousand years since he was born. In such a short period of time, he had already stood at the peak of the Divine Beginning Realm, and his strength was comparable to a Principles Master of the three void realms if he was given thousands of years or tens of thousands of years, who knew what level he would have reached?","He might even have become a ruler.","Of course, these were all Jian Wushuang’s own expectations. Moreover, he could not be sure when the experts from the outside world would arrive. He did not know what level he could reach at that time, so he could only take one step at a time.","“Little guy, I know that you are very talented in space-time. Not only did you comprehend the space-time divine skill from the space-time gold stone I left behind, but you also integrated my space-time divine skill into your swordsmanship. This is indeed rare,” Temporal Temple Master suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang immediately looked at Temporal Temple Master.","...."]},{"number":3332,"title":"Chapter 3332 - The Temple of Principles","paragraphs":["——","“Your talent in the space-time principles is so high that I should take you as my disciple under normal circumstances. Unfortunately, I have lived for so many years and seen too many things. I have already given up on taking you as my disciple. Moreover, you are already Xuan Yi’s disciple. Although Xuan Yi is dead, I have no intention of taking him as my disciple,” Temporal Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang looked calm. He had heard from Temple Master Bai Xing that the Temple Master had already given up on taking him in as a disciple.","He had never expected that the Temple Master would take him in as a disciple.","“However, although I can’t take you in as a disciple, I can give you some guidance on the space-time principles,” Temporal Temple Master said with a smile.","“I’ve carefully checked your current physical condition. If nothing unexpected happens, you won’t be able to condense a trace of divine power within 300 years. In other words, you won’t have much strength during these 300 years, let alone fighting with others. However, these 300 years won’t affect your comprehension of the principles and the application of the principles.","“So, if you’re willing, you can stay by my side for the next 300 years and cultivate in this independent space. What do you think?”","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed when he heard the Temple Master’s words. He nodded without hesitation and said, “Temple Master, I’m willing!”","Of course, Jian Wushuang was willing.","What kind of existence was the temple master?","No one in the Divine Beginning Realm could compare to him in terms of spacetime principles alone. It was extremely difficult for others to come into contact with such a super expert, even some of the higher-ups of the Temporal Temple, people like Temple Master Bai Xing, Ba Cang, and others could not meet the Temporal Temple Master just because they wanted to, let alone stay by his side all the time.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, there were countless experts, but many powerful Principles Masters were also eager to seek guidance from the Temporal Temple Master because the Temporal Temple Master could give them a little guidance on the principles of space and time, it was a great help to these masters of principles, but the Temporal Temple Master could not be bothered to give them any guidance.","If he could cultivate by the Temporal Temple Master’s side, the Temporal Temple Master would not be stingy with his guidance. It would benefit any cultivator who was proficient in the principles of space and time!","It could be said that cultivating by the Temporal Temple Master’s side was a dream opportunity for countless cultivators.","But now, the Temporal Temple Master had given this opportunity to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was not stupid. Of course, he knew that this was a rare opportunity, so how could he refuse it.","“Well, in these 300 years, I will arrange your cultivation so that you can make the greatest progress during the 300 years when divine power can not be condensed. After 300 years, when your strength recovers, I will leave the Divine Beginning Realm and continue to explore the universe battlefield. The rest of your journey will be up to you,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Thank you, Temple Master.” Jian Wushuang thanked him profusely.","“In the past 300 years, besides staying by my side and cultivating according to my arrangements, there are 15 Principles Temples on my island. They should be of great help to you, Bai Xing!” Temporal Temple Master glanced at the void beside him.","“Temple Master.” Temple Master Bai Xing’s figure appeared directly.","“Take this little girl to the Principles Temple,” Temporal Temple Master instructed.","“Yes.” Temple Master Bai Xing nodded respectfully.","Jian Wushuang immediately followed Temple Master Bai Xing.","After walking out of the independent space where Temporal Temple Master lived, Jian Wushuang and Temple Master Bai Xing walked side by side on the Saha Island.","“Little girl...” Temple Master Bai Xing had just opened her mouth, but she immediately stopped. “That’s not right. Although you’re still an Immortal Saint, your real combat strength is stronger than that of an ordinary Principles Master. You’re on the same level as me. It doesn’t seem appropriate for me to call you little girl. I’ll just call you by your name.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what did Temple Master tell you just now?” Temple Master Bai Xing asked curiously.","“Nothing much. He just told me about the difference in strength between a ruler and a Principles Master, as well as some things about the three Saint Realms. In addition, Temple Master wants me to cultivate by his side for the next 300 years,” Jian Wushuang said, he did not mention his master and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","“What?” Temple Master Bai Xing was shocked. “Temple Master wants you to cultivate by his side for 300 years?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Temple Master Bai Xing immediately praised him, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, I have to say that you’re really lucky. Temple Master had made up his mind many years ago not to accept any more disciples. This time, he didn’t make an exception when he met you, but he asked you to cultivate by his side...”","“Our Temporal Temple has been established for a long time. Although there have been countless experts who are good at spacetime principles, there are probably no more than 20 of them who have received personal guidance from Temple Master. Moreover, Temple Master has only given them some simple guidance once or twice, but there hasn’t been anyone who can cultivate by Temple Master’s side until now!”","“Tut-tut, if you can cultivate with the Temple Master, even if you are the Temple Master’s personal disciple, you won’t get the same treatment. You are really lucky this time.”","“Ah?” Jian Wushuang was stunned at first, but then he nodded slightly.","Indeed, it was really lucky that he could cultivate with the Temple Master for 300 years.","“Temple Master Bai Xing, Temple Master wants me to go to the temple of principles. The temple of principles should be the palace complex that you pointed out to me, right?” Jian Wushuang changed the subject.","Jian Wushuang remembered that when he had just arrived on the Saha Island, Temple Master Bai Xing had brought him to several fortuitous places on the island. However, there was one place that Temple Master Bai Xing pointed out to him but did not bring him in, it was a group of palaces.","According to Temple Master Bai Xing, the threshold of the palaces was extremely high. Even an ordinary Principles Master of the first or second realm of the void realm was not qualified to enter. In order to enter, one usually needed to master more than two rules.","Since the threshold was so high, it was obvious that the palaces were extraordinary.","“You guessed right. The group of palaces that I pointed out to you is where the Principles Temple is located. As for the purpose of the Principles Temple...can’t you guess it?” Temple Master Bai Xing looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","“Of course, the Principles Temple is aimed at the rules, but the threshold is so high. Obviously, it’s not only aimed at the space-time principles. If nothing goes wrong, the purpose of the Principles Temple should be to integrate the principles, right?” Jian Wushuang said.."]},{"number":3333,"title":"Chapter 3333 - Affinity Test","paragraphs":["——","“Smart.” Temple Master Bai Xing smiled. “There are a total of sixteen Principles Temples. Apart from the other one which is used for the affinity test, the other fifteen are all for fusing another principle with the spacetime principles. Cultivating in the Principles Temple might not guarantee that you’ll be able to fuse these two principles, but at least it’s much easier than comprehending them yourself.”","“These 15 temples focus on the fusion of principles, including destruction and space-time, life and death and space-time, life and space-time, thunder and space-time, and so on. Heavenly Sword Marquis, I know that apart from the space-time principles, the second principle you have comprehended is the Samsara principles. Among these 15 temples, there is one that combines the Samsara and space-time principles, which you can use.”","“The fusion of space-time and reincarnation?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","The fusion of space-time principles and reincarnation principles were two different principles. When he was in the Blood Wave Temple, he had barely found the key points of the fusion. He had already entered the rudiments of the fusion of the two principles, what he needed next was a lot of time to constantly adapt and study them.","Now, if the Principles Temple that corresponded to space-time and reincarnation was really helpful to the integration of the two principles, it would definitely save him a lot of time.","“Let’s go to the Principles Temple now,” Jian Wushuang said.","Although there were 15 Principles Temples for the integration of principles, he did not need the other Principles Temples for the time being. Only the Principles Temple that corresponded to space-time and reincarnation was useful to him. It would be of great use to him.","“Don’t worry, before you go to the Principles Temple, you have to test your affinity for the principles.” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“Rule affinity?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“There are all kinds of principles between heaven and earth, and I don’t need to explain how useful these principles are to cultivators. Every cultivator has a different affinity with the principles between heaven and earth. This affinity represents whether he has the talent and qualification to comprehend this principle.”","“Take you for example. You have been comprehending the space-time principles and the Samsara principles at a very fast speed and have a very high talent. This means that you have a very high affinity with these two principles. Only in this way can you comprehend these two principles so quickly.","“But if it were other principles, such as you comprehending the life-death principles, the same perception, the same opportunity, and the same time, the achievements you can achieve in the life-death principles might not necessarily be able to achieve your achievements in the space-time principles and the Samsara principles,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“I see. The affinity is equivalent to the talent for meditating on various principles. Only when the affinity is high, the speed of meditating on the corresponding principles will be faster.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He could understand what Temple Master Bai Xing meant by affinity, he could understand.","“Yes, the affinity with the principles determines whether you have the qualification and talent to study this principle. You can comprehend the principles of space-time and reincarnation in such a short time, which means that you have a very high affinity with these two principles. If you are an ordinary Immortal Saint, then you don’t need to care about your affinity with the principles of heaven and earth. But you are not ordinary!” Temple Master Bai Xing continued to explain.","“You already have the battle strength of the three realms of void, but you have already grasped the power of will. The strength of the Principles Master depends largely on the power of will. As for the way to obtain the power of will, the most important thing is to grasp more principles or to integrate more principles!”","“You have already grasped one principle, and it won’t be long before you grasp two principles. In the future, you must find a way to grasp the third or even the fourth principle. Naturally, you must now figure out which principles are suitable for you to comprehend so that you can make corresponding preparations in advance.”","Jian Wushuang suddenly understood.","Yes, it was enough for him to master the principles of space-time and reincarnation.","However, once he reached the level of Principles Master, he had to find a way to master more principles. At this time, he had to figure out which principles were suitable for him to comprehend.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, come with me.” Temple Master Bai Xing led Jian Wushuang to the building complex of the Principles Temple and directly entered the temple at the front.","There were all kinds of air currents in the magnificent temple. These air currents represented the principles of heaven and earth. At a glance, there were at least hundreds of such air currents, Jian Wushuang could immediately sense the existence of the space-time principles and reincarnation principles from these air currents.","“Temple Master Bai Xing, what should I do?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s simple. You just sit here with your legs crossed, close your eyes and try your best to communicate with the surrounding principles power,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded and immediately sat down in the center of the hall according to Temple Master Bai Xing’s instructions, then he closed his eyes and began to communicate with the airflow that represented the principles power.","An hour passed in the blink of an eye.","During this one hour, the air currents in the hall surrounded Jian Wushuang. Among the air currents, a few of them emitted light, some dazzling and some dim.","“Well, you can open your eyes now,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","Jian Wushuang immediately opened his eyes and saw the airflow that was emitting light.","“These glowing airflow should be the principles power that has a high affinity with me, right?” Jian Wushuang said, because he had noticed the most dazzling airflow among these glowing airflow, it was the airflow that represented the space-time principles.","“Yes, the more dazzling these glows are, the more affinity you have with this principle. Without a doubt, your affinity with the space-time principles is the highest. As for the reincarnation principles, it is slightly inferior to the space-time principles, but its affinity is still very high. In addition, your affinity with the earth principles, the gold principles, and the fate principles is also good. You can find a way to understand these principles in the future!”","“But what surprised me the most was the principles of destruction!”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, I didn’t expect your talent in the principles of destruction to be so high. It’s not much weaker than yours in the space-time principles,” Temple Master Bai Xing said with a hint of surprise.","Jian Wushuang immediately looked at one of the equally dazzling airflow that was comparable to the airflow of the space-time principles.","That airflow represented the destruction principles!","...."]},{"number":3334,"title":"Chapter 3334 - The Fusion Process","paragraphs":["_____________","“I didn’t expect my affinity with the destruction principles to be so high.” Jian Wushuang was also surprised.","It was not that he had not been exposed to the destruction principles.","After all, he had met many experts who were good at the destruction principles.","However, even though he had come into contact with the principles of destruction, he had never tried to comprehend it. After all, the principles of spacetime and the principles of reincarnation were enough for him to study, he did not have the time and energy to study other principles.","Because he had never tried, he subconsciously thought that he was not suitable to study the principles of destruction. But in the end...his affinity with the principles of destruction was not weaker than his own principles of spacetime.","“The light is so dazzling, and your affinity with the destruction principles is much higher than your affinity with the Samsara principles. It would be a pity if you don’t comprehend the destruction principles,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“I didn’t know that I had the talent to comprehend the destruction principles. Now That I know it, after I have mastered the Samsara principles, the next thing I want to comprehend is the destruction principles,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“A cultivator, even a Principles Master, has limited energy. Under normal circumstances, Principles Masters can only choose four rules to comprehend. You have already comprehended two principles. If you want to comprehend the destruction principles as the next principle, you can choose three principles. As for the fourth principles...you have a good affinity with the earth principles, the gold principles, and the fate principles. You can choose one of them to comprehend,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","A Principles Master could only become a ruler if he had comprehended four principles and completely fused them. Therefore, Jian Wushuang had to comprehend four principles as well, now that he had three principles: space-time, reincarnation, and destruction, the only principles left was...","“There’s no rush. I’m still far from mastering the Samsara principles and destruction principles, let alone fusing all three principles. I’ll consider choosing the fourth principle after I’ve comprehended and fused all three principles,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","“It’s up to you. Let’s go. I’ll take you to the Principles Temple.”","Immediately, Temple Master Bai Xing brought Jian Wushuang to the Principles Temple that focused on space-time and reincarnation.","As soon as they entered the Principles Temple, Jian Wushuang immediately sensed the two different principles that filled the entire temple.","These two principles were the space-time principles and the Samsara principles, and both were very strong.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you can sit down and slowly feel it with your heart. Soon, you will be able to feel some strange things in this temple,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and sat down cross-legged according to Temple Master Bai Xing’s instructions. He began to feel it with his heart. In his senses, the power of two different principles that filled the temple began to slowly merge.","Yes, the reason why the Principles Temple was unique was that there was a process of merging two different principles in the Principles Temple.","What Jian Wushuang saw now was the process of merging the space-time principles and the Samsara principles. From the beginning to the end, the two principles completely merged into one. Jian Wushuang saw it clearly.","“I saw a complete cycle of Heavenly Dao in the Blood Wave Temple, which also included the merging of various principles. Unfortunately, I spent most of my energy on mastering the space-time principles and the Samsara principles. As for the merging of the two principles, although I studied it for a while, it was too short and didn’t involve much. Now...”","“The Principles Temple is purely a fusion process of the two principles of space-time and reincarnation. The fusion process is clearer and more detailed than what I saw in Blood Wave Temple, so it will be more helpful to me.” Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised.","He only needed a simple scan to understand how helpful the Principles Temple was to him.","He had already barely taken that step in the fusion of the two principles of spacetime and reincarnation, and could be considered to have entered the rudiments. Under such circumstances, if he could cultivate in the Principles Temple...then his progress in the fusion of the two principles would definitely be huge. It would not be long before he could truly fuse the two principles together.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you stay here and meditate. I have something to do, so I’ll leave first. If Temple Master has any instructions, I’ll let you know,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“Thank you, Temple Master Bai Xing,” Jian Wushuang thanked him.","Temple Master Bai Xing waved his hand and left quickly. Jian Wushuang was the only one left in the huge Principles Temple.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the center of the temple. He closed his eyes and began to meditate quietly.","Ten days passed in the blink of an eye.","During these ten days, Jian Wushuang stayed in the Principles Temple. By watching the fusion process of the two principles and studying them, he had improved a lot in the fusion of the two principles of space-time and reincarnation.","However, Jian Wushuang did not stay any longer.","After all, the Principles Temple had always been on Saha Island. As long as he had time, he could cultivate in the Principles Temple. However, the Temple Master did not stay on Saha Island all the time. Now, he had the opportunity to cultivate with the Temple Master, of course, he did not want to miss the 300 years.","In the independent space where the Temple Master lived, Jian Wushuang stood respectfully in an ordinary manor. The Temple Master was holding a kettle in front of him and watering a young sapling that had just sprouted.","Temporal Temple Master was very familiar with both the kettle and the watering. He was very calm, no different from an ordinary person.","Jian Wushuang saw all of this.","“Little guy, guess what I’m doing?” Temporal Temple Master turned to look at Jian Wushuang after watering the sapling.","“Temple Master, you must be planting a tree,” Jian Wushuang replied.","“How long has this tree been growing?” Temporal Temple Master asked again.","“This tree...” Jian Wushuang looked at the sapling carefully.","In his eyes, the sapling was very ordinary and nothing special. It was obviously an ordinary sapling that could be seen everywhere in the world. Jian Wushuang could clearly sense the vitality of the sapling.","“Judging from its vitality, this sapling should have been planted less than ten days ago. If I’m not mistaken, it must have been planted after you returned to the Divine Beginning Realm, Temple Master,” Jian Wushuang answered truthfully.","“Oh, really?” Temporal Temple Master said with a faint smile, “Then take a look at it now.”","After saying that, Temporal Temple Master sprinkled the kettle in his hand on the sapling.","In an instant, the sapling began to change.."]},{"number":3335,"title":"Chapter 3335 - Space-Time Conversion","paragraphs":["______","In the manor, under Jian Wushuang’s gaze, the ordinary little sapling that had just shown its leaves began to grow at an incredible speed. In the blink of an eye, it had turned into a towering tree, and it was still growing, its branches were luxuriant and luxuriant.","Hualala! The trunk extended, and the entire tree was like a huge mushroom vine, covering the entire manor. In the end, it even covered the entire independent space, at this time, the diameter of the tree had already exceeded hundreds of meters. An extremely ancient and ancient aura emanated from the tree.","Jian Wushuang stared at the tree in front of him in astonishment. He could also sense the vitality of the tree and thus determine its age. However, the current age of the tree was definitely more than 10 million years old!","This was an ancient tree that had lived for more than 10 million years!","“How could this be?” Jian Wushuang was extremely shocked.","“It’s simple. This is the original appearance of the sapling. However, in order to make it easier for me to irrigate it and to not attract too much attention, I used time conversion to keep it in the sapling stage,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Time conversion?” Jian Wushuang was stunned and asked, “What is time conversion?”","“Time conversion is the conversion of two things of different time periods. For example, this tree has lived for tens of millions of years, but after time conversion, it still looks like a sapling. Similarly, after time conversion, a sapling can also turn into an ancient tree that is tens of millions of years old!” The Temporal Temple Master explained.","“The principles of time and space are profound and profound. After mastering the principles of time and space, the next step is to improve the application of the principles of time and space. The first step in the application of the principles of time and space is the conversion of time and space!”","“The conversion of time and space is one of the methods of the conversion of time and space. This conversion can only be used on inanimate objects such as mountains and lands. As for the conversion of time and space to life, that is a higher level method.”","“In addition to time conversion, there is also space conversion. This space conversion is even easier to demonstrate. look.”","Temporal Temple Master waved his hand. The independent space they were in was originally a manor, but in the blink of an eye, it had turned into a huge plain. The plain was clear and full of vitality.","Temporal Temple Master waved his hand again, and the plain disappeared. In its place was an endless sea.","“This is...” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. From the manor to the plain and then to the sea, everything was within Temporal Temple Master’s control.","This method immediately reminded Jian Wushuang of the secret skill of the mountain and river map, the thousand treasures great world.","The thousand treasures great world contained many worlds, and each world had its own characteristics and were different. The thousand treasures great world changed according to Jian Wushuang’s will.","“You have the map of mountains and rivers. The world of treasures in the map is actually a kind of world transformation. You should be able to understand the space transformation more easily,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“Indeed.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, but he immediately asked in puzzlement, “Temple Master, although the space-time transformation is very strange, it shouldn’t be very useful in a fight, whether it’s time transformation or space transformation, right?”","“It’s not very useful.” The Temple Master nodded. “Time-space conversion is only the most rudimentary use of the space-time principles. After mastering the space-time conversion, one can truly step into the threshold of using the space-time principles. As for in a real battle, there is almost no need to use the space-time conversion. However...after you master the space-time conversion, the biggest use is not the space-time conversion, but your use of the space-time principles has reached a new level. The difference is still very big.”","Temporal Temple Master smiled and continued, “Little guy, now that you have completely mastered the principles of spacetime, how many principles of spacetime do you think you can use now?”","“All of them, of course. I can use all the power of the principles of spacetime around me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s right. Since you can use all the power of the principles of spacetime around you, and the power of the principles of spacetime between heaven and earth is endless, why do different people control the power of the principles of spacetime differently?” Temple Master Bai Xing looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","“This...” Jian Wushuang frowned and said, “This is the different application of the principles of time and space.”","“Yes, it is the application. To give a simple example, two people draw water from the same river. One of them draws water from a bowl. He can only draw water back and forth bowl by bowl. How much water can he draw back from the river?”","“The other person is using a bucket to fetch water back and forth. Although it’s still insignificant to the river, the amount of water that he can fetch back is far from what the first person can compare to.”","“The space-time principles that we know is that river. It’s endless, and no matter how you use it, it can be used by you. But the difference is that the tool that we use to fetch water is the use of the space-time principles. Right now, your use of the space-time principles is very shallow, and it’s still at the most basic stage. You’re just like the person who uses a water bowl to fetch water. The space-time principles that can be used at one time is only a small bowl!”","“As for a master of space-time conversion, he is equivalent to a person who uses a bucket to fetch water. Although he still uses relatively simple tools, a bucket of water is much more than a bowl of water. Therefore, after mastering the space-time conversion, the power of space-time principles that he can use immediately will be greatly enhanced","“Under normal circumstances, when two cultivators who have comprehended the space-time principles use the same space-time techniques, the power of the cultivator who has mastered the space-time transformation is at least ten times stronger than that of the cultivator who has not! This is the difference!”","At this point, the Temple Master finally stopped and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang looked as if he had suddenly realized something. “After mastering the space-time transformation, the technique of the space-time transformation is not important. What is important is that the use of the power of the space-time principles will be much stronger.”","“That’s right.” The Temporal Temple Master smiled.","“Temple Master, according to what you said, the time-space conversion is only a superficial method of using the time-space principles. Then what is it after the time-space conversion?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","“The time-space conversion is the first stage of the use of time-space. This stage is very long. More than 99% of the cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm who are good at time-space stay in this stage. As for the second stage, it is time-space imprisonment!”","...."]},{"number":3336,"title":"Chapter 3336 - 300 Years","paragraphs":["——","“Space-time imprisonment?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He was no stranger to space-time imprisonment. He had mastered space-time teleportation and had a strong life-saving ability. Only by using space-time imprisonment could he defeat him.","The three Saint Realms had been prepared for the battle on Saha Island. They had asked Master Qingyan to use space-time imprisonment from the beginning, not giving him a chance to escape.","“The space-time imprisonment can only be used by experts who use the space-time principles. I heard from Temple Master Bai Xing that there are no more than 20 people in the Divine Beginning Realm who can use the space-time imprisonment,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, the space-time conversion can only be regarded as a shallow use of the space-time principles, but at the level of the space-time imprisonment, the use of the space-time principles is already considered good. Such people are indeed not big in the Divine Beginning Realm, so it’s normal that there are no more than 20 of them.” Temporal Temple Master nodded slightly.","“After mastering the space-time imprisonment, the next step is to master the third stage of the application of the space-time principles, the space-time flow rate!”","“Flow rate?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. “Is it the same as the space-time tower?”","The time flow rate in the three-story space-time tower was completely different from that in the outside world.","In the first story of the space-time tower, the time flow rate was ten times slower than that in the outside world, and in the second story, it was a hundred times slower. In the third story, the time flow rate was a thousand times slower, which was incredible. The characteristics of the space-time tower...were clearly the same as the spacetime flow that the Temporal Temple Master had mentioned.","“The spacetime tower can be considered as such. However, the spacetime tower only purely changes the flow of time. On the other hand, the real flow of time and space can change together. There are still some differences between the two.” The Temporal Temple Master smiled.","“Actually, in the Divine Beginning Realm, many experts who specialize in the principles of space-time can simply change the flow of time. However, they can only barely change the flow of time in a small area. Not only is the area small, but it can only be maintained for a short period of time. It can not be sustained at all. However, experts who have truly grasped the move of the flow of time and space can turn the flow of time in a piece of space into eternity. They can even refine it into a treasure!”","“Just like the space-time tower, I refined it myself. The flow of time in it is completely stable and can continue.”","Jian Wushuang understood.","“Temple Master, the flow of time and space is only the third stage of the application of the space-time rule. What about the fourth stage?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","“The fourth stage...that is a higher level of application. Unfortunately, even I am far from being able to reach that level. Even if I tell you, it is useless. In the Divine Beginning Realm, if you can reach the third stage of the application of the space-time principles and master the flow of time and space, it will be very impressive,” Temple Master said.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","Apparently, the Temporal Temple Master was also in the third stage of mastering the flow of time and space. In this way, the Temporal Temple Master was already the one who had the highest understanding of the principles of time and space in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm, however, Jian Wushuang had not even reached the rudiments of the principles of time and space. Even if he knew the fourth stage, it would be useless.","“Little guy, you have been staying here for the past 300 years. I will teach you the use of the space-time principles according to your progress. If you encounter any problems that you don’t understand, you can take the initiative to ask. With your talent in the space-time principles, under my guidance, although you won’t be able to reach the stage of space-time imprisonment in the past 300 years, it shouldn’t be difficult for you to master the space-time transformation.”","“Work hard,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes, thank you, Temple Master.” Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised.","From that day on, Jian Wushuang spent most of his time in this independent space. He followed Temporal Temple Master, sometimes watching him plant trees, sometimes meditating on his own, and sometimes asking for advice from Temporal Temple Master, Temporal Temple Master was not stingy with him. Whenever he asked a question, he would guide and answer it in various ways, either directly or indirectly.","Under such circumstances, Jian Wushuang’s application of the principles of space-time had been improving at an alarming rate.","Spring went to the east, and time continued to pass.","Three hundred years was insignificant to the Divine Beginning Realm, which had existed for an unknown number of years. For an ancient existence like Temporal Temple Master, three hundred years passed in a snap of the fingers. He simply planted trees a few times, let alone three hundred years, 30,000 years would pass easily.","However, to Jian Wushuang, these three hundred years were very precious. He did not dare to waste any time during these three hundred years. He had been cultivating wholeheartedly. Now, the three hundred years had finally passed.","He was still in the manor in the independent space. Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the empty ground with his eyes slightly closed. The surroundings were calm and peaceful.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He slowly extended his right arm and opened his palm. There was a faint white light in the center of his palm.","This white light was extremely sharp. It was a sword essence!","Sword essence...this was Jian Wushuang’s sword essence condensed from his own sword principle.","At first, it was extremely weak, as if it would be extinguished at any time. But soon, the light of the sword shadow became brighter and more dazzling. The size of the sword essence kept increasing, and in the blink of an eye, it formed a three-foot sword shadow.","After the three-foot sword shadow was formed, it did not stop there. Instead, it continued to enlarge. It was clearly a sword shadow, but it suddenly turned into a sword river in Jian Wushuang’s hand and spread out.","The sword river disappeared, and then a towering sword mountain appeared. After that, the sword shadow evolved into various things.","After a long time, the sword shadow disappeared, and Jian Wushuang opened his eyes.","“Temple Master!”","After opening his eyes, Jian Wushuang immediately stood up and bowed respectfully to the figure in front of him.","“Sword essence evolves everything. Have you reached the third realm of sword principle?” Temporal Temple Master looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Jian Wushuang had already reached the third realm of sword principle. He had already reached the second realm, boundless sword tree!","His boundless sword skill had already reached the limit of the second stage of sword principle when he was in the Blood Wave Realm. After returning to the time-space island, he had cultivated in this independent space for 300 years, although he focused most of his energy on the application of the space-time principles, the principles were used in conjunction with sword principle. While studying the application of the principles, he also took into account sword principle and swordsmanship.","Therefore, he had also made some progress in the way of the sword.. Now, he had broken through to the third realm of the way of the sword and evolved everything!"]},{"number":3337,"title":"Chapter 3337 - Swordsmanship and Divine Arts","paragraphs":["Chapter 3337: Swordsmanship and Divine Arts","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The third level of Dao is common among the principles. Most Principles","Masters have reached the third level of Dao. Only a few weaker Principles","Masters are still at the second level. Now that you have reached the third level","of sword principle, if you fight with Principles Masters in the future, you won’t","be at a disadvantage.”","“Now that you’ve made a breakthrough in sword principle, how about your","swordsmanship? How are the sword techniques you created?” Temporal","Temple Master looked at Jian Wushuang.","“The seven sword techniques of the Wushuang sword manual have been","improved. Although they are not the best among the unique skills created by","the Principles Master, they are not weak,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s right.” Temporal Temple Master nodded slightly. “Although your seven","sword moves were created when you were weak, this sword move is quite","complete. It involves all aspects and can be improved continuously. Moreover,","this sword move of yours can be combined with the space-time principles. It’s","already very rare that you can use the space-time principles perfectly.”","Jian Wushuang also smiled, then he said, “Temple Master, you asked me to try","to integrate the space-time divine skill into these seven sword techniques. I’ve","tried my best. Blood Asura has integrated the first move of the space-time","divine skill, the heaven-designated skill, and the second move of the","space-time divine skill, Canyang, which is part of the unparalleled sword","manual I created.”","“Oh?” Temporal Temple Masters eyes lit up. “Show me what you’ve got.”","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang waved his sword in the open space of the","manor.","Whoosh!","The sword swept across, and a scarlet sword shadow burst out.","The sword shadow was like the setting sun, its red light illuminating the world.","However, the setting sun was obviously incomplete.","The peerless sword technique...the setting sun!","Weng!","The sword shadow swept across the void in front of him, instantly creating a","large space ripple. This space ripple was filled with a red light. Following that,","the scarlet sword shadow directly exploded. Rumble...an endless killing power","swept out, a huge space-time storm instantly formed.","The second move of the space-time divine art, space-time annihilation!","Under this sword move, the power of space- time annihilation was completely","unleashed, and the power was earth-shaking!","When the Temple Master saw this scene, the light in his eyes became even","brighter.","When the space-time annihilation completely dissipated, the Temple Master","looked at Jian Wushuang again. “Yes, your sword skill is powerful, and the","sword skill combines space-time annihilation. The two complement each other","and are much stronger than your own pure space-time annihilation. Most","importantly, the hidden sword skill of space-time annihilation makes it","impossible to guard against.”","“When I created this sword skill, I only wanted to integrate space-time storm","into it. After mastering space-time annihilation, I wanted to integrate","space-time annihilation into this move. Although I spent a lot of effort, I still","succeeded,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Space-time divine skill was the most powerful divine ability created by the","Temporal Temple Master. Now, Jian Wushuang had directly integrated this","divine ability into his sword skill, which made the Temple Master praise him","greatly.","“It’s a pity that I have only successfully integrated time-space annihilation into","the first move of setting sun. However, although I have mastered the fourth","move of the time-space divine skill, time-space illusion kill, I still can’t","integrate it into the life and death instant that I created,” Jian Wushuang said.","Among the seven sword moves of the Wushuang Sword Manual, the life and","death instant was the most terrifying burst of speed in an instant. It was a","strike that could kill the opponent without giving the opponent a chance to","react.","Not only did this strike need to burst out with terrifying speed, but it also","needed to carry a shocking power that could directly kill the opponent.","The fourth move of the space-time divine skill was called ‘space-time illusion","kill’. Jian Wushuang had mastered this move in the past 300 years, and this","move also needed to burst out with terrifying speed to kill the opponent in an","instant, it was exactly the same as the instant of life and death, so the two","could naturally be combined.","After Jian Wushuang mastered the space-time illusion kill, the Temple Master","had reminded him to try to integrate the space-time illusion kill into the","instant of life and death. Jian Wushuang did the same, but after all, there was","too much time, and it was not effective yet.","“Don’t worry, the space-time divine skill is, after all, my painstaking work over","the years. Every move is very impressive. If you casually integrate it into your","own sword skill, wouldn’t it make the divine skill I created too useless?” The","Temple Master said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang smiled.","It was true that space-time divine skill was created by Temporal Temple","Master himself. It was already amazing that he could integrate two divine","abilities into his swordsmanship in such a short period of time. He had just","mastered the space-time illusion kill, it was indeed too fast for him to","integrate it into his swordsmanship.","“Little guy, it has been 300 years. Your divine power should have recovered to","its peak, Temporal Temple Master suddenly asked.","“It has completely recovered.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Because of the backlash of the power given by Blood Wave, he could not","condense his divine power during the past 300 years. He had been in a weak","state, but after 300 years, he finally began to recover, now, his strength had","recovered to its peak.","“After your divine power has recovered, have you sensed any signs of a","breakthrough?” Temporal Temple Master asked again.","“No.” Jian Wushuang his head with a bitter smile.","His divine power had long reached the limits of the Immortal Saint, and he had","completely mastered the space-time principles. His sword principle had","already reached the third realm. If it were an ordinary person, they would have","broken through long ago, but he...showed no signs of a breakthrough at all.","“It’s indeed not easy to break through to the Principles Master level at the","perfect life-level. As far as I know, your master Xuan Yi took a long time to","break through to the Principles Master level. When he finally broke through, he","had already fused three principles,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was","His master had fused three principles to become a Principles Master?","Like his master, he was a perfect life-form. Could it be that he had to wait until","the three principles were fused before he could break through?","But that was too far away.","“I don’t know the details. You Don’t have to be too impatient. The more","impatient you are, the harder it will be for you to break through. Everything","will be fine when the time comes,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“I will follow your instructions, Temple Master.” Jian Wushuang nodded","repeatedly.","“Well, 300 years have passed. It’s time for me to leave and go to the universe","battlefield. But before I leave, there are some things I have to explain to you.”","Temporal Temple Master smiled."]},{"number":3338,"title":"Chapter 3338 - Inspector","paragraphs":["Chapter 3338: Inspector","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation EndlessFantasy Translation","In the magnificent palace, many high level experts of the Temporal Temple","had gathered together.","Although Jian Wushuang was not one of the high-level experts of the","Temporal Temple, because of the battle on Saha Island and his explosive","power, he had gained a very high among the of the Temporal","Temple. In addition, over the past 300 years, Jian Wushuang had","cultivating by the side of the Temple Master. This kind of treatment","had never been given to anyone since the creation of the Temporal Temple. It","was clear that Jian Wushuangs position in the Temporal Temple Master’s heart","was very high, therefore, Jian Wushuang also had a place in the temple.","The Temporal Temple Master sat on the throne at the top and looked down at","the people below.","“I have been adventuring in the universe battlefield all year round. This time, I","only came back temporarily. I plan to go to the universe battlefield again soon.","and before I leave.?Bai Xing,” The Temple Master shouted.","“Palace Master.” Temple Master Bai Xing immediately stood up.","“When I am adventuring in the universe battlefield, you will still be the acting","Temple Master of the Temporal Temple. You will be in charge of all the matters","in the Temporal Temple,” the Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes.” Temple Master Bai Xing nodded respectfully.","“Ba Cang, you will still be the supervisor of the palace and assist Bai Xing in","managing the Temporal Temple,” Temporal Temple Master said.","“Yes, master.” He accepted the order.","“Phosphorescence...” Temporal Temple Master continued to issue some more","appointments, which were basically the same as before.","In the end...","“Heavenly Sword Marquis,” Temporal Temple Master suddenly said.","Jian Wushuang was stunned, and the surrounding people all looked at Jian","Wushuang.","“Temple Master.” Jian Wushuang walked forward.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, although you are only an Immortal Saint, your","strength has long surpassed that of an ordinary Principles Master. I now","appoint you as the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple. Do you agree?”","Temple master said.","“Inspector?” Jian Wushuang awas shocked.","He had been in the Temporal Temple for so many years, so he knew a little","about the positions of the higher ups in the temple. Temple Master and","Inspector were undoubtedly at the top and held great power. As for the","inspector...he was under the supervisor and also had great power. He was also","one of the highest-ranking officials in the Temporal Temple. In terms of status","and power, he was higher than many Principles Masters in the two or even","three void realms.","Moreover, there had only been five patrol masters before, but now the","Temporal Temple Master had appointed him as the sixth?","“I’his...” Jian Wushuang was a little stunned. He could not help looking around","at the lh?ople around him.","Sure enough, the surrounding Principles Masters looked at him strangely.","There were some strange emotions in their eyes. The Principles Masters","immediately communicated with each other secretly.","The Temple Master wants Heavenly Sword marquis to be an inspector?”","“An inspector has a lot of power. Usually, only experts in the four void realms","and above will be appointed. As for Heavenly Sword Marquis...although his","performance in the previous battle was amazing, everyone knows that he used","external forces. As for his own strength, he is still far from being appointed as","an inspector, right?”","“You can’t say that. After all, in the previous battle, even without external help,","the Heavenly Sword Marquis’ combat strength was still at the third level of the","Void Realm. Moreover, he was only an Immortal Saint, and his talent and","potential were so great. Now, it has been three hundred years since that battle,","and he has been cultivating by the Temple Master’s side. Perhaps he has","already reached the fourth level of the Void Realm?”","“It’s possible, but he’s still too young and inexperienced. It’s still too early for","him to become an inspector and become the highest-ranking official of the","Temporal Temple. ”","The Principles Masters discussed quietly and had their own opinions on the","appointment of the Temporal Temple Master.","As for Jian Wushuang himself, he knew his own limits, he immediately said,","Temple Master , let’s not talk about whether I’m qualified to be an inspector.","I’ve only been in the Temporal Temple for a short period of time. I’m afraid it’s","not appropriate for me to be an inspector without much contribution to the","Temporal Temple.”","“It’s not a problem for you to be an inspector with your strength. As for your","experience and contribution, you can slowly accumulate them in the future. I","said that you’re qualified to be an inspector, so naturally you’re qualified. You","don’t have to worry too much. I’ll ask you if you’re willing to be an inspector.”","Temporal Temple Master looked down, there was a hint of deep meaning in his","eyes.","Jian Wushuang was obviously still hesitant, but when he noticed the profound","in the Temple Master’s eyes, he stopped thinking and said, “I do.”","“Well, from today on, you are the sixth inspector of the temple.” The Temple","Master smiled, he continued, “Inspector, you have a very high position in the","temple and your position is extraordinary. You will fight for the temple","directly. In the Divine Beginning Realm, if there is a fight between the temple","and the experts from other forces, the inspector will deal with it immediately.”","“Although your strength has reached the required level, the enmity between","you and the three Saint Realms is too deep to be resolved. In the future, when","you fight for the Temporal Temple, you will inevitably have to deal with the","three Saint Realms again. In order to prevent the three Saint Realms from","using any tricks against you in the future, here is a token. Keep it well.” The","Temporal Temple Master waved his hand, a token emitting a special","space-time fluctuation was thrown towards Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took the token and held it in his hand. He asked in puzzlement,","“Temple Master, what is this token?”","“This token is a life-saving token that I personally refined. It can save your life.","As long as I have this token, I can guarantee that no one in the Divine","Beginning Realm can really kill you,” Temporal Temple Master said, his words","were filled with absolute confidence.","He did have such confidence.","As a ruler-level expert, he was proficient in the principles of spacetime. He was","definitely the best at using the principles of spacetime in the Divine Beginning","Realm. With such high attainments in spacetime, the life-saving token he","refined contained special spacetime techniques, although it did not have the","ability to attack, it was definitely enough to save his life.","Even if a master-level expert from the outside world arrived, Jian Wushuang","could still escape with this token, let alone the fact that a master-level expert","from the outside world had yet to arrive at the Divine Beginning Realm.","Therefore, the Temple Master did not show any fear even though he knew that","the three Saint Realms were backed by the power of the will of heaven. He also","knew that the power of the will of heaven could possibly allow a master-level","expert from the outside world to arrive at the Divine Beginning Realm, he","dared to protect Jian Wushuang’s real trump card!","In the Divine Beginning Realm, although Temporal Temple Master could not","be said to be truly invincible, no one could stop him if he wanted to leave."]},{"number":3339,"title":"Chapter 3339 - He Was Flattered","paragraphs":["Chapter 3339: He Was Flattered","Translator. EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon hearing the words of the Temple Master and looking at the token in his","hand, Jian Wushuang was not only pleasantly surprised, but also flattered.","At this moment, the hearts of the Principles Masters were also surging.","“The Temple Master has personally refined two life-saving tokens. As far as I","know, the Temple Master has refined two of them before. One of them has","been used a long time ago, and the other one is left in the Temporal Temple in","case anything happens. The Temple Master has also warned us not to use this","token unless the Temporal Temple is in a life-or-death situation!”","“It’s like this. One of the tokens Lord Temple Master refined was used as one of","our trump cards, but now Lord Temple Master has refined one for Heavenly","Sword Marquis?”","“Previously, he asked Heavenly Sword Marquis to cultivate by his side for 300","years, and then appointed him as an inspector. Now he has given him a","life-saving token. I’m afraid even Lord Temple Masters personal disciple won’t","be able to get this treatment.”","“Temple Master, aren’t you favoring Heavenly Sword Marquis too much?”","Many Principles Masters present thought that Temporal Temple Master was","favoring Jian Wushuang too much. That was great.","Indeed, Temporal Temple Master had been teaching Jian Wushuang since he","returned to the Divine Beginning Realm. Now that he was going to the universe","battlefield, he also left some trump cards for Jian Wushuang, just like","Temporal Temple Master’s return, it was purely for Jian Wushuang’s return.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, remember, the token I’m giving you now is","extremely difficult to refine. I can only give you this one token at most to save","your life. If you use it, there won’t be a second one. So, unless it’s a","life-or-death situation, don’t use this token easily,” Temporal Temple Master","specially warned.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded immediately.","“Oh, one more thing,” Temporal Temple Master said. He flipped his palm and a","purple-gold command flag, which was emitting dense space- time power,","appeared in his hand. “When I left the Saha Island, I brought this heavenly","golden flag back. It’s a top-tier treasure in space-time and has great power. I","used it many times when I was adventuring in the universe battlefield.","“However, I already have a golden sky-painting flag, so it’s useless now. Now,","I’ll give this golden sky-painting flag to you. I hope you can use its power as","soon as possible.”","With that, Temporal Temple Master waved his hand and threw the golden","sky-painting flag to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it, but his mind was in a daze.","He was surprised by Temporal Temple Masters arrangement today.","First, he appointed Jian Wushuang as an inspector, gave him a life-saving","command talisman, and now he gave him the golden banner that he had","gotten from green rock master on Saha Island. It was equivalent to completely","spoiling Jian Wushuang.","course, Jian Wushuang was flattered.","The surrounding Principles Masters looked at Jian Wushuang with completely","changed expressions.","Although they had seen Temporal Temple Masters preference for Jian","Wushuang they had only felt a little bit of emotion. Now that Temporal","Temple Master had given him the heavenly golden banner.?these Principles","Masters could no longer calm down. They were more or less envious, even","jealous.","Yes, when a person who was just a little kid in their eyes had suddenly become","their equal, or even higher than them, and had obtained all kinds of resources","and treasures that drove them crazy...of course, they would be jealous.","Jian Wushuang also saw all of this jealousy. He looked at the Temple Master","and saw the faint smile on his face.","Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","“The Temple Master has lived for so many years, and he has always been","watertight in dealing with things. He should have known that if he gave me the","life-saving talisman and the golden banner in front of so many people, it","would definitely attract the jealousy of others. It would bring me a lot of","trouble in my future position as an inspector, but the Temple Master still did","it...” Jian Wushuang understood.","In fact, Temporal Temple Master could have given him the life-saving","command talisman and the golden sky-painting flag. After all, he had been","cultivating by Temporal Temple Master’s side and had had opportunities, but","Temporal Temple Master did not give them to him back then, but now, he had","given them to him in front of so many people. Jian Wushuang could guess the","meaning behind it.","“Temple Master wants to train me. He doesn’t mind giving me more obstacles","in the Temporal Temple. If I can’t even pass this small obstacle, how can I","compete with the three Saint Realms in the future? Not to mention that I might","face a ruler-level expert from the outside world in the future,” Jian Wushuang","murmured, but at the same time, he had questions.","Because under normal circumstances, to make things difficult for the younger","generation, or even to deliberately arrange some obstacles to temper the other","party, this kind of behavior, usually only in the training of their own","successors, that’s why I did it.","Is the Temporal Master doing this...to train him to be the next Temporal","Master?","“Maybe it’s possible,” Jian Wushuang thought.","He knew that the Divine Beginning Realm was no longer attractive to the","Temporal Temple Master. The reason why the Temporal Temple Master came","back every once in a while was because he was worried about the Temporal","Temple. After all, the Temporal Temple had a deep foundation, however, there","were too few experts. Once they lacked a master-level battle strength like him,","it would be difficult to guarantee their safety.","Take the battle on Saha Island as an example. If Temporal Temple Master had","not arrived in time, the outcome of that battle would have been quite tragic.","Because of this, Temporal Temple Master had never ventured into the deepest","part of the universe battlefield. Actually, with his strength, he could have gone","to the central region of the universe. That place was the paradise for experts","like him.","Under this premise, if he could cultivate an heir with the strength of a ruler","who was qualified to intimidate hundreds of millions of experts in the Divine","Beginning Realm, he would not have any worries and could go to the depths of","the universe directly, he could even go for tens of millions of years without","coming back.","Because as long as there was a ruler, the Temporal Temple could ensure his","safety.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and felt bitter.","“Well, I’ve told you what I need to tell you. I’ll leave the Temporal Temple to","you. Haha!” The laughter of the Temporal Temple Master echoed in the temple,","he slowly disappeared from everyone’s sight and soon disappeared completely."]},{"number":3340,"title":"Chapter 3340 - Patrol Squad","paragraphs":["Transtator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Farewell Temple Master!","Many experts in the hall respectfully sent Temple Master off.","After Temple Master disappeared completely..","“Alright everyone, Temple Master has already left for the universe battlefield,","and our space-time shrine is still the same as before. Everyone, carry out your","duties and leave.” Palace Master Bai Xing waved his hand, then he said, “Ba","Cang, Heavenly Sword Marquis, you two stay here.”","The experts in the temple left one after another.","When they left, they glanced at Jian Wushuang a few more times, with strange","emotions in their eyes.","Soon, only Jian Wushuang, Temple Master Bai Xing, and Ba Cang were left in","the temple.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, Congratulations on becoming the sixth inspector of","our Temporal Temple. You also received the life-saving token and the golden","sky-painting flag from Temple Master.” Temple Master Bai Xing looked at Jian","Wushuang with a smile.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you are really lucky to be valued so much by the","Temple Master. He even gave you a life-saving token and a golden","sky-painting flag. To be honest, even I am envious of these two things.” Ba","Cang also smiled.","“You two, don’t you see that the Temple Master seems to have other","intentions? Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course.” Ba Cang nodded.","“It’s possible that the Temple Master wants to groom you as his successor. Of","course, he may have other motives. As for why..I can’t figure it out, Temple","Master Bai Xing said.","“Yes, the Temple Master has always been unpredictable. Now that he","deliberately gave you the life-saving command talisman and the heavenly","golden banner in front of so many people, he must have his own plans. But","these plans shouldn’t be bad for you,” Ba Cang added.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could only shrug his shoulders helplessly.","“Ba Cang, you are the supervisor of the Temporal Temple, and Heavenly Sword","Marquis is now your direct subordinate. Tell him something about the","supervisor first,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“Okay.” Ba Cang nodded slightly and looked at Jian Wushuang.","The inspector has a very high position in the Temporal Temple and is","responsible for external battles. Under normal circumstances, it should be an","expert of the void fourth realm, or at least the void third realm. However,","Heavenly Sword Marquis, although you are only an Immortal Saint, your","strength has long reached the void third realm. In addition, you have been","cultivating with the Temple Master for 300 years. Even the Temple Master","himself said that your strength is not a problem, so it’s definitely not a","problem.”","“In addition to the position of inspector, there is also a patrol team.”","“Patrol team” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","The patrol team is directly under the command of the inspector and fights","with him. After al, in the Divine Beginning Realm, although our Temporal","Temple is aloof from worldly affairs, we often fight with some big forces and","experts. Once a fight breaks out, the inspector alone will not be enough. We","need a large number of experts!”","“A patrol squad consists of 10 Principles Masters from the second to the first","realm of the Void Realm and 100 top-notch Immortal Saints,” Ba Cang said.","“10 Principles Masters and 100 top-notch Immortal Saints? Jian Wushuang","was intrigued.","This squad could be considered very powerful in the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, only first-rate forces could have such a squad","of experts. However, for the Temporal Temple, this squad.t was just one of","the patrol squads that were usually responsible for battles.","One person can lead ten Principles Masters and hundreds of Immortal Saints","to battle outside. It’s no wonder that the position of the patrol envoy is very","high and that he’s very powerful,” Jian Wushuang thought.","“Our Temporal Temple has only had five patrol envoys before, so naturally, we","only have five patrol squads. Now that you’ve become the sixth patrol envoy,","Our Temporal Temple naturally has to arrange a patrol squad for you. However,","this patrol squad needs a lot of experts. Even our Temporal Temple will need","some time to gather them for you,” Ba Cang said.","“There’s no hurry. Im just curious. are all the people in the patrol team","members of the Temporal Temple?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course not.” Ba Cang shook his head with a smile. “Heavenly Sword","Marquis, it’s not like you haven’t entered the Divine Hall of the Temporal","Temple before. The divine seats of the experts of the Temporal Temple are all","there. In total, there are only about 1,000 people. How can there be so many","experts in the patrol team?","“After all, a patrol team needs 100 Peak Saints, not to mention Principles","Masters. Six patrol teams make up 600 Peak Saints.","“Most of the experts in the patrol team are rule masters, but the Peak Saints","are experts recruited by the Temporal Temple in the Divine Beginning Realm.","We pay them and they fight for us.”","“Is that so? Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and asked, “Master Ba Cang,","how long will it take to gather the patrol team?","“Under normal circumstances, we can gather a complete patrol team within","100 years,” Ba Cang said.","“That’s good. I’ve been improving my understanding of the principles of time","and space with the Temple Master for 300 years, but I rarely have the","opportunity to go to the Temporal Temple. Now that the Temple Master has","left, I can go to the Temporal Temple to cultivate during the 100 years that the","patrol team has been established,” Jian Wushuang said.","“No problem. You can cultivate by yourself. When the patrol team is","established, I’l send a message to you. It doesn’t matter if you’re in the middle","of cultivation. Anyway, we don’t have many opportunities to use the patrol","team. You can ask them to wait for you as long as they don’t wait too long,” Ba","Cang said.","“I understand” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Soon, Jian Wushuang left the temple and went straight to the Principles","Temple.","In the Principles Temple, where the two principles of space-time and","reincarnation had fused, Jian Wushuang sat down alone in the center of the","temple. He took a deep breath, looked around, and sensed that...the two","principles of space-time and reincarnation had slowly fused together.","“The Principles ‘Temple..Ive been here a few times in the past 300 years, and","made a lot of progress. However, I’ve only stepped into the threshold of","fusing the principles of spacetime and reincarnation. I only know how to fuse","them, but I still need a lot of time to fully fuse them. In the Temporal Temple,","rl need a lot less time!”","“If I’m not mistaken, in about a hundred years, I should be able to perfectly","merge the space-time principles and the Samsara principles. Let’s begin!","Jian Wushuang immediately fell silent in the fusion of the two principles.."]},{"number":3341,"title":"Chapter 3341 - Principles Fusion","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: Endless Fantasy Translation","— –","Time flew by, and 128 years had passed.","In the Principles Temple, Jian Wushuang was still sitting cross-legged with his","eyes closed. On the surface of his divine body, the power of space-time and","Samsara slowly rose. Under Jian Wushuang’s guidance, the two powers of","principles began to merge, gradually, they began to merge.","originally, it was extremely difficult to merge the two different principles,","which contained different characteristics.","But now, with Jian Wushuang’s guidance, the two completely different powers","of rules gradually began to merge. From the beginning of the merging, the two","completely merged into a new whole, without any distinction between them!","“It’s done!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes, and his eyes were full of surprise and","joy.","From being inspired by the complete cycle of Heavenly Dao in the Blood Wave","Temple, he had stepped into the threshold of the integration of the two rules.","In the past 300 years, he had made continuous progress, and the integration of","the two principles was getting deeper and deeper, he had completely entered","the threshold. Now, after 128 years of cultivation in the Principles Temple, he","had finally perfectly integrated the space-time principles and the Samsara","principles!","Now that the two principles were perfectly fused, Jian Wushuang could use the","power of the two different principles at the same time. At the same time, he","immediately sensed that after the principles were fused, he had gained another","complete power of will! He had gained another complete power of will!","“Power of will..I. had already gained one when I mastered the space-time","principles. Now, because of the fusion of the two principles, I have gained","another power of will. Together with the life divine power, it is equivalent to","one power of will. This is equivalent to three powers of will. Moreover, when I","use the heaven-cleaving skill, it is enough to provide me with one power of","will. This is equivalent to four powers of will” Jian Wushuang clenched his","hands, he was extremely excited in his heart.","Grasping four portions of the power of will was something that only void","fourth level experts possessed.","Although he was only an Immortal Saint, when he went all out, he could","completely erupt with power that was not inferior to the power of the void","fourth level.","Moreover, this was only the basic power. An expert and a Principles Master did","not completely rely on the power of will to display his true battle strength. He","still had many other methods.","For example, the use of the power of principles, such as absolute arts,","treasures, secret skills, and so on!","Jian Wushuang was absolutely confident in these aspects.","“It’s a pity that although I’ve made great progress over the years, I sill haven’t","crossed the bottleneck in the reincarnation principles.” Jian Wushuang","frowned.","Previously, in the Blood Wave “Temple, through the complete Heavenly Dao","cycle, his comprehension of the reincanation principles had also greatly","improved. He had reached the limit of the Immortal Saint and was only one","step away from completely mastering the reincarmation principles.","However, after all these years, he had already fused the two principles of time","and space with the Samsara principles. However, he had encountered a","bottleneck in the Samsara principles and had not been able to take the last","step. Otherwise, he would have been able to obtain another portion of the","power of the will, naturally, his strength could also be stronger.","“Although I have not completely mastered the Samsara principles, there is no","need to be too anxious. If I am anxious, it will be harder to break through.","Everything will be natural. In addition, I previously obtained a samsara bead","from the light king. It is said that with this samsara bead, I can enter the","Samsara Heaven Realm to cultivate. I can also take a look at the Samsara","Heaven Realm when I have time.” Jian Wushuang stood up with a smile, he","walked out of the hall.","After walking out of the hall, Jian Wushuang took out a message token.","This message token belonged to Ba Cang.","Jian Wushuang was now the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple, under the","command of Ba Cang. Of course, he had a message token.","When he was still in the Principles Temple fusing the two rules, Ba Cang had","sent a message to him saying that the patrol team had been set up and was","waiting for him to go. However, he was at the critical stage of fusing the two","principles at that time, he just replied and did not pay attention to it.","It had been 30 years since Ba Cang had sent him a message","In other words, after the patrol guards had been set up, they had been waiting","for him to enter the ranks for 30 years. Now that he had fused the two rules, he","naturally could not delay any longer.","After receiving Jian Wushuang’s message, Ba Cang immediately found him.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you have stayed in the Principles Temple for 130","years. You have even delayed your appointment to the patrol unit. It seems that","you have made some progress, right?” Ba Cang looked at Jian Wushuang with","interest.","“Yes, I have made some progress,” Jian Wushuang did not deny it.","“Have you made any progress? Have you merged the two principles of","space-time and reincarnation?” Ba Cang asked curiously.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“Really?” Ba Cang was surprised.","Most of the experts in the patrol team were recruited from the Divine","Beginning Realm, so the patrol team was not stationed on the Saha Island, but","in a hidden place in the Divine Beginning Realm, it was covered by a","restriction.","After leaving the Saha Island, Ba Cang and Jian Wushuang teleported all the","way to the camp of the patrol team.","“Master Ba Cang” An old man with a child’s face and white hair stood","respectfully in front of Ba Cang and Jian Wushuang.","“Zhen Tong, this is the new inspector of the Temporal Temple, Heavenly Sword","Marquis,” Ba Cang introduced.","“Zhen Tong, greetings, Inspector. I’ve long heard of your name. Everyone in","the Divine Beginning Realm now regards you as the number one genius. In the","battle of the Heavenly Marquis, you single-handedly injured the Flame Sword","Master and the Sorcerer God. It’s truly shocking” Zhen Tong Master looked at","Jian Wushuang with a dazzling light in his eyes, he kept complimenting Jian","Wushuan","“You’re too kind, Zhen Tong Master,” Jian Wushuang greeted him with a smile.","“Zhen Tong Master is a member of the ‘Temporal Temple. He is responsible for","many of the recruitment of the patrolling guards. From now on, you can rest","assured that he will handle some simple matters in the patrolling guards,” Ba","Cang said.","“Okay:” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“Alright, Zhen Tong, I’ve brought your patrol envoy here. I’ll leave the rest to","you. I’ll take my leave first,” Ba Cang said.","“Yes, sir.” Zhen Tong was extremely respectful","“Thank you, Lord Ba Cang.” Jian Wushuang also expressed his gratitude.","Ba Cang immediately turned around and left.","Zhen Tong stood in front of Jian Wushuang and said, “Sir, our patrol team has","10 Principles Masters and 100 Peak Saints in the camp. Would you like to meet","them and greet them first?”","“Sure, you can gather them first,” Jian Wushuang instructed."]},{"number":3342,"title":"Chapter 3342 - Master True Eyes","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the huge camp, there were many towering palaces or lofts standing tall.","At this moment, in one of the lofts, three figures sat upright by the side of a","long table, casually eating and drinking.","The two of you, it has already been so long since our patrol unit was","established. Why hasn’t that patrol inspector shown up yet?” One of them","asked.","“Who knows? The other middle-aged man curled his lips. “I heard that this","patrol envoy is the Heavenly Sword Marquis who started that shocking battle","over 400 years ago. In that great battle over 400 years ago, although this","Heavenly Sword Marquis is only an Immortal Saint, his strength is no less than","that of the three void realms. Moreover, his methods are endless and","extraordinary. In the end, he even fought a Saint Realm Master head-on and","even heavily injured a Saint Realm Master. It’s simply inconceivable!”","“Seriously injuring a Saint Realm Master? You believe that? The old man","whose eyes were slightly glowing with white light sneered, “This Heavenly","Sword Marquis is nothing more than a little fellow who got lucky. He’s young","and full of vigor. Although he has some talent, if one were to say that his","strength is really that amazing, I wouldn’t believe it even if you beat him to","death”","“Pure eye master, that Heavenly Sword Marquis’ combat strength was also the","one who heavily injured the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God. Many","people saw it with their own eyes, which is why it caused such a commotion.","Since so many people have verified it, there’s definitely nothing wrong with it,”","the middle-aged man said.","Even if that Heavenly Sword Marquis really heavily injured the Flame Saint","Master and the Sorcerer God in that battle, he must have used some special","trump cards and methods. This can only mean that he had a fortuitous","encounter. However, I don’t believe that he can use such a trump card a second","time.” Master True Eyes, whose eyes were glowing with white light, did not","think much of it.","That’s true.” The middle-aged man smiled. “However, ever since that battle,","Heavenly Sword Marquis has made a name for himself. His current position in","the Temporal Temple is extraordinary. I’ve even heard that even the Temple","Master holds him in high regard and even favors him. The position of inspector","was appointed by the Temple Master himself. No one can say for sure what","such a person will achieve in the future. We’d better behave ourselves under","him and not offend him.”","“What’s there to be afraid of? No matter what, he’s just an Immortal Saint. Do","you really take him seriously?” Master True Eyes was still disdainful.","Hearing this, the middle-aged man and the other Principles Master looked at","cach other. “The two could only smile helplessly.","At this moment..a Peak Saint walked in and walked in front of the Master True","Eyes and the other two, he said respectfully, “My Lords, Lord True Eyes has","ordered me to inform the three of you that the patrol envoy has arrived at the","camp. He wants you to meet him immediately”","“OhP The three Principles Masters beside the table were moved.","“We were just talking about him. Who would have thought that he would arrive","in the blink of an eye?” The middle-aged man said as he stood up.","“Since the patrol envoy has arrived, the three of us should go and see him first.”","The other Principles Master also stood up.","However, Master True Eyes did not make any movements.","“Master True Eyes, what are you. The middle-aged man looked over in","puzzlement.","“Humph, this Heavenly Sword Marquis made us wait for him for such a long","time. Now that he has arrived, we have to go and see him with just a casual","sentence? Who does he think he is?” Master True Eyes snorted coldly.","“Master True Eyes, it doesn’t matter whether you think highly of Heavenly","Sword Marquis or not, he is still an inspector and our superior. If he wants to","see us now, if we don’t go...we will be disobeying orders. Although we are not at","the stage of a great war, it is not a small crime to openly disobey orders in the","camp.” The middle-aged man said with a frown.","That’s right, Master True Eyes. No matter what, Let’s go and see him first.”","The other Principles Master added.","“If you want to go, go ahead. I don’t intend to go anyway. If he asks, just say","that I’m drunk. Let’s see what he can do to me,” Master True Eyes said coldly.","The middle-aged man and the other Principles Master looked at each other","helplessly.","They also knew that Master ‘True Eyes was a proud man because he was","extremely talented and had grown up to be a Principles Master of the three","void realms, moreover, he was very strong among the three void realms!","He only believed in strength and what he saw. In his eyes, Jian Wushuang was","just a little guy, and he was just an Immortal Saint, as a Principles Master of","the three void realms, he could not kowtow to an Immortal Saint.","Therefore, when he first learned that jian Wushuang was the patrol inspector,","he felt extremely uncomfortable, not to mention that Jian Wushuang had kept","them waiting. Now, he was even more dissatisfied with Jian Wushuang.","“In that case, the two of us will leave first.”","The middle-aged man and the other Principles Master stopped persuading him","and immediately went to see Jian Wushuang.","In the open space in the center of the camp, the experts of the patrol team had","already lined up in an orderly manner.","There were 100 Peak Saints in a row of 20, forming a total of five rows. The","Principles Masters were standing at the front.","At this moment, both the Immortal Saints and the Principles Masters were","staring at Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the front, with different gazes.","At the same time, many Peak Saints were secretly discussing among","themselves.","“He is Heavenly Sword Marquis?","“Yes, that’s him. He is the undisputed number one expert on the True Saint List","and the strongest Immortal Saint in the history of the Divine Beginning","Realm. It is said that in the battle more than 400 years ago, he fought head-on","with many Principles Masters in the Saint Realm without being at a","disadvantage. In the end, he even fought with the masters of the Saint Realm.","So many top experts of the three Saint Realms couldn’t do anything to him!","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, he’s my idol. I wish I could be half as powerful as","him.”","“Half? I’ll be satisfied as long as I have one-tenth of his strength.”","The Immortal Saints chatted and did not conceal their admiration for Jian","Wushuang at all.","Indeed, the Principles Masters might feel a little uncomfortable after hearing","about Jian Wushuang’s battle record, because the Principles Masters had","always been far above the Immortal Saints since ancient times, however, Jian","Wushuang, the Immortal Saint, was an exception. Not only could he stand on","equal footing with them, but he was even stronger than many Principles","Masters.","However, the Immortal Saints in the Divine Beginning Realm were not","dissatisfied with Jian Wushuang at all. They even worshipped him more and","more, feeling that Jian Wushuang had helped them, the Immortal Saint, this","made the Principles Masters not dare to look down on them in the future."]},{"number":3343,"title":"Chapter 3343 - Suppression","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang crossed his hands behind his back and looked indifferently at the experts in front of him. Suddenly, his expression changed, he asked, “Master True Eyes, shouldn’t the patrol team be composed of ten Principles Masters and 100 Peak Saints?","“Lhave seen the 100 Peak Saints, but why do I only see nine Principles Masters and one more random guy?”","“Well...” Master True Eyes looked at the Principles Masters around him and frowned. “Inspector, I’ve asked my men to inform them. Everyone should have arrived by now, but I don’t know why he didn’t come. I’ll send a message to him now.”","Master True Eyes was about to send a message.","‘The middle-aged man who had been drinking with Master True Eyes stood up and said, “Inspector, Master True Eyes is...drunk!”","“Oh, drunk?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and found it funny.","Although good wine could make people drunk, in the Divine Beginning Realm, any cultivator who was slightly stronger could freely control their drunkenness, especially when they had reached the level of Principles Master. With a thought, they could make their drunkenness disappear completely.","‘The bottle of wine was enough to make a Principles Master lose consciousness completely. He did not even know if there was such wine in the Divine Beginning Realm, so how could Master True Eyes be drunk? Even if he was really drunk, it was probably on purpose.","“Inspector, this Master True Eyes is too presumptuous. I’ll bring him here now,” said Master True Eyes.","“No need.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “Since this Master True Eyes is unwilling to come to see me, I’ll go and see him.”","“You’re willing to see him, sir?” Master True Eyes was stunned.","“Lead the way,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Master True Eyes said nothing more and led Jian Wushuang to the attic where Master True Eyes was.","As for the Principles Masters of the patrol team, they looked at each other and immediately followed.","“Let’s go and take a look.”","“The Master True Eyes doesn’t listen to the order of the patrol master. This is going to be a good show.”","“If [were the patrol master, I would definitely teach him a good lesson.”","While discussing among themselves, the Peak Saints also followed suit.","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived in front of the attic.","“Patrol master, this is the residence of the clear-eyed master. He should be in the attic now,” Master True Eyes said.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the attic and sensed the aura of Master True Eyes. He immediately said coldly, “Master True Eyes, come out. Do you want me to invite you in personally?”","“Who is it?”","A dissatisfied voice sounded, and then Master True Eyes walked out of the attic with a red face and a smell of alcohol.","But on the surface, it seemed that Master True Eyes was really drunk.","“True Eyes, how dare you ignore the order of the inspector?” He stared at Master True Eyes coldly and shouted.","“Inspector? Who? Him?” Master True Eyes looked like a drunkard, he glanced at Jian Wushuang from the corner of his eyes and then burst into laughter. “Are you kidding me? Isn’t he just a young boy at the Saint Realm? How dare you call him an inspector? I don’t think I’m drunk. You’re drunk!”","“How dare you! How dare you disrespect an Inspector?” Master True Eyes could not help but shout angrily.","In front of everyone in the patrol team, he directly told them that Jian Wushuang was merely an Immortal Saint. Anyone with a discerning eye could tell that this Master True Eyes was deliberately pretending to be crazy, but in fact, he was trying to embarrass Jian Wushuang.","“Master True Eyes, right?” Jian Wushuang looked at the Master True Eyes with his hands behind his back.","“It’s me,” Master True Eyes replied with a hint of mockery in his eyes.","“Do you know your identity?” Jian Wushuang asked indifferently.","“Of course I do. I’m the captain of the sixth patrol team of the Temporal Temple,” Master True Eyes said.","“Then do you know who I am?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“You? Didn’t I tell you that you’re just a young boy at the Saint Realm? Yes, you’re just an Immortal Saint. How dare you talk to me? Get out of my way,” Master True Eyes scolded.","“Good, you’re really brave. Now that you know your identity, it’s easy to deal with you. Now, as the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple, I order you, Master True Eyes, to disobey my orders. Everyone in the camp is publicly disobeying my orders. Immediately suppress and send you to the eighth level of","the boundless prison. You’ll never be able to get out!” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang’s words shocked everyone around him.","The boundless prison was a place used by the Temporal Temple to lock up experts. It was also very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm.","There were nine levels in the boundless prison. Each level had some unbearable torture that could even make people break down. It was extremely terrifying. The eighth level of the boundless prison was only inferior to the ninth level, this was definitely a place that made many people tremble in fear.","Now, Jian Wushuang had given the order to lock the Master True Eyes directly into the eighth level of the boundless prison. However, Jian Wushuang was now an inspector, and the Master True Eyes was his subordinate, Jian Wushuang indeed had the right to do so, and he had a reason for it.","‘The Master True Eyes openly disobeyed orders. Just this alone, even if Jian Wushuang wanted to kill him, it was reasonable. Although the Master True Eyes only wanted to show off to Jian Wushuang, he did not really want to disobey orders, however, he did do so.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what did you just say? You want to suppress me and put me in the boundless prison?” The Master True Eyes was instantly enraged, his eyes were filled with raging anger. As for his drunkenness, it had all dissipated.","“What? Are you clear-headed now?” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. “Does no one understand what I said? take him down!”","“Thi:",".” The surrounding Principles Masters were at a loss. Even Master True Eyes was stunned, but he did not come forward immediately.","“Let’s see who dares!” Master True Eyes looked around, his aura of the three void realms swept across the area. In the end, he looked at Jian Wushuang again. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, aren’t you lucky enough to be favored by the Temple Master? Now that the Temple Master has gone to the universe","battlefield, how dare you be so arrogant? And you want to suppress me in the boundless prison? Haha, what a joke!”","“I, pure eye, have been in the Temporal Temple for so many years and have made great contributions. Even Temple Master Bai Xing and Lord Ba Cang have to think twice before suppressing me. Who do you think you are?”","The voice of Master True Eyes shook the sky, showing no respect for Jian Wushuang.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled."]},{"number":3344,"title":"Chapter 3344 - Gives You a Chance","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor:","EndlessFantasy Translation","“Master True Eyes, you think too highly of yourself.” Jian Wushuang sneered at pure eye master.","“It’s true that you’ve made great contributions to the Temporal Temple, but that doesn’t mean that you can act recklessly. I’m the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple, and you’re my subordinate. I’m going to send you to the boundless prison. Even Temple Master Bai Xing and Lord Ba Cang won’t say a","word. If you don’t believe me, you can send a message to them right now. See if they’ll respond to you.”","“Impossible!” Master True Eyes was still confident. However, when he sent a message to Temple Master Bai Xing and Ba Cang, but they did not reply to him, Master True Eyes panicked.","He finally realized that he was wrong.","He had thought that his position in the Temporal Temple would not be lower than Jian Wushuang, the Immortal Saint.","However, the truth was that Jian Wushuang’s status in the Temporal Temple was extraordinary. Even the Temporal Temple Master valued and favored him, and many people could already see that the Temporal Temple Master wanted to groom Jian Wushuang as his successor.","Moreover, with Jian Wushuang’’s talent, it would not take long for him to become the top expert in the Divine Beginning Realm. It was uncertain whether he could become a ruler, but it was definitely not difficult for him to reach the level of the six void realms.","Such a figure was not someone that he could compare with.","Now, he had already sent a message to Temple Master Bai Xing and Ba Cang, but they had ignored him.","Obviously, Temple Master Bai Xing and Ba Cang were on Jian Wushuang’s side and had acquiesced in Jian Wushuang’s punishment of suppressing him in the boundless prison.","“Master True Eyes, I know you are not convinced by your strength, so I can give you a fair chance to avoid being accused of using my power to suppress others,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","“What chance?” Master True Eyes immediately looked at him.","“In the Divine Beginning Realm, strength is always respected. The reason why you are not convinced by me is because I am only an Immortal Saint. Therefore, I am giving you a chance to fight me one-on-one, and I am standing here. If you can make me take a step back, I will lose!”","“If I lose, not only will I not send you to the boundless prison, but I will also never order you to do anything in the patrol team in the future. In other words, you can do whatever you want in the future,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Really?” Master True Eyes stared at Jian Wushuang with a bright light in his eyes.","The others looked at each other with rich expressions.","“Of course I meant what I said. But if you lose, you’ll have to accept my punishment,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Sure. If you win, I won’t hesitate to kill me, not to mention locking me in the boundless prison.” Master True Eyes clenched his hands with excitement.","He did not think that he would lose.","After all, he was a genuine expert of the third realm of the void. He was also an extremely powerful existence among the three realms of the void. Even if he fought against the four realms of the void, he could barely hold them off. As for Jian Wushuang...","Although his battle record from the battle 400 years ago was shocking, everyone knew that there were some special factors behind Jian Wushuang’s achievements. As for Jian Wushuang’s own battle strength...at most, he was only at the threshold of the three realms of void.","Even if Jian Wushuang’s strength had improved over the past 400 years, as long as he did not break through to become an Immortal Saint, he should not be that strong.","‘The Master True Eyes estimated that Jian Wushuang’s current strength was at the peak of the three realms of void, and his strength was about the same as his. However, what Jian Wushuang said just now was that as long as Jian Wushuang was pushed back even one step, he would win.","He was not confident that he could defeat Jian Wushuang in a head-on fight, but he was very confident that he could push Jian Wushuang back only one step.","After Jian Wushuang and Master True Eyes confirmed that they were going to fight, the experts of the patrol team retreated to the surrounding area to make room for Jian Wushuang and Master True Eyes, at the same time, the people of the patrol team began to discuss among themselves.","“Who do you think will win?”","“Tm not sure. Over 400 years ago, the patrol master’s battle strength was already very strong. With his talent, it’s impossible that he hasn’t made any progress over the years. In terms of strength, the patrol master is probably stronger. However, the patrol master said that as long as the clear-eyed master","can force him back a step, he will lose. It’s hard to say.”","“Yes, in terms of overall strength, the inspector is definitely stronger. After all, it is said that the inspector of the Temporal Temple is in the fourth realm of the void. Since he is able to become an inspector, even if he does not have the combat strength of the fourth realm of the void, he should be about the","same. However, the Master True Eyes does not want to defeat the inspector head-on. He just needs to think of a way to force the inspector to take a step back.”","“I’s hard to say who will win this battle. However, it was proposed by the inspector, so he should be confident.”","The crowd discussed among themselves. Most of the Immortal Saints thought that Jian Wushuang would win.","After all, these Immortal Saints had almost blindly worshipped Jian Wushuang, Not to mention that Jian Wushuang was only facing the Master True Eyes of the third void realm, even if Jian Wushuang was facing a master in the fourth or even the fifth realm of the void, they still felt that Jian Wushuang","could win.","As for the Principles Masters, they also thought that Jian Wushuang might be stronger, but the result of this battle was still hard to say.","In the center of the camp, there was already a huge battlefield. On both sides of the battlefield, Jian Wushuang and the Master True Eyes were facing each other from a distance.","“Clear-eye master, you go first.” Jian Wushuang looked at Master True Eyes indifferently without any pressure.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you asked for it.” Master True Eyes smiled coldly. His eyes tured cold, and a strong aura swept out from his body.","This aura stirred the world, and in an instant, it formed a huge storm.","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis, to be able to produce such a battle record over 400 years ago, he definitely has some strength. Unfortunately, he is too arrogant!” Master True Eyes muttered, “I won’t tangle with him any longer. I’ll directly use my strongest attack. As long as I can force him to retreat, this","battle will be my victory!”","Master True Eyes made up his mind. In an instant, endless divine power surged up and began to gather at an astonishing speed.","At the same time, a pair of pitch-black gloves appeared on Master True Eyes’ hands. Large amounts of space-time principle energy gathered on the gloves."]},{"number":3345,"title":"Chapter 3345 - Power Suppression","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor:","EndlessFantasy Translation","“There’s another principle of space-time...it should be the principles of gold.”","Jian Wushuang stood where he was and looked at Master True Eyes calmly. He could feel that besides the power of the principles of space-time, there were also the principles of gold in Master True Eyes hand.","Gold was extremely strong and invincible. Under normal circumstances, experts who comprehended the principles of gold were very good at attacking power.","And this Master True Eyes had already completely grasped the principles of gold. Although these two principles had yet to completely fuse together, gold and space-time could still achieve the basic superposition of power.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, today I’ll let you see the strongest move I’ve created with a million years of effort, the gold splitting palm!”","Boom!","The world suddenly shook.","‘The power of gold and space-time gathered in Master True Eyes’ palm instantly exploded out, carrying a total of three portions of his will power. A suffocating power suddenly appeared in the world.","It was a huge golden handprint.","This golden handprint contained both the power of gold and the power of space-time. The power of gold and the power of space-time complemented each other. Not only was the power of the attack extremely powerful, but its speed was also astonishing.","‘The huge golden handprint pressed down on Jian Wushuang in all directions.","Although he had not come close, Jian Wushuang had already felt an extraordinary pressure.","‘The surrounding spectators were all shocked when they saw the golden handprint.","In their opinion, the Master True Eyes’ move could probably be compared to some experts of the void fourth realm in terms of power alone.","“The inspector is overconfident this time!”","“Tm afraid only experts of the void fourth realm can withstand such a powerful move head-on and not take a step back.”","“This Master True Eyes is really powerful!”","Many people were secretly amazed.","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change at all when he saw the golden handprint attacking him.","When the golden handprint appeared in front of Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang slowly reached out and grabbed the hilt of the Blood Mountain Sword. In his body, the life divine power was activated instantly, and the two parts of the will power that Jian Wushuang had grasped...suddenly erupted at this","moment.","“Wushuang Sword manual, Xi Xiang!”","Whoosh!","The Blood Mountain Sword suddenly unsheathed, and a scarlet sword light flashed in the void like blood-red lightning and directly struck the golden handprint.","A terrifying power burst out from the scarlet sword light, almost instantly splitting the golden handprint into two halves. Then the sword light crazily swept in all directions, crushing the golden handprint into pieces, it turned into a vast amount of divine power and disappeared from the world.","After the power subsided, Jian Wushuang still stood there and did not take a step back. As for Master True Eyes, he staggered backward.","After a long while, Master True Eyes regained his balance.","“How is this possible?” Master True Eyes looked up at Jian Wushuang again, his face full of shock and disbelief.","He had never expected that his strongest attack could not force Jian Wushuang to take a step back!","After all, he had comprehended the principles of gold, which was very good at attacking.","“His sword attack just now...” Master True Eyes recalled the sword attack that Jian Wushuang had just performed. In that sword attack, he clearly felt two completely different powers of principles, however, these two powers of principles were perfectly fused together, and they were completely","indistinguishable from each other.","“The fusion of principles? Heavenly Sword Marquis has already fused two principles?","“Moreover, he has clearly mastered three portions of the power of his will. In terms of basic divine power, he, an Immortal Saint, is actually stronger than me?” The Master True Eyes’ eyes widened, his heart was filled with shock.","He did not know that although Jian Wushuang was only an Immortal Saint, his basic divine power was stronger than that of an ordinary Principles Master because of his perfect life level, in addition, the secret skills he had cultivated had greatly increased his power. Since both sides had mastered three","parts of the power of will, his basic power naturally had a great advantage.","In terms of ultimate moves, although the move pure eye master used was the strongest move he had created, Jian Wushuang’s first move of Xi Xiang was also the strongest move in the Peerless Sword Manual. Moreover, he had cultivated with Temporal Temple Master for 300 years, his swordsmanship","has already stepped into the third level of derivation of all things. In swordsmanship, the seven sword styles of the peerless swordsmanship have all been elevated to the level of Principles Master.","In other words, in terms of the power of the absolute art, Jian Wushuang’s Xi Xiang move was not much different from the giant golden handprint of the Master True Eyes. However, what really determined the huge gap between the two sides, or is it the fusion of the two principles in Jian Wushuang’s","swordsmanship.","After the two principles were combined, not only would there be an additional power of will, but the power of the fusion of the two different principles would also be much stronger than just superimposing the two principles.","For example, in the Blood Wave Realm, when Light King fought with Di Hao, Di Hao barely superimposed the two principles, while Light King perfectly combined the two principles. As a result, the two sides were on completely different levels.","Now that Jian Wushuang had used the power of the fusion of the two principles, of course, he was much stronger than Master True Eyes, who had only superimposed the space-time principles and the gold principles.","Therefore, in this collision, Master True Eyes was completely defeated. Because of the huge difference in power between them, Jian Wushuang did not suffer much impact, so he did not take a step back.","“Master True Eyes, as a Principles Master in the three realms of the void, you can’t only have this much strength, right? Show me all your other skills.” Jian Wushuang looked at Master True Eyes indifferently.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, don’t be happy too early.” Master True Eyes gritted his teeth, but his mind was racing. “Heavenly Sword Marquis has also mastered three parts of the power of will, and his basic strength is stronger than mine. The key is that he has fused two principles. I will definitely be","crushed by him in a head-on collision. Therefore, I can only rely on speed and movement skills to catch him off guard and force him to retreat!","At the thought of this, Master True Eyes’ figure instantly flickered, and dense golden and space-time principles burst out at the same time.","‘Weng weng a layer of dazzling golden light suddenly appeared in the world. This golden light was incomparably dazzling, and for a time, it completely blocked the line of sight of the many experts present. After the golden light dissipated, everyone looked again and discovered that in the center of the","battleficld...a total of eight figures had appeared out of nowhere.","These eight figures were none other than the eight Master True Eyes’ whose bodies were covered in a layer of golden light. In addition to the original pure eye master, a total of nine ‘Master True Eyes’ had appeared in front of everyone.","These nine Master True Eyes’, regardless of whether they were seen with the naked eye or sensed with their soul energy, were all exactly the same. There was no difference at all."]},{"number":3346,"title":"Chapter 3346 - Defeated","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Nine Master True Eyes?”","“Why do they look exactly the same!”","“Is this a spacetime illusion body or a clone secret technique?”","‘The many experts watching the battle looked at the nine Master True Eyes who had appeared in the middle of the battlefield in astonishment.","The nine Principles Masters on the battlefield immediately saw through it.","“This should be a time-space conversion, transforming one area of time-space into nine areas of time-space at the same time,” Master True Eyes said solemnly.","In the center of the battlefield, the nine ‘Master True Eyes’ maintained the same expression as they stared at Jian Wushuang with cold eyes.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is indeed powerful, but he hasn’t cultivated for long and hasn’t mastered the space-time principles for a long time. His application of the space-time principles must be very crude. Now, I’ve created eight phantoms with the space-time conversion and my original body. He won’t","be able to distinguish the nine phantoms at the same time. As long as he can’t distinguish them, he won’t be able to resist them,” Master True Eyes sneered, the next moment, the nine Master True Eyes’ attacked at the same time.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The nine Master True Eyes’ were incredibly fast. They attacked Jian Wushuang from all directions at the same time. Their expressions and actions were exactly the same, even the power of the gold and space-time principles in their hands were exactly the same.","The nine Master True Eyes’ reached out their hands at the same time. The gold and space-time principles in their hands overlapped each other. In an instant, a golden light flashed and rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a golden sun. The key was that the nine Master True Eyes’ attacked at the same time,","it was nine giant golden suns.","“His aura and attack power are exactly the same. He definitely can’t block this attack.” The Master True Eyes’ was very confident.","However...Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at the original body of Master True Eyes’ with a mocking look.","“What?” Master True Eyes’ was shocked.","Jian Wushuang had already struck.","Whoosh!","The swift and fierce strike, which also contained the power of the two principles of space-time and reincarnation, instantly struck Master True Eyes’ golden palm.","In an instant, the golden light dimmed, and Master True Eyes’ entire palm was cut off. A majestic power hit Master True Eyes’ body, causing him to tremble violently and retreat in a sorry state.","“Impossible!”","“This is impossible!”","After Master True Eyes’ steadied himself, he let out a few roars. His eyes were wide open as he looked at Jian Wushuang. “How can you see through my illusionary body formed by space-time transformation? Unless...unless your application of space-time principles is better than mine. But how is this","possible?”","Master True Eyes did not believe it. He had cultivated for millions of years and had long mastered the space-time principles. He had always been quite skilled in the application of space-time principles, although he was still at the level of space-time transformation, however, he had already mastered the","use of space-time conversion very well. How long had Jian Wushuang mastered the space-time principles?","It had only been a few hundred years. In a few hundred years, Jian Wushuang’s use of the space-time principles had already surpassed his?","Of course, he could not believe it.","“Master True Eyes, I’ve said that you think too highly of yourself. Similarly, you underestimate me too much. You think that everyone has mastered the space-time principles for hundreds of thousands of years like you, but in the end, your use of the space-time principles is still at this level?” Jian","‘Wushuang sneered, then his figure suddenly froze.","Buzz, buzz, the same scene appeared.","One after another, illusions formed by space-time conversion appeared on the battlefield. At a glance, there were a total of nine figures.","“Master True Eyes, you just used space-time conversion. Now, come and see my space-time conversion. I wonder if you can find my original body from these illusions.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then the nine figures moved directly.","The nine Jian Wushuang flew rapidly in the battlefield, but they did not intend to attack at once.","Master True Eyes stared at the nine figures around him. He tried his best to find Jian Wushuang’s original body, but he soon found that he could not find any flaws. The nine Jian Wushuang were in his perception! They were exactly the same!","“Is his use of the space-time principles better than mine?” Master True Eyes’ could not help thinking.","But suddenly...a chill appeared behind him without any warning.","“Oh no!” Master True Eyes’ expression changed drastically, but by the time he reacted, it was already too late.","Buzz!","The cold sword tip carried a shocking power and easily pierced through the surface of Master True Eyes’ body. However, just as the sword tip was about to enter the divine body of Master True Eyes, it suddenly stopped.","Jian Wushuang had appeared behind the Master True Eyes at some point. He held the sword in one hand and said coldly, “Master True Eyes, you’ve lost!”","“Lost, lost?” Master True Eyes’ eyes widened in disbelief. However, he quickly calmed down. He turned around and stared at Jian Wushuang. “Shadowless escape art, it’s Shadowless Escape Art!”","“Yes, Shadowless escape art.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The Shadowless escape art of the Blood Blade Master was one of Jian Wushuang’s trump cards. More than 400 years ago, his mastery of the Shadowless escape art was still in the initial stage, and he could not hide it from the soul perception of the Principles Master, however, after years of dedicated","cultivation, Jian Wushuang’s strength had soared, especially his use of the space-time principles. Naturally, his mastery of the Shadowless escape art had also improved.","Now, his mastery of Shadowless escape art had reached the profound realm. Although he was far from the exceptional realm, which was the peak of the Blood Blade Master, he was still very terrifying. At the very least, he was an ordinary Principles Master, he could not sense his existence at all. Even an","expert of the three realms of the void like Master True Eyes could not detect him.","“Tunderstand now. Your use of the principles of space-time is not much better than mine. At most, you are just as good as me. At most, you are slightly better than me. That’s why you can see through my illusory body formed by space-time conversion. The reason why I can’t see through your illusory","body formed by space-time conversion is that the nine figures are all illusory bodies, and your original body has already used the shadowless escape art to hide in the surroundings. Of course, I can’t see through it!” Master True Eyes said.","“You’re right. Unfortunately, it’s too late,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","Master True Eyes was right. Although his use of the space-time principles had improved tremendously over the past 400 years, it was not so far beyond Master True Eyes’, the reason why Master True Eyes could not see his original body was because he had already used the Shadowless escape art."]},{"number":3347,"title":"Chapter 3347 - Faith","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Thave lost this battle. I accept my defeat wholeheartedly. Lord Inspector, no matter what you do to me, I will accept it.” Although Master True Eyes was still holding his hands tightly, his body was still trembling, but there was no anger in his heart.","He had indeed lost this battle.","He had lost too miserably because he could not force Jian Wushuang to take half a step back.","He had used all his skills, whether it was the direct power or the use of the space-time principles, but he had been crushed by Jian Wushuang.","Especially the last nine illusions. He felt that he had been completely fooled by Jian Wushuang.","There was nothing to say. Jian Wushuang had completely defeated him with his strength.","Master True Eyes had lost his temper. He stood there dispiritedly, waiting for Jian Wushuang to punish him.","But at this time, the others came up to plead for Master True Eyes.","“Inspector, although Master True Eyes offended you, it was only a spur of the moment. Moreover, Master True Eyes has contributed a lot to our Temporal Temple, so I hope you can be lenient with him,” Master True Eyes said first.","“Yes, although the Master True Eyes has done it before, he didn’t deliberately disobey orders. I hope you can show mercy,” the middle-aged man who had been drinking with the Master True Eyes said.","“Inspector...”","The other Principles Masters also pleaded for mercy.","It was obvious that although the Master True Eyes was a little arrogant, he had a good reputation and good relationships with other experts of the same level.","The reason why he offended Jian Wushuang this time was mainly because he was not convinced that Jian Wushuang was only a Saint Realm expert. In his heart, he had no intention of disobeying orders.","Looking at the Principles Masters who were pleading with him, Jian Wushuang looked indifferent, but he smiled in his heart.","He knew what Master True Eyes was thinking. The reason why he fought with Master True Eyes and even said that he would win as long as Master True Eyes could force him to retreat was to intimidate the experts present.","He knew very well that he was only an Immortal Saint. Although he had an amazing battle record from more than 400 years ago, there were many reasons for that. It did not prove his true strength, so it was difficult to convince the public.","Jian Wushuang was well aware of this. He had long guessed that he would encounter some trouble if he took the position of inspector and successfully led the patrol team. Therefore, he was mentally prepared, the appearance of the Master True Eyes was within his expectations.","As for the Master True Eyes himself, Jian Wushuang was not too angry. On the contrary, he used the Master True Eyes to intimidate everyone in the patrol team.","He believed that after today’s battle, no one in the patrol team would dare to disobey his orders. After all, strength was the most important thing in this world, and he had proved it to everyone with his strength, he was qualified to be an inspector.","As for the final punishment of Master True Eyes...Jian Wushuang had already made a decision in his heart.","“Master True Eyes, because it’s my first time in the camp and I haven’t really taken up the position of an inspector, your disobedience is not considered as much. However, there is no doubt that you have offended me. I originally planned to send you to the eighth level of the boundless prison for hundreds","of thousands of years to appease my hatred. However, since Zhen Tong and the others have pleaded on your behalf, I can spare your life.”","“Men, send Master True Eyes to the fifth level of the boundless prison and imprison him for a hundred years!” Jian Wushuang ordered.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s punishment, the surrounding Principles Masters heaved a sigh of relief and smiled.","Although Jian Wushuang still punished Master True Eyes in the end, the punishment was obviously much lighter than what he had previously said.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had planned to lock Master True Eyes up in the eighth level of the boundless prison. The eighth level was a place that made many Principles Masters tremble in fear, and it had been more than 100,000 years.","But now, it was only the fifth level of the boundless prison...the torture of the fifth level was already tolerable for ordinary Principles Masters, not to mention that only 100 years had passed in the blink of an eye for Master True Eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s punishment was only one or two punishments for Master True Eyes, which was already very generous.","“True Eyes, why don’t you hurry up and thank the patrol master for his mercy?” Zhen Tong said.","Master True Eyes also reacted. He looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression and then bowed respectfully. “Clear-eye, thank you, inspector!”","“Get up, Master True Eyes. I hope you can reflect on yourself in the boundless prison. Think carefully and come back to me in 100 years,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Master True Eyes was no longer arrogant. He was only respectful.","Soon, Master True Eyes left.","Jian Wushuang had met with many experts of the patrol team. The key was that he had shocked everyone with his absolute strength. Jian Wushuang was very satisfied with the result.","‘Then, Jian Wushuang ordered everyone to leave. The Immortal Saints of the patrol team were still talking about the battle when they left.","“Our inspector is too strong!”","“Yes, I heard that the Master True Eyes is a very strong Principles Master. But in front of the inspector, he can’t fight back at all. The gap is too big. Don’t forget that the inspector is just an Immortal Saint, who is at the same Realm as us.”","“Tut-tut, the Immortal Saint is so powerful. It’s incredible.”","Everyone was amazed.","After this meeting, the experts of the patrol team, from the Principles Masters to the Immortal Saints, were completely convinced by Jian Wushuang, in the future, Jian Wushuang would not be hindered in leading this patrol team.","In the center of the camp, there was a towering palace, which was where Jian Wushuang lived.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was sitting in front of a table, holding a token in his hand. He was communicating with Ba Cang.","“Lord Ba Cang, don’t worry. I only imprisoned the Master True Eyes in the fifth level of the boundless prison for a hundred years,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Well, I knew you could handle it properly. I didn’t pay attention to him when he sent me a message,” Ba Cang said with a smile, “By the way, since True Eyes has been sent to the boundless prison, your patrol team will lose a Principles Master. I’ll get someone to replace him immediately.”"]},{"number":3348,"title":"Chapter 3348 - Mission","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Immediately?” Jian Wushuang frowned. “Lord Ba Cang, the Master True Eyes will only be imprisoned in the boundless prison for 100 years. There’s no need for another Principles Master to come, right?”","“If your patrol team is fine, there’s no need to be anxious. But now...Heavenly Sword Marquis, your patrol team will have a mission soon. Since there’s a mission, it’s natural to ensure the integrity of the patrol team,” Ba Cang said.","“There is a mission so soon?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","As far as he knew, the patrol team was responsible for fighting for the Temporal Temple. However, because the Temporal Temple was one of the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm, it was an absolute overlord, and few people dared to provoke it, naturally, there was less competition.","Usually, the patrol team did not have too many things to do, and they would only go on missions occasionally.","Now that he had just taken over as the patrol inspector, he immediately had a mission. It could only be said that he was very lucky.","“Yes, there is a mission. Moreover, this mission is probably not easy, so I have asked the Sword Dragon Master to rush over as quickly as possible. He should be able to reach you in less than half a day. You can gather the patrol guards now and set off as soon as the Sword Dragon Master arrives,” Ba Cang","said.","“Where is the mission location?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s in the second heaven. As for the details of the mission, I’ll explain it to you later. You can gather the guards now,” Ba Cang instructed.","Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","As soon as Jian Wushuang gave the order, the experts of the patrol team gathered again.","The 100 Superior Saints and the nine Principles Masters soon arrived.","Sword Dragon Master was an ancient and powerful Principles Master. In terms of strength, he was considered very strong among the three void realms. He could take over the position of Master True Eyes, the combat strength of the patrol team did not weaken at all.","After Sword Dragon Master arrived, Jian Wushuang ordered everyone to head to the Second Heaven.","On the way to the Second Heaven, Ba Cang also told Jian Wushuang the details of the mission.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you are going to the Amethyst Fog Sea of the Second Heaven. Long ago, the Amethyst Fog Sea was the base of the Amethyst Demon Sect, the overlord of the Second Heaven. At its peak, the Amethyst Demon Sect was comparable to the Octagonal Heaven Sect of the Third Heaven,","or even stronger.”","“However, for some unknown reason, the Amethyst Demon Sect provoked the Flame Saint Realm, one of the three great Saint Realms. Under the leadership of the Flame Saint Master, the Amethyst Demon Sect was completely annihilated, and the entire sect was reduced to a wasteland. Almost all of the","experts of the Amethyst Demon Sect were killed. However, although the Amethyst Demon Sect was annihilated, the various resources and treasures that the Amethyst Demon Sect had accumulated over the years were not obtained by the Flame Saint Realm. Instead, they completely disappeared with the","destruction of the Amethyst Demon Sect.”","Pausing for a while, Ba Cang continued, “There are rumors that the Amethyst Demon Sect’s many treasures were taken away by the surviving experts of the Amethyst Demon Sect. However, there are also rumors that the treasure of the Amethyst Demon Sect is hidden in the Amethyst Fog Sea. It’s just that","it’s too secretive, and no one has found it yet. Because of this rumor, experts often venture into the Amethyst Fog Sea in the Divine Beginning Realm to try their luck. However, they haven’t found much.”","“But not long ago, a few Immortal Saints from the Temporal Temple obtained a special token by chance. They recognized that it was related to the destroyed Amethyst Demon Sect, so they took it to the Amethyst Fog Sea. Unexpectedly, they found a secret realm hidden in the Amethyst Fog Sea!”","“Mystic realm of heaven and earth?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","The resources and wealth accumulated by the Amethyst Demon’s doctrine over a long period of time have never been found, and now the several Immortal Saints of the Temporal Temple have found a secret realm of heaven and Earth in the Amethyst Fog Sea through the keepsake, this secret realm of","heaven and earth! It’s probably where the treasure is!","“What happened after that? Did the Immortal Saints from the Temporal Temple enter the secret land of heaven and earth to investigate?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Not yet,” Ba Cang said. “Although they found the secret realm, it would take at least two or three Principles Masters to open it. They are just Immortal Saints, so how could they do that?”","“So they sent a message to the Temporal Temple at once. But when the temple was about to send Principles Masters to open the secret realm, the major force around the amethyst fog sea, Xiao Yao Mansion, got the news from God knows where. They sent a large number of experts and occupied the secret","realm. They also chased away the little guys from the Temporal Temple.”","“Xiao Yao Mansion? That name sounds familiar,” Jian Wushuang murmured, suddenly, his expression changed. “I remember. It’s Master Xiao Yao. He came from Xiao Yao Mansion, and I heard from Temple Master Bai Xing that Xiao Yao Mansion is a powerful overlord in the Second Heaven.”","“Yes, Xiao Yao Mansion is a top force in the entire Divine Beginning Realm. Since the Amethyst Demon Sect was destroyed, the territory around the Amethyst Fog Sea has been under its control. No one from the sects in the Second Heaven dares to provoke Xiao Yao Mansion, so it’s considered a great","overlord. However, Xiao Yao Mansion has offended the Temporal Temple this time. It’s not tactful,” Ba Cang said coldly.","Jian Wushuang also nodded secretly.","Although the carefree mansion was an overlord in the Second Heaven, it was nothing compared to the Temporal Temple.","Usually, the Temporal Temple kept a low profile and would not take the initiative to provoke other sects. However, it was not something that ordinary sects in the Divine Beginning Realm could easily provoke. For example, this time, the carefree mansion took the initiative to provoke the Temporal","Temple, it was indeed overestimating itself.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, the Immortal Saints of the Temporal Temple are waiting around the Amethyst Fog Sea. You will lead the patrol team to take back the secret realm of heaven and earth. If the people of the carefree mansion know what’s good for them, then let’s teach them a lesson. The Temporal","Temple is not a place that they can provoke,” Ba Cang said in a deep voice.","“Tsee.” Jian Wushuang understood.","The Temporal Temple did not seek hegemony, but it did not mean that it was easy to bully.","On the contrary, the Temporal Temple was never at a disadvantage. In the Blood Wave Realm, when Temple Master Bai Xing learned that the three Saint Realms had attacked Jian Wushuang, he immediately thought of ways to kill the Principles Masters of the three Saint Realms in the universe battlefield.","This time, the carefree mansion had become the target of the Temporal Temple."]},{"number":3349,"title":"Chapter 3349 - Amethyst Fog Sea","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Under Jian Wushuang’s personal leadership, the sixth patrol team arrived at the Second Heaven in the shortest time. When they arrived at the border of the Amethyst Fog Sea, the Temporal Temple was the first to discover that several Immortal Saints from the mystic realm of heaven and earth were","already waiting for them.","The person in the lead happened to be an acquaintance of Jian Wushuang.","“Haha, Brother Heavenly Marquis!” A hearty laughter rang out as a burly man in red armor walked up to Jian Wushuang.","“Yue Yu, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang also revealed a smile.","“Yue Yu, you have to call me inspector now.” Another person walked over.","“Duan Lang, you’re here too?” Jian Wushuang looked at him.","Duan Lang and Yue Yu had gone to the blood wave world with him before, so they had a good relationship, especially Duan Lang. When Jian Wushuang had just received the quota to go to the Blood Wave Realm, Duan Lang had fought with Jian Wushuang because he was not convinced.","Originally, both Duan Lang and Yue Yu were not far from Jian Wushuang. However, after the trip to the Blood Wave Realm, Jian Wushuang had become a top expert in the Divine Beginning Realm. He was well-known throughout the world and was extremely famous, soon after arriving at the spacetime","temple, he was appointed as an inspector. Yue Yu and Duan Lang were also aware of this news.","“Di Hao, Qian Hongzi, and Feixue, where are they?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","“Among the six people who went to the Blood Wave Temple with us, Di Hao has become a Principles Master. Although you haven’t made a breakthrough, your battle strength is stronger than Di Hao’s. You’re not on the same level as us.”","“As for Qian Hongzi and Feixue, Qian Hongzi has been in closed-door cultivation since he came back from the Blood Wave Realm. He hasn’t come out until now. Feixue has gone out alone. Yue Yu and 1 are fine. We just happened to get a token from the Amethyst Demon Sect, so we came here to take a look.","I didn’t expect to encounter such a thing,” Duan Lang said.","“As for the people of the carefree mansion, although they have occupied the secret realm, it is very stable. If I’m not wrong, to open the secret realm, not only do they need the help of several Principles Masters, but they also need the help of the token. Although there are enough Principles Masters in the","carefree mansion, they can not enter the secret realm without the token!”","“That is to say, no one has been able to enter the mystic realm of heaven and earth until now. Even if it’s really the resources and wealth accumulated by the Amethyst Demon Sect over a long period of time, no one has been able to get into it?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","“That’s right.” Duan Lang nodded.","“Haha, that’s great. The carefree mansion thought that they would chase you away and then immediately enter the mystic realm of heaven and earth to search for treasures. By then, even if the experts of the Temporal Temple arrived, they would have already looted all the treasures in the mystic realm of","heaven and earth, so they could completely deny it. It’s a good idea, but unfortunately, without the token, they can’t enter the mystic realm of heaven and earth. They are doomed to fail!” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Duan Lang, do you remember how to get to the mystic realm of heaven and earth?” Jian Wushuang looked at Duan Lang.","“Of course I do.” Duan Lang nodded.","“Well, you and Yue Yu lead the way. Let’s go and meet the people of the carefree mansion!” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Okay!” Duan Lang and Yue Yu were very excited.","They were reluctant when they were chased away by the people of the carefree mansion. They were also very angry and aggrieved.","Now, when Jian Wushuang’s patrol team finally arrived, they naturally wanted to go to the mystic realm of heaven and earth to get back at them.","Under the guidance of Duan Lang and Yue Yu, the group directly entered the Amethyst Fog Sea and quickly flew toward the mystic realm of heaven and earth. Before long, they had arrived at the mystic realm of heaven and earth, Jian Wushuang had also sensed the existence of the experts of carefree","mansion."]},{"number":3350,"title":"Chapter 3350 - Acquaintances","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Amethyst Fog Sea, which had calmed down a long time ago, became restless again because of the appearance of the secret realm of heaven and earth.","A large amount of hazy purple fog filled every corner of the world. In the center of the Amethyst Fog Sea, a complete secret realm of heaven and earth had appeared in front of the world. At this moment, around this secret realm of heaven and earth...many experts from the Xiaoyao Mansion were gathered","there, with two people in the lead.","“Damn it, what’s going on with this secret realm of heaven and earth? The six Principles Masters of the Xiaoyao Mansion attacked at the same time, but they were actually unable to open this secret realm of heaven and earth?” A handsome young man wearing a luxurious silver robe secretly gritted his","teeth, his expression was also quite unsightly.","“This secret realm is different from ordinary secret realms. Not only does it have secret realm defensive methods, but most importantly, it is also covered with a layer of special restriction. The level of this restriction is extremely high. Unless there is an expert of the fifth or sixth level of the void, it would","be too difficult for us to break this restriction by ourselves,” the long-browed elder with narrowed eyes said.","“Have you asked the person who sent us the message?” The handsome young man asked.","“Yes, I have. According to him, he was only invited by the Peak Saints to lead the way here because he was familiar with the Amethyst Fog Sea. As for the purpose of the Peak Saints, he didn’t know. Later, when the secret realm of heaven and Earth was born, he thought that the Peak Saints were just lucky,","so he sent us the message without thinking too much,” the long-browed old man explained in a deep voice.","“From the looks of it, those Peak Saints shouldn’t be that simple. They might have come to the Amethyst Fog Sea to look for opportunities, and they might even have a special token to open this heaven and earth secret realm.”","“Bastard, if I knew this would happen, I wouldn’t have let those people go,” the handsome man cursed.","“Young master, no matter what, those people are from the Temporal Temple. They have already told us their identities. The Temporal Temple knows that they are here. Now that we have forcefully occupied this secret realm, we have already offended the Temporal Temple. If we force those Peak Saints to.","stay and force or kill them, we will have completely offended the Temporal Temple. There is nothing we can do to let them go,” the long-browed elder said.","“Hmph, the Temporal Temple...” The handsome man’s eyes were cold. However, when he thought about the difference in strength between the Xiaoyao Mansion and the Temporal Temple, he felt helpless.","“Without the token, we won’t be able to open this heaven and earth secret realm. Doesn’t that mean that not only did we come all the way here for nothing, but we’ve also offended the Temporal Temple?” The handsome man said.","“That’s right. But it’s still too early to say that. After all, the heaven and earth secret realm is still in our hands. Before the experts of the Temporal Temple arrive, we can think of ways to open the heaven and earth secret realm. For example, we can invite experts above the fifth level of the void realm to","open the heaven and earth secret realm by force. or we can invite master-level experts who are good at restraining arrays. It’s also possible to open the heaven and earth secret realm.” The long-browed elder said.","Many people were still talking about the astonishing achievements of Heavenly Sword Marquis on the Saha Island.","He was a super figure who had fought head-on against the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God and severely injured them.","A man’s life was like the shadow of a tree!","Even the Principles Master could not calm down after hearing the name of Heavenly Sword Marquis.","“Young Master Xiaoyao, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang looked at the handsome man with a teasing smile.","That’s right, the handsome man was Young Master Xiaoyao, the number one genius of Xiaoyao Mansion and the personal disciple of the Mansion Master of Xiaoyao Mansion.","However, hundreds of years had passed, and Young Master Xiaoyao was still a saint. He was no longer comparable to Jian Wushuang.","“Jian, Heavenly Sword Marquis...what are you doing here?” Master Xiaoyao asked, suppressing the fear in his heart.","“What?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “I’m now the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple. I’m leading the sixth patrol team to fight for the Temporal Temple. Don’t you know why I’m leading the patrol team to the Amethyst Fog Sea?”","Master Xiaoyao’s face was gloomy. Of course, he knew why Jian Wushuang came, but he could not say it right away.","“Master Xiaoyao, the secret realm behind you was found by the people of the Temporal Temple. After finding it, your Xiaoyao Mansion immediately sent experts to chase away our people and take the secret realm for yourself. Isn’t that a bit too overbearing?","“Or do you think my Temporal Temple is easy to bully?” Jian Wushuang shouted coldly.","Master Xiaoyao’s body trembled. Before he could speak, the long-browed elder beside him immediately said, “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, I’m afraid there’s a misunderstanding. How dare my Xiaoyao Mansion disrespect the Temporal Temple?”"]},{"number":3351,"title":"Chapter 3351 - Attack","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You are Shi Yin Master of Xiaoyao Mansion, right?” Jian Wushuang glanced at the long-browed elder. “I heard that you are the strongest person in Xiaoyao Mansion besides Marquis Xiao Yao. Your words should be able to represent Xiaoyao Mansion. However, you just said that it was a misunderstanding.","Thope you can explain it clearly. What kind of misunderstanding?”","Jian Wushuang had already obtained information about many experts of the Xiaoyao Mansion on his way here because he knew that he was facing the Xiaoyao Mansion. Of course, he also knew about the long-browed elder, Master Shi Yin.","Master Shi Yin was a very strong expert of the third realm of the void. It was said that his battle strength had reached the peak of the third realm of the void. In the Xiaoyao Mansion, his strength was only slightly weaker than Marquis Xiao Yao.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, at first, our Xiaoyao Mansion didn’t know that those little guys were from your Temporal Temple. Later, although they revealed their identities, they only revealed their movement skills and didn’t show anything to prove it. Mr. Heavenly Marquis, you also know that in the Divine","Beginning Realm, especially in times of crisis, it’s common for people to pretend to be disciples of big sects. Our Xiaoyao Mansion has encountered this many times before...” Master Shi Yin said...before he could finish his words.","“So, you just chased away the people of the Temporal Temple?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, the Amethyst Fog Sea is the territory of our Xiaoyao Mansion. Before we can confirm the identities of these little guys, we have to ensure that the secret realm of heaven and Earth is not occupied in advance,” Master Shi Yin said.","“Master Shi Yin, there is indeed a misunderstanding. Now that I have personally shown up and proved that the Immortal Saints are from our Temporal Temple, you should be able to return the secret realm to us, right?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Return?” Master Shi Yin was stunned.","Jian Wushuang used the word ‘return’ to express his position. It meant that the secret realm was first discovered by the Temporal Temple, which meant that it belonged to the Temporal Temple. The Xiaoyao Mansion was only temporarily in charge of the Temporal Temple.","Now that the Temporal Temple had sent people, the Xiaoyao Mansion had to leave immediately?","Although this was reasonable, if they were to leave just like that, they would be too unwilling.","“Mr, Heavenly Marquis, no matter what, the Amethyst Fog Sea is the territory of our Xiaoyao Mansion. This is our territory, and our Xiaoyao Mansion is one of the top overlords in the Second Heaven. It’s a top force even in the Divine Beginning Realm. Mr. Heavenly Marquis, aren’t you going too far by not","giving our Xiaoyao Mansion face?” Master Shi Yin said.","“Too much?","“Haha, so what If I’m too much for a mere Xiaoyao Mansion?","“Do you really think that the Temporal Temple is easy to bully by snatching our things and chasing our people away?” Jian Wushuang gave a hearty smile, then he gave a direct order. “Sergeants, listen up. Kill them and take back the secret realm of heaven and earth. Anyone who dares to stop us will be","Killed without mercy!”","“Kin!”","“Haha, brothers, kill them!”","“How dare a mere Xiaoyao Mansion steal from the Temporal Temple? They are courting death!”","The sixth patrol team, 10 Principles Masters, 100 Peak Saints, Yue Yu, Duan Lang, and a few others swarmed out after hearing Jian Wushuang’s order. They did not give the Xiaoyao Mansion any chance at all.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s order to attack and the many experts charging at the same time, the people of the Xiaoyao Mansion were shocked.","“Oh no!”","Master Shi Yin’s expression also changed drastically. He looked at Master Xiaoyao and said, “Master, step back first. The others, stop them!”"]},{"number":3352,"title":"Chapter 3352 - Marquis Xiaoyao Arrives","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Boom!","As powerful auras rose, the patrol team of the Temporal Temple and the experts of Xiaoyao Mansion immediately engaged in a fierce battle.","“Sword Heaven Marquis, you are too much. This is the territory of our Xiaoyao Mansion. You are not allowed to be presumptuous!” Master Shi Yin shouted, as soon as he finished his words, a thick aura rose from his body. It carried the pressure of the peak of the third realm of the void and directly pressed","toward Jian Wushuang, Master Shi Yin also rushed toward Jian Wushuang at the first moment.","“Too far?” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. When he saw Master Shi Yin coming toward him, his aura suddenly soared, and he activated his life divine power. At the same time, he also used the Heaven-cleaving skill.","Jian Wushuang, who had mastered two parts of the will, could rival the three realms of the void after using his life divine power. Once he used the Heaven-cleaving skill, he could reach the level of the four realms of the void!","It was the peerless sword technique, Xi Xiang!","Whoosh!","A scarlet sword light with extreme violence swept out in an instant.","Like a blood-red thunderbolt, it directly crushed toward Master Shi Yin who was rushing toward him.","Master Shi Yin took out a huge hammer. The two principles of earth and lightning pervaded this huge hammer. Even though they had yet to fuse together, its power was still exceptionally shocking, hong long long ~ ~ this huge hammer instantly magnified under Master Shi Yin’s control. For a moment, it","blotted out the sky and blotted out the sun. In an instant, it collided head-on with that blood-red bolt of lightning.","Peng!","The sky collapsed and the earth cracked. At this moment, the entire void trembled.","At the same time, numerous spatial cracks that spread over ten meters spread out crazily like a spider web.","“So terrifying!”","“The spatial cracks spread over ten meters...”","“It’s too powerful. We have to be careful. We must not be dragged into it.”","The Principles Masters and many Immortal Saints on the battlefield were all pale and shocked when they saw the crazed space crack.","In the center of the space crack... “Puff!”","Master Shi Yin spat out a mouthful of blood. His face was pale and his aura instantly became weak. He was forced back in a sorry state. It took him a long time to regain his balance.","“Void, the fourth realm of the void?”","After regaining his balance, Master Shi Yin looked at Jian Wushuang in shock. His heart was in turmoil.","“How is this possible? The strength that Heavenly Sword Marquis displayed in the battle 400 years ago was not only at the third realm of the void? Although he fought against the Master of the Saint Realm, everyone knew that he used a very powerful trump card.”","“But now...he hasn’t used any trump cards, and his battle strength has already reached the fourth realm of the void realm?”","Master Shi Yin did not expect that Jian Wushuang’s battle strength had already reached such a level. He had thought that if Jian Wushuang was at the third realm of the void realm, he would be able to fight Jian Wushuang head-on or even suppress him, then he could wait for their Mansion Master to","come, but now...","“Master Shi Yin, get lost. Otherwise, even if you are an expert in the third realm of the void realm, you will die here today.” Jian Wushuang’s cold voice echoed in the world, making Master Shi Yin’s face even uglier.","As a Principles Master, he also had an immortal body, so his life-saving ability was stronger than that of the Immortal Saint. With Master Shi Yin’s life-saving ability, it was almost impossible for an ordinary expert in the fourth realm of the void realm to kill him, however, Master Shi Yin did not have any","confidence in facing Jian Wushuang.","After all, Jian Wushuang was famous for having many trump cards and means. In the battle more than 400 years ago, he had revealed countless trump cards. Now, Jian Wushuang could easily crush him without using his trump cards, once Jian Wushuang used his trump cards, he might really be able to","kill him here.","However, if he left just like that, he would not be able to give up the heaven and earth secret realm.","And just when Master Shi Yin was in a dilemma...","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, right? Although you are an inspector of the Temporal Temple, what you have done today is too disrespectful to our Xiaoyao Mansion, right?” A deep voice suddenly came from the void not far away.","Upon hearing this voice, Young Master Xiaoyao, who was standing at the back of the battlefield, was immediately overjoyed. Master Shi Yin also heaved a sigh of relief as if a heavy burden had been lifted off his shoulders.","Whoosh!","A two-meter-tall figure, who seemed to be strolling leisurely in the void, rushed over from the surrounding void and appeared in front of Jian Wushuang in an instant.","This person was dressed in a silver tight suit. His long hair was flowing with a hint of silver gray, making him look rather ancient. He carried a two-meter-long heavy sword on his back. Standing there, he gave off an extremely peculiar feeling.","“Lord Mansion Master!”","“Master!”","Upon seeing the man, Master Shi Yin and Master Xiaoyao immediately bowed.","“Is he Marquis Xiaoyao?” Jian Wushuang also looked at the long-haired man. Although the long-haired man was standing there, he gave Jian Wushuang an invisible pressure.","“I’s said that Marquis Xiaoyao, the Mansion Master of Xiaoyao Mansion, became a rule master 20 million years ago. He went to the universe battlefield for a long time and got some opportunities. When he came back, he had the battle strength of the void fourth realm. From then on, he took over the","position of Mansion Master of Xiaoyao Mansion. In terms of strength, he is not the strongest among the experts of the void fourth realm, but he is quite strong!” Jian Wushuang recalled the information about Marquis Xiaoyao.","Thave to say, this Xiaoyao Marquis is indeed a strong, he rose from now to become an overlord, is completely from the edge of life and death climbed up, not a trace of luck.","With the appearance of Marquis Xiaoyao, the battle between the two sides stopped temporarily. The experts on both sides separated and retreated to the side. Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao were still standing in the middle. Everyone’s eyes were fixed on them, everyone’s eyes were fixed on them.","“didn’t expect that you would be alarmed and come to the Amethyst Fog Sea, Marquis Xiaoyao.” Jian Wushuang stood in the void with a sword in one hand and looked at Marquis Xiaoyao with interest.","“It can’t be helped. The inspector of the Temporal Temple and Heavenly Sword Marquis, who is so famous in the Divine Beginning Realm, have come to the amethyst fog sea. As the Mansion Master of Xiaoyao Mansion, I have to welcome them personally,” Marquis Xiaoyao said calmly.","“There’s no need to welcome them. I’m sure you know about this matter, Marquis Xiaoyao. The secret realm in the Amethyst Fog Sea was discovered by the people of the Temporal Temple first, so it naturally belongs to us. I hope that the people of Mansion Xiaoyao can give up this secret realm,” Jian","‘Wushuang said directly.."]},{"number":3353,"title":"Chapter 3353 - Negotiations","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, the Amethyst Fog Sea has been under the control of our Xiaoyao Mansion all these years. Since this secret realm was born in the Amethyst Fog Sea, it should belong to our Xiaoyao Mansion. The one who should leave and give up this secret realm should be your Temporal","Temple,” said Marquis Xiaoyao.","“What a joke. The territory controlled by your Xiaoyao Mansion is so vast. If you say so, all the cultivators in this vast territory belong to your Xiaoyao Mansion, and all the opportunities are yours.”","“But will the cultivators in this territory agree to it?” Jian Wushuang sneered.","“Marquis Xiaoyao, it takes incredible luck to find a secret realm of heaven and earth hidden in the Amethyst Fog Sea. Your Xiaoyao Mansion has occupied the Amethyst Fog Sea for so many years, but you still couldn’t find it. This means that your Xiaoyao Mansion is not fated with the secret realm of","heaven and earth. So, how can you ask for it?”","“You are right.” Marquis Xiaoyao nodded slightly. “Our Xiaoyao Mansion has occupied this Amethyst Fog Sea for so many years, but we haven’t been able to find this secret realm. Indeed, we shouldn’t force it. However, even if your Temporal Temple finds this secret realm first, you might not be able to say","that this secret realm belongs to your Temporal Temple. Don’t forget, this secret realm was left behind by the former Amethyst Demon Sect!”","“The Amethyst Demon Sect was a peak overlord of the second sky a long time ago. Back then, the one who destroyed the Amethyst Demon Sect and turned the Amethyst Fog Sea into ruins was one of the three great Saint Realms, the Flame Saint Realm. After the Flame Saint Realm destroyed the Amethyst","Demon Sect, shouldn’t the things left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect belong to the Flame Saint Lord?” Marquis Xiaoyao laughed coldly.","“How about I send a message to the Flame Saint Realm and ask them to send experts over to discuss who will get the secret area?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Only his own camp and the Xiaoyao Mansion were involved in the fight for the secret area. The Temporal Temple had the absolute advantage against the Xiaoyao Mansion, but if the Flame Saint Realm got involved...it would be completely different.","Just as Marquis Xiaoyao had said, it was the Flame Saint Realm that destroyed the Amethyst Demon Sect. In the end, the ownership of the mystic realm of heaven and earth belonged to the Saint Realm of flame.","Marquis Xiaoyao also saw the change in Jian Wushuang’s expression, he immediately smiled and said, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, in my opinion, let’s sit down and have a good talk. The Xiaoyao Mansion doesn’t expect to get all the treasures in the mystic realm of heaven and earth, but it’s impossible for","the Temporal Temple to monopolize them!”","“You’re right. In that case, tell me what you want.” Jian Wushuang looked at Marquis Xiaoyao calmly.","“It’s simple. No one has entered the secret realm. No one knows what’s in it, but it might be the treasure left by the Amethyst Demon Sect. No matter what’s in it, our Xiaoyao Mansion and your Temporal Temple will share half of it!” Marquis Xiaoyao said.","“50-502”","“Marquis Xiaoyao, what do you think? If your Xiaoyao Mansion was in the Flame Saint Realm, we would be in the same situation since the Amethyst Demon Sect was destroyed. But your Xiaoyao Mansion...how can you say that we are 50-50?” Jian Wushuang mocked him.","Marquis Xiaoyao’s eyes darkened.","Of course, he knew that it was almost impossible for Xiaoyao Mansion to share half of the treasures equally with the Temporal Temple. He was just hoping to get lucky, he could ask for a sky-high price at the beginning.","“How do you want to distribute the treasures in the secret realm?” Marquis Xiaoyao looked at him.","“It’s simple. The Temporal Temple will take 90% of the treasures in the secret realm, and your Xiaoyao Mansion will take 10%!” Jian Wushuang said.","“10%? Impossible, that’s too little. My Xiaoyao Mansion will take at least 30%!” Marquis Xiaoyao shouted.","“30%?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Marquis Xiaoyao. He could see that 30% was close to Marquis Xiaoyao’s bottom line, but it was not the bottom line.","“30% is too much. I’ll give you 20% at most,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Marquis Xiaoyao’s expression was uncertain, obviously hesitant.","Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Marquis Xiaoyao, 20% of the opportunity treasures is already a lot. If you don’t want to, then there’s no way to negotiate. We can only have a falling out!”","“But before we fall out, you have to think carefully about how much power your Xiaoyao Mansion has. You don’t have any confidence against my Temporal Temple alone. If you really do as you say and let the Flame Saint Realm come and interfere, then what will happen to your Xiaoyao Mansion?","“Tm afraid you won’t be able to get anything out of it.”","Jian Wushuang’s words made Marquis Xiaoyao frown. He was obviously talking about his weakness.","He knew very well that Jian Wushuang was willing to talk to him and give him 20% of the opportunity treasures on behalf of the Temporal Temple. It was not because he was worried about the Xiaoyao Mansion, but because he was worried about the Flame Saint Realm, he did not want the Flame Saint","Realm to be involved in it.","However, the Xiaoyao Mansion was nothing in front of the Temporal Temple, not to mention the Flame Saint Realm.","If he were to lose all decorum with Jian Wushuang and let the Flame Saint Realm get involved, then the mystic realm of heaven and earth would really have nothing to do with the Xiaoyao Mansion.","Jian Wushuang could see that Marquis Xiaoyao’s heart was wavering, so he immediately spoke again, “Marquis Xiaoyao, I know that you’re very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm and that you’ve grown up to be quite a legend. I admire you very much. I can make the decision on my own to give you","30% of the opportunities and treasures.”","“Huh?” Xiaoyao Mansion immediately looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “What do you mean?”","“I’s simple. I’ve been cultivating in the Saha Island for more than 400 years and my strength has improved greatly. Now I’m in need of experts to practice with. I’m looking forward to your strength, so I want to fight you head-on.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“If you can defeat me in this battle, I’ll get 30% of the opportunities and treasures for your Xiaoyao Mansion. But if you lose, your Xiaoyao Mansion will only get 20%. Moreover, after opening the secret realm of heaven and earth, the experts of your Xiaoyao Mansion will have to obey the arrangement of","my Temporal Temple. How about it?”","“Are you serious? Can you really get 30% of the opportunities and treasures for my Xiaoyao Mansion?” Marquis Xiaoyao stared at Jian Wushuang with bright eyes.","“Of course, I won’t go back on my words. As for whether I can do it or not, you don’t have to doubt it. Don’t forget that I’m a Saint Realm Inspector of the Temporal Temple. My words carry some weight in the temple,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice."]},{"number":3354,"title":"Chapter 3354 - Battle Marquis Xiaoyao","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Okay, I’ll bet with you!” Marquis Xiaoyao agreed directly.","In fact, when Jian Wushuang gave him 20% of the opportunity treasure, Marquis Xiaoyao had already wavered. Now, Jian Wushuang gave him a very promising opportunity to fight for 30% of the opportunity treasure. If Marquis Xiaoyao did not agree, it would be too tactless of him.","Seeing Marquis Xiaoyao agree, Jian Wushuang immediately smiled.","He did not lie. In the past 400 years, his strength had improved a lot, and he really wanted to fight with some real experts.","In the camp, although he had defeated Master True Eyes and Master Shi Yin, both of them were only in the third realm of the void. It was difficult for him to put pressure on them now, he easily defeated them and did not have a chance to use his full strength, let alone some tricks or trump cards.","However, Marquis Xiaoyao was a genuine expert in the fourth realm of the void.","He was also a very strong expert in the fourth realm of the void. At the same time, he used a heavy sword as a weapon and specialized in sword principle. Such an expert was what Jian Wushuang yearned to fight.","Therefore, he used 10% more treasures as a bet to let Marquis Xiaoyao fight with him.","“Marquis Xiaoyao, I hope your strength won’t disappoint me.” Jian Wushuang licked his lips and said with a faint smile.","“Lalso want to see how powerful you are, as a Saint Realm expert who has made such a great name in the Divine Beginning Realm and is even known as the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm.” Marquis Xiaoyao’s face was cold, he stared at Jian Wushuang and said, “‘m","standing right here. Bring it on!”","“As you wish.” Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He moved his body and made his move.","The surrounding experts, whether they were the patrol guards or the experts of Xiaoyao Mansion, had already retreated to the side and made way for the huge battlefield.","When they saw Jian Wushuang make his move, the experts were also looking forward to it.","“Who will win the battle between the Inspector and Marquis Xiaoyao?”","“Of course, the inspector will win!”","“It is said that Marquis Xiaoyao has reached the fourth void realm a long time ago and has been famous in the Divine Beginning Realm. Although the inspector hasn’t been famous for a long time, he is more famous than Marquis Xiaoyao and is very strong. It will be interesting for them to fight.”","The experts of the patrol team were extremely excited as they watched the battle. Of course, as a member of the patrol team, they thought that Jian Wushuang would win, especially the Immortal Saints, they worshiped Jian Wushuang blindly. No matter who the opponent was, they all thought that Jian","‘Wushuang would win.","As for the experts of the Xiaoyao Mansion, their eyes were also burning with passion.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, is he going to fight with the Mansion Master?” Master Shi Yin had a strange look on his face.","“Humph, Heavenly Sword Marquis only had the battle strength of a Superior Saint in the Blood Wave World 400 years ago. Where did he get the courage to challenge master?” Master Xiaoyao snorted in his heart, obviously, he did not think that Jian Wushuang had the strength to challenge Marquis","Xiaoyao.","However, no matter what the people around him thought, Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao were already fighting head-on in the center of the battlefield.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had been very relaxed when he faced the Master True Eyes and Master Shi Yin, and he had kept his strength. But now that he was facing Marquis Xiaoyao, Jian Wushuang did not hold back from the beginning, once he activated his life divine power and the Heaven-cleaving","skill, coupled with the power of his two wills, his battle strength reached its peak in an instant.","“Peerless Sword technique, Xi Xiang!”","The Blood Mountain Sword turned into a blood-red lightning bolt and instantly rushed out.","That shocking violent aura rushed into the sky. Wherever the sword light went, space cracked inch by inch.","“Humph!”","However, Marquis Xiaoyao only snorted lightly. When the blood-red lightning bolt arrived, the two-meter-long heavy sword that he had been carrying on his back instantly appeared in his hand. He held the heavy sword with one hand, an endless amount of power surged into the sword.","Following that...the broadsword simply swept across.","It seemed simple, but the broadsword contained two incomparably violent principles of destruction and lightning. These two laws of power were perfectly fused together, complementing each other, allowing this casual sweep of the sword...its power was earth-shattering.","Hua la la the air was directly swept away. In the middle, it was like a long meteor, colliding head-on with the blood-colored lightning.","Bang!","With a loud bang, the blood-colored lightning suddenly dimmed, and two extremely violent powers wildly collided.","Hua la the surrounding space exploded one after another, and one after another, spatial cracks that were dozens of meters long spread out continuously in the battlefield. It was as if the world was splitting apart from the middle...the commotion was incredible.","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle could not help but click their tongues when they saw the scene in the middle of the battlefield.","They knew very well that the power displayed by Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao far exceeded that of everyone present. This level of power was not something that the people present were qualified to participate in.","Finally, with a low rumble, the two powers in the middle of the battlefield finally retreated with the defeat of one of them. The two figures also retreated.","Jian Wushuang only staggered back a few steps, while Marquis Xiaoyao retreated a long distance before stopping again.","At first glance, it seemed that Jian Wushuang had the upper hand, but in fact...","“Haha, Marquis Xiaoyao, it is said that you have mastered the two brutal principles of thunder and destruction at the same time, and they are fused together. This makes your attack extremely terrifying and violent. Your casual attack has the power to destroy the world. Now it seems that it is true.” Jian","Wushuang laughed loudly, it echoed in the world.","Jian Wushuang was quite surprised.","After all, he had just used his most powerful attack, Xi Xiang, with all his strength. However, Marquis Xiaoyao had only casually swept his sword and was still in a stalemate with him for so long before he was forced to retreat, if Marquis Xiaoyao also used an offensive sword skill, its power would probably","be stronger than his.","“You’re not weak either.” Marquis Xiaoyao also stared at Jian Wushuang. ”","‘s hard to imagine that an Immortal Saint could have the power equivalent to the four void realms. I was careless and suffered a small loss, but it won’t happen again.”","“Haha, let’s do it again.” Jian Wushuang laughed heartily and moved forward again. At the same time, the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand turned into arcs of light"]},{"number":3355,"title":"Chapter 3355 - Heart Penetration","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hua! Hua! Hua! Hua! ~ ~ ~","One after another, extremely fast sword shadows rushed out.","‘Wushuang Sword Manual...Ninth Heaven of illusionary sword!","Although Marquis Xiaoyao used a heavy sword, his speed was not slow at all. The heavy sword seemed to weigh hundreds of millions of pounds, but it seemed to be weightless in his hand. He waved the heavy sword again and again, he easily blocked all of Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship.","Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship has completely exploded.","“Xi Xiang!”","“Star dream!”","“Setting sun!”","“Emperor Blood Kill!”","“Life and death moment!”","Jian Wushuang used the peerless sword manual he had created to its fullest. The violent, Swift, and Strange Sword Shadows attacked Jian Wushuang crazily. Not only did he use Jian Wushuang to his fullest, at the same time, he also used his body speed and his understanding of sword principle to its","fullest.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s battle strength had reached its peak, leaving aside some of his trump cards and tricks.","Each sword skill had its own characteristics. If it were an ordinary expert, it would be difficult to resist it, but against Marquis Xiaoyao...","According to the information that Jian Wushuang had obtained, the most terrifying thing about Marquis Xiaoyao was his close-combat ability.","His close-combat ability was too strong, With the combination of offense and defense, coupled with his extremely violent offensive, he could easily defeat the enemy.","But now, in the face of Jian Wushuang’s endless attacks of swordsmanship, Marquis Xiaoyao was calm and easy to deal with. No matter how tricky Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was, or how strange it was, Marquis Xiaoyao was able to withstand it.","After a fierce battle, although Jian Wushuang had been attacking crazily, he did not gain any advantage from Marquis Xiaoyao.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, is this your strongest strength?” Marquis Xiaoyao suddenly stopped what he was doing. His eyes were cold as he stared at Jian Wushuang, and a mocking smile appeared on his lips. “Although your swordsmanship is indeed very powerful and strange, and in terms of real combat","strength, it is indeed difficult for an ordinary expert of the void four realms to defeat you, it is still too early for you to challenge me with such strength!”","As soon as he finished his words, Marquis Xiaoyao’s body suddenly shook. A shocking destructive aura burst out from his body. At the same time, a large amount of dark purple thunderbolt power surged out from his body, these dark purple thunderbolts even spread directly to the heavy sword in his","hand.","“Kill, thunderbolt!”","Swish!","A flash of lightning suddenly shot out.","It was so fast that even Jian Wushuang could barely see a trace of it. Marquis Xiaoyao was already in front of him, and at the same time, the two-meter-long heavy sword had been raised high above the heavy sword, the two extremely violent rules of destruction and thunder were perfectly fused together.","In an instant, he slashed down with a bang!","“This sword!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly darkened. The moment he saw Marquis Xiaoyao’s sword, he moved at the same time.","Buzz, buzz, a sword light suddenly swung out. In an instant, it stirred up the surrounding space and time, causing the surrounding void to completely turn blood-red.","The sky was blood-red, the ground was blood-red, and even the air was filled with a large amount of blood mist.","This sword light was also extremely overbearing, easily cutting through space. At the same time, the majestic power of space and time suddenly covered the void in front of them.","The peerless sword manual...blood asura!","The strongest move of the seven sword moves of the Peerless Sword Manual was now displayed in Jian Wushuang’s hands. The effect of the space-time stagnation was instantly produced. Marquis Xiaoyao and his extremely violent sword...both of them were affected by the space-time stagnation,","although they managed to break free in the blink of an eye.","However, because of this slight impression, the speed and power of Marquis Xiaoyao’s violent sword were greatly weakened, giving Jian Wushuang a chance to resist.","Bang!","The two sword lights finally collided head-on. As soon as they came into contact, Jian Wushuang immediately felt a violent force transmitted from the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand.","This force shook his divine body, causing him to let out a muffled groan. His body also retreated in a sorry state at the first moment.","Whoosh!","The sword light dissipated and mercilessly shattered the surrounding void, forming a shockwave that spread out in all directions.","Jian Wushuang had already steadied himself. He tightened the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand and frowned slightly.","“Marquis Xiaoyao is indeed at the peak of the void fourth realm. He is also a top expert who specializes in close combat. The power of his move just now was too strong. It was not something I could withstand in a head-on collision. Even though I had used blood asura at the first moment and slowed down","the speed and power of this move, this move still crushed me.” Jian Wushuang sighed quietly.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you are very strong, but you are still weaker than me.” Marquis Xiaoyao looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Isn’t it too early to say that? I haven’t lost yet.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Why? Aren’t you going to admit defeat?” Marquis Xiaoyao’s eyes darkened.","“It’s just that you are stronger than me in a head-on fight. In a real fight, victory and defeat are not determined by the power of a head-on fight.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but then his body swayed slightly, he disappeared directly in front of Marquis Xiaoyao.","This scene caused Marquis Xiaoyao’s pupils to constrict.","‘The surrounding experts who were watching the fight looked around blankly.","“What’s going on? Where did the inspector go?”","“Ican’t find him. I can’t even sense his soul?”","“Shadowless escape art! It’s the inspector’s Shadowless escape art!”","The Principles Masters in the patrol team immediately reacted.","“The shadowless escape art of the Blood Blade Master?” Marquis Xiaoyao remained calm. “Humph, I knew you had mastered the shadowless escape art, but unfortunately, your shadowless escape art can’t be compared to the Blood Blade Master’s. It may be no problem to hide it from an ordinary Principles","Master, but it’s a joke to hide it from me.”","Marquis Xiaoyao’s soul power spread out directly. In just a moment, he had already sensed Jian Wushuang’s location. “Over here!”","Marquis Xiaoyao transformed into a thunderbolt and immediately appeared in the void where Jian Wushuang was. At the same time, he swung his hand violently.","“Your sensing ability is not bad.” Jian Wushuang’s figure also appeared in the void. At the same time, he also swung his Blood Mountain Sword.","The two collided again, but this time, Marquis Xiaoyao’s heavy sword easily passed through the body of the Blood Mountain Sword and Jian Wushuang’s divine body without any obstruction.","“What?” Marquis Xiaoyao was stunned. “Oh no, it’s time-space conversion!”","Marquis Xiaoyao was the first to react. At the same time, he sensed that Jian Wushuang had appeared behind him.","Jian Wushuang smiled. He looked at Marquis Xiaoyao, who had his back to him, and gently threw out his Blood Mountain Sword.","“The second move of the bloody blade swordsmanship, the first move of heart penetration!”"]},{"number":3356,"title":"Chapter 3356 - Was Defeated!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“So fast!”","“So fast!”","A trace of shock flashed across Marquis Xiaoyao’s eyes.","He had already realized that what he had encountered before was just an illusion formed by the space-time conversion, and he had also sensed Jian Wushuang’s real location. Logically speaking, with his strength, since he had reacted at the first moment, even if he was in a passive position, he should","have been able to barely defend himself.","But now, Jian Wushuang’s thrust made Marquis Xiaoyao lose the thought of defending.","‘What could he do? This sword move was too fast!","The blood blade sword art was the strongest assassination sword art created by the Blood Blade Master. It was used together with the shadowless escape art.","Jian Wushuang had mastered the shadowless escape skill to the initial level. He had also mastered the second move of the bloody sword skill, which was called penetrating heart form.","It was faster and faster than the first move of the blood drop skill. Most importantly, the piercing force of the sword skill was even more terrifying.","If Jian Wushuang had only used the first move of the blood drop skill, he might have been blocked by Marquis Xiaoyao even at such a good time. However, once he used the second move... Even Marquis Xiaoyao would not be able to block it, he could only watch as the sword with a terrifying piercing force","struck his divine body.","Boom!","The void shook, and the layer of thunder covering Marquis Xiaoyao’s body was instantly penetrated. The defense on his body was also instantly shattered. However, Marquis Xiaoyao was wearing protective armor, which was an extremely high-level supreme treasure. Jian Wushuang’s sword attack...it was","unable to penetrate the protective armor directly, but a terrifying penetrating power still passed through the armor and into Marquis Xiaoyao’s divine body.","“Humph!”","Marquis Xiaoyao snorted and his face suddenly darkened. Under the influence of that power, he retreated crazily and only regained his balance after a long time.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re really good!” Marquis Xiaoyao stared at Jian Wushuang with a solemn face and then sighed, “I lost this battle!”","“Haha, thank you for letting me win.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","‘The surrounding experts who were watching the battle instantly burst into an uproar.","“As expected, the patrol inspector won!”","“The patrol inspector is so powerful. It is said that Marquis Xiaoyao is a Principles Master with amazing strength and has a great battle record. However, the patrol ambassador still defeated him head-on!”","“Humph, see, I told you that you would win.”","The sergeants of the patrol team were very happy, but it was the opposite in Xiaoyao Mansion.","“What happened? Although master was pushed back just now, it doesn’t mean that he has lost. Wasn’t Heavenly Sword Marquis also pushed back by Master?” Young Master Xiaoyao did not understand, to be exact, he did not believe that his master would be defeated by Jian Wushuang.","Master Shiyin, who was beside him, secretly shook his head. “The Lord Mansion Master has indeed lost this battle.”","“Great elder.” Young Master Xiaoyao looked at him with a frown.","“Young master, although the Lord Mansion Master and Jian Wushuang were both pushed back once, the outcome of the battle hasn’t been determined yet. However, the Lord Mansion Master has actually done his best in this battle. Under the Lord Mansion Master’s best efforts, he could only fight with","Heavenly Sword Marquis. Don’t forget that the reason why Heavenly Sword Marquis has such an incredible reputation in the Divine Beginning Realm is not only because of his own strength, but also his trump cards and means!”","“He has many trump cards and techniques. For example, he has a universe true treasure with shocking power. Once it is used, his power can reach a whole new level. Also, during the battle over 400 years ago, he summoned a terrifying Yimo and forced the Flame Saint Master into a difficult situation.”","“He has too many trump cards and techniques, but now, he hasn’t used them. Just by relying on his own power, he is already on par with the Palace Master. What do you think will happen if he uses those trump cards and techniques?” Master Shiyin looked at Young Master Xiaoyao.","“Are you saying that once this Heavenly Sword Marquis uses his trump card, master will be no match for him?” Young Master Xiaoyao was startled.","“Yes, not only is he no match for him, I’m afraid Lord Mansion Master will have to worry about his own life in the hands of this Heavenly Sword Marquis,” Master Shiyin said seriously.","“What? This Heavenly Sword Marquis...can threaten master’s life?” Young Master Xiaoyao was completely stunned.","“Don’t doubt it. If I’m not wrong, Lord Mansion Master also knows this. That’s why he voluntarily admitted defeat and didn’t continue fighting with Heavenly Sword Marquis. Once he forces Heavenly Sword Marquis to use his trump card, the outcome would be unimaginable even to Lord Mansion Master.”","Master Shiyin said.","“It’s like this.” Young Master Xiaoyao finally understood.","But when he knew the cause and effect, he felt even more upset.","Because more than 400 years ago in the Blood Wave Realm, Jian Wushuang was on the same level as him, and they even fought face-to-face.","But in the blink of an eye, in less than 400 years, his opponent had reached the point where even his master feared him and dared not force him to use his trump card.","The gap between them was too big.","Jian Wushuang knew why Marquis Xiaoyao had admitted defeat. However, he had already fought with Marquis Xiaoyao and forced him to use all of his strength. The battle was enjoyable, he did not have any regrets, so he did not want to continue fighting.","“Marquis Xiaoyao, since you have lost this battle, then according to what I said before, no matter what opportunities or treasures there are in the mystic realm of heaven and earth, my Temporal Temple will take 80% of them, while your Xiaoyao Mansion will only take 20%. Moreover, in the secret land of","heaven and earth, the experts of your Xiaoyao Mansion will have to listen to the arrangement of my Temporal Temple,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","“Sure.” Marquis Xiaoyao was very straightforward and did not care about anything else.","“Alright, let your people move aside first. Let our people open the secret realm first. Then we will each send a group of experts to enter the secret realm together,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Marquis Xiaoyao nodded.","But at this time, Master Shiyin walked up. “Mansion Master, Mr. Heavenly Marquis, this secret realm is very unique. We’ve already tried it and even asked several Principles Masters to join hands, but they can’t really open it. I wonder if you have any ideas, Mr. Heavenly Marquis?”","“Humph, do you think this secret realm can be opened as long as a few Principles Masters join hands?” Jian Wushuang sneered and then glanced behind him. “Duan Lang, take out the token..”"]},{"number":3357,"title":"Chapter 3357 - Entering the Secret Realm of Heaven and Earth","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Duan Lang immediately stepped forward and handed the token to Jian Wushuang.","“There really is a token.” Master Shiyin glanced at the token and sighed.","He had guessed that to enter the secret realm of heaven and earth, there should be a token to guide them. Moreover, the token should have been found by the Immortal Saints who had discovered the secret realm of heaven and earth, but unfortunately, he knew too late.","If they had known that Duan Lang and the others had tokens, they would not have let them go so easily. They would have found a way to get the tokens and immediately opened the secret realm to enter, by the time Jian Wushuang and the patrol team arrived, the opportunity treasures in the secret realm","would have fallen into their hands, and the initiative would be in their hands.","Unfortunately, because of the difference of one step, they could only enter the secret land of heaven and earth with the experts of the Temporal Temple. Even if there were a mountain of treasures and opportunities inside, they could only get 20%, they had to listen to Jian Wushuang’s arrangements.","“The secret realm of heaven and earth is not big. You and I don’t need so many experts to enter. Each of us can choose a few people to enter,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s fine. Besides you, Shiyin, and I, there are four other Principles Masters in the Xiaoyao Mansion. A total of six people will enter,” Marquis Xiaoyao said.","“As for the Temporal Temple...” Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment, then he ordered, “Zhen Tong, you and Master Si Ye will lead the soldiers to hold back. The other Principles Masters will follow me into the secret realm of heaven and earth.”","“Yes.” Zhen Tong and Master Si Ye immediately nodded respectfully.","They asked Zhen Tong and Master Si Ye to hold back in order to prevent any unnecessary changes.","As for the secret realm, there might be some dangers, but they should be able to deal with it with their current strength.","“Duan Lang, Yue Yu.” Jian wushuang looked at them again. “You guys found the secret realm of heaven and earth first, so you should be the first to explore it. But for some reasons, you can’t go in now. But you can rest assured that if we find the treasures left by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the secret","realm of heaven and earth, or if we get a lot of opportunities and treasures, we will give you a portion according to a certain ratio!”","“Okay.” Duan Lang nodded.","“Haha, I hope there really are treasures left by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the secret realm of heaven and earth. Then we will make a fortune.” Yue Yu also smiled.","They had no objection to Jian Wushuang’s decision, and they had long been mentally prepared.","This was the way the Temporal Temple operated. If the experts under them obtained opportunities or treasures with their own power, they would naturally own them. However, if they did not get them by themselves...if they had borrowed the Temporal Temple’s power, then these treasures and fortuitous","encounters would definitely belong to the Temporal Temple. After that, the Temporal Temple would share a portion of the treasures and fortuitous encounters with these experts according to what they had done.","This time, although Duan Lang, Yue Yu, and the others had found this secret realm of heaven and earth, they had carelessly allowed the Xiaoyao Mansion to intervene. Thus, they could only let the Temporal Temple step in. As for the Temporal Temple...they could only get some opportunities or treasures","based on their contributions.","As for whether they could enter the heaven and earth secret realm, they did not care too much. As long as they could get a part of it, they would not have to make a wasted trip.","After deciding on the experts to enter, Jian Wushuang immediately ordered people to open the heaven and earth secret realm.","Previously, without the token, several Principles Masters of the Xiaoyao Mansion could not do anything to the heaven and earth secret realm. But now, because of the token, the Temporal Temple only sent three Principles Masters, they easily opened the secret realm, and a space passage that could allow","several people to enter at the same time appeared in front of them.","As soon as the space passage appeared, an extremely ancient aura spread out from it.","However, judging from the aura, the secret realm had existed for a long time. It was obviously left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect.","“Let’s go in!”","Jian Wushuang led his eight Principles Masters, including Sword Dragon Master, and the six Principles Masters led by Marquis Xiaoyao to enter the secret realm almost at the same time.","The secret realm had existed since the Amethyst Demon Sect dominated the Second Heaven. Even though the Amethyst Demon Sect was later destroyed by the Flame Saint Realm, the secret realm was still preserved, it had been quiet for a long time, but today, the tranquility of the secret realm was finally","broken.","Buzz! A burst of light flashed, and more than ten figures stepped out of the spatial tunnel and appeared in the secret realm of heaven and earth.","As soon as they came to the secret realm of heaven and earth, Jian Wushuang and the others immediately looked around.","“What an ancient aura. Such an ancient aura can only be found when the Amethyst Demon Sect is still in the Second Heaven!” Sword Dragon Master said.","“Everyone in the Temporal Temple, have you noticed the difference between the secret realm and the Amethyst Fog Sea?” Marquis Xiaoyao looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","“Yes, I have. The Amethyst Fog Sea used to be the lair of the Amethyst Demon Sect. When the Flame Saint Realm attacked the Amethyst Fog Sea, it turned into ruins, It’s still a horrible scene. However, there’s no trace of a battle in the heaven and earth secret realm. On the contrary, it’s very peaceful. The","ground and the surrounding mountains are intact. Obviously, the battle didn’t affect the heaven and earth secret realm,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Not only was it left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect, but it was not affected by the war at all. This secret realm might be the place where the Amethyst Demon Sect has been hiding the treasures and opportunities.” Master Shiyin’s eyes became extremely hot.","“It might be the place where the treasures and opportunities are hidden, but the problem now is how to find them.” Marquis Xiaoyao smiled faintly and looked at Jian Wushuang again. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, how do you think we should find them?”","“This secret realm is not very big. Even if the Amethyst Demon Sect hides the treasures and opportunities in a deep place, we should be able to find them. At most, it will take us a little more time. Marquis Xiaoyao, according to the previous agreement, the experts of your Xiaoyao Mansion must always","listen to me in this secret realm. Now, I have decided that we should explore this secret realm together and find them slowly.” Jian Wushuang said with a smile."]},{"number":3358,"title":"Chapter 3358 - Searching","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the secret realm of heaven and earth, a group of 15 people from the Temporal Temple and the Xiaoyao Mansion were wandering around.","The secret realm of heaven and earth was not big. Soon, Jian Wushuang and the others arrived at its core. There were many palaces and pavilions standing there. These palaces and pavilions were quite majestic, obviously, they were not something that ordinary small sects could have.","“The treasures left by the Amethyst Demon Sect are probably hidden in these palaces and pavilions. Let’s take our time to find them.” Jian Wushuang smiled and the group immediately began to search carefully in the palaces and pavilions.","comment","Time passed, and more than half a day passed ina flash.","They had searched all the palaces and pavilions in the secret realm, but they did not find any treasures.","“How could it be?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Is the treasure not hidden in the palaces and pavilions, but somewhere else in the secret realm? Or is there no treasure opportunity left by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the secret realm?” Sword Dragon Master said.","“No, it’s too early to tell, Maybe the treasure is hidden here, but it’s hidden so well that we didn’t find it. Let’s search again,” Jian Wushuang said.","The people of the Xiaoyao Mansion, including Marquis Xiaoyao, did not have any objections.","Soon, they searched the palace again. This time, they searched more carefully. It could be said that they searched the entire palace, but they still found nothing.","“It seems that even if there is treasure left by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the secret land, it must be hidden very well. If we continue to search like this, it’s probably useless, Why don’t we spread out and search?” Marquis Xiaoyao suggested.","“Spread out?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then smiled. “Yes, but there’s no need to spread out too much. How about this, the experts of the Temporal Temple and your Marquis Xiaoyao each send a team of two to search. That way, even if we find the treasure, we can share it fairly, right?”","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Marquis Xiaoyao’s expression did not change, but his heart jumped.","He actually hoped that the experts from both sides could split up to search for the treasure. In this way, if his people were lucky enough to get the treasure, they could say that they did not get it, and Jian Wushuang would not be able to explore it, they had a chance to take the treasure for themselves.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang had already seen through his plan, so he said that they would move in pairs. Moreover, both sides would send one person each. In terms of the number of people on both sides, the Temporal Temple would have a few more people, in this way, the Temporal Temple would have a","chance to secretly occupy the treasures they found.","After Jian Wushuang made his decision, the experts from both sides quickly began to work in pairs to search the secret land of heaven and earth.","As the leader, Jian Wushuang, of course, was with Marquis Xiaoyao. The two of them also searched the secret land of heaven and earth.","However, even though the group had been divided into several groups and the efficiency of the search was much higher than before, they still could not find anything after searching.","Time passed, and soon, Jian Wushuang and the others had entered the secret land of heaven and earth for a day.","Ina magnificent palace, two rule masters stood in the middle and carefully observed the surroundings.","One of the two Principles Masters was Master Tianfu from the Temporal Temple, and the other was Master Xue Yi from the Xiaoyao Mansion.","“We’ve been to this palace several times, but we didn’t find anything before. It seems that we can’t find anything this time,” Master Xue Yi said.","“Don’t be anxious. Keep looking carefully. We can’t tell if there are any special mechanisms or formations hidden in this palace. It’s just that we haven’t activated them yet,” Master Tianfu said.","Master Xue Yi shrugged and could only continue searching. The two of them also kept trying to move the decorative equipment in the palace to see if there were any mechanisms, but unfortunately, there was nothing.","The two of them could only sigh softly and leave the palace.","Just as they walked out of the palace, a gray stream of light suddenly flashed around them.","“Huh?” Master Tianfu narrowed his eyes. “Master Xue Yi, did you see a gray light just now?”","“Gray light? What gray light?” Master Xue Yi glanced at Master Tianfu. He and Master Tianfu had walked out of the palace at the same time, but he had indeed not seen any gray light just now.","“That’s not right. I clearly saw a gray light flash just now. Although it disappeared very quickly, there was definitely one.” Master Tianfu was incomparably certain.","“You really saw it?” Master Xue Yi’s expression also moved.","Master Tianfu was a dignified Principles Master. Of course, there was no way he could have seen anything wrong. Since he had seen the gray light just now, there was an 80% chance that he was right.","And just as the two of them were extremely puzzled.","‘The gray light lit up once again, and this time, it came directly in front of them.","“What is this?” Master Xue Yi’s expression immediately changed.","“Be careful!” Master Tianfu immediately shouted out.","Xiu!","‘That gray light carried an incomparable speed and impact force, instantly enveloping Master Tianfu and Master Xue Yi. The two of them had not even seen clearly what this gray light was, however, a terrifying might had already swept over.","Boom!","The peaceful heaven and earth secret realm suddenly let out a roar. It was like a sudden clap of thunder on flat ground, instantly exploding.","This terrifying roar was accompanied by a shocking might that spread wildly in all directions. At the first moment, it crushed some of the surrounding palaces and pavilions into powder. Even the entire heaven and earth secret realm was on the verge of collapsing under this terrifying might, it’s all falling","apart.","“What’s wrong?”","“What’s going on?”","“What a terrible power. Who is it?”","Many experts, including Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao, who were searching for treasures and opportunities in the secret land of heaven and earth, were shocked by this terrifying power. One by one, they soared into the sky, appear in the void, all eyes, all look to the source of that power.","However, when they took a look, they could only see the shocking might and energy that was crazily attacking, as well as the large waves of air that were stirred up by the might. They could not see anything else clearly. After a while, the might gradually depleted, only then did they see the void clearly.","They could see that the void, including the land, had already become a piece of trash. A huge pit appeared in everyone’s line of sight, and under the pit, one of Master Tianfu and Master Xue Yi stood there trembling, the other had already half-knelt down. Both of their faces were pale, and their auras were","completely dispirited. There was still blood spewing from their mouths under their feet.","This scene caused everyone’s pupils to constrict."]},{"number":3359,"title":"Chapter 3359 - Gray Shadow","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Master Tianfu!”","“Xue Yi!”","The experts of the Temporal Temple and Xiaoyao Mansion immediately rushed toward the pit at their fastest speed. In the blink of an eye, they had already appeared in front of Master Tianfu and Master Xue Yi.","“Xue Yi, what’s going on?* Marquis Xiaoyao asked with a frown.","“1, [don’t know,” Master Xue Yi said with a trace of fear.","“You don’t know?” Marquis Xiaoyao could not help being stunned.","comment","Asa Principles Master, he was injured to such an extent, but Master Xue Yi did not know what had happened?","“Master Tianfu.” Jian Wushuang looked at Master Tianfu.","In terms of strength, Master Tianfu had already reached the peak of the void second realm, which was slightly stronger than Master Xue Yi.","‘It’s a gray streamer,” Master Tianfu said in a low voice.","“A gray streamer?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Master Xue Yi and I were searching in a palace, but we didn’t find any trace of it. When we walked out of the palace, I immediately sawa gray streamer flash around us. I was already alert at that time, but then the gray streamer appeared again and directly rushed toward us. You’ve all seen what happened","next,” Master Tianfu said.","Jian Wushuang’s expression immediately turned grave when he heard Master Tianfu’s words.","“mn other words, you didnt see clearly what the gray light was?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Master Tianfu nodded. “I could barely see that the flowing light was a light shadow, but I couldn’t see clearly what the time was.”","“How could an expert at the peak of the second void realm be injured so badly before he could even see his opponent?” Marquis Xiaoyao’s face darkened, and he looked at Jian Wushuang. ‘It seems that the secret realm is not as simple as we thought.”","“Well, I thought that the secret realm was just a place for the Amethyst Demon Sect to hide treasures. But now it seems that there is a high chance that it is a place for treasures. However, there must be a lot of dangers in this place. For example, the gray shadow just now might be a method left behind by the","Amethyst Demon Sect to guard the treasure. It might be a special puppet fighter or a sect-guarding exotic beast,” Jian Wushuang said.","The first thing Jian Wushuang thought of when he heard about the gray shadow was puppet fighters or exotic beasts, but he did not think of human cultivators. After all, the secret realm of heaven and earth had existed for a long time, the secret realm of heaven and earth had not been opened for a long time.","Ifa human cultivator was really in the secret realm of heaven and earth, he would not have been alone for so many years.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what should we do next? Do we continue to search?” Marquis Xiaoyao asked.","“Yes, of course!” Jian Wushuang smiled. “We didn’t find any trace of treasure after searching. I almost thought that this secret realm might not be the treasure place of the Amethyst Demon Sect, but just an ordinary secret realm. But because of the appearance of this gray shadow, I think this secret realm is","not simple.”","“Right now, Iam almost certain that the secret realm of heaven and earth has something left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect!","“Since there is a treasure, of course, we have to continue searching, Just like before, we will continue searching in pairs. However, when we are searching, we have to be careful. We have to be wary of the gray figure’s attack. Also...”","“Marquis Xiaoyao, there is no need for us to continue searching. We will stay in the central area of this building complex and observe the surrounding movements. Once we see the gray figure appear again, we will immediately take action!”","Okay.” Marquis Xiaoyao nodded heavily. He was now certain that the secret realm of heaven and earth was the treasure place of the Amethyst Demon Sect.","Jian Wushuang’s arrangement was very reasonable.","He asked the others to continue searching for the treasure in the complex. As the strongest, the two of them stood in the center of the complex to deal with the possible changes. Once the gray figure appeared again...they would be able to detect it immediately.","Immediately, the Principles Masters of both sides continued to search carefully in the surrounding buildings.","Because of their serious injuries and the sharp decline in their strength, Master Tianfu and Master Xue Yi did not continue searching. Instead, they stayed with Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao and kept an eye on the situation around them.","An hour later...","In the void not far away from Jian Wushuang, the gray streamer appeared again without any warning.","Although the gray streamer appeared very suddenly, Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao noticed it immediately.","“It’s there!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a fierce light as he instantly locked onto the gray streamer.","However, the gray flowing light under his gaze was too fast!","It was so fast that Jian Wushuang did not even have time to give any warning. The gray flowing light was no longer hindered in the slightest as it directly charged toward the two Principles Masters who were searching around. The strength of the two Principles Masters was relatively average, even though","the two of them had been on guard against the gray flowing light because of the lessons they had learned from Master Tianfu and Master Xue Yi, they still did not manage to block it in time.","Boom!","Another earth-shaking, terrifying boom swept across the area.","‘When Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao entered the area, the gray flowing light had already disappeared, and the two Principles Masters who had been hit by the flowing light had also been severely injured!","“Damn it!”","Looking at the two Principles Masters who seemed to be even more miserable than Master Tianfu and Master Xue Yi, Jian Wushuang’s face turned very ugly.","‘It’s too fast. The gray flowing light just now was too fast. It was so fast that even you and I didn’t have time to react. What’s more, we still couldn’t see clearly what it was!” Marquis Xiaoyao also said in a low voice.","Yes, although the two of them had noticed the appearance of the gray flowing light and looked over immediately, they still could not figure out what it was. They still did not know what the gray light shadow was.","“The gray light is hidden too well. It’s hiding right beside us, but we can’t find it at all. Even the Principles Masters, who are best at soul perception, can’t seem to catch the existence of the gray light,” Marquis Xiaoyao said seriously.","‘It’s really troublesome. If we want to continue searching for the treasure, we must find a way to find the gray light first. Otherwise, if we let it be around us, our Principles Masters will be too dangerous.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold."]},{"number":3360,"title":"Chapter 3360 - Space-Time Prison","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao were not afraid of the gray light shadow. After all, they were powerful, so the gray light shadow should not be able to threaten them. However, most of the Principles Masters under them were only in the second realm of the void, they could not face the gray light shadow.","Four Principles Masters had been seriously injured. If they let the gray light shadow continue, more Principles Masters would be injured.","“The gray light shadow was too fast and did not have any aura or power. We could not sense its existence. It was just like the shadowless escape art You mastered,” Marquis Xiaoyao said.","“Shadowless escape skill?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he nodded secretly.","Indeed, his shadowless escape skill was hidden in the surrounding void and could hide from the soul detection of the cultivators, but because his mastery of the shadowless escape skill was only in the profound realm, therefore, he couldn’t hide it from Marquis Xiaoyao, who had already reached the peak of","the fourth realm of the void.","But the gray shadow could even hide from Marquis Xiaoyao.","It was hidden in the secret realm of heaven and earth, but no one knew where it was.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you have mastered the shadowless escape technique, so you should know more about this concealment method. Do you have a way to find the gray light shadow now?” Marquis Xiaoyao asked.","“Tm not sure, but I can try.” Jian Wushuang focused his eyes, and a large amount of the power of space-time principles had gathered in his body.","In the blink of an eye, the power of space-time principles gathered in his body had reached an astonishing level.","“space-time principles?” Marquis Xiaoyao looked at him in surprise. “To find the gray figure, you should find a way to improve your soul perception. What use can you use the space-time principles now?”","‘Just watch.’ Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. Then he stretched out his right hand and made a strange cut in the void in front of him.","‘One finger drawing the sky, space-time prison!”","Buzz! With that simple stroke, the power of the space-time principles gathered in Jian Wushuang’s body suddenly surged up and swept out in all directions like a wave. In just a moment, it covered the entire secret realm of heaven and earth.","“This is...","When Marquis Xiaoyao saw the power of the space-time principles around him, his pupils suddenly shrank. “Space-time imprisonment, this is space-time imprisonment!”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you have mastered space-time imprisonment? How is that possible? When I fought with you, your application of space-time principles clearly did not reach this level?” Marquis Xiaoyao looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“Haha, Marquis Xiaoyao, there are many things you don’t know.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","His application of space-time principles indeed did not reach the level of space-time imprisonment. It was still at the level of space-time conversion. Under normal circumstances, he could not use space-time imprisonment.","However, Jian Wushuang could use the power of the treasure even though he could not use it by himself.","For example, he was using the golden sky-painting flag given to him by the Temporal Temple Master!","The golden sky-painting flag was a top-notch treasure in space-time. It could be very useful in the hands of experts who were proficient in space-time principles. For example, back on Saha Island, Green Rock Master had used the golden sky-painting flag to cast time and space imprisonment, which","prevented many powerful Principles Masters in the Temporal Temple from breaking it.","Although Jian Wushuang could not use the principles of time and space as well as green rock master, he could still use the golden sky-painting flag to perform some tricks, especially since the golden sky-painting flag had some secret skills, Jian Wushuang had mastered the simplest of them, the space-time","prison, and he had already performed it.","“Although I don’t know why you can use the space-time imprisonment, what we need to do now is to find the gray shadow. If you completely imprison this space-time, you can only trap it in this space-time, but you still can’t find it?” Marquis Xiaoyao frowned and said.","‘If it’s just an ordinary space-time lock, it can only trap people. However, my space-time prison is different. Not only does it have the effect of space-time lock, but it also has a great space-time domain. In other words, this space-time will definitely be under my control. My space-time power can sweep","through every space-time wantonly. No matter how deep it is hidden, I can find it.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Wait a moment, I’m already looking for him.”","Upon hearing this, Marquis Xiaoyao’s heart was in turmoil. “This Heavenly Sword Marquis really has a lot of tricks up his sleeve.”","Marquis Xiaoyao looked at Jian Wushuang with a meaningful look. He knew that Jian Wushuang had a lot of tricks up his sleeve, so he chose not to continue fighting with Jian Wushuang. Instead, he chose to admit defeat, he had made a wise choice at that time.","After all, Jian Wushuang did not show any tricks in that battle, like in the space-time prison.","“I found it!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly lit up, and a smile appeared on his face. “You really hid it well. Unfortunately, no matter how well you hid it, you can’t escape from this space-time!”","“Marquis Xiaoyao, follow me!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice, but his figure instantly shot out.","Naturally, Marquis Xiaoyao immediately followed Jian Wushuang.","swish! Swish!","Two figures flashed at the same time, but in an instant, they appeared in front of an empty void.","“Here.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a fierce light. The Blood Mountain Sword behind him had already been drawn, and a brutal sword essence, with shocking power, instantly slashed toward the empty void.","As for Marquis Xiaoyao, although he did not see anything strange in the void in front of him, he followed Jian Wushuang and also pressed forward with his heavy sword.","The two sword shadows slashed toward the empty void almost at the same time. At first, there was indeed nothing in the void, but just as the two sword shadows were about to fall, a strange gray light suddenly appeared, then the gray light flashed and instantly collided with the two sword shadows.","Clang! Clang!","The sound of metal colliding rang out. Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao retreated almost at the same time.","“They pushed me and Marquis Xiaoyao back at the same time?” Jian Wushuang was quite surprised as he retreated.","After a while, he and Marquis Xiaoyao regained their balance, and their eyes immediately looked at the void in front of them.","Jian Wushuang had also sensed that after fighting with him and Marquis Xiaoyao, the gray shadow did not choose to hide again. Instead, it stood in the void."]},{"number":3361,"title":"Chapter 3361 - The Legacy","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","‘When the power completely dissipated, Jian Wushuang finally saw the other party clearly.","It was a disheveled old man with silver hair and tattered clothes, who looked like a beggar.","Although the disheveled old man did not emit any aura, when he stood there and appeared in everyone’s sight, they could still sense an extremely rich life aura from him.","In other words, this sloppy old man was not a puppet fighter, but a real life. He was actually a human cultivator!","“He is a cultivator?”","Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao looked at each other in shock.","At the beginning, when they knew about the existence of the gray light shadow, the first thing they thought of was the helmet or some special exotic beasts, but they did not expect that the other party was a human cultivator.","Because the secret realm of heaven and earth had existed for a long time, and it had been sealed all year round. If there were human cultivators, they would have left long ago, why would they stay here?","But now, they had miscalculated.","The sloppy old man who appeared in front of them was definitely a real human cultivator.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang stared at the sloppy old man in front of him and asked in a solemn voice.","“Who am I? It’s been a long time since anyone asked me this question. I’ve even forgotten who I am,” the sloppy old man said, his voice was extremely hoarse and a little stiff. It was obvious that he had not spoken for a long time.","“Have you forgotten who you are?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but he immediately understood that the sloppy old man must be an extremely ancient existence. It was very likely that he had been left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect, it had been at least hundreds of millions of years since then.","He had been alone in the secret land of heaven and earth for such a long time. He had been lonely for so many years. The sloppy old man had not lost his mind, let alone forgotten who he was, it had already been very impressive.","“Lord Ba Cang...” Jian Wushuang sent a message to Ba Cang immediately.","If the secret land of heaven and earth was closed, he could not communicate with the outside world. But now that the secret land of Heaven and earth had been opened, his communication with the outside world was not restricted. The reason why Jian Wushuang looked for Ba Cang, in order to get","information on the Amethyst Demon Sect.","Although the sloppy old man had forgotten who he was, Jian Wushuang guessed that he must be from the Amethyst Demon Sect. It was very likely that he was an expert in the Amethyst Demon Sect, he had survived the destruction of the Amethyst Demon Sect in the Flame Saint Realm and had stayed in","the secret realm of heaven and earth.","As long as he got information about the experts of the Amethyst Demon Sect, he should be able to know the identity of the sloppy old man.","As one of the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm, the Temporal Temple was the most ancient existence. It was much older than the Amethyst Demon Sect. When the Amethyst Demon Sect dominated the Second Heaven, the Temporal Temple had always been the overlord of the Divine","Beginning Realm. Naturally, the Temporal Temple had information about the experts of the Amethyst Demon Sect, but it would take some time to find all of them.","“You’re very good.” The sloppy elder suddenly glanced at Jian Wushuang. “It’s rare for a saint to find me, but unfortunately, you can’t come to this place. Leave.”","The sloppy elder’s voice was cold, as if he was asking them to leave.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly, while Marquis Xiaoyao, who was standing beside him, said in a low voice, he said in a low voice, “Your Excellency, although I don’t know your true identity, I think you must be someone left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect. If I’m not wrong, you’re here to","protect the treasure left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect, right?”","“It’s been almost 200 million years since the Amethyst Demon Sect was destroyed. The experts left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect have all died except for you. There’s no possibility of them rising again. And this treasure is useless to you, who has become a lone wolf. Why don’t you help us and give","us the treasure?”","Hearing this, the sloppy old man’s eyes darkened.","He had indeed forgotten his name and identity, but he still remembered his mission.","His mission was to stay here and guard this place, to protect the final hope of the Amethyst Demon Sect’s rise.","Marquis Xiaoyao was right. The many treasures and opportunities left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect were indeed hidden in this secret realm. He was the guardian of these treasures and opportunities. He had waited for so many years...he had waited for the experts left behind by the Amethyst","Demon Sect to come with the tokens. Then, he would use these treasures and opportunities to rise again in the Divine Beginning Realm.","Unfortunately, after waiting for nearly 200 million years, not a single person had come to this secret realm of heaven and earth.","Until now, someone had finally used the tokens to open the secret realm of heaven and earth. However, under the observation of these Principles Masters, this sloppy old man had long known that the other party had nothing to do with the Amethyst Demon Sect, that was why he did not immediately","show himself.","But now...","“Are all the seeds left in the sect dead?” The sloppy old man looked up at the void and muttered to himself.","“Of course they are dead. Otherwise, why would no one come here to look for you? How could that token fall into our hands?” Marquis Xiaoyao sneered.","“Your Excellency, a wise man submits to circumstances. Your Amethyst Demon Sect has already lost the possibility of rising again. Moreover, with the Flame Saint Realm around, even if your Amethyst Demon Sect still has some experts left behind, it is impossible for you to re-establish the Amethyst","Demon Sect. Therefore, it is better for you to hand over that treasure. This way, we will forget about the matter of you seriously injuring the four of us Principles Masters. Otherwise...” Marquis Xiaoyao’s eyes were filled with annoyance and coldness.","“So what if you don’t? I didn’t blame you for barging in here, and I was even willing to let you leave. What a joke that you still dare to threaten me. You’re really courting death!” The sloppy old man’s gaze turned cold.","“Since you’re not willing to leave, then you can stay here forever to accompany me.”","As soon as the sloppy old man finished speaking, an extremely terrifying aura instantly appeared. It was as if a giant dragon that had been slumbering for billions of years had suddenly awakened.","This aura was earth-shaking and immediately swept out and suppressed the entire area.","In the secret realm of heaven and earth, there were more than a dozen Principles Masters from both the Temporal Temple and the Xiaoyao Mansion, including Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao, who were experts in the void realm. But at this moment...under the pressure of this sudden burst of aura,","almost everyone felt a sense of fear from the depths of their souls."]},{"number":3362,"title":"Chapter 3362 - Demon Master Chen Huo","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Something’s wrong, be careful!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed when he felt the overwhelming aura from the sloppy old man.","Marquis Xiaoyao’s eyes darkened, but then a monstrous aura rose from his body. At the same time, a large amount of destructive and thunder principles power rose. At this moment, Marquis Xiaoyao...at a glance, he appeared just like a terrifying destructive thunder god.","“He is just an old fellow that has been left behind from the era of the Amethyst Demon Sect. Moreover, he has been trapped in this secret realm.” Marquis Xiaoyao did not have the slightest fear towards the sloppy old man. He knew...during the battle when the Amethyst Demon Sect was destroyed, the top","Principles Masters under the Amethyst Demon Sect had already been killed by the Flame Saint Realm. Even if there were some who remained, their strength would definitely not be that great.","Although nearly two hundred million years had passed since the battle, the sloppy old man had stayed in the secret realm and did not go out. He did not have the chance to gain experience or opportunities. Even if his strength had increased...it definitely would not have been much.","Furthermore, he had just met the sloppy old man. Although the sloppy old man had given him a lot of pressure, Marquis Xiaoyao did not think that his strength would be weaker than the sloppy old man.","“Kill, thunderbolt!”","Swoosh!","Following Marquis Xiaoyao’s shout, a flash of lightning suddenly shot out.","It was so fast that people could not see clearly. Most people could only see a flash of lightning across the sky.","However, Marquis Xiaoyao had already arrived in front of the sloppy old man. At the same time, he had raised the two-meter-long heavy sword high up. On the heavy sword, two extremely violent rules, destruction, and thunder, perfectly merged together, he slashed down with a bang!","The power of this sword could be said to be world-shaking!","Jian Wushuang was extremely familiar with this sword. Previously, when he was fighting with Marquis Xiaoyao, Marquis Xiaoyao had used this sword to completely crush him in terms of power.","This was Marquis Xiaoyao’s strongest sword, and its power had almost reached the limit of an expert of the void fourth realm.","However, in the face of such a powerful sword strike, a mocking expression appeared on the sloppy old man’s face. He did not make much of a move and merely waved his tattered sleeve, causing a thin and weak arm...like a blade, it directly hacked at the heavy sword.","“Get lost!”","The sloppy old man also shouted.","The heavy sword collided with the arm, and following a metallic sound, the heavy sword in Marquis Xiaoyao’s hand was instantly sent flying. However, that arm still carried a shocking might, it directly struck Marquis Xiaoyao’s divine body.","Marquis Xiaoyao’s body shook, and the defense on the surface of his body immediately collapsed. His divine body also suffered an unprecedented impact at this moment, his divine body actually directly collapsed at this moment.","This was not the end. At the same time that Marquis Xiaoyao’s divine body collapsed, a terrifying devouring power was wantonly devouring Marquis Xiaoyao’s divine power. In just an instant, more than 60% of Marquis Xiaoyao’s divine power was devoured.","‘Weng! Marquis Xiaoyao’s immortal body was activated immediately. By using up the remaining divine power, his body was finally reassembled. However, after reassembling, his aura was extremely weak. His divine power...was only left with less than 20%!","“Run!”","After reassembling his divine body, Marquis Xiaoyao did not hesitate at all. He frantically fled to the side, pulling away from the sloppy old man.","As he fled, his face was also filled with unprecedented horror!","One move!","In just one move, he had defeated his most powerful ultimate skill and destroyed his divine body, causing him to lose more than 80% of his divine power in an instant!","Such strength...was too terrifying!","‘The numerous Principles Masters from the Temporal Temple and Xiaoyao Mansion, who were also in the secret realm of heaven and earth, was completely stunned by the scene before them.","Who was Marquis Xiaoyao?","He was the Mansion Master of the Xiaoyao Mansion. Although there were more than ten Principles Masters present, Marquis Xiaoyao was definitely the most powerful one apart from Jian Wushuang. Moreover, the Xiaoyao Mansion was good at fighting head-on, he had mastered the two violent","principles powers of destruction and thunder at the same time. Moreover, he had perfectly combined them together with an absolute art to unleash the most powerful attack. Even Jian Wushuang felt inferior to him.","But now, his most powerful attack was so weak in front of the sloppy old man?","“How is this possible?!”","“The Mansion Master’s divine body was destroyed in one move, and he lost so much divine power. Does this mean that he can kill the Mansion Master if he attacks again?”","“This man’s strength is so terrifying!”","Terrifying!","These two words appeared in everyone’s hearts.","And the many Principles Masters present looked at the sloppy old man with eyes filled with terror.","At the same time, they all understood that this sloppy old man probably did not have any intention of killing them, so he only attacked to teach them a lesson, give them a warning, and let them leave, otherwise, the four Principles Masters who had been severely injured by him would not have survived.","But now, the sloppy old man had shown up, and because of what Marquis Xiaoyao had said, he had clearly intended to kill them!","On the other side, while he was shocked by the sloppy old man’s strength, Jian Wushuang finally recognized him from the information provided by the Temporal Temple.","“Chen Huo!”","“You are the genius elder of the Amethyst Demon Sect, Demon Master Chen Huo!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice echoed in the secret realm.","Hearing the name of Demon Master Chen Huo, the rule masters felt that he was a stranger. The Amethyst Demon Sect was too far away from the current era, and the Principles Master was no longer active in the Divine Beginning Realm, they had long been forgotten by the world.","Of course, they did not know who the Demon Master Chen Huo was.","However, as the Mansion Master of Xiaoyao Mansion, Marquis Xiaoyao, who had also lived for a relatively long time, had heard of the Demon Master Chen Huo.","“Demon Master Chen Huo? Is He that genius elder from the Amethyst Demon Sect who broke through to the Principles Master Realm in less than 100,000 years and reached the fourth level of the void realm in 300,000 years?” Marquis Xiaoyao’s eyes were also filled with shock. “How is this possible?","Shouldn’t this Demon Master Chen Huo have been killed by the experts of the Flame Saint Realm during that battle?”","Marquis Xiaoyao did not know.","During the battle that destroyed the Amethyst Demon Sect, many of the top experts of the Amethyst Demon Sect were killed, including more than 90% of the Principles Masters. However, there were also some who were lucky enough to survive. For example, this Demon Master Chen Huo...because of","some reasons, he had been staying in the secret realm of heaven and earth and had not participated in the battle. Of course, the Flame Saint Realm had not been able to kill him.","However, the Flame Saint Realm had not announced it to the public, so everyone thought that this genius elder had also died in that battle. However, that was not the case.."]},{"number":3363,"title":"Chapter 3363 - Genius Elder","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Demon Master Chen Huo?”","After Jian Wushuang said the name of the sloppy old man, the sloppy old man fell into deep thought.","“Demon Master Chen Huo... It’s so familiar, so familiar. Yes, yes, that’s my name, I’m Demon Master Chen Huo!” The sloppy old man’s eyes flashed with a fierce light, after thinking of his name, a large amount of memories and thoughts flooded in.","After all, Demon Master Chen Huo was a powerful Principles Master. It was only because he had waited for so long in this secret realm of heaven and earth that he gradually forgot himself and began to forget everything, however, these things that he forgot would form memories that would remain in his","mind.","As long as he was reminded, these memories would be recalled one by one.","“Tam the Amethyst Demon Sect’s Demon Master Chen Huo. That is my root. When I was young, master had led me into the Demon Sect and taught me with great care. I did well. In less than 100,000 years, I broke through to become the Principles Master and became the number one genius of the","Amethyst Demon Sect. In the following 200,000 years, I made a name for myself in the Divine Beginning Realm, letting everyone in the Divine Beginning Realm know my name, Demon Master Chen Huo!”","“My master is also very pleased with my achievements. The elders in the sect, the Sect Master, are also full of expectations for me. As long as I improve my strength, the overall strength of the Amethyst Demon Sect will be able to completely surpass those great sects in Third Heaven.”","“Originally, everything was developing in a good direction. However, one day, a disaster arrived!”","“The Flame Saint Realm is the Flame Saint Realm!”","“They attacked our Amethyst Demon Sect and massacred our experts. My master, the sect master, and many top experts of our purple star demon sect were annihilated in that battle. Among the many elders, I was the only one who brought the final hope of the Amethyst Demon Sect’s rise to power. I lay","dormant in this secret realm of heaven and earth...”","“Flame Saint Realm! Damned Flame Saint Realm!”","“A bunch of trash, they all deserve to die!”","The sloppy old man, who was the Demon Master Chen Huo, had a look of delight on his face when he spoke at the beginning. However, as he spoke, his voice became more and more impassioned, and his face became redder and redder. In the end, his eyes turned scarlet, he became completely crazed!","“Kill, Kill!”","“People from the Flame Saint Realm deserve to die!”","Boom!","A world-shaking killing intent crazily burst out of Demon Master Chen Huo.","The aura emitted by Demon Master Chen Huo reached a new level at this moment. This level was enough to make experts like Marquis Xiaoyao and Jian Wushuang tremble in fear.","“Oh no!”","“This Demon Master is completely crazy!”","“He has been alone in the secret land of heaven and earth for nearly 200 million years. It’s fine if he forgot his memory before, but now that he remembered it with a towering hatred, it’s no wonder he’s crazy!”","Jian Wushuang’s face was unsightly. At this moment, he saw the crazy Demon Master suddenly let out a roar. The roar shook the sky and tore the void in an instant, forming a terrifying shock wave, it swept wildly in all directions.","“Just a roar, and it tore through space?” Jian Wushuang was shocked, but he immediately shouted, “Be careful, retreat quickly!”","In fact, without Jian Wushuang’s reminder, the experts from both the Temporal Temple and the Xiaoyao Mansion had already retreated far away when they saw Demon Master sunk into madness and recalled his terrifying strength.","They stood in the distance and watched in horror as the shock wave created by Demon Master Chen Huo’s roar shattered many palaces and pavilions in the secret realm of heaven and earth and razed the entire building complex to the ground.","“What’s wrong with Demon Master Chen Huo? It’s fine that he’s mad, but how could he be so powerful?” Marquis Xiaoyao was the most terrified among them. He had fled to the edge of the secret realm of heaven and earth, he looked at the Demon Master from afar.","As for Jian Wushuang, he was not far away from Marquis Xiaoyao, and his face was very solemn. “According to the information, when the Flame Saint Realm destroyed the Amethyst Demon Sect, Demon Master Chen Huo was only a rule master of the void four realms. At most, he was at the peak of the","void four realms. But now, the strength he displayed...”","He had injured Marquis Xiaoyao in one move and almost killed him.","With a roar, he shattered the void.","Even experts at the peak of the five void realms or even the five void realms could not achieve such terrifying strength.","Obviously, the strength of this Demon Master was at least at the level of the six void realms. As for what level he was at among the six void realms, it was unknown. However, Jian Wushuang guessed that...the Demon Master must be very strong among the six realms of the void!","It was quite normal for him to advance from the peak of the fourth realm of the void to the sixth realm of the void in nearly 200 million years.","However, don’t forget the environment that Demon Master was in!","He had been staying in this secret realm of heaven and earth and was completely isolated from the outside world. There were no opportunities, no experiences, and he could not even interact with anyone. There was only boredom and loneliness.","In such an environment, ordinary people would have long gone mad, not to mention trying to find ways to improve their strength.","Moreover, even if he could stabilize his mind and cultivate, he could still improve his strength very slowly by immersing himself in cultivation and not having any contact with the outside world, once he encountered a bottleneck, he might be trapped there and could not improve at all.","For example, although Jian Wushuang occasionally went into closed-door cultivation, he would not stay in it for too long because he knew that blindly cultivating in closed-door cultivation was far from being comparable to his adventures outside.","And this Demon Master Chen Huo had stayed in such a crazy environment for nearly 200 million years, yet his strength could still increase so much. It was indeed impressive.","“A genius elder is indeed a genius!” Jian Wushuang secretly exclaimed.","In the era when the Amethyst Demon Sect was still in existence, the Demon Master Chen Huo’s talent could not be compared with his perfect life, but it was still very impressive. He became a Principles Master in less than 100,000 years, he reached the fourth void realm in less than 300,000 years.","Such a speed of improvement could make countless top geniuses in the Divine Beginning Realm look up to him.","“However, this genius elder is a bit tricky now.” Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the crazy Demon Master in the void in front of him.","‘The eyes of the Demon Master were scarlet and filled with shocking killing intent. It seemed that he wanted to kill everyone here, and he really had such strength.","“Tt seems that I have to find a way to calm him down first.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly."]},{"number":3364,"title":"Chapter 3364 - Persuasion (Part One)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“All of you should die!”","Demon Master Chen Huo was completely mad. At this moment, he was like a peerless ferocious beast from ancient times. His body suddenly flashed, and no one had the time to react, he had already appeared in front of the nearest Principles Master from Xiaoyao Mansion. Then, his right hand struck out","like lightning, directly piercing through the god body of that Principles Master, and the strange power contained in that palm...almost instantly, all the divine power of the Principles Master in the second realm of the void realm was destroyed.","In the blink of an eye, the Principles Master of the Xiaoyao Mansion had died.","“Thi:","The other Principles Masters around were shocked when they saw this scene.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, immediately made his move...","“Paint the ground as a prison, space-time binding!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and the vast power of space-time principles that covered the surrounding area instantly covered Demon Master Chen Huo.","Space-time binding...was also a move in the space-time prison. It was used to restrict the opponent’s movements while completely confining the surrounding space-time.","However, when the space-time binding was applied to Demon Master, he only shook his body slightly and then broke free.","“As expected, my space-time binding, even with the help of the golden sky-painting flag, can only restrict an ordinary expert of the fifth void realm. It’s impossible to restrict an expert of the sixth void realm like Demon Master.” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","He had to find a way to stop Demon Master Chen Huo. Otherwise, if he continued to kill like this, there would be no one in the secret realm who could escape.","suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. He shouted at Demon Master Chen Huo, “Demon Master Chen Huo, your Amethyst Demon Sect has been destroyed. As a genius elder of the Amethyst Demon Sect, don’t you want to avenge the Amethyst Demon Sect?”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was loud and clear, echoing throughout the secret realm of heaven and earth. Of course, Demon Master Chen Huo heard it clearly, and his body suddenly stopped in the void. His scarlet eyes were filled with shocking killing intent, he suddenly looked at Jian Wushuang and asked,","“What did you say?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, he said in a low voice, “Demon Master Chen Huo, since you can control your body, it seems that you still have your rationality. I’m telling you now if you still have the slightest intention of avenging the Amethyst Demon Sect, then stop. But if you don’t have the intention","of avenging the Amethyst Demon Sect, then you can continue to kill.”","Demon Master Chen Huo was already standing there. His killing intent was still soaring, but the scarlet in his eyes slowly faded away. His earth-shaking aura also slowly faded away.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang also heaved a sigh of relief. “Has he finally stopped?”","Jian Wushuang was also very nervous. He did not know whether his words could make Demon Master Chen Huo stop. However, he could see that although Demon Master Chen Huo looked crazy, as a Principles Master of the six void realms, no matter how crazy he was...he should be able to maintain a","trace of rationality. Moreover, he valued the Amethyst Demon Sect so much, so his words should make Demon Master Chen Huo somewhat worried.","As expected, when Demon Master Chen Huo heard his words, although his killing intent did not weaken, he stopped killing for the time being.","“Boy, what do you mean by what you said just now?” Demon Master Chen Huo stared at Jian Wushuang with cold eyes.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, then he said, “Demon Master Chen Huo, I’ve made myself clear. If you kill all of us here, I guarantee you’ll lose your only chance to avenge your Amethyst Demon Sect!”","“Huh?” Demon Master Chen Huo’s pupils constricted slightly. He did not speak but listened to Jian Wushuang’s story.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, you should have already noticed that I’m not an expert under the command of the Flame Saint Realm. I’m from the Temporal Temple!” Jian Wushuang said.","“Temporal Temple?” Demon Master Chen Huo’s memories of the Temporal Temple immediately appeared in his mind, but his expression remained calm. “The Temporal Temple is indeed an ancient overlord. Even when the Amethyst Demon Sect was at its peak, we didn’t dare to provoke it. However...now","that the Amethyst Demon Sect has been destroyed, I’m the only one left. I’m not afraid of your Temporal Temple. Even if I kill all of your people here, what can the Temporal Temple do to me?”","The Demon Master Chen Huo was not conceited, but he did indeed have the ability to do so.","One had to know that he was now a super expert of the six states of the void. In the Divine Beginning Realm, unless the three great Saint Realm Masters or those few rulers personally took action, no one could do anything to him.","Although the Temporal Temple had a deep foundation and was powerful, under the circumstance that the Temporal Temple Master did not personally take action, they probably could not do anything to the Demon Master Chen Huo. After all, the Demon Master Chen Huo was not only terrifyingly","powerful...the Amethyst Demon Sect had long been destroyed, so there was nothing that could restrain or restrict him.","As the saying went, a bare-footed person was not afraid of wearing shoes. It was true that the Demon Master did not care about the Temporal Temple at the moment.","“Demon Master, with your current strength, the Temporal Temple is indeed unable to do anything to you. However, you have lived from the Amethyst Demon Sect’s era until now. You should know the position of the Temporal Temple. The Temporal Temple and the flame holy region have always been on","opposite sides. They have even been fighting for a long time. Although this kind of fight will not affect the status of the Flame Saint Realm, it will often cause pain to the Flame Saint Realm.”","“Besides, the person standing in front of you has the same hatred with the Flame Saint Realm as you do. He will not rest until one of us is dead!” Jian Wushuang said.","“The person standing in front of me? Are you talking about yourself?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes, it’s me.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Not only do I have a hatred with the Flame Saint Realm, but I also have a hatred with the other two Saint Realms. The three Saint Realms have risked their lives to kill me more than once or twice. It can be said that they and I are absolutely dead. There is no turning","back.”","“Hmph, kid, why didn’t you look in the mirror before you lied? Who do you think you are? However, for a mere Immortal Saint, if you were to say that you have a feud with the three great Saint Realms, this old man would believe you. However, you actually said that the three great Saint Realms had risked","everything to kill you multiple times... Hehe, if the three great Saint Realms really risked everything to kill you, would you still be alive? Who do you think you are?” Demon Master Chen Huo sneered.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, I’m not lying to you. The feud between me and the three Saint Realms, and the three Saint Realms have risked their lives to kill me many times, is known by everyone in the Divine Beginning Realm. You can go out and ask anyone,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.."]},{"number":3365,"title":"Chapter 3365 - Persuasion (Part Two)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is this kid really as he said? The three Saint Realms are willing to do anything to kill him?” Demon Master Chen Huo frowned.","At this moment, Marquis Xiaoyao, who had already escaped to the edge of the secret realm, hurriedly spoke, “Demon Master Chen Huo, What Heavenly Sword Marquis said is true. I have a mirror image of him fighting with the three Saint Realms. You can take a look.”","After saying that, Marquis Xiaoyao waved his hand and threw a mirror token at Demon Master Chen Huo.","Demon Master Chen Huo took the mirror token and began to read it.","The mirror token was the scene of Jian Wushuang fighting with the three Saint Realms on the Saha Island more than 400 years ago.","The battle was earth-shaking and there were many experts watching the battle. Naturally, someone recorded the scene with the mirror token. The mirror image had long been spread in the Divine Beginning Realm, Marquis Xiaoyao happened to have one in his hands.","Demon Master Chenhuo looked at the scene in the mirror token. At first, he was only surprised, but later, it completely turned into shock. In the end, even he was shocked.","“Boy, you are an Immortal Saint. How could you fight with the three Saint Realms and severely injure Saint Master Yan and Sorcerer God?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, you should believe me now.” Jian Wushuang said seriously, “As I said, I have been fighting with the three Saint Realms for a long time, including the Saint Realm of fire, which was responsible for the destruction of the Amethyst Demon Sect. The so-called enemy of the enemy is","a friend. “Demon Master Chen Huo, we should stand on the same side. If we fight, the Saint Realm of fire will be secretly happy.”","“You’re right.” Demon Master Chen Huo nodded slightly, and the killing intent in his body began to weaken. “Since you’re fighting with the Flame Saint Realm so fiercely, and you even heavily injured the Flame Saint Master, I won’t hold you responsible for breaking into the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm","and offending me. You can leave now.”","It was obvious that Demon Master Chen Huo had no intention to attack Jian Wushuang and the others.","In fact, he did not intend to kill Jian Wushuang and the others because he had held back before. It was only because Marquis Xiaoyao had angered him and he had just remembered the destruction of the Amethyst Demon Sect that he began to kill them.","But now, when he saw the mirror image of Jian Wushuang severely injuring Saint Master Yan, the anger in his heart had disappeared, and he even had a good impression of Jian Wushuang, After all, he hated Saint Master Yan to the bone, Jian Wushuang had severely injured Saint Master Yan, and he had","already vented his anger on him.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, don’t dismiss me yet. I think the two of us can have a good talk,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Talk about what?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked over.","“About what I said before, do you still have any thoughts of avenging the Amethyst Demon Sect?” Jian Wushuang asked.","A fierce light flashed in Demon Master’s eyes.","Jian Wushuang smiled and glanced at the Principles Masters around him. “I’ve asked the outsiders to reopen the secret realm. Leave and let me talk to Demon Master.”","“Yes.” The Principles Masters obeyed Jian Wushuang’s order.","As for Marquis Xiaoyao...he had come to the secret land of Heaven and Earth to obtain the treasures left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect. However, he did not obtain the treasures and opportunities. Instead, he was severely injured, moreover, a Principles Master of his Xiaoyao Mansion had been killed","by Demon Master Chen Huo. This made him extremely aggrieved and unwilling.","However, no matter how aggrieved and unwilling he was, once he thought of the terrifying strength of Demon Master Chen Huo, he could not think of anything else.","Shaking his head, Marquis Xiaoyao could only leave with the rest of the people from Xiaoyao Mansion.","In the blink of an eye, all the Principles Masters had left, leaving Jian Wushuang alone in the Secret Land of Heaven and Earth to look at Demon Master Chen Huo.","“Boy, you’re an Immortal Saint, but you can make so many Principles Masters obey you. You’re really capable,” Demon Master Chen Huo praised.","Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly.","“Alright, what do you want to say? Speak,” Demon Master Chen Huo said.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, you should have noticed that although I’m only an Immortal Saint, I’m...very special,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, “I can make Principles Masters obey me and be respectful to me. I can also kill ordinary Principles Masters. In the Great War 400 years ago, I was able to fight","the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God at the same time and severely injure them!”","“Yes!”","“Yes, you are special, or rather, heaven-defying!”","“When I was young, I was also called a peerless genius. But compared to you, I am nothing. But no matter how special you are or how talented you are, what does it have to do with me?” Demon Master Chen Huo said in a deep voice.","“Of course I care. Demon Master Chen Huo, as I said before, the three Saint Realms will do anything to kill me. This is no joke. More than 400 years ago, they set up an inescapable net to kill me. They even sent the three Saint Realm Masters and the Sorcerer God, who has the battle strength of a Saint","Realm Master, to kill me. It shows how much the three Saint Realms value me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Indeed. This is the first time I’ve heard of the three Saint Realms going all out to kill an Immortal Saint. Even a top Principles Master, or even some of the top sects in the Divine Beginning Realm, shouldn’t be able to make the three Saint Realms go through so much trouble, let alone an Immortal Saint.”","“Then do you know why the three Saint Realms are so desperate to kill me?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","Demon Master Chen Huo was stunned. Many thoughts appeared in his mind, but he quickly thought of the most likely possibility.","“As far as I know, the three Saint Realms have never been so desperate to deal with someone, but now they are dealing with you. Do the three Saint Realms think you can threaten their status?” Demon Master Chen Huo said with a serious expression, as he said this, he found it hard to believe.","How ancient were the three Saint Realms in the Divine Beginning Realm? And how powerful were they.","They had the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao. They were the true rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm. For a long time, no one had been able to subvert the notice of the three Saint Realms, even if it was the three Freedom Alliances...although the three Freedom Alliances were so powerful that even","the three Saint Realms feared them, no matter how powerful the three Saint Realms were, they could not threaten the status of the three Saint Realms.","Yet, a single cultivator, and he was just an Immortal Saint, was able to pose such a great threat to the three great Saint Realms?","Was this possible?"]},{"number":3366,"title":"Chapter 3366 - Persuasion (Part Three)","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You’re right. The reason why the three Saint Realms are so desperate to kill me is because I can threaten their position. To be more precise, I’m a great threat to the will of heaven behind them!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was low, “Demon Master Chen Huo, you should know that the will of the Heavenly Dao is behind the three Saint Realms. With the support of the will of the Heavenly Dao, it’s almost impossible to shake the position of the three Saint Realms. Even if you’re extremely talented and will","break through to the ruler level in the future, as long as the will of the Heavenly Dao exists, you’ll never be able to pose a real threat to the three Saint Realms!”","“But I can!”","Jian Wushuang spoke with absolute confidence.","‘What he said was the truth. In the Divine Beginning Realm, with the support of the will of the Heavenly Dao, almost no one could threaten the three saint realms.","Not even a master level expert.","For example, the three Freedom Alliances had a master level expert behind them, but they had been helpless against the three Saint Realms.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, I’m the only one in the Divine Beginning Realm who can pose a threat to the will of the Heavenly Dao. Although I’m still weak, given a certain amount of time, I can destroy the will of the Heavenly Dao and destroy the three Saint Realms at the same time. Your enemy happens to","be the Flame Saint Realm of the three Saint Realms, so... We can join forces,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Join hands? How?” Demon Master Chenhuo asked.","“As I said, what I need now is time, but the three Saint Realms will not let me grow like this. They will certainly try to hinder my growth and even fight to the death with some special means to kill me. At this time, of course, I need some help,” Jian Wushuang said.","Demon Master Chen Huo had clearly understood Jian Wushuang’s intention. “Boy, don’t tell me you want me to be your bodyguard?”","“Ican be considered a bodyguard, but to be exact, you and I are equal. You protect me so that I can continue to grow. When my strength reaches a certain level, I will destroy the Flame Saint Realm and avenge your Amethyst Demon Sect. How about it?” Jian Wushuang said.","Upon hearing this, Demon Master Chen Huo sneered, “Boy, do you want me to be by your side and be your guard? Putting aside whether you can really pose such a great threat to the will of the Heavenly Dao and the three Saint Realms, even if you can, who knows how long it will take. If you need tens of","millions of years, hundreds of millions of years, wouldn’t I have to guard you for so many years?”","“You want me to be your guard with just a few words? You’re dreaming.”","“Demon Master Chenhuo, you should already have an answer to whether I can threaten the will of heaven and the three Saint Realms in the future. As for the time required, it’s not as long as you think. I can guarantee that within 100,000 years, I will destroy the Flame Saint Realm. If I can’t do it, or if you","don’t see my progress in these 100,000 years and feel that there’s no hope, you can leave at any time!”","“100,000 years!” Jian Wushuang said.","“100,000 years?” Demon Master Chenhuo looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise. “You’re just an Immortal Saint now. How can you reach that level in just 100,000 years?”","“Tm confident.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","In fact, Jian Wushuang was not very confident.","Although 100,000 years was not a short time, it was very, very difficult for him to reach the point where he could threaten the will of the Heavenly Dao and shake the three Saint Realms. As for why Jian Wushuang was so confident...it was because he had learned from the Temporal Temple Master that the","three Saint Realms could invite outside help at the Overlord level.","According to his guess, if the three Saint Realms really invited outside help, then 100,000 years would have passed.","At that time, if he had not reached the stage where he could threaten the will of the Heavenly Dao and shake the three Saint Realms, then it would be the same with or without the protection of Demon Master Chen Huo.","Seeing the confidence on Jian Wushuang’s face, Demon Master Chen Huo began to ponder.","With this thought, Jian Wushuang saw that there was hope, he immediately continued, “Demon Master Chen Huo, if you are willing to join hands with me and follow me, I will find a way to make you a consecrator of my Temporal Temple. This consecrator is a special existence in the Temporal Temple. He","can disobey the orders of my Temporal Temple, but he can enjoy many of the benefits of my Temporal Temple, such as the Amethyst Demon Sect...”","“Although the Amethyst Demon Sect has been destroyed for so many years, there were still quite a number of people who survived that battle. Most of these experts who survived have probably died, but it’s not certain that no one left behind. Perhaps there are still experts left behind by the Amethyst","Demon Sect hiding in the Divine Beginning Realm. And if you become a consecrator of my Temporal Temple, you can ask my Temporal Temple to help find the traces of these people.”","“Although the intelligence ability of the Temporal Temple is not the best in the Divine Beginning Realm, it is still very good. As long as you give the order, the intelligence department can secretly find the people left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect without the Flame Saint Realm noticing it in","advance.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chen Huo again.","At this moment, Demon Master Chen Huo was already moved.","Indeed, just as Jian Wushuang said, he valued the Amethyst Demon Sect very much. Because of that, after the destruction of the Amethyst Demon Sect, he hated the Flame Saint Realm to the extreme. He wanted to avenge the Amethyst Demon Sect, he wanted to completely destroy the Flame Saint Realm,","and he wanted to kill the Flame Saint Master.","However, with his ability, it was very difficult for him to pose a threat to the Flame Saint Realm, let alone completely destroy it. Even if he was lucky enough to break through to the ruler level in the future, he was only qualified to be on equal footing with the Flame Saint Realm. With the power of the will","of heaven, it was still impossible for him to destroy the Flame Saint Realm.","But now, Jian Wushuang’s appearance gave him a glimmer of hope.","Although this hope seemed very small and strange, it was indeed the only chance for him to avenge the Amethyst Demon Sect.","Of course, he wanted to seize the last chance.","In addition, Jian Wushuang also said that he only needed to protect them for 100,000 years. If there was no hope within 100,000 years, he could leave at any time.","100,000 years...was insignificant to him, who had stayed in the secret land of heaven and earth for nearly 200 million years.","Moreover, the authority Jian Wushuang mentioned in the end made Demon Master Chen Huo even more tempted.","After hesitating for a long time, Demon Master Chen Huo finally nodded and said, “Okay, I agree!”"]},{"number":3367,"title":"Chapter 3367 - Guard","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed when he saw Demon Master Chen Huo agree!","Demon Master Chen Huo was a super expert of the six realms of the void, and he was once a genius elder with great talent. He was completely alone in this secret realm of heaven and earth without any experience, his strength had improved so much. One could imagine how fast he would improve if he","left the secret realm of heaven and earth and went to the Divine Beginning Realm to fight with experts.","Without a doubt, Demon Master Chen Huo was qualified to strive for the master level. However, such a super expert would stay by his side and be his guard for the next 100,000 years, how could jian Wushuang not be surprised?","“Boy, your name is Heavenly Sword Marquis, right?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked at Jian Wushuang again. “Don’t be happy too early. Let me be clear. Although I promised to stay by your side and be your guard for the next 100,000 years, all I have to do is to protect you. I may not help you with other","things.”","“Moreover, you are now highly valued by the three Saint Realms. The three Saint Realms will certainly try to kill you again. If I can handle it, I will help you. But if I can’t handle it and even my life is in danger, don’t blame me for running away.”","“Of course. Although you are my guard, you have an equal relationship with me. If I want you to do something for me, I will ask for your opinion in advance. If you don’t want to, I will not force you","ian Wushuang said with a smile.","He did not feel regretful. He knew that it was impossible for him to command Demon Master Chen Huo like an ordinary guard. However, as long as Demon Master Chen Huo agreed to protect him with all his strength, it was enough, not to mention anything else, a super expert of the sixth realm of the","Void was enough to intimidate his opponent.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, now that it’s settled, we’re on the same side. Can you tell me what level your strength has been in all these years?” Jian Wushuang suddenly asked.","He was indeed quite curious about the strength of Demon Master Chen Huo.","Through his previous attacks, although he knew that Demon Master Chen Huo had the battle strength of the sixth realm of the void, he did not know how powerful Demon Master Chen Huo was among the six realms of the void. He also had control over the specific power of his will, Jian Wushuang","wanted to have a certain understanding of the rules he comprehended.","“My strength should be at the peak of the Six Void Realms,” Demon Master Chen Huo said.","“The peak of the Six Void Realms?”","jan Wushuang was stunned.","Although the six void realms were at the same level, there was a huge gap in strength.","Temple Master Bai Xing and Star River Master could only be considered normal or average among the six void realms.","As for the four ancient immortals who had followed the Temporal Temple Master to sweep through the six realms, these four ancient existences were considered extremely powerful existences among the six realms of the void. They should be considered at the peak level.","As for those above the four ancient immortals, they were at the level of Elder Dark Bone.","Elder Dark Bone was someone who could fight against a Saint Realm Master. His strength could be said to have reached the peak among the six realms of the void!","As a peak existence among the six void realms, Demon Master Chenhuo was no weaker than old monster abyssal bone. However, he was no weaker than the four ancient immortals.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, since you are at the peak of the Six Void Realms, your comprehension of the principles...” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“Thave mastered the three principles of darkness, wind, and slaughter at the same time, and the three principles have been completely merged together. In addition, I have opened the secret realm of heaven and earth, so I naturally have mastered six portions of the power of the will. Now, I am still","focused on studying the principles of the Earth, and I have already comprehended most of them. I should be able to master the seventh portion of the power of the will in a short time. By then, I will be able to improve my strength and reach the peak of the six void realms!” Demon Master Chenhuo said,","“Demon Master Chenhuo said.","Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows.","The level of Principles Master was usually determined by the power of the will. However, because Principles Master was only in the six realms of the void, even if you had mastered seven parts of the power of the will, you could only be in the six realms of the void, however, it had already reached the peak.","Because if you integrated four principles at the same time, you would be at the ruler level.","For example, Elder Dark Bone had mastered seven parts of the power of will.","The gap between Demon Master Dark Bone and Master of the Earth principles was very small. This meant that he was very close to Elder Dark Bone.","“With such a powerful Principles Master as a guard, I really made a lot of money.” Jian Wushuang laughed in his heart, then he asked, “Demon Master Chen Huo, I entered the secret realm of heaven and earth for the opportunity treasures left by the Amethyst Demon Sect. You should know where they are,","right?”","“Of course I do. Those resources and treasures were accumulated by the Amethyst Demon Sect over a long period of time. They are in my hands. Do you want them?” Demon Master Chen Huo’s eyes were sharp, he stared at Jian Wushuang.","“You have them.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then he continued, “Don’t misunderstand. I’m not interested in this batch of treasures. I came here under orders. As for whether I can get this batch of treasures in the end, I don’t care too much. But...if possible, I hope you can find a few things that the Immortal","Saint can use or opportunities that can help him.”","“An opportunity or treasure that can help the Immortal Saint?” The Demon Master Chen Huo’s expression changed. “You’re also an Immortal Saint. Why do you want to use it for yourself?”","“Of course not. With my strength, I can’t use treasures or opportunities at the Immortal Saint Realm. However, I have a few Saint Realm friends outside the secret realm. They were the first to find the secret realm. I promised them that I would give them some opportunities,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Is that so?” Demon Master Chen Huo nodded slightly. “It’s just a few opportunities or treasures that the Immortal Saints can use. It doesn’t matter much. I can give you some so that you can share it with them.”","“Thank you very much.” Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","In fact, with his current status and the fact that he had killed many Principles Masters in the battle more than 400 years ago, he had a lot of resources and treasures, but the Immortal Saints could use very few of them, therefore, he could only ask the Demon Master Chenhuo for some.","After the two of them reached an agreement, they did not continue to stay in the secret realm. Instead, they left directly."]},{"number":3368,"title":"Chapter 3368 - Looking for Someone","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Amethyst Fog Sea, around the secret realm of heaven and earth, many sergeants of the patrol team and experts of the Xiaoyao Mansion were waiting quietly.","Suddenly, the void rippled, and a space passage appeared out of thin air. Then two figures stepped out of the space passage one after another.","Jian Wushuang was fine when he saw the two figures, but when the people around him saw Demon Master Chen Huo, they were all shocked, especially the Principles Masters who had entered the secret realm of Heaven and earth.","Previously in the secret realm of heaven and earth, they were completely shocked by the monstrous strength displayed by Demon Master Chen Huo. They were all filled with fear and fear towards him, now, seeing that Demon Master Chen Huo had actually walked out of the secret realm of heaven and","earth, they naturally could not calm down.","Jian Wushuang saw the gazes of the surrounding people and immediately smiled. “Everyone, don’t be too nervous. Demon Master Chen Huo is now one of us.”","“One of us?” Everyone was stunned.","Jian Wushuang did not explain too much. Instead, he looked directly at Marquis Xiaoyao who was beside him. “Marquis Xiaoyao, we were wrong. There are no opportunities or treasures in the secret land of heaven and earth, and our Temporal Temple did not get anything. Naturally, your trip to the","Xiaoyao Mansion will be in vain.”","Marquis Xiaoyao’s expression changed. He took a deep look at Jian Wushuang and then looked at Demon Master Chen Huo. Although he knew it was not that simple, he did not intend to pursue the matter any further.","“Let’s go!”","Marquis Xiaoyao waved his hand and left with the people of Xiaoyao Mansion.","After the people of Xiaoyao Mansion lett...","“Duan Lang, Yue Yu, this is for you. Take it and divide it among yourselves.” Jian Wushuang took out an interspatial ring and handed it to Duan Lang.","Duan Lang and Yue Yu looked at each other in bewilderment.","“Brother Heavenly Marquis, didn’t you say that you didn’t get the opportunity treasure left by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the secret realm?” Duan Lang asked.","“No, but I did get something else. It’s not a small gain. As the people who discovered the secret realm, you deserve it,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","It was true that he did not get the opportunity treasure left by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the secret realm, but he did get a helper at the peak of the Six Void Realms, which was more than enough for him, it was much more valuable than obtaining a lot of resources and treasures.","“Zhen Tong.” Jian Wushuang looked at Zhen Tong Master who was beside him. “Now that I know what happened in the Amethyst Fog Sea, I’ll let you lead the patrol team back to the camp. As for me, I still have some private matters to deal with in the Second Heaven. I’ll come back when I’m done.”","“Yes.” Zhen Tong Master nodded respectfully.","Although the patrol ambassadors were the leaders of the patrol teams, they were usually quite relaxed because they rarely went out on missions. Now, Jian Wushuang had to deal with some private matters in the Second Heaven, he was allowed to do so.","As long as he could come back in time when the mission was given.","Just like that, after leaving the Amethyst Fog Sea, they parted ways. Zhen Tong Master led the patrol team back to the camp, while Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo stayed in the Second Heaven.","Above the vast void, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo flew slowly.","“Demon Master Chen Huo, I have reported your matter to Temple Master Bai Xing of the Temporal Temple. Temple Master Bai Xing has promised you a position of worship. In addition, Temple Master Bai Xing has also instructed the intelligence department of the Temporal Temple to look for the experts","left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect. However, we can’t be sure how long it will take to find them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes.” Demon Master Chen Huo nodded slightly, then said, “From today on, I’m your guard. You don’t have to call me Demon Master Chen Huo anymore. Just call me Chen Huo.”","“Chen Huo? Sure.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, where do you want to go now?” Demon Master Chen Huo asked.","“You’ll know when we get there.” Jian Wushuang kept him guessing,","Demon Master Chen Huo did not ask further. He followed Jian Wushuang forward. During this time, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo teleported several times and arrived at an even faster speed. Just a day later...they arrived at their destination.","It was a grand canyon surrounded by mountains. There were towering peaks around it. At a glance, there seemed to be no less than dozens of them. However, these peaks were arranged in a unique way, the surrounding canyon was completely covered. The peaks and the canyon were connected to the","magic array in a special way, making it look like a whole.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo stood in the void near the canyon. They looked down at the canyon, but because of the restrictive magic array, even they could not see the inside of the canyon.","“If I remember correctly, this place should be the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, right?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Chen Huo, you’ve been alone in the secret land of heaven and earth for nearly 200 million years. You almost forgot your own name, but you can still recognize this sect’s lair. It’s rare,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Nonsense. I was an elder of the Amethyst Demon Sect, and the Amethyst Demon Sect is one of the overlords of the Second Heaven. Of course, I pay attention to the other overlords and some top forces in the Second Heaven, especially the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. It’s the only existence in the","Second Heaven that even the Amethyst Demon Sect fears. Moreover, when I was young, I had dealings with the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. I’ve been to the mountain gate of the valley a few times, so of course, I remember it,” Demon Master Chen Huo said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood.","“But I’ve been in the secret land of heaven and earth for too long. I wonder what has happened to the valley. Who is the current Valley Master?” Demon Master Chen Huo asked.","“The current Valley Master of the valley is called Longyu,” Jian Wushuang said. He had already gotten some information about the valley from the Temporal Temple. He knew about the Valley Master and some experts of the valley, he had a good understanding of them.","“Longyu? It’s this overbearing woman?” Demon Master Chen Huo raised his eyebrows. Apparently, he knew the current Valley Master of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“By the way, Heavenly Sword Marquis, what are you doing in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” Demon Master Chen Huo asked.","“Looking for someone,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Looking for someone? Who?” Demon Master Chen Huo asked.","“My wife, Leng Rushuang!” Jian Wushuang said.","“Wife?” Demon Master Chen Huo was stunned.","Jian Wushuang did not hide anything and simply told Demon Master Chen Huo about his wife."]},{"number":3369,"title":"Chapter 3369 - Was Finally Here","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, are you saying that your wife was brought here many years ago by the people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley because she is suitable to cultivate the supreme divine skill of the Valley?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“That’s not right, is it?” Demon Master Chen Huo frowned. “Most of the secret skills in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley require one to abandon emotion. As for the supreme skill, it is said that only those who are absolutely pure in heart and have not been touched by the secular world are qualified","to cultivate it. If the person you are looking for is really your wife, how could she not be touched by the secular world and have no emotion at all?”","“She is indeed my wife, but she is from my previous life. When we entered the reincarnation passage at the same time, my memory of my previous life was not affected at all. However, her memory seems to have disappeared, so she doesn’t know who I am in this life,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Is that so?” Demon Master Chen Huo raised his eyebrows and then said, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, if we do as you say, this matter will be troublesome.”","“First of all, your wife has lost her memory of her previous life, so she can’t recognize you at all. Moreover, since she has already come to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to cultivate the divine skill, it’s fine if she hasn’t made any progress or achievements in the divine skill, but once she has","cultivated the divine skill to a certain level, she won’t have any feelings at all. At this point, even if she has restored her memory of her previous life, I’m afraid it won’t be of any use.”","“Lknow. That’s why I cultivated to this level as soon as possible and came here to ask for her right after I had a certain level of strength,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","He had been very worried.","He was worried that if his wife cultivated the divine skill to a certain level and completely abandoned all emotions, her memories from her previous life would never be found again, and even if they were found, they would be immediately discarded.","That was why he had seized every opportunity to increase his strength. He wanted to reach the point where he could face the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley head-on as soon as possible.","But now, he had already reached this step.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what do you plan to do?” Demon Master Chen Huo looked over. “First of all, I have to remind you that although the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is only an overlord of the Second Heaven, it is different from other sects of the Second Heaven. The Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley has a very deep foundation, and there has always been an extremely terrifying old monster hiding there. It is very difficult to provoke.”","Of course, Jian Wushuang knew who the old monster was. It was the old Valley Master in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley who had mastered the supreme divine skill.","Jian Wushuang now knew more about the old Valley Master.","Moreover, he had heard from Temple Master Bai Xing that once the old Valley Master went crazy, even experts at the level of the three Saint Realm Masters and Temporal Temple Master would have a headache.","“Don’t worry, I know my own strength. I Won’t be so stupid as to go to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley and take my wife away. However, with my current strength and status, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley won’t dare to look down on me. I can pay a visit to the Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley first and see if there are any other ways for me to take my wife away. No matter what they offer, I can agree to it!”","“But if Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley doesn’t give me any chance to negotiate, then it’s not my fault.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining with a fierce light.","Upon hearing this, Demon Master Chen Huo narrowed his eyes slightly but did not say anything more.","“Let’s go down.”","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo descended directly toward the entrance of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","As soon as Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo landed on the open space at the entrance of the valley, several disciples of the valley immediately went up to greet them.","Most of the disciples of the valley were women. The female disciple in the lead asked, “Who are you and why are you here?”","“Please go in and inform them that the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple, Heavenly Sword Marquis, is here to pay a visit,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?” The female disciple immediately raised her head and looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","Jian Wushuang was too famous now. From the high and mighty Principles Masters to the ordinary cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm, most of them had heard of his name. As for the disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, they naturally knew of Jian Wushuang.","When they learned that the Immortal Saint was the famous Heavenly Sword Marquis, the disciples were shocked, but the female disciple quickly calmed down.","“Please wait a moment, I’l go in and report immediately.” The female disciple rushed into the valley as fast as she could.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo were not in a hurry. They waited quietly at the entrance of the valley.","Ina quiet attic in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, Longyu, the Valley Master of the valley, was living there.","At this moment...","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","Dressed in a plain robe, Longyu stood up with a cold expression. “Did you really see him? is he really here to visit?”","“I didn’t see him myself. I came to see you as soon as I received the report. But now, Heavenly Sword Marquis is very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm. Besides, almost all the sects and forces have seen the mirror image of the collision between Heavenly Sword Marquis and the three Saint Realms.","They all know what he looks like. Therefore, there should be no one pretending to be him.” Standing in front of Longyu was a black-clothed woman, the black-clothed woman was an elder of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and she was also a Principles Master.","“What should have come has come.” Longyu narrowed her eyes slightly.","“valley Master, which one is Heavenly Sword Marquis coming for?” The black-clothed woman asked.","“Who else can it be for?” Longyu glanced at the black-clothed woman and sighed inwardly.","She had long known that Jian Wushuang would come to her one day.","Jian Wushuang had saved the genius disciple Han Xin in the Blood Wave Realm. Later, he asked her about Leng Rushuang, which alerted her. When she returned to the valley, Han Xin reported the matter to Longyu, who immediately ordered people to investigate.","As the mirror image of Jian Wushuang fighting with the three Saint Realms spread in the Divine Beginning Realm, the Principles Master who had taken Leng Rushuang away in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley recognized Jian Wushuang at a glance.","Back in the Golden Crow Nine Realms, Jian Wushuang had revealed his life-level pressure and summoned the power of the will of heaven to suppress Leng Rushuang in order to prevent the people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley from taking her away, immediately after, countless experts from","the three Saint Realms descended. The rule master had witnessed all of this, and he had always remembered Jian Wushuang. Therefore, when he saw the mirror image of Jian Wushuang again, he immediately confirmed Jian Wushuang’s identity."]},{"number":3370,"title":"Chapter 3370 - Closed the Door and Disappeared","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“When our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley brought that person back, we were stopped by this Heavenly Sword Marquis. However, at that time, he was too weak and was not even a saint. He was not even in our eyes. Who would have thought that in less than a thousand years, this Heavenly Sword","Marquis’ strength had improved to the point that even our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had to pay attention to him!”","“Also, he has an extraordinary status in the Temporal Temple. I heard that even the Temporal Temple Master thinks highly of him.” Valley Master Longyu narrowed her eyes slightly.","Jian Wushuang’s growth speed was indeed beyond their imagination.","But now that Jian Wushuang had come to visit her, it was a headache for her.","“valley Master, Heavenly Sword Marquis is outside the valley, and he came to visit openly. Are we going to meet him or not?” The black-clothed woman asked.","“No.” Longyu waved her hand. “We know his purpose, so we can’t let him in. Otherwise, with his character and strength, if he goes crazy in our valley, our valley won’t be able to bear the consequences.”","“You tell him that we have some internal affairs to deal with, and we have to close our doors and refuse visitors. Later, 1, Longyu, will visit him personally.”","“Understood.” The black-clothed woman nodded and rushed out of the valley.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo were still waiting in the open space at the entrance of the valley. Finally, the black-clothed woman walked out.","“Elder Ling Yi of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley greets Mr. Heavenly Sword Marquis. May I know who this is...” The black-clothed woman bowed to Jian Wushuang humbly and then looked at Demon Master Chen Huo.","The black-clothed woman was also a Principles Master. Although she was not strong, she could still feel the invisible pressure brought by Demon Master Chen Huo.","She could tell that Demon Master Chen Huo was not weak.","“This is my guard. As for his name, I won’t mention it,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Guard?” The black-clothed woman was shocked, and her mind was full of thoughts. “Although the old man beside Heavenly Sword Marquis did not emit any aura, from the pressure he gave me, he must be at least an expert of the third or fourth realm of the Void. How could such an expert be willing to be","his guard?","“It seems that the Temporal Temple places more importance on him than I expected.”","“Elder Ling Yi, we came here specially to visit. May we go in now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Tm sorry, but I have to deal with some matters in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. I’m in the middle of meeting with the guests, so I can only thank you for your kindness. But don’t worry, my Valley Master said that after some time, he will come to apologize to you personally,” The black-clothed","woman Ling Yi said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned.","He wanted to enter the valley first and discuss with the Valley Master and the other high-level officials to see if there was any room for negotiation, even if the valley offered some harsh conditions, he could accept it.","But he did not expect that he would be refused entry!","The higher-ups of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley did not see him at all. They only sent elder Ling Yi to get rid of him.","“Elder Ling Yi, I am now the sixth inspector of the Temporal Temple. I represent not only myself, but also the Temporal Temple behind me. This time, I specially came to visit the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, but I did not even enter the door. Isn’t that a little unreasonable?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes","were cold.","“Humph, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is still so arrogant. Even the inspector of the Temporal Temple was denied entry.” Demon Master Chen Huo snorted coldly.","“Tm sorry. It’s not that I don’t know my limits. If there are some private matters in the valley, it’s not convenient for outsiders to enter.” Elder Ling Yi insisted.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly. “How long will it take for the valley to finish the matters?”","“I don’t know. It may take at least a few years, at most a few hundred years or even a thousand years. In short, before the matters in the valley are settled, the valley will not see outsiders. Moreover, the Valley Master has ordered that the mountain gate will be completely sealed immediately,” Elder Ling Yi","said.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but then he smiled and said, “In that case, I’ll pay you a visit after you’ve dealt with the internal affairs of your Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang glanced at Demon Master Chen Huo and said, “Let’s go!”","The two immediately left.","Seeing them leave, Elder Ling Yi revealed a strange smile and returned to the valley.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo did not walk far in the void around the valley, but they stopped.","“Chen Huo, do you think that there are some private matters in the valley that are inconvenient for outsiders to enter?” Jian Wushuang looked at Chen Huo.","“Of course, it must be fake.” Demon Master Chen Huo smiled.","“[ think it’s fake too.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “If something really happened in the valley, the disciples at the gate would not look so relaxed. Moreover, if the valley really closed the door to visit me, the disciples at the gate would have told me. But when they didn’t, the disciple immediately went in","to report it!”","“Apparently, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley did not close their doors to me, at least not before I came. But after I came to visit, the people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley deliberately said that because they did not want me to enter the valley.”","“It’s like this.” Demon Master Chen Huo smiled and said, “The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley obviously knows your purpose of coming here, so they deliberately refused to let you in. But you can’t even enter the valley, so how can you take your wife away?”","“Humph, they won’t let me in. Can’t I think of another way?” Jian Wushuang snorted.","“What way?” Demon Master Chen Huo glanced at Jian Wushuang, he immediately said, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, I have to warn you first. Don’t think of barging into the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley and taking your wife away by force. The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is not to be trifled","with. Moreover, I’m afraid that you can’t break the sect-protecting formation of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.”","“Iknow. It’s a bad idea to break into the valley by force. But since they don’t want me to enter the valley, can’t I find a way to make them come to see me outside the valley?” Jian Wushuang smiled strangely."]},{"number":3371,"title":"Chapter 3371 - Force Them to Come Out","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You mean, force them to come out?” Demon Master Chen Huo asked with a strange look on his face.","“This is the sect of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. There should be many experts or disciples of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley valley around the sect. As long as we capture a group of them, there’s no need to worry about Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley being in a hurry,” Jian Wushuang","said with a smile.","“That’s a good idea, but I’m afraid that you won’t be able to attract the attention of the highest level of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley just by capturing a few disciples. At the very least, you’ll have to capture one or two Principles Masters,” Demon Master Chen Huo said.","“As long as you capture disciples, are you afraid that you won’t attract big fish?” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo left.","As one of the overlords of the Second Heaven, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was superior to the previous Xiaoyao Mansion in terms of both strength and foundation. The territory controlled by the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was also very vast.","In one of the restaurants in a bustling city around the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo were sitting by the window. They were looking at a team in the market not far away, the team was made up of women. Judging from their attire, it was obvious that","they were from Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“Chen Huo, it’s up to you,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“There are eight people in total. The strongest one is only a rank five True Saint. I’m not in the mood to fight such a little guy,” Demon Master Chenhuo refused directly.","This was normal. Demon Master Chenhuo was a super expert at the peak of the sixth void realm. Such super experts would more or less pay attention to their status. For them, even if they were asked to fight a Peak Saint or an Invincible Saint...but now, he was asked to fight eight True Saints who were","only at the fifth rank. Of course, he did not want to.","“If you don’t fight, do you want me to go?” Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes at Demon Master Chenhuo, he said, “I’m now too famous in the Divine Beginning Realm. If I fight, it’s hard to guarantee that I won’t be recognized. Once the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley knows that I’m the one who’s arresting","people, let alone sending experts, they might immediately recall all their disciples. Then our plan will not work.”","“It’s your plan. It has nothing to do with me.” Demon Master Chenhuo curled his lips. “Forget it. Let ‘it’do it.”","Demon Master Chenhuo waved his hand, and a burly figure immediately appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“This is... puppet fighter?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“This is a puppet fighter left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect. Although it’s not very strong and is only at the level of an ordinary Invincible Saint, it’s more than enough to capture these little guys from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley,” Demon Master Chen Huo said.","“A puppet fighter at the level of an Invincible Saint?” A smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s face, at the same time, he praised, “As expected of the Amethyst Demon Sect. Its foundation is indeed extraordinary. I’m afraid that in its heyday, the Amethyst Demon Sect should have even a puppet fighter at the","level of a Principles Master, right?”","Demon Master Chen Huo snorted and did not answer. He just gave an order to the puppet fighter, “Go and capture the eight of you who are wearing the same clothes. Remember, only capture and suppress them alive. Don’t kill them. This is a top-tier holy treasure for suppression. Just suppress them","inside.”","Demon Master Chenhuo also gave a mini palace to the puppet fighter.","Under the order of Demon Master Chenhuo, the puppet fighter immediately set off.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo watched quietly in the restaurant. When they saw the puppet fighter appear in front of the eight disciples of forget-love valley, they immediately attacked without saying anything.","They attacked the disciples of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley directly in the city near the gate of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley!","The eight disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley were also shocked. They did not expect to be attacked here. They immediately reported to the sect and fought with the puppet fighter.","However, in this fight...the Invincible Saint puppet fighter swept the eight disciples away. The eight disciples wanted to escape, but the Invincible Saint puppet fighter took out the mini palace and used its suppressive power, in an instant, all eight of them were suppressed.","After doing all this, the puppet fighter at the level of the Invincible Saint retumed to Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Let’s go, welll go to the next place to catch them,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Immediately, he and Demon Master Chenhuo wandered around the cities around the mountain gate of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Every time they came to a city, they would look for the disciples or experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. As soon as they found one...they would","immediately have the saint-level puppet fighter take action and suppress it.","It had to be said that the strength of the puppet fighter that the deepfire demon master took out was indeed not bad. It was not inferior to human cultivators at the Invincible Saint Realm. In addition, with the help of the top-tier holy treasure-level suppression-type treasure...it was very easy to suppress","the disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","Even if it encountered a peak saint, it could not escape from this puppet fighter.","In just half a day, that saint realm puppet fighter had suppressed nearly 40 disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Among them, there were one Peak Saint, three rank seven True Saints, and the rest were all ordinary disciples below rank seven.","And this puppet fighter had suppressed the disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley so brazenly in front of everyone, and it was in the vicinity of the mountain gate of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. This naturally caused the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to be furious, the","Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley immediately sent experts over to kill them.","It was still in a city near the mountain gate of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. That Invincible Saint Realm puppet-fighter had just suppressed four disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. In the end, just as he was about to return to the side of the Demon Master Chen Huo...a spatial","tunnel suddenly appeared in the void of this city. Following that, no less than ten figures stepped out of the spatial tunnel at the same time.","Each of these figures had a strong aura. The weakest one was an expert above the Peak Saint Realm, and the two Principles Masters were in the lead.","When they arrived, they immediately surrounded the Invincible Saint puppet fighter.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo hid their auras in a corner of the city. When they saw the ten-odd figures from Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, they smiled.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, the big fish you’ve been waiting for is finally here. The two Principles Masters, together with so many Peak Saints and Invincible Saints, it seems that Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is also very cautious. They know that this matter might not be so simple, so they sent so","many experts at once,” Demon Master Chen Huo said with a smile.","“It’s big fish, and the two Principles Masters in the lead happen to be two acquaintances of mine,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Acquaintances?” Demon Master Chen Huo was surprised.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were extremely sharp as he looked at the two figures in the center of the Void who were emitting the aura of Principles Masters."]},{"number":3372,"title":"Chapter 3372 - Acquaintances","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The first of the two was Han Xin, whom he had saved in the Blood Wave Realm.","Han Xin was a genius disciple of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. When she was in the Blood Wave Realm, she had obtained another Blood Wave Token and had broken through to become a Principles Master. However, because she had just broken through not long ago...she had not had the time to","open her own secret realm, so she was only a Principles Master in the Void Realm. She only had one part of the power of the will.","As for the other person, it was a long time ago.","It was the first time Jian Wushuang met someone from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley in the Dragon-phoenix Pavilion in the Golden Crow Nine Realms. In order to prevent them from taking his wife, Leng Rushuang, away, they fought, when he used the Heaven-cleaving skill to sweep the","surroundings, it was the Principles Master who stopped him.","At that time, the Principles Master only sent his consciousness doppelganger, but even so, he could still easily crush Jian Wushuang.","It was because of the appearance of the Principles Master’s consciousness doppelganger that the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was able to take his wife away in front of Jian Wushuang.","Now, Jian Wushuang did not expect that it would be such a coincidence. The expert sent by the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was the Principles Master who had sent the consciousness clone.","“This Principles Master should be the Zhu Xin Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.” Jian Wushuang had long known the identity of this Principles Master.","Among the Principles Masters of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, Zhu Xin Master could only be considered as an ordinary Principles Master. Her strength had been stuck at the level of the two void realms, and her methods were not too excessive.","“Han Xin, together with Zhu Xin Master, they are indeed two big fish. As long as we can suppress them, Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley will not be nervous. As for their Valley Master, no matter how unwilling she is, she has to come and see us.” Jian Wushuang sneered, “Let’s go. If we want to suppress","these two Principles Masters, we have to do it ourselves.”","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo immediately dashed toward the void in front of them.","In the void, many experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, led by Han Xin and Zhu Xin, had surrounded the Invincible Saint puppet fighter in the center, but they were not in a hurry to attack.","“Is this the person who is unscrupulously suppressing the disciples of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” Zhu Xin stared at the puppet fighter with a cold gaze.","“Martial uncle, something isn’t right. Although this person’s aura is quite extraordinary, there isn’t the slightest bit of life aura on his body,” Han Xin said.","“Iknow. If nothing unexpected happens, the person in front of us should only be a puppet fighter. He is only obeying the orders of his master. As for the person who is truly against our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, there is someone else, and he must be nearby,” Zhu Xin Master said coldly.","She had just finished speaking...","“Haha, Zhu Xin Master, you’re really smart.”","A hearty laughter suddenly rang out. Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo had already appeared in the void beside them.","‘When they saw who it was, Zhu Xin Master and Han Xin’s expressions instantly changed.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Han Xin looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment. “It’s you?”","“I’s him.” Zhu Xin Master’s body shook violently.","She knew about Heavenly Sword Marquis, who was famous throughout the Divine Beginning Realm more than 400 years ago. She had recognized him as the little guy who had stopped her from leaving with Leng Rushuang in the Dragon-phoenix Pavilion.","At that time, Jian Wushuang was indeed just a little guy. Although he had shown extraordinary abilities and abilities, she had not taken him seriously. But now...that little guy had grown to a level that even she was extremely afraid of.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, is this puppet fighter yours?” Han Xin stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Sort of.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","“Did you order this puppet fighter to suppress the disciples of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley in the surrounding territory?” Han Xin asked again.","“Yes,” Jian Wushuang admitted directly.","“Why? Why did you do that?” Han Xin frowned.","Because Jian Wushuang had saved her life in the Blood Wave Realm, Han Xin subconsciously thought that Jian Wushuang and the great Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley should be friends but not enemies. Therefore, she did not understand why Jian Wushuang did this now.","“My purpose is actually very simple. Although you don’t know it, the top experts of your Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, such as Valley Master Longyu, must know it. and the Zhu Xin Master, who is beside you, might also be able to guess it,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you deliberately let your puppet fighter suppress the disciples of our valley. Your purpose should be to lure Han Xin and me out, right?","“We are your real targets,” Master Zhu Xin said in a cold voice.","“You’re half right. I did use this puppet fighter to lure the Principles Masters of our valley out. As for my real purpose, it’s not you. But as long as I suppress you two, my purpose will be achieved,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“You want to suppress the two of us? With just you?” Zhu Xin Master’s eyes turned cold, her face was also filled with anger. She waved her sleeve, and a large amount of divine power swept out, turning into a huge divine power storm that swept toward Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo.","However, after Zhu Xin Master had done all this, she did not wait for the divine power storm to reach Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo. She turned her head and shouted at the same time, “Han Xin, run!”","She did not hesitate at all.","‘The moment she saw Jian Wushuang, she knew his real purpose. At the same time, she also knew his strength and means. Jian Wushuang alone was not enough for her and Han Xin to fight him, not to mention that Jian Wushuang had an unfathomable Principles Master by his side.","Therefore, Zhu Xin did not intend to fight Jian Wushuang in the first place. She was just pretending to be angry to pave the way for her and Han Xin to escape.","Now, as the divine storm swept toward Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo, she and Han Xin immediately fled backward. As for the Peak Saints, they also fled in all directions.","“You want to escape? It’s not that easy.” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly. A large amount of space-time principle power rose from his body. Then, he reached out his right hand and made a strange cut in the void in front of him.","“One finger painting the sky, space-time prison!”","Buzz! With that simple cut, the space-time principles power condensed in Jian Wushuang’s body instantly surged up and swept out in all directions like waves. In just a moment, it covered the entire secret realm of heaven and earth."]},{"number":3373,"title":"Chapter 3373 - Suppression","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Is this...space-time imprisonment?”","Zhu Xin Master, who was fleeing frantically, sensed the changes in the surrounding space-time immediately and was shocked. “How is this possible? How did you master space-time imprisonment so quickly after cultivating for so long?”","“There are many things you don’t know.” Jian Wushuang smiled and appeared in front of Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin in the blink of an eye. Then, he waved his hand and an ancient blood-red tower appeared out of thin air, it expanded rapidly, and a majestic aura spread out from the bottom of the tower.","“A true treasure, a suppression type true treasure!” Zhu Xin Master and Han Xin were immediately terrified.","‘They were Principles Masters after all. Although they knew that their strength was inferior to Jian Wushuang, they thought that it would be very difficult for Jian Wushuang to kill or suppress them. However, with the help of a suppression type true treasure...it was completely different.","Suppression type true treasures were used to suppress experts.","Under normal circumstances, as long as the difference in strength between the two sides was huge, the stronger side could completely rely on the suppression type true treasure to suppress the weaker side.","“So what if you have a suppression type true treasure? Although you’re stronger than me, you’re not much stronger. As long as I have enough divine power, how can you suppress me?” Zhu Xin Master said coldly.","“Haha, Zhu Xin Master, I’m afraid you’ve made a mistake. Although I’m the one who took out this suppression type true treasure, I’m not the one who uses it.” Jian Wushuang laughed loudly.","“What?” Zhu Xin Master was stunned. The next moment, she saw the person controlling the blood tower.","The person controlling the blood tower was the sloppy old man who had previously made her feel unfathomable.","This sloppy old man was naturally the Demon Master Chen Huo. He was an existence at the peak of the sixth level of the Void. Now that he was in control of the blood-colored tower, a world-shaking might burst forth from it, in almost an instant, the blood-colored tower had already covered both Zhu","Xin Master and Han Xin.","“No, impossible!”","“How can this be?”","Zhu Xin Master and Han Xin struggled madly under the blood-colored tower. However, no matter how hard they struggled, they were unable to break free of the blood-colored tower.","In the end, the blood tower opened its bloody mouth like a beast and swallowed them.","‘The two Principles Masters could not resist at all and were suppressed in an instant.","As for the Peak Saints, Jian Wushuang did not let them go. He also suppressed them with the suppression-type holy treasure in the hands of the invincible saint-level helmet.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo gathered again.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, your suppression-type holy treasure is quite powerful. It should have reached the level of an advanced supreme treasure. Its value is extraordinary. How did you get such a precious treasure?” Demon Master Chenhuo returned the blood-red tower to Jian Wushuang, at the same","time, he asked.","“got this blood-red tower from a rule master i killed,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He was telling the truth. More than 400 years ago, the battle on Saha Island had been earth-shaking.","Many Principles Masters had died in that battle, and Jian Wushuang had killed some of them with his own hands.","For example, the four flame divine guards around the Flame Saint Master and the Tianyou Master, who had reached the peak of the fifth void realm and was one of the top officials of the Destruction Saint Realm, had all been killed by Jian Wushuang after he had received the power from Blood Wave.","‘The four flame divine guards, which were treasures left behind by Tianyou Master and the others, naturally fell into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","‘The suppression-type supreme treasure, the blood tower, which Jian Wushuang took out was from Tianyou Master.","In fact, he had obtained many supreme treasures from the previous battle, and several of them were useful to him, but he did not have the time to use them. It was not until today that he gave them to Demon Master Chen Huo, that he handed them over to Demon Master Chen Huo to use.","“Zhu Xin and Han Xin have been suppressed. Now, Valley Master Longyu from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley can’t refuse to meet me.” Jian Wushuang sneered and glanced at the blood-red tower in his hand, then, he kept the blood-red tower in his arms.","In the blood-red tower, Zhu Xin and Han Xin were trapped inside. Although their strength was not restricted or restricted, and they were constantly bombarding the surrounding towers, no matter how they used their skills...they were unable to shake the blood tower in the slightest.","“I’s useless. This tower is a suppression type true treasure, and it is estimated to have reached the level of a high-level true treasure. With such a true treasure, just the two of us won’t be able to move, much less destroy this tower.” Zhu Xin Master attacked a few times, he shook his head helplessly.","“Uncle-master, Heavenly Sword Marquis did not kill us immediately. Instead, he suppressed us within this blood tower. What is he trying to do?” Han Xin asked with a frown.","“He is trying to...” Zhu Xin narrowed her eyes. She swallowed the words that were about to come out of her mouth, “Don’t worry about what his motive is. In short, Heavenly Sword Marquis isn’t trying to kill us. He is just trying to use the two of us to threaten our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. If","nothing goes wrong, the Valley Master already knows that the two of us are being suppressed by Heavenly Sword Marquis. He will definitely come out to rescue us.”","“How to save him?” Han Xin asked again.","“Negotiate with him. Valley Master will definitely negotiate with Heavenly Sword Marquis, but we don’t know how to negotiate with him. We’ll wait in this tower.” Master Zhu Xin sighed, she did not feel good about it.","More than a thousand years ago, when she first saw Jian Wushuang in the Dragon-phoenix Pavilion, he was not even a saint. At that time, Jian Wushuang was just an ant, even worse than an ant, she did not take Jian Wushuang seriously at all.","However, in the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang had grown to such an extent. Moreover, when they met again, she was suppressed by him without any ability to fight back.","The contrast between them was so great that it was hard for him to accept for a moment.","On the other side, in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, as what Master Zhu Xin had said, Valley Master Longyu and the top management of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had already learned that Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin had been suppressed by Jian Wushuang.","“How dare he! How dare he suppress the elders of the valley!”","“How dare he? If he didn’t have the courage and courage, he wouldn’t have fought with the three Saint Realms. To be honest, he’s not even afraid of the three Saint Realm Masters, so he doesn’t care about the valley.”","“Suppressing the elders of the valley is no longer a challenge to the valley, but a declaration of war!”","The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley’s highest-level Principles Masters were all extremely furious at this moment!"]},{"number":3374,"title":"Chapter 3374 - Face-To-Face","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In contrast to the furious elders present, Longyu, the Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, appeared rather calm at this moment.","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis is really persistent. He wants to use such a method to force us out!” Longyu said in a low voice.","“Force us out? What does the Valley Master mean by this?” An elder at the side asked in puzzlement.","“You don’t know.” At this moment, the woman in black spoke, “Not long ago, that Heavenly Sword Marquis personally came to visit our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, but was rejected by us. After he left, he immediately began to suppress the disciples of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley in","the surrounding territories. Of course, his goal was to force us out.”","“Is that so?”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis actually came to visit us?”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is extraordinary in both strength and status. Since he came to visit us, how could our valley refuse him?”","Most of the elders present were not aware of the conflict between Jian Wushuang and our valley, so they were puzzled.","“Everyone, there is a subtle relationship between Heavenly Sword Marquis and the valley. He is here for the young master!” Longyu said.","Hearing the words ‘young master’, the elders in the hall were shocked.","“Young master?”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is related to young master?”","“How can that be? Young master should have no connection with the outside world. How can he have anything to do with Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“Valley Master, what exactly is going on?” A white-haired old woman asked.","“It’s like this.” Longyu immediately began to explain. She briefly described the cause and effect of the matter.","“It’s because I knew that there might be some connection between Heavenly Sword Marquis and the young master. If he appeared in front of the young master, it might affect the young master’s cultivation. That’s why I blocked him out. I just didn’t expect the Heavenly Sword Marquis to be so persistent","and use such a method to force us to meet him,” Longyu said.","‘When they heard Longyu’s words, the elders all understood. At the same time, they also understood Longyu’s actions.","The young master was too important to their Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. The young master’s cultivation must not be sloppy. Therefore, ever since the young master came to their Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, the young master’s existence...only the elders and some of the best disciples","knew some things, but the others did not.","Not to mention the experts from the other forces, even 99% of the people in the valley did not know about the existence of the young master.","Now, Jian Wushuang was obviously here for the young master, so they could not let him affect the young master.","“We can’t let Heavenly Sword Marquis meet the young master, but the problem is that Heavenly Sword Marquis has suppressed so many disciples of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, including Han Xin and Elder Zhu Xin. Under such circumstances, we can’t avoid him anymore,” Longyu said.","“Since we can’t avoid him, Let’s face him. Let’s see what Heavenly Sword Marquis is going to do!”","“Yes, although Heavenly Sword Marquis is strong and powerful, our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has been in the Divine Beginning Realm for so many years. Why should we fear him?”","“Even Temple Master Bai Xing of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, or even Temporal Temple Master, wouldn’t dare to go too far against our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. What is this little Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is too arrogant. I suggest we teach him a lesson. As long as we don’t kill him, even the Temporal Temple won’t say anything.”","Some elders had already said that they wanted to teach Jian Wushuang a lesson.","This was normal.","The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley’s heritage was far beyond that of sects like the Xiaoyao Mansion. Even the Amethyst Demon Sect at its peak was far inferior to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Most importantly...the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had always had its biggest reliance.","With that Reliance, even the three Saint Realms and the three Freedom Alliances had some concerns about them.","Because of this, they were not afraid of any sects or forces, and no one dared to push them to the limit. As time went by...this made the elders and disciples of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley more arrogant.","They did not want to provoke Jian Wushuang, but they were not afraid if he provoked them.","“valley Master, in my opinion, this is not a trivial matter. You all know how powerful Heavenly Sword Marquis is. Even if the three Saint Realms set up an inescapable net and the three masters of the Saint Realm, together with the Sorcerer God, could not do anything to him. We have to think carefully","before we meet him. Why don’t we report this to the old master and see what he says?” An elder who had reached the fourth realm of the Void said.","However, Longyu waved her hand. “When Heavenly Sword Marquis came to visit previously, I’ve already checked. He only has a Principles Master who is suspected to be at the fourth level of the Void. With his own strength, he won’t pose much of a threat to our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. There’s","no need to trouble the ancestor.”","“Let’s go meet Heavenly Sword Marquis first. If both sides can agree, then they’ll naturally be on good terms. If they can’t agree, then let’s have a big battle. As long as we don’t kill him, we’ll teach him a lesson. There won’t be any problems.”","Hearing Longyu’s words, the surrounding elders all nodded in agreement.","“Then where is the Heavenly Sword Marquis now?” Longyu asked.","“He’s staying in the city where Elder Han Xin and Elder Zhu Xin were suppressed. It seems that he knows that we won’t be able to sit still, so he might as well wait for us there,” the black-clothed woman said.","“Very good. Since that’s the case, let’s go meet them.” Longyu’s eyes emitted a cold light. “To be safe, let’s invite Martial Uncle Que out.”","“Martial Uncle Que?” The surrounding elders were all startled.","They naturally knew who Martial Uncle Que was that Longyu was talking about.","In the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, other than the oldest and most revered old supremacy, this Martial Uncle Que had the highest seniority!","In terms of strength, Martial Uncle Que was naturally very strong. At least, he was much stronger than anyone present, including Longyu. Such an ancient and senior expert...logically speaking, he should have gone to the depths of the universe battlefield, but Martial Uncle Que did not.","Therefore, Martial Uncle Que became one of the trump cards of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","Soon, many experts of the valley headed toward Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3375,"title":"Chapter 3375 - Master Gorsch","paragraphs":["Chapter 3375: Master Gorsch","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The cities where Master Han Xin and Master Zhu Xin were suppressed were still in a tavern.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo were drinking while quietly waiting for the arrival of the experts from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“The speed of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is really slow,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Don’t worry. You’ve suppressed the two rule masters, so the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley won’t pretend that they don’t know. Besides, although the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley keeps a low profile and doesn’t compete for hegemony, it’s actually a very arrogant sect that values its reputation very much. If they don’t react at all, won’t they become a joke?” Demon Master Chen Huo said with a smile.","“I’m not worried that they won’t come. I’m just worried about their attitude. If we can come to an agreement later, it’ll be fine. But if the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is too tough and doesn’t give us a chance to talk, then we’ll be in trouble.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","At this moment, a group of figures was rushing over from the void not far away.","“Oh, they’re here.”","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chen Huo raised their heads.","Although they were still some distance away, they had a clear view of each other’s lineup.","“Eight Principles Masters?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “As far as I know, although Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has always been the overlord of the Second Heaven and no one has dared to provoke it, in fact, there are not many top experts in Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. For Principles Masters, there are only about a dozen of them. I’ve already suppressed two of them before, but now I’ve summoned eight Principles Masters at once. Tsk, tsk, they really think highly of me.”","“Among these eight Principles Masters, I only know two. One of them is their Valley Master Longyu, and the other is Master Gorsch. This old woman is a character from my master’s era. When she became famous, I wasn’t even born. At that time, it has been 300 million years since then. Such an ancient character is still staying in the Divine Beginning Realm?”","In the Divine Beginning Realm, regardless of whether it was some top forces or sects, or some solitary experts, under normal circumstances, as long as their strength reached a certain level and there was almost no room for improvement in the Divine Beginning Realm...they would all go to the depths of the universe battlefield to wander or roam about, and once they went out, very few would return.","However, there were also some people who clearly had no room for improvement in the Divine Beginning Realm, but they were not in a hurry to leave. Instead, they stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm, like the four ancient immortals of the Temporal Temple...they had founded the Temporal Temple together with the Temporal Temple Master, which was much further away from now. However, the four of them still stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm.","There was also Elder Dark Bone, who was also an old monster, who was still in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“I guess you’re worried about the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley,” Jian Wushuang said. Then he asked, “Chenhuo, since you know about Master Gorsch, you should know her strength, right?”","“Well...when the Amethyst Demon Sect was still alive, I had a fight with Master Gorsch. At that time, I was only at the fourth realm of the Void Realm, and Master Gorsch was also at the fourth realm of the Void Realm. When I fought with her, we were evenly matched. To be exact, she was slightly better than me. Now, although she’s not very talented, it’s been a long time. No matter what, her strength should have improved!","“According to my estimation, her current combat strength is at least at the peak of the fifth void realm, and it’s very likely that she has reached the level of the sixth void realm,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“If she really is at the sixth void realm, are you confident that you can defeat her?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course I’m confident.” Demon Master Chenhuo smiled. “This old woman was only a hair’s breadth away from the fifth void realm, but I was able to fight her as soon as I stepped into the fourth void realm. Now, even if she has reached the sixth void realm, she is absolutely no match for me.”","Demon Master Chenhuo was very confident. Indeed, he was now at the peak of the sixth realm of the void, and the gap between him and the pinnacle of the sixth realm of the Void was very small.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, there were probably not many Principles Masters who could be stronger than him.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","Although there were eight Principles Masters from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, the only one who was worthy of Jian Wushuang’s fear was Master Gorsch. As for the others, even their Valley Master Longyu... Jian Wushuang did not take them seriously.","“Well, they are here. Let’s go and meet them.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and walked out of the tavern with Demon Master Chenhuo. They came to the void and stopped in front of the eight rule masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, greetings to all of you from Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.” Jian Wushuang maintained an extremely humble posture at the beginning.","After all, he did not want to lose all decorum with the valley. It would be best if they could reach an agreement.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how dare you suppress the two Principles Masters and so many disciples of the valley? Don’t think that because you have the support of the Temporal Temple, the valley won’t dare to do anything to you. Release the people of the valley.” Longyu’s eyes were cold, she stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Haha, Longyu, long time no see. You still have such a bad temper.” A hearty laugh came out of the mouth of Demon Master Chenhuo, who was looking at Longyu with a smile.","Longyu also noticed the existence of Demon Master Chenhuo.","“You, you are...Demon Master Chenhuo?” Longyu’s pupils suddenly shrank.","“Chenhuo? The monster from the Amethyst Demon Sect?” Master Gorsch immediately looked at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Haha, I didn’t expect that the two of you would still remember me after such a long time. How rare.” Demon Master Chenhuo sneered.","“How is that possible? Aren’t you already dead?” Longyu looked at Demon Master Chenhuo in shock.","“During the battle that destroyed the Amethyst Demon Sect back then, many of the top experts of the Amethyst Demon Sect should have been killed. And you are the most famous genius elder of the Amethyst Demon Sect. The Flame Saint Realm wouldn’t let you off so easily. How can you still be alive and have even gotten together with Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Master Gorsch’s face was also filled with shock.","She had personally fought with the Demon Master Chenhuo before, so she knew how terrifying he was.","The Flame Saint Realm would definitely think of ways to kill such a super genius, but now, the Demon Master Chenhuo was clearly alive and well.","“Hmph, the Flame Saint Realm wants to kill me, but unfortunately, I won’t give them a chance.” The Demon Master Chenhuo’s voice was cold. “As for why I’m with the Heavenly Sword Marquis, that’s none of your business.”"]},{"number":3376,"title":"Chapter 3376 - Urgent","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After a simple greeting between Demon Master Chenhuo and the people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, the two sides went back to the main topic.","“valley Master Longyu, as well as the people of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, I, Heavenly Sword Marquis, can swear that I have no hostility toward the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley from the beginning to the end. As for the reason why I suppressed the experts and disciples of the","Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley this time, it was because I had no choice. I hope you can forgive me.” Jian Wushuang lowered his attitude.","“Do you really have to do this? Not only did you suppress the ordinary disciples, but you also suppressed two Principles Masters. Do you really have to do this?” Valley Master Longyu shouted coldly.","“I suppressed them because I wanted to lure you out. In fact, when I visited Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley not long ago, if you hadn’t rejected me, this wouldn’t have happened,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Humph, Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has some private matters to deal with. I said that I would visit you in the Temporal Temple, but you forced me to meet you by suppressing the disciples of the experts of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. How can you visit people like this?” Valley Master","Longyu said.","“valley Master Longyu, I’m afraid only you know the reason why your Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley rejected me. But now that things have come to this, it’s useless to pursue this matter. Let’s get down to business.” Jian Wushuang looked at Valley Master Longyu. “Compared to Valley Master Longyu","and the other masters of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, you should already know why I’m here.”","The Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley looked at each other in dismay. Naturally, they understood, but they did not show any change in their expressions.","“How would I know why you’re here?” Valley Master Longyu asked.","“Then let me be clear. More than 1,000 years ago, in the Dragon-phoenix Pavilion of the Golden Crow Nine Realms in the endless territories, the people of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley took my wife away in front of me. Among the people who took my wife was the consciousness clone of Master","Zhu Xin. Now, I’m here to visit Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to take my wife away!” Jian Wushuang said.","“Your wife?” Valley Master Longyu and the Principles Masters frowned.","Wife?","Their young master and Heavenly Sword Marquis were husband and wife?","“No.” Valley Master Longyu immediately shook her head. “Young master is the most suitable person to cultivate the divine skill that our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has spent so many years and energy to find. She shouldn’t have any secular aura at all. How could she have a husband?”","Thinking of this, Valley Master Longyu immediately believed that Jian Wushuang was lying.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you think that people from our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley are so stupid that they will be easily deceived by you?” Valley Master Longyu said angrily, “The rule of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has always been that we only accept virgins as disciples. Anyone","who enters our valley must be heartless and unfeeling, Therefore, before she comes to the valley, we will make sure that her love threads are completely cut off!”","“You said that the person that Master Zhu Xin took away was your wife, but since she was your wife, how could she be qualified to enter our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?”","“It’s true that the person that Master Zhu Xin took away was my wife, but her memory has not been completely restored. As long as you let me see her, I will naturally have a way to restore her memory,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Whether she’s your disciple or not, it’s meaningless now,” Valley Master Longyu said.","“Meaningless?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","“Yes, as long as she enters my great forget love valley, she will naturally sever all love. My Supreme Emotion- forgetting Valley will naturally not allow her to meet you. Moreover, even if my Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley allows it, you won’t be able to see her,” Valley Master Longyu said.","“Why?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“I’s simple. The person you mentioned is dead!” Valley Master Longyu said.","“What did you say?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically, and a fierce light flashed in his eyes.","“Yes, she is dead. Not long after she came to our valley, she died during an experiential training,” Valley Master Longyu said seriously.","When the Principles Masters of the Supreme Emotion forgetting Valley heard Valley Master Longyu’s words, they were all stunned and could not help but sigh in their hearts.","They all knew that the person Jian Wushuang was talking about was their young master. The young master was still alive and well. However, in order to make Jian Wushuang completely give up, Valley Master Longyu directly said that their young master...was dead.","At this moment, when Jian Wushuang heard the news, he was a little stunned and did not react in time. What followed was endless killing intent and unprecedented fear, but he quickly calmed down.","He raised his head and looked carefully at Valley Master Longyu and the Principles Masters beside her. Although these Principles Masters were trying their best to hide it, Jian Wushuang still saw some clues.","“valley Master Longyu is fine, but some of the other Principles Masters have strange expressions. It seems that they were also shocked by the look in their eyes!” Jian Wushuang observed carefully.","“More than 400 years ago, when I met Han Xin in the Blood Ware Realm and asked about Shuang ‘er for the first time, Han Xin’s expression was obviously different. I’m sure that Shuang ‘er was alive and well at that time, and her position in Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was extraordinary. But now,","when valley master jade said that Shuang ‘er was dead, it was as if she was talking about the death of an insignificant ordinary disciple!”","“Based on these two points, I am sure that Valley Master Longyu is lying!”","Jian Wushuang immediately understood and his eyes turned cold. “Valley Master Longyu, I am sure that she is still alive. Just tell me what conditions you want me to take her away.”","“Conditions? What conditions can you offer?” Valley Master Longyu glanced at Jian Wushuang.","“No matter what kind of harsh conditions you offer, as long as you bring them up, I can try to fulfill them. Even if you want me to destroy a top sect in the Third Heaven for you, or even destroy a Saint Realm and kill a Master of the Saint Realm, I can try!” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands, his eyes were","full of longing and expectation.","He and his wife had been separated for too long.","He could not wait to see his wife. He was too eager.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, both Valley Master Longyu and the Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley were stunned."]},{"number":3377,"title":"Chapter 3377 - Rage","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis really dares to say it!”","“He destroyed a Saint Realm and even killed a Saint Realm Master? Who does he think he is?”","“Don’t underestimate him. This Heavenly Sword Marquis once severely injured the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God at the Saint Realm. Although everyone knows that he must have used some special power, it’s still incredible that a saint can do this. His potential in the future is really boundless.","He might really have the strength to kill a Saint Realm Master in the future.”","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis is willing to accept such a condition. It can be seen how deep her obsession with the young master is.”","The Principles Masters of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley were secretly communicating.","“Humph, it is precisely because this obsession is too deep that it should be destroyed as soon as possible. Otherwise...” Valley Master Longyu’s eyes flickered, but his heart was even more determined.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, although the conditions you mentioned are shocking and tempting, and even I was almost moved by you, it’s a pity that the disciple you mentioned is indeed dead. I can’t let you see her again even if you talk about heaven-breaking,” Valley Master Longyu said.","“Of course, if you really want to see her, there’s a way. After all, you’re a member of the Temporal Temple, and your talent is so high. The Temporal Temple Master must think highly of you. You can ask the Temporal Temple Master to help you reverse time and space and resurrect her.”","Upon hearing Valley Master Longyu’s words, Jian Wushuang’s face turned extremely gloomy.","He did not expect that Valley Master Longyu would insist that his wife was dead even though he had shown enough sincerity and lowered his attitude!","This left him no room for negotiation.","It was useless no matter what he said.","As for Valley Master Longyu’s request for him to invite Temporal Temple Master to perform the reverse of time and space...","That was right. The Temporal Temple Master valued him very much. If he went to beg Temporal Temple Master, even though the price of performing the reverse of time and space was very high, Temporal Temple Master might really help him once. But the key was...! Temporal Temple Master was not in","Temporal Temple at all!","He had already gone to the universe battlefield and had just left. It was impossible for him to come back now, so it was impossible for him to help him reverse time and space.","Valley Master Longyu knew this, so she dared to say this, not giving Jian Wushuang any chance to refute.","“Since you’re already dead, you can ask Temporal Temple Master to reverse time and space if you have the ability.” Valley Master Longyu sneered in her heart.","“Valley Master Longyu, it seems that you really don’t want to give me any chance. You really want to shed all pretense of cordiality with me.” Jian Wushuang’s voice had become extremely cold.","“I don’t have that idea, but the person you’re talking about is indeed dead. There’s nothing I can do.” Valley Master Longyu said.","“Very good.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned scarlet as if he was a demon from hell. “Valley Master Longyu, you might not know this, but I said something to you when your people took my wife away from the Dragon-phoenix Pavilion, didn’t I?”","“What did you say?” Valley Master Longyu and the Principles Masters looked over.","“L said to Master Zhu Xin that if my wife lost a hair or suffered any grievance, I would wipe out your entire clan!” Jian Wushuang said slowly, “Now since you said that my wife is dead, there is no need for your clan to exist anymore!”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what did you say?” Valley Master Longyu was immediately enraged.","“How arrogant.” The Principles Masters of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley were also shocked and angry.","The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had always been arrogant because of its strongest support. Even the three Freedom Alliance and the three Saint Realms were not afraid of them. As for Jian Wushuang...although they had some concerns, they were not afraid of him.","However, such a person said that he wanted to destroy the entire Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley in front of all of them?","How could they not be angry!","“I, Heavenly Sword Marquis, have never been careless with my words. Since I said that I wanted to destroy your entire family, I will destroy your entire family.” As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and a mini palace appeared in his hand.","As soon as the palace appeared, it immediately attracted the attention of the experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Because they had sensed the aura of many saints from the palace, it was not surprising, the Immortal Saints imprisoned in the palace were the disciples of the Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley who had been suppressed by Jian Wushuang.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what are you going to do?” Valley Master Longyu’s face was cold.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. With just a thought, a terrifying power directly covered the mini palace. In an instant, dozens of disciples of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley who were imprisoned in the mini palace were crushed under the pressure, their bodies were immediately shattered. Even their","immortal bodies were useless.","This scene made Valley Master Longyu and the other rule masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley extremely shocked and angry.","However, Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand again. What appeared in his hand was a mini blood-red tower. This blood-red tower exuded the aura of a supreme treasure. The moment Valley Master Longyu and the others saw this blood-red tower...their eyes were wide open because they had already","sensed the auras of Han Xin and Zhu Xin Master in the blood-red tower.","At the same time, a surge of astonishing power rose from Jian Wushuang’s body and directly covered the scarlet tower.","“No!”","“Stop!”","Valley Master Longyu and Master Gorsch were both furious.","However, the power had already affected Zhu Xin and Han Xin. Although they were both Principles Masters, they were suppressed in the scarlet tower and could not resist Jian Wushuang’s power at all.","Boom! The terrifying power crushed their divine bodies in an instant. However, they were Principles Masters after all, so it was not enough to kill them with just one attack, however, they had already used up nearly half of their divine power.","A large amount of power surged from Jian Wushuang’s body again. It was obvious that he intended to cover them with power for the second time.","“He’s courting death!”","“Stop him!”","The people from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley immediately attacked.","They did not dare to give Jian Wushuang a second chance to use his power to crush them. Therefore, if they used their power to crush them again, Zhu Xin and Han Xin in the blood-red tower would probably be able to withstand it. They would most likely die!","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re too impudent!”","The cold voice came from Master Gorsch, who was exuding a shocking destructive aura."]},{"number":3378,"title":"Chapter 3378 - Fierce Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A majestic aura surged out of Master Gorsch’s body and directly pressed down on Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","‘When they felt this aura, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo instantly understood the level of Master Gorsch.","“She really is in the sixth realm of the Void.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Tt seems that this old woman has not wasted her time.” Demon Master Chenhuo was still very relaxed.","Many Principles Masters of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley looked proud.","Master Gorsch was the strongest person in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley besides the old master. He was also a great reliance!","In the second heaven, other overlord sects, like Xiaoyao Palace, the strongest Marquis Xiaoyao was only at the peak of the void fourth realm. However, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley’s foundation was obviously much deeper. As long as Master Gorsch took it out...is enough to bring shame to","almost all the sects in the duplex.","Buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz","buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz buzz.","She held a spear in her hand, the spear is extremely sharp, lightning-like thrust, three rules of the integration of the power, at this moment also completely revealed.","And at the moment when Master Gorsch made his move, the Demon Master Chenhuo also moved.","Demon Master Chenhuo’s figure flickered and appeared in front of Master Gorsch as though she had teleported. After that, a similarly shocking aura rose up. The Demon Master Chenhuo stretched out her palm and clenched it into a fist. After that, she directly punched out.","“Courting death!”","The eyes of Master Gorsch turned cold as she shouted out.","She was a great being of the sixth level of the Void Space Realm, and she did not hold back. As soon as she made her move, she tried her best. Even a great being of the sixth level of the Void Space Realm had to be fully focused to receive this spear, but this Demon Master Chenhuo...she did not dodge or","evade. Instead, she threw a punch.","The key point was that this fist did not even have a pair of fists or gloves or weapons. It was purely an empty-handed collision with her true treasure spear. If this was not courting death, then what was? In the blink of an eye, this sharp spear collided with Demon Master Chenhuo’s seemingly ordinary","fist.","Peng!","Aloud sound rang out. In an instant, space cracks that spread over 100 meters spread out crazily.","Heaven and earth seemed to split apart directly from the middle.","After this collision sound rang out, an extremely pathetic figure immediately retreated explosively from the battlefield.","This pathetic figure was still emitting a white light, but it was much dimmer than before.","“Uncle-Master Que!”","The scene in front of them shocked Longyu and the Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","They had been proud of the strength that Master Que had displayed, but in the blink of an eye, Master Que had been forced back by the opponent. Furthermore, the opponent had forced her back with his bare hands. He had not even used his weapon.","“How can this be?”","Master Que had a look of disbelief on her face. She raised her head and looked at the Demon Master Chenhuo in front of her.","At this moment, the Demon Master Chenhuo was still as calm as ever. However, there was a suffocating aura spreading from his body.","This aura was something that even Master Que could not help but be moved.","“Six realms of the Void, you are also at the six realms of the Void!” Master Que was extremely shocked, and a huge wave rose in her heart.","Although she had noticed Demon Master Chenhuo before, and at the same time, she knew about his talent in the past, but in her mind, he had been silent for so many years, and his reputation in the Divine Beginning Realm had not spread out at all, obviously, he had gone into seclusion.","Only by staying in seclusion could he escape the pursuit of the Flame Saint Realm. and since he was in seclusion, he was naturally completely cut off from the outside world, unable to obtain any opportunities and experiences. Even if nearly 200 million years had passed...his strength should not have","increased much.","But now, it was clear that she had guessed wrong!","“With his bare hands, he didn’t even use his gloves, yet he was able to force me back with a single punch. This strength...is definitely not just the ordinary six realms of the void. I’m afraid he has already reached the peak of the six realms of the Void!”","Thinking of this, Master Que sucked in a breath of cold air.","“Que, you and I had crossed paths before 200 million years ago. At that time, I had just stepped into the fourth realm of the Void not long ago. I didn’t gain any advantage from your hands and instead suffered a small loss. But today, I’m afraid the situation will have to be completely reversed.” Demon","Master Chenhuo sneered.","Master Que’s expression sank, but he shouted in a low voice, “Leave this Demon Master Chenhuo to me. You guys go deal with Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","Whoosh!","Master Gorsch’s figure flashed, and in the blink of an eye, he was engaged in a fierce battle with Demon Master Chenhuo.","Meanwhile, Longyu and the other elders of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley swarmed toward Jian Wushuang.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, release Master Han Xin and Master Zhu Xin, and we’ll spare your life!” Longyu shouted.","“Ridiculous.” Jian Wushuang smiled disdainfully with a sneer on his face. Although he did not use his power to kill Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin in the scarlet tower at the first moment, he immediately made his move.","His body flashed and he disappeared in front of the Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“Is this...shadowless escape art?”","“Be careful, this is the shadowless escape art created by Blood Blade Master. It’s very strange!”","The Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley immediately became alert.","In the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, besides Master Gorsch, she was the most powerful expert and also at the peak of the Void realm. She could see through Jian Wushuang’s escape art.","“He’s there, sixth elder, behind you!” Longyu immediately shouted.","“What?” The sixth elder of the Supreme Emotion Valley, a purple-clothed girl with a long whip, turned around immediately. Sure enough, Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared behind her, and as soon as he appeared, a blood-red flash had already attacked.","It was the second move of the bloody blade swordsmanship, the first move of heart penetration!","“It’s too fast!”","The purple-clothed girl was shocked. She immediately waved the long whip in her hand. The long whip was like a flood dragon, instantly wrapping around the blood-red flash, trying to block it, however, the terrifying piercing power of the blood-red flash was completely beyond her imagination.","Whoosh! Almost in an instant, the purple-clothed girl’s long whip was shaken to the side. Fortunately, the long whip was a supreme treasure. If it was an ordinary top-tier holy treasure, under the terrifying piercing power, the long whip would probably be shattered instantly.","The long whip was easily shaken away, and the blood-red shock wave did not decrease in power, but it continued to pierce through the purple-clothed girl’s divine body.","The purple-clothed girl immediately activated the surface defense of her body.","But in the end..."]},{"number":3379,"title":"Chapter 3379 - Dilemma","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chi!","‘The terrifying piercing force of the blood-red light shattered the defense on the purple-clothed girl’s body almost instantly. Then, it continued to attack the purple-clothed girl’s protective armor. Although the armor did not shatter...however, the piercing force crazily attacked her divine body. The","purple-clothed girl’s body trembled crazily, and 80% of her divine body collapsed on the spot!","Although it did not completely collapse, as a Principles Master, 80% of her divine body collapsed. It took her more than 30% of her divine power to recover in an instant.","After the collision with Jian Wushuang, the purple-robed girl was so frightened that she immediately retreated to the side.","As for Jian Wushuang...after he successfully fought with the purple-robed girl, he disappeared again. The Principles Masters nearby could not sense his position and could not surround him.","“He’s with you!”","Longyu spoke again and immediately informed the other Principles Masters of Jian Wushuang’s position.","However...as soon as she spoke, Jian Wushuang immediately changed his position. Although she could sense it at the first moment after she sensed it, she spoke it out from her mouth and finally made the other Principles Masters realize it, there was obviously a time difference between them.","Although the time difference was very small, it was enough for Jian Wushuang.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","In the void, Jian Wushuang relied on the shadowless escape art to conceal himself time and time again. Then, he attacked again and again at lightning speed. Although Longyu had wamed him at once, the reaction of the Principles Masters was still half a beat slower.","And this half a beat forced them to face Jian Wushuang’s attack head-on.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang’s speed was too fast when he used the shadowless escape art. Longyu had been trying to catch up with him. As long as she could fight with Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang would not be able to conceal himself anymore, the other Principles Masters could also attack, but the","problem was that Longyu could not keep up at all.","She could not keep up with Jian Wushuang, so she could only keep reminding him. However, the reminder only prepared the Principles Masters and gave them some reaction.","In other words, although there were many Principles Masters present in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, they could not surround Jian Wushuang at all, nor could they join hands. They could only passively wait for Jian Wushuang to kill them again and again.","Jian Wushuang had severely injured three Principles Masters’ divine bodies and depleted a lot of their divine power. If this continued, the Principles Masters’ divine power would be depleted more and more.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, if you have the ability, fight us head-on!” Longyu could not help but shout.","“Humph, what a joke. You have seven Principles Masters ganging up on me, an Immortal Saint, and you want me to fight you head-on?","“Longyu, are the people of Your Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley all so shameless?” Jian Wushuang scolded her coldly.","Being scolded by Jian Wushuang on the spot, Longyu’s face was extremely ugly, but she could not do anything about it.","Indeed, they had already outnumbered them. It was indeed a little shameless of them to ask Jian Wushuang to fight them head-on at this time.","However, if Jian Wushuang continued to rely on the shadowless escape art to fight them, they would be too passive. If this continued, the seven rule masters would be forced to retreat.","At first, Longyu knew that Jian Wushuang was hard to deal with, but she did not expect him to be so hard to deal with. At first, she had called Master Gorsch for insurance, but now, Master Gorsch was not in a good situation, let alone helping them to suppress Jian Wushuang.","Longyu had noticed that in the surrounding void, Demon Master Chenhuo, who was fighting Master Gorsch, had put on a golden-red glove!","The golden-red glove gave off a terrifying destructive aura. It was an extremely powerful true treasure. In terms of level, it was probably a top-tier true treasure!","Previously, when sinking fire devil master fought with the all-out gorse master with his bare hands, he was able to push back gorse master and put him in an extremely difficult situation, now Demon Master Chenhuo had taken out a top-tier true treasure weapon... Once the power of this top-tier true","treasure was added to it, it was enough to let Demon Master Chenhuo’s power reach a whole new level!","Sure enough, Demon Master Chenhuo, who had put on the golden fist gloves, had only attacked three times in the following fierce battle. She had not used any powerful techniques or trump cards, and she had fought head-on, however, Master Que could no longer withstand it, and their godly body had","obviously suffered a lot of damage.","“Too powerful. This Demon Master Chenhuo’s current strength has definitely reached the peak of the six states of the void. I’m afraid he’s only one step away from reaching the pinnacle of the six states of the void and grasping seven portions of the power of will. Furthermore, his innate talent is","extraordinary and his killing ability is terrifyingly strong, I’m completely not his match. Just Now, my divine power has already been depleted by nearly 30%. If this continues, I’m afraid it won’t be long before my entire body’s divine power is depleted.”","Master Gorsch’s face was extremely ugly. She was trying to find a way to resist the Demon Master’s crazy attack while sending a message to tell Longyu about her current situation. She wanted Longyu to think of a way quickly.","But what could Longyu think of now?","‘They were not in the nest of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. They could not use any powerful restrictions or magic arrays. They could only rely on their own strength. In terms of strength, they were obviously not as strong as Jian Wushuang and the Demon Master.","The question they faced now was whether to continue fighting or retreat!","They could not win ina fight!","If they retreated, they were afraid that Jian Wushuang would kill the suppressed Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin.","In other words, they were now in a dilemma.","Although Longyu was the Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, she did not know what to do.","However, just as Longyu and the others were in a dilemma, a figure suddenly appeared around the battlefield.","“Stop!”","The voice was a bit hoarse, but it was quite gentle. It was like the morning sun in winter, warming people’s hearts.","‘The experts of both sides, the Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, who were fighting fiercely, were shocked when they heard the voice, and then they became ecstatic.","As for Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo, they were also shocked.","The voice was very calm as if it could confuse their minds. They could not help but stop what they were doing.","The fierce battle was held up because of the voice.","The Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, including Master Gorse and Longyu, rushed to the figure who suddenly appeared and bent down.","“Greetings, old lord!”"]},{"number":3380,"title":"Chapter 3380 - The Old Lord","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Long Yu, as well as the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley’s Principles Masters, all had their heads lowered and were extremely respectful.","Even if it was Master Gorsch, who had already reached the sixth level of the void, in front of this person, he did not have the appearance of an expert at all. Regardless of whether it was his expression or gaze, they were filled with unprecedented respect and fanaticism.","This was very normal because the person who had arrived was their old master!","He was the greatest reliance of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and also their greatest pride.","“All rise.”","A hoarse and gentle voice rang out once again. Master Gorsch, Longyu, and the others raised their heads and looked at their old master.","This old master was extremely thin and weak. She was probably only 1.5 meters tall, appearing somewhat short. She had silver-gray hair and wore a coarse and loose linen robe, she was holding a kirin walking stick in her hand. Her face was full of wrinkles, and her eyes were completely sunken. Only a","line could be seen.","It was difficult to associate such a thin, weak, and frail old woman with the word ‘expert.","But everyone present knew clearly that this old woman possessed earth-shaking strength.","“Is she the old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?”","Jian Wushuang stood there with a solemn gaze. He looked at the old woman and was a little shocked.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, we’re in trouble.” Demon Master Chenhuo appeared beside Jian Wushuang and said in a low voice, “The old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is an extremely terrifying existence.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. Of course, he knew.","The old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was said to be the only one who had cultivated the divine skill to an extremely high level. Although she was still at the level of a rule master, she was at most at the pinnacle of the six void realms, however, once she used the supreme divine","skill of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, her battle strength instantly soared to a whole new level.","Even the three great Saint Realm Masters, even the true rulers, would be afraid of that level.","Therefore, after a long period of time, regardless of whether it was the three great Saint Realms or the three great Freedom Alliances, when they faced the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, they all had some misgivings. When they fought for some benefits...they did not dare to push the Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley too far.","Once they pushed the valley too far, the three Freedom Alliances and the three Saint Realms would have a headache when the old Valley Master showed up.","This time, although Jian Wushuang did not push the valley to the limit, he did it at the gate of the valley. When Longyu, Master Gorse, and the others could not do anything to them...finally, the old Valley Master came out personally.","“You are Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","The old woman spoke gently. She slowly raised her eyes, which had narrowed into a line, and looked at Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis greets you, senior.” Jian Wushuang also appeared to be quite humble and bowed slightly at the first moment.","“You are too kind. Although I have stayed in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley for many years, I have heard a lot about you. You have severely injured the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God in the Saint Realm. Your ability is really admirable,” the old woman said.","“You flatter me,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The old woman looked at Demon Master Chenhuo again. “My young friend Chenhuo of the Amethyst Demon Sect, I have a lot of connections with the Amethyst Demon sect. I felt sorry for the destruction of the Amethyst Demon Sect, but I’m glad to see you again today.”","“It’s my honor to meet you, senior,” Demon Master Chenhuo said with a dry smile, keeping a low profile.","What a joke. This old woman in front of him was a terrifying old monster who had lived for God knows how many years and was extremely powerful. Even when the Amethyst Demon Sect was still around...his master and some of the upper echelons of the Amethyst Demon Sect had to respectfully address","this old woman as a junior. Although Demon Master Chenhuo was not weak, in front of this old woman...he did not dare to put on any airs.","“Young friend Heavenly Sword Marquis, young friend Chenhuo, I already know about this matter,” the old woman said slowly, “It doesn’t matter who is right or wrong, Since I have already made an appearance, I will let it go. I will not pursue the matter of your killing the disciples of our Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley. However, I hope that you can release Zhu Xin and Han Xin for my sake.”","The old woman clearly did not intend to kill Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo, nor did she say that she wanted to seek justice for the disciples who had been killed by Jian Wushuang. She just wanted to resolve the matter.","Upon hearing this, Longyu, Master Gorsch, and the other experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley frowned. However, since the old master had said it herself, they naturally did not dare to disobey her.","However, they were willing to resolve the matter, but Jian Wushuang was not happy.","“Senior, there is no enmity between me and Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. I have always been respectful and friendly to them. Not long ago, I saved Han Xin’s life in the Blood Wave Realm. It can be said that I really hope to become friends with them, but the prerequisite is that they let me take my","wife away!”","“Master!” Jian Wushuang’s voice was extremely solemn.","“Senior, you want me to release Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin. That’s fine, but I have to see my wife first!”","Jian Wushuang obviously would not forget his purpose of coming here just because of the appearance of the old master.","He wanted to find his wife and take her away. No one could stop him.","The old master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was indeed an earth-shaking expert and was very difficult to deal with. Jian Wushuang did not want to be her enemy unless necessary, but now...for his wife, he had no choice!","“Your wife? Leng ‘er?” The old woman pondered for a moment then shook her head. “No, Leng ‘er is very important to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. I can’t let you see her and affect her state of mind.”","“Then I can only let you down.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","“Young friend, are you really going to make an enemy of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” The old woman raised her eyelids slightly, and a sharp cold light flashed out of the gap between her eyes.","This cold light made people’s hearts tremble.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo felt a chill in their bodies and hearts under this cold light.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, think carefully. This old monster is not to be trifled with. Why don’t we leave this place first and make a long-term plan?” Demon Master Chenhuo said softly. It was obvious that he was already a little afraid."]},{"number":3381,"title":"Chapter 3381 - Threats","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Leave first?”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, but his eyes were filled with unprecedented determination. “Impossible. I can give in to anything, but I can’t give in to this!”","“Senior, I don’t want to make an enemy of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, but I have to take my wife with me. If you don’t allow it, I’ll have to offend you.” Jian Wushuang growled and flipped his palm, he took out the scarlet tower again.","Although the divine power of Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin had recovered a little, they could still be easily killed by Jian Wushuang if he wanted to.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how dare you?”","“How dare you act presumptuously in front of the old master?”","Longyu and Master Gorse were shocked by Jian Wushuang’s action and shouted.","“Shut up!” Jian Wushuang glanced at Longyu and Master Gorsch, which made them even more furious.","“My young friend, I haven’t fought for many years, and I don’t want to do it today. But if you want to continue, I’ll bully you no matter what.” The old woman just looked at Jian Wushuang calmly.","Jian Wushuang did not speak, but a majestic power surged out of his body. The moment the majestic power surged out, it was ready to cover the blood-red tower in front of him. But at this moment...whoosh!","The old woman in the void in front of him suddenly disappeared.","‘When she reappeared, she had already passed through Jian Wushuang. However, although the old woman had passed through Jian Wushuang’s divine body, the latter’s body began to slowly disappear.","The old woman’s face slightly sank.","Whoosh!","In the void on the other side, Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared out of thin air, and his aura was slightly weakened. Apparently, the old woman’s attack had not hurt him at all.","“Time-space teleportation?” The old woman looked at Jian Wushuang again.","“Lknow that senior’s strength is unfathomable. In a head-on fight, even if ten of me are tied together, I’m definitely not your match. But I’m afraid it won’t be so easy for you to kill me.” Jian Wushuang also looked at the old woman.","‘Their eyes met in the void, and for a moment, the space completely froze.","The old woman was still as calm as an ancient well, she said indifferently, “The space-time divine art created by the Temporal Temple Master is indeed extraordinary. Among them, the space-time teleportation is the strongest life-saving technique in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, although the","space-time teleportation is amazing, as long as we can use the space-time imprisonment, we can’t use it.”","“I don’t know how to use space-time imprisonment, but I happen to have a special treasure. As long as an expert who specializes in space-time principles is able to use it, it won’t be difficult for me to use it.","“Longyu, the principles you control contain space-time principles. I’ll give you this jade ring and you can use space-time imprisonment.”","The old woman waved her hand and threw a purple jade ring at Longyu.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted slightly, but he immediately relaxed. “Senior, even if you want Valley Master Longyu to use the jade ring to confine time and space, I’m afraid you won’t be able to stop me from leaving, right?”","Jian Wushuang smiled and flipped his hand, and a purple-gold token that emitted a strong power of time and space appeared in his hand.","At the sight of the purple-gold token, the old woman was finally moved. “Heaven-painting golden flag?”","“Yes, it’s the golden sky-painting flag. But I wonder if the jade ring given by senior can be compared to the one in my hand?” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","“The golden sky-painting flag is a top-notch treasure in space-time. It’s very difficult to find a treasure in space-time that is higher than the golden sky-painting flag in the entire Divine Beginning Realm. It’s not something that my jade ring can compare to. I just didn’t expect that the Temporal Temple","Master would give the golden sky-painting flag to you. It seems that the Temporal Temple Master values you very much,” the old woman said.","“Senior, since you know about the golden banner, you should know that with my knowledge of space-time principles and the Mansion Master of the Golden Banner, I can easily break the space-time restriction. However, you still can’t keep me here,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s right.” The old woman nodded slightly. The moment she saw the golden banner, she knew that it was impossible for her to kill Jian Wushuang here, even though she was extremely powerful.","“Senior, you can’t kill me, but I can easily kill people from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, such as master Zhu Xin and Han Xin in the scarlet tower. As long as I use my mind, they will die. So, I hope you can consider what I said before.”Jian wushuang looked at the old woman.","“Young friend, are you threatening me?” The old woman asked coldly.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and admitted, “Perhaps my wife is too important to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and you are not willing to make concessions for Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin. According to Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin, this is just the beginning. If you don’t agree, I will stand","guard outside the valley from now on. I will kill any expert or disciple who dares to take a step out of the valley!”","“No matter how long it takes, 100 years, 1,000 years, 10,000 years...unless I die, don’t even think about stepping out of the valley!”","Jian Wushuang’s killing intent was fierce, and his cold voice reverberated in the air like the voice of the grim reaper.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the Principles Masters of the valley were instantly enraged.","The weathered old woman’s face also turned cold.","However, no matter how angry they were, they had to carefully consider the threat that Jian Wushuang had mentioned.","It was true that they could not kill Jian Wushuang. Even if their old master appeared personally, Jian Wushuang could easily escape by using time-space teleportation.","If Jian Wushuang did not die, with his battle strength, if he stayed in Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley from now on and killed anyone he saw outside, the consequences...would be too much for them to bear.","‘They knew that Jian Wushuang was from the Temporal Temple, but they could not threaten him like Jian Wushuang did. The Temporal Temple was not only powerful, but also very mysterious, they were too mysterious.","Everyone in the Divine Beginning Realm knew that the Temporal Temple was terrifying, but so far, no one knew where it was.","If they did not even know where the Temporal Temple’s lair was, how could the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley retaliate against Jian Wushuang?"]},{"number":3382,"title":"Chapter 3382 - Compromise","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The vast void had completely frozen. The whole world was silent.","The old woman’s eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang. She did not speak for a long time.","As for the Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, no one dared to say anything.","After a long while, the weathered old woman’s expression changed slightly and she said, “I have lived for so many years, but this is the first time someone dares to threaten me in front of me. I have to say that you are very courageous.”","comment","“Senior, please forgive me. I would never dare to be disrespectful to you unless I had no choice,” Jian Wushuang said.","“can see that you are very stubborn. In that case, I will allow you to meet her,” the weathered old woman said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","The Principles Masters in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley changed their expressions slightly, but they did not say anything.","They also knew that their old master could not do anything to Jian Wushuang and could only make some concessions.","“My friend, follow me to the valley.” The old woman’s voice became gentle again.","Jian Wushuang nodded and felt slightly relieved. The atmosphere around them had finally calmed down.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, are you really going to follow her to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley?” Demon Master Chenhuo came to Jian Wushuang’s side and asked carefully.","“Or what?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Tcan go, but I have to be careful. This old monster has unfathomable means and seldom contacts with the outside world. No one knows her temper. If you threaten her in front of so many people, who knows whether she will hold a grudge against you?” Demon Master Chenhuo secretly sent a voice","transmission.","“Now that we’re outside Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, she can’t do anything to you. However, once we’re in Supreme Emotion Valley, there are many restrictive spells there. Even if you have a strong life-saving ability, this old monster might be able to kill you. When that time comes...”","“Idon’t think so.” Before Demon Master Chenhuo finished his words, Jian Wushuang waved his hand, “The old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has a high prestige in the Divine Beginning Realm. She should pay attention to her status, so the possibility of her going back on her","word is very low. Moreover, even if she does go back on her word and try to kill me with the help of some restrictions in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, I won’t be afraid.”","Jian Wushuang had enough confidence.","With his current life-saving means and the life-saving command token given by Temporal Temple Master, even three Saint Realm Masters of the three Saint Realms would not be able to do anything to him. As for the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, even if it was a dragon’s den or a tiger’s den...it","would not be able to threaten his life.","“Let’s go.”","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang followed the old woman into the valley.","Previously, when Jian Wushuang came to the valley, he was refused entry. But this time, because of the personal guidance of Longyu and the others, he was not hindered at all.","After entering the valley, Jian Wushuang also looked at the scene in the valley.","As the overlord of the Second Heaven and a top sect in the Divine Beginning Realm, the valley was not as magnificent as he had imagined. Instead, it was quiet and peaceful. There were many buildings in the valley, most of them were elegant.","Under the guidance of the old woman, Jian Wushuang soon arrived in front of a huge mountain.","This huge mountain was located in a very special geographical position. It was in the center of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and the entire mountain was covered by a special restriction, which clearly isolated the mountain completely.","“My friend, you are now looking at the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley’s Love Valley, which is where I live. The person you are looking for also lives in this mountain. Now I can take you into the Love Valley, but only you. As for your friend, Chenhuo, please wait here for a while,” the old woman said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He was the only one allowed to enter the mountain, and Chenhuo had to wait outside?","“Humph, Heavenly Sword Marquis, I’m afraid you don’t know the rules of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. The mountain in front of you is a forbidden area of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. No one is allowed to enter it. Even as the current Valley Master, I have to inform the old master","in advance if I want to enter, let alone an outsider like you. I can only enter after the old master agrees.” Longyu snorted.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","According to Longyu, he, the current Valley Master of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, was not qualified to enter and leave Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley at will. Now that the old woman was willing to take him in, it was already a great favor to him.","“Chenhuo, wait for me here,” Jian Wushuang instructed.","“Well, be careful.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded.","“My young friend, follow me in.” The old woman waved her hand, and a space passage appeared in front of them. The old woman led Jian Wushuang into the space passage.","After walking out of the space passage, they arrived at the mountainside. Under the guidance of the old woman, Jian Wushuang came to a cave mansion in the middle of the mountain.","“My friend, the person you want to see is in this cave mansion,” the old woman said.","Jian Wushuang immediately looked into the cave mansion. Although the cave mansion was very deep, Jian Wushuang could still sense the figure in the deepest part of the cave mansion.","“Shuang er!”","The familiar aura and feeling made Jian Wushuang’s body and heart tremble.","However, just as Jian Wushuang was about to step into the cave mansion, the old woman reached out and stopped him.","“My friend, you can’t enter the cave mansion,” the old woman said.","“Why?” Jian Wushuang frowned, and his voice sounded urgent.","“Although I promised to let you meet her, I didn’t promise to let you have any contact with her,” the old woman said.","“Senior.” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, and there was a trace of anger in his eyes.","He wanted to meet Leng Rushuang, so how could he just give her a simple look?","He noticed the change in Jian Wushuang’s expression, the old woman smiled bitterly and said, “My friend, it’s not that I’m unreasonable, but my disciple is in a critical period of cultivation. At this time, she must not be disturbed by anyone!”","“A critical period of cultivation? Is it to cultivate that divine skill?” Jian Wushuang glanced at the old woman. “If she completely cultivates it, won’t she completely abandon her emotions? I won’t be able to recover her previous life’s memories in the future..”"]},{"number":3383,"title":"Chapter 3383 - The Best of Both Worlds","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“It’s true.”","The old woman also nodded in acknowledgment, “Once you have successfully cultivated the supreme divine skill of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, you will abandon all feelings between men and women. Even if you have restored her memory of her previous life, her feelings will still be","abandoned. However, the supreme divine skill is extraordinary. It’s not easy to master it.”","“What do you mean?” Jian Wushuang asked in a deep voice.","“My friend, you should know that the supreme divine skill can only be cultivated by someone with a pure heart who has not been influenced by the secular world. Because of this, it is difficult for the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to find a suitable person for cultivation!”","“The girl in the cave mansion has lived two lives. If it was just this one life, it would definitely be the best choice to cultivate the divine skill. However, because she still carries the memories of her previous life, she will be greatly hindered in cultivating the divine skill.” The old woman’s voice became","serious.","“When the girl was brought to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley and brought to me, I found that she was very special. Although she had lived two lifetimes, she had two lifetimes of memories, but the memories of her previous life had been suppressed, or even sealed.”","“Sealed?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Indeed.” The old woman continued, “I carefully examined her body and finally came to the conclusion that the expert must have forcibly injected a part of the will power into her body when she reincarnated!”","“This portion of the power of will should have originated from a Principles Master. Moreover, under that expert’s methods, the power of this will has been completely erased from that Principles Master’s will. What it possesses is only some understanding and comprehension regarding the principles. For","anyone to have such power of will remain in their body is simply a great fortune!","“After all, the power of will can only be acquired after mastering a complete set of principles. With a complete set of power of will in his body, it means that even if he doesn’t cultivate, he can still become a Principles Master in a short period of time as long as he slowly transmits the power of will in his","body.”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","He immediately recalled that when he met Leng Rushuang in the Nine Realms of the Golden Crow, she was known as the most powerful genius in the Nine Realms of the Golden Crow. She was even more dazzling than him because at that time, even if Leng Rushuang did not cultivate...her comprehension","of the principles could be improved at an incredible speed. It was as easy as eating and drinking.","At that time, Jian Wushuang thought it was incredible. But now, he finally understood!","“The master that the old valley master mentioned should be master, right?” Jian Wushuang muttered in his heart.","He could guess that his Master Xuan Yi was also worried that Leng Rushuang would not be able to grow after coming to the Divine Beginning Realm because she did not have Jian Wushuang’s great talent advantage. She might even die before Jian Wushuang found her, he had met with some kind of threat","and died. That was why his master had used a great method to forcefully bestow a portion of the power of will on Leng Rushuang. It could be considered as giving Leng Rushuang some support so that she could wait for Jian Wushuang’s arrival.","Jian Wushuang could completely understand his master’s action.","“That expert’s method is indeed heaven- defying, Forcibly bestowing a portion of the power of will on a reincarnated soul without damaging it at all. Such a method is beyond my reach.” The old woman sighed softly.","“However, that expert might not have thought of it himself, Although the power of will did not harm the soul, because it contained too many things and was too vast, it completely suppressed or even sealed the memories of the reincarnated soul. Therefore, after the baby was bom, it did not immediately","recover the memories of its previous life.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","He had never understood why Leng Rushuang did not have any memories of his previous life when he entered the reincarnation passage with her.","It turned out that Leng Rushuang did not have any memories. It was just that her memories of her previous life had been sealed because of the power of her will.","Naturally, she could not remember them.","“Of course, although the girl’s memories from her previous life were sealed, as long as the Principles Master appeared, she could easily suppress the power of the will in her body temporarily and help her recover the memories from her previous life,” the old woman said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was delighted.","Obviously, if he wanted to recover Leng Rushuang’s memories, it would be very easy.","“After knowing this, I’m not sure if she can continue to cultivate that divine skill, but I still let her start to cultivate that divine skill with the attitude of giving it a try. The result of the cultivation was unexpectedly out of my expectations. She was not affected by the memories of her previous life at all. Her","cultivation speed is very amazing, much faster than when I first cultivated it!","“After that, I understood that as long as I completely sealed the girl’s past memories, she would definitely be able to master the divine skill and even cultivate it to the highest level, much higher than my level. Therefore, I personally set up a seal in her body to ensure that her past memories could no","longer recover on their own.”","“Senior!” Jian Wushuang was shocked and angry.","“My young friend, don’t worry.” The old woman comforted Jian Wushuang, “Before I met you, I didn’t want to restore her memory from her previous life. I even thought about whether it was possible to completely erase her memory from her previous life. However, after meeting you, I changed my mind.”","“can’t help it. Your talent is unparalleled and your potential is so great that no one in the Divine Beginning Realm can compare to you. In the future, you might really reach a level that no one in the Divine Beginning Realm has ever reached. I, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, naturally don’t want","to offend you too much. Therefore, I can take a step back and choose a way to achieve the best of both worlds.”","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked over.","“Soul peeling!” The old woman laughed.","“Soul peeling?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. Of course, he understood what the old woman meant by soul peeling. It was forcibly turning one soul into two souls, or one person...into two people.","Such a method was not easy to accomplish. The slightest carelessness could lead to the complete annihilation of the soul.","“Senior, are you planning to separate her past life and present life into two people through soul peeling?” Jian Wushuang looked at the old woman."]},{"number":3384,"title":"Chapter 3384 - Soul Peeling","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“That’s it.” The old woman said seriously, “Soul peeling is to turn this girl’s soul into two pieces. One of them will carry her memories from her previous life, and you will take it with you. The other piece will carry her memories from this life, and she will continue to stay in my Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley to cultivate that supreme divine art!”","“This way, the good thing is that you can have the best of both worlds. After all, you only want your wife from your previous life. As for the bad thing, once you peel off her soul, the two parts of her soul will not be complete. Thus, you will need some treasures related to the soul to completely restore her","soul. The requirements for such a soul treasure are extremely high. In the Divine Beginning Realm, the only thing that can fulfill this condition is the soul treasure, the star-moon Agarwood. Moreover, it must be a hundred million years old!”","“The star-moon Agarwood is an extremely rare treasure. In the Divine Beginning Realm, it can even be said to be extinct. This kind of treasure lives in an extremely harsh environment. It’s hard to even exist for a million years. Thus, it’s even harder to obtain a hundred million years old star-moon","agarwood.”","“However, my Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley once obtained a small piece of hundred million years old star-moon agarwood by chance. It can be used on the soul that was left in my Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley after it was peeled off, allowing it to completely recover. As for the part of the","soul that retained your wife’s memories, you’ll have to think of a way yourself.”","“Of course, since our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has a piece of hundred-million-year-old star-moon agarwood, and as the most ancient and mysterious Temporal Temple of the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm, we should have it. Even if we don’t have it, we can definitely","find a way to get it.”","After saying that, the old woman looked at Jian Wushuang again.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was silent.","Soul peeling...Jian Wushuang had some understanding of soul peeling and knew the advantages and disadvantages of soul peeling.","Most importantly, his wife, Leng Rushuang, had actually carried out soul peeling in her previous life.","Because of her special physique, her wife’s soul was divided into two parts. One part of her personality became Leng Rushuang, and the other part was the evil incarnation of her physique, Leng Ruxue, the two souls occupied the same body. At first, Leng Rushuang was in charge, but later, Leng Rushuang’s","soul consciousness was suppressed and led by Leng Ruxue.","In the end, their souls were completely separated. Leng Ruxue followed her master into the Divine Beginning Realm, while Leng Rushuang entered the reincarnation passage like Jian Wushuang.","In other words, Leng Rushuang had stripped her soul before, and she had already borne the price.","“Senior, if her soul is stripped in two, who will be in charge of her body now?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course, the soul left in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, which is my disciple, will be in charge.” The old woman said seriously, “I can’t help it. The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has spent a lot of money to nurture this girl. Now that she has finally reached this level, she is very close to the","top of the supreme divine skill. At this moment, I won’t let her give up this body and start over!”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","He knew that the soul stripping was actually tolerable for Leng Rushuang. The key question was who would control her current body once the soul was stripped.","Of course, Jian Wushuang hoped that his wife could control this body, but the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley obviously would not allow it.","Jian Wushuang could understand. After all, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had indeed paid too much for her to cultivate the supreme divine skill. If she let the soul with the memories of this life leave this body...then she would have to start all over again. It was absolutely unbearable for the","Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you may not know this, but I will soon die,” the old woman suddenly said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang looked at her in surprise.","The old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion Valley, a task that even the three masters of the Saint Realm, including the Temporal Temple Master, were afraid of, would soon die? Was this a joke?","“Tm not lying to you,” the old woman said solemnly. “The supreme divine skill of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is very special. Although it’s extremely powerful and can allow me, who was only at the sixth realm of the Void realm, to burst out with battle strength comparable to that of a master,","or even stronger than an ordinary master, it’s so powerful that I have to pay a price every time I use it.”","“What’s the price?” Jian Wushuang asked immediately.","Lifespan!” The old woman sighed, she continued, “Under normal circumstances, when a cultivator reaches the level of a Principles Master, their lifespan may not be endless, but it’s also very long. However, no matter who it is, as long as they cultivate the divine skill of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting","Valley, there’s no such thing as an endless lifespan.","“Thave personally experienced it. For example, when I cultivate the divine skill to this level, my lifespan can only last for one billion years at most.”","“One billion years is considered very long. Senior’s lifespan should be far from one billion years, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Although he did not know how long the old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had lived, as far as he knew, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had existed in the Divine Beginning Realm for less than one billion years.","“Just based on the time I’ve lived, this old body is still far from one billion years. However, this old body has just said that these one billion years of life is just the threshold to cultivate that divine technique. After cultivating, every time I use it, it will consume my life. Under normal circumstances, every","time this old body uses that divine technique, it will consume one hundred million years of life!”","“Thave been staying in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley ever since I started cultivating that divine skill. During that time, the valley had encountered many dangers, so I had to use all my strength. I have used that divine skill many times, and my lifespan has been continuously consumed. So far, I","have less than 100 million years left!”","“Less than 100 million years? Does that mean...” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","“Yes, if I use that divine skill one more time, I will die immediately. So, even if you disrespect me today and threaten me in front of me, I have not completely shed all pretense of cordiality with you. Although this is also because of your strong life-saving skills, more importantly, I don’t want to give you","this last chance to use the divine skill,” the old woman said.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and sighed in his heart.","He had thought that the old Valley Master was really helpless against him, so he had to step back. But now it seemed that was not the case.."]},{"number":3385,"title":"Chapter 3385 - The Enemy of the Supreme Emotion-Forgetting Valley","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Thave less than 100 million years left, and I can only use the divine skill once more. I don’t want to use it unless I have no other choice, because once I use it, my death is nothing. The key is that the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has lost my intimidation. I’m afraid that it will be destroyed soon,” the","old woman said.","“Destroyed? Senior, you can’t be that serious, right?” Jian Wushuang frowned, “No matter what, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley is an overlord in the Second Heaven. It has more than ten Principles Masters under it, and it has a huge foundation. Such a powerful sect, even if it loses your","intimidation, will not be as fearful as before. However, once the sect forces come, they will not easily provoke the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, right?”","Jian Wushuang was very confused.","Because in his opinion, even if the old Valley Master did not exist in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, with an expert of the six void realms like Master Gorsch and the foundation of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, he was still far stronger than a force like the Xiaoyao Mansion.","How could such an overlord be easily destroyed without any reason?","“Little friend, although our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley appears to be glorious on the surface and because of me, no one has dared to provoke us for a long time, in fact, there are many hidden dangers in our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, especially in terms of enemies. Our Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley has a great enemy,” the weathered old woman said.","“Great enemy?” Jian Wushuang was startled.","“The Destruction Saint Realm, one of the three Saint Realms, is a great enemy of our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley,” the weathered old woman said in a low voice, “Many years ago, our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley offended the Destruction Saint Realm because of some conflicts of interest.","Later, in the universe battlefield, I completely offended the Destruction Saint Realm!”","“The universe battlefield?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Yes, it was in the universe battlefield that I obtained the supreme divine skill. However, the three Principles Masters of the Saint Destruction Realm fought with me at the same time. When they saw that I had obtained the divine skill, they immediately tried to snatch it. Unfortunately, they were not","strong enough. Not only did they fail to snatch the divine skill from me, but they were also killed by me on the spot.” The old woman sneered.","“However, because of this matter, Destruction Saint Realm was furious. However, because I had never been to the Divine Beginning Realm or touched the secular world, Destruction Saint Realm couldn’t figure out my true identity for a while. It wasn’t until a lucky coincidence that they found out that I was","from the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. After they found out, Destruction Saint Realm immediately sent a large number of experts over. Even Destruction Saint Master’s consciousness appeared.","“However, after they found out my true identity, I had already mastered that divine art and cultivated it to a certain level. That’s why I directly attacked the Destruction Saint Realm experts and repelled them head-on. Even the Destruction Saint Realm Master’s consciousness was torn to shreds on the","spot!”","At this point, the vicissitudes of life revealed a cold smile.","“After that battle, my name naturally shook the world. Destruction Saint Realm did not know my actual strength, so they did not continue to fight. After that, our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley and Destruction Saint Realm had several clashes. I also fought with Destruction Saint Master’s original","body several times, but each time I used the divine skill, Destruction Saint Master could only escape in a sorry state. After a few lessons, Destruction Saint Master finally calmed down. After so many years, he did not dare to have a large-scale collision with our Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang finally understood.","He finally understood why the old Valley Master had said that the Destruction Saint Realm was a great enemy of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","“Indeed, the three Saint Realms are the rulers of the Divine Beginning Realm because of the power of the will of heaven. To a certain extent, even the three Freedom Alliances are at a disadvantage against the three Saint Realms. Because of this, the three Saint Realms have always been overbearing, and","they have always treated the sects of the Divine Beginning Realm as if they were kings and subjects!”","“In the Divine Beginning Realm, if any sect dares to be disrespectful to the three Saint Realms, the three Saint Realms will immediately punish them. The sects can not afford any punishment, and the Amethyst Demon Sect was completely destroyed.","“The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley has fought with the Destruction Saint Realm several times, but the latter didn’t gain any advantage. Moreover, the Destruction Saint Master has suffered a few losses at your hands. The Destruction Saint Master will definitely hold a grudge!”","“It’s fine for you to stay in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley for now, but once you die, the Destruction Saint Realm might directly attack the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley,” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","“That’s exactly what I think.” The old woman said, “So before I die, I must do everything for the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to cultivate a person who can cultivate the divine skill to the top level. The girl in the cave mansion can be said to be my last hope. The progress of the girl is very smooth,","but now with your unexpected change...","“Thave no choice but to find a way to get the best of both worlds by stripping her soul. However, after stripping her soul, her body must remain in the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. This is my bottom line. Otherwise, I don’t have the confidence to let her start over and cultivate to the top level again","in the remaining time.”","After saying that, the old woman looked at Jian Wushuang. Her eyes opened slightly, and there was a hint of pleading in them.","Obviously, the old Valley Master had made a final concession. She hoped that Jian Wushuang would understand, but she accepted it if he did not.","“Senior, I understand what you said. But if I take my wife’s soul and leave, how can I make her recover completely?” Jian Wushuang asked.","He knew alittle about soul stripping, but he did not know how to find a new body and restore it to its original state.","“It’s not difficult. First, you have to get the star-moon Agarwood and make your wife’s soul complete. Then, you can choose two methods to make your wife recover,” the old woman explained.","“First, the first method is for you to find a suitable body. Then, you can invite an expert who specializes in souls to help your wife’s soul enter that body directly and possess it. You can completely wipe out the original consciousness of that body and let your wife occupy it.","“This method is the simplest, but it has many flaws.”"]},{"number":3386,"title":"Chapter 3386 - 6: Risks","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“After all, it’s forcefully taking over the other party’s body. There must be a lot of initial forays into your own body. Although the consciousness of the owner of that body will be completely wiped out, there will more or less remain some things of the other party. It will have a certain impact on your wife’s","consciousness, and it will be possible for your wife to make some changes.","“In addition, if the person your wife possessed was only an ordinary person or some weaker cultivators, it would be slightly better to be able to control them. However, if the person who possessed was quite powerful, for example, to possess a Principles Master, then even if this Principles Master’s","consciousness was wiped out, the power in his body was not something that your wife’s consciousness could control. The slightest carelessness could result in unimaginable consequences!”","“These are the risks that must be borne by forcibly possessing a soul!” The old woman said.","“Te also heard of soul possession. Not only is it very risky, but it’s also too vicious. Even if my wife’s soul is stripped, she wouldn’t choose to use this method to choose a body that doesn’t belong to her,” Jian Wushuang said.","“If you don’t want to rely on soul possession, you can only rely on treasures to create a new body for your wife,” the old woman said.","“How?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“To create a new body that is exactly the same as your wife’s divine body without any discomfort or incipient experience, ordinary treasures won’t work. As far as I know, there is a special treasure in the world called the iceheart glazed jade. This treasure can create a glazed body according to the wishes of","the cultivator. The glazed body will be completely integrated with the cultivator’s soul consciousness without any flaws or risks.","“As long as you can get the glazed ice jade, you can create a perfect body for your wife, which is exactly the same as her original body. Moreover, this glazed body is exactly the same as a human cultivator,” the old woman said.","“If 1m not wrong, it shouldn’t be easy to get a treasure like the glazed ice jade, right?” Jian Wushuang looked at her.","“Yes.” The old woman nodded. “The iceheart glazed jade is much rarer than the hundred-million-year-old star-moon agarwood that I mentioned before. If you can find some hundred-million-year-old star-moon agarwood in the Divine Beginning Realm, and you might have it in the Temporal Temple,","then the iceheart glazed jade is almost impossible to find in the Divine Beginning Realm. Even if the Temporal Temple has accumulated wealth over countless years, I’m afraid it won’t be able to find the iceheart glazed jade.","“Of course, there might not be any in the Temporal Temple, but they should have a way to find him. After all, I’ve heard that someone came back from the universe battlefield with a big piece of ice heart glazed jade. You can ask the Temporal Temple to find him for you.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang fell silent.","After a while, Jian Wushuang looked up again and asked, “Senior, is what you said true?”","“Of course, I won’t lie to you.” The old woman smiled. “If you don’t believe me, you can ask the experts of the Temporal Temple. With their knowledge, they should know whether what I said is true or not.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He also understood that the old Valley Master would not lie to him. Even if she wanted to lie, Jian Wushuang was not stupid. He could see it or ask someone.","“Senior, I am not a tactless person. As long as I can ensure that my wife’s soul will not be affected and that I can find the ice heart glazed jade to help my wife recover, I will agree to the soul stripping,” Jian Wushuang said.","He knew very well that the old Valley Master had already made a big concession and told him some secrets of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, especially that the old Valley Master’s lifespan...was less than 100 million years, once he used the divine skill again, he would die immediately. This was","definitely a big secret.","In order to convince him, the old valley master had told him his biggest secret. However, the old Valley Master had no choice but to make his biggest concession.","Under such circumstances, Jian Wushuang could not be so tough alll the time, but he had to make some concessions.","Now, his concession was to give up his wife’s body in this life, take away her soul and the memories of her previous life, and find Bing Xin glazed jade to help his wife recover her body in the future.","Although the process was a little troublesome, it was better than the current stalemate with Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, which made both sides unhappy.","Moreover, with Jian Wushuang’s current strength, it was already the limit for him to force the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to make such a concession.","After all, he was only in the Saint Realm, and his strength was only in the fourth void realm. The reason why he was able to make the old valley master give in was because the old Valley Master was worried about the disciples and experts of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, he could only use the","divine skill once.","However, if the old Valley Master was unwilling to give in, Jian Wushuang did not have much choice.","After all, he could only kill the disciples of the experts outside the valley. However, if the valley made a move, it would seal the mountain and isolate itself from the outside world for hundreds of years, when Leng Rushuang reached a high level of the divine skill, Jian Wushuang would never be able to find","his wife again.","On this basis, he finally made a compromise.","“It’s great that you can understand the current situation of the valley. However, there is still a problem to be solved,” the old woman said.","“What problem?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The problem is how to peel off the soul,” the old woman said seriously, “the soul is the foundation of a cultivator. It’s easy for me to peel off a person’s soul and turn it into two souls. However, it’s very difficult to peel off the two souls without causing any damage.","“After all, although I have studied the Dao of the soul, my attainments in the aspect of the soul are not that great. If I were to peel off the soul alone, it is very likely that I would cause great damage to the girl’s soul during the process. If I am not careful, her soul might even collapse. Therefore, it is best if","we can invite an expert who is extremely skilled in the aspect of the soul to work with me to peel off her soul.”"]},{"number":3387,"title":"Chapter 3387 - Agreed","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“There are many experts in the Divine Beginning Realm who are good at soul manipulation, but there are almost no experts who are absolutely confident in soul peeling and won’t cause any harm to the two souls. However, under normal circumstances, as long as an expert in the sixth realm of the Void","realm who is especially good at soul works with me, I’m at least 90% sure that I won’t harm the girl in the process of soul peeling,” said the old woman.","“An expert of the sixth realm of the void who specializes in the soul?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","It was not easy to find such an expert.","It must be known that there were too few experts of the sixth realm of the void in the Divine Beginning Realm. If the experts of the sixth realm of the Void who roamed the universe battlefield and stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm all year round were excluded...there were probably no more than 20 of","them. Among the less than 20 experts, there were even fewer who specialized in the soul.","“I know someone. Not only has she reached the sixth realm of the Void realm, but her attainments in the soul are also extremely high. It’s not an exaggeration to say that she’s the number one expert in the Divine Beginning Realm. Moreover, she has some friendship with me. I can think of a way to find","her,” the old woman said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Please contact her immediately.”","“Don’t worry.” The old woman waved her hand. “As far as I know, this person has been in closed-door cultivation for a very important time. She didn’t even pay attention to her children who wanted to see her. I can’t contact her at the moment. However, as soon as she comes out, I will tell her about it and","ask her to help.”","“Thank you, senior,” Jian Wushuang said, “by the way, although I know you are the old Valley Master of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, I still don’t know your name...”","“Tam Ma Yi,” the old woman said.","“Ma Yi?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","This name was very strange. It was not her real name, but something like a nickname.","“My friend, since you and I have agreed, let’s leave now,” Ma Yi said.","Jian Wushuang looked deeply into the depths of the cave mansion and nodded slightly.","Soon, Jian Wushuang and Ma Yi walked out of Love Valley.","Outside Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, Demon Master Chenhuo and many Principles Masters of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley were still waiting quietly.","‘When Jian Wushuang and Ma Yi walked out of the peak, they immediately came forward to greet them.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how is it? Did that old monster make things difficult for you?” Demon Master Chenhuo asked.","“I’s going well. I’ve already negotiated with Senior Ma Yi and made some concessions. The final result is acceptable to both of us,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Agreed?” Demon Master Chenhuo’s expression changed. He did not know what Jian Wushuang and the old woman Ma Yi had talked about, but he did not continue to ask when he saw Jian Wushuang’s expression.","On the other side, Ma Yi did not tell Longyu, Master Gorsch, and the others about the agreement with Jian Wushuang. Instead, he continued to look at Jian Wushuang. “My friend, I’m afraid it will take some time for my friend to go into seclusion. If you don’t mind, you can stay in my Supreme","Emotion-forgetting Valley. If you have other things to do, you can leave first. When my friend comes out of seclusion, I will send a message to you. This is my message token, keep it well.”","Ma Yi handed his message token to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took the token and pondered for a moment, then he said, “Most of the female disciples in the valley are female. It would be inconvenient for Chenhuo and I to stay here for a long time, so we’d better leave first. When you have a result, you can send me a message.”","“Twon’t send you off. But before you leave, I hope you can release Zhu Xin and Han Xin,” Ma Yi said with a smile.","“Of course.” Jian Wushuang smiled. With a flip of his palm, the blood-red tower appeared in his hand again. With a thought, he immediately released master Zhu Xin and Han Xin, who were suppressed in the tower.","“Senior Ma Yi, and everyone from Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, thank you for your trouble today. There are a lot of resources in this interspatial ring. I apologize to Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Goodbye!” Jian Wushuang threw an interspatial ring at the Longyu, then, he turned around and","left with Demon Master Chenhuo.","After taking the interspatial ring and seeing Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo completely disappear in front of them, everyone from Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley heaved a sigh of relief.","Although the encounter with Jian Wushuang had caused the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley to lose many disciples, most of them were only at the saint level, which was still within the acceptable range of the Supreme Emotion Valley. Moreover, Jian Wushuang had also taken out the interspatial ring","as an apology, in terms of face, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley had already gotten over it, so they naturally did not plan to pursue the matter any further.","However, if Jian Wushuang had killed both Master Zhu Xin and Han Xin, the matter would not have been resolved so easily.","Once the matter was resolved, the valley quickly regained its peace. The old woman, Mai Yi, returned to the mountain and continued to guide Leng Rushuang in her cultivation.","Jian Wushuang immediately took out his messaging token and asked Temple Master Bai Xing after leaving the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley with Demon Master Chenhuo.","He naturally asked about some things related to soul peeling.","Although he believed in what Ma Yi had said in the valley, he still carefully asked Temple Master Bai Xing about it. Temple Master Bai Xing was knowledgeable and answered all of them, the answer he got was almost the same as what Ma Yi had said.","First of all, as long as the soul was peeled off and stored on the hundred-million-year-old star-moon agarwood, the soul could be restored completely without any damage or defects. As for the hundred-million-year-old star-moon agarwood...there were indeed some in the Temporal Temple that could","be used.","Then there was the matter of the recovery of the body after the soul was peeled off, Without a doubt, it was the best and most flawless choice to use the iceheart glazed jade to build a glazed body. However, who exactly had the iceheart glazed jade, the Temporal Temple also spent some time to investigate.","Finally, there was an expert of the sixth realm in the Void who was good at soul. The Temporal Temple also gave him one. However, this expert came from the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect and was in the user’s Temporal Temple, there was no expert of the six void realms who specialized in the soul.","After receiving Temple Master Bai Xing’s reply, Jian Wushuang felt more or less at ease."]},{"number":3388,"title":"Chapter 3388 - Samsara Sect","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what do you plan to do next?” Demon Master Chenhuo asked.","“Next...” Jian Wushuang began to ponder. “It will take some time for Senior Ma Yi’s good friend to enter seclusion. I can only wait patiently until her good friend comes out. As for the patrol team, there is no task at the moment, so there is no need to rush back.”","Jian Wushuang was thinking quickly, but suddenly his eyes lit up. “Oh, the reincarnation pearl!”","Jian Wushuang remembered one thing. In the Blood Wave Realm, he had won a reincarnation pearl from the Light King in a bet.","And this reincarnation pearl was a certificate to enter the Samsara Heaven Domain.","“The Samsara Heaven Domain is a Saint Realm for comprehending the Samsara principles. Although I have perfectly fused the Samsara principles with the space-time principles, I’m still a little far from fully comprehending the Samsara principles. If I can enter the Samsara Heaven Domain and cultivate","for a period of time, I might be able to make a breakthrough. Once I have fully grasped the Samsara principles, my strength will soar again.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","He knew very well that in this world, no matter where he went or what he wanted to do, the most important thing was his own strength!","Only when he was strong enough could he do what he wanted to do. Therefore, improving his strength was his top priority.","The Samsara Heaven Realm was the place where he could improve his strength. Moreover, the Samsara Heaven Realm was in the second heaven, so it was on the way for Jian Wushuang.","“Chenhuo, I’m going to the Samsara Heaven Realm. Come with me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Samsara Heaven Realm? The territory of the Samsara Sect?” Demon Master Chenhuo raised his eyebrows.","“Do you know it?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Yes.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded. In the Amethyst Demon Sect’s era, there were very few sects in the Second Heaven that were qualified to challenge the Amethyst Demon Sect. The Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley was one of them, and the other was the Samsara Sect. Although the foundation of","the Samsara Sect is inferior to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley and its strength and trump cards are not as powerful as the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, it is still considered a very powerful sect!”","“As for the Samsara Heaven Realm, it already existed at that time. It is said that the Samsara Heaven Realm was personally created by the founder of the Samsara Sect, the Samsara Grandmaster. This place is extremely helpful to cultivators who comprehend the principles of reincarnation. However, the","actions of the Samsara Grandmaster are very strange.”","“He created the Samsara Sect himself, but after he created the Samsara Heaven Realm, he spread out the hundreds of samsara beads that he personally refined to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm and spread them throughout the entire Divine Beginning Realm. As for the interior of the Samsara Sect, he","only left a relatively small portion.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","The samsara bead was a token to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm.","There were hundreds of such tokens, but the Samsara Grandmaster only left a small part of them for the Samsara Sect. Most of them were scattered in the Divine Beginning Realm?","It was indeed strange.","“In our era, no one knew the Samsara Grandmaster’s intention, so he didn’t care much. After leaving the Samsara Heaven Realm and the samsara bead, he went to the universe battlefield and never came back. In that era, people often got the samsara bead by chance and entered the Samsara Heaven Realm","to study the Samsara principles. Most of them gained a lot,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“There must be a deeper meaning behind his actions. In short, it has nothing to do with us. I came to the Samsara Heaven Realm just to improve my understanding of the Samsara principles,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, “Let’s go and visit the Samsara Sect.”","Immediately, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo set off.","In the Second Heaven, countless sects and forces were established. Among them, there were several recognized overlords.","For example, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley and the Xiaoyao Mansion were overlords that made all parties submit to them.","Although the Samsara Sect was not as powerful as the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, it was stronger than the Xiaoyao Mansion and had a deeper foundation.","The Samsara Sect occupied a vast territory. However, the headquarters of the Samsara Sect was in a huge secret land of heaven and earth. This secret land of heaven and earth was covered by a magic array and no one was allowed to enter. As for the Samsara Heaven Realm...it was also in the secret realm","of heaven and earth.","Jian Wushuang and Chenhuo had already arrived at the entrance of the secret realm of heaven and Earth where the Samsara Sect was located.","Jian Wushuang had no intention of concealing his identity, and he did not change his appearance at all. He took the samsara bead and went to the entrance.","As for the Demon Master, he followed behind Jian Wushuang and did not emit any aura. Even if others used their souls to check, they could hardly see the exact level of the Demon Master’s strength, this was why Demon Master Chenhuo was so good at concealing his aura.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had asked Demon Master Chenhuo about his strength, such as how powerful his aura concealing technique was, the answer he got was that Demon Master Chenhuo also had an extremely unique secret skill. This secret skill was similar to the shadowless escape skill that Jian","‘Wushuang had mastered. It could hide in the void and disappear into nothingness, they could not be sensed by the soul.","To acertain extent, this secret skill was slightly stronger than the shadowless escape skill. Because of this, when they were in the secret realm of heaven and earth in the Amethyst Fog Sea, Jian Wushuang and Marquis Xiaoyao could not sense the existence and location of this Demon Master. It was best","for Jian Wushuang to use the golden sky-painting flag to cast space-time imprisonment and completely control space-time to find him.","With such a powerful technique and a secret skill to conceal his aura, if the Demon Master did not want others to know his actual strength, ordinary people, even some Principles Masters with extraordinary strength, would not be able to see it.","But if it was a real battle, it would be different.","“Please inform them that Heavenly Sword Marquis of the Temporal Temple is here with the samsara bead and wants to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm controlled by your sec","realm.","Jian Wushuang took out the samsara bead and showed it to the Samsara Sect disciples guarding the entrance of the secret","“Samsara bead?” The Samsara Sect disciples at the entrance of the secret realm glanced at the samsara bead and immediately knew that it was real. Then they immediately remembered the name that Jian Wushuang had just given them.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis of the Temporal Temple?”","“That super monster?”","The Samsara Sect disciples looked at Jian Wushuang with excitement, but soon someone went in to report."]},{"number":3389,"title":"Chapter 3389 - Do You Remember Dujiu?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In an exquisite pavilion in the headquarters of the Samsara Sect, the sect leader of the Samsara sect, who was sitting in front of a long table and casually flipping through a token, suddenly stood up.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis? This Heavenly Sword Marquis is actually outside our Samsara Sect?” The Samsara Sect leader’s face was ashen, and there was a trace of shock and anger in his eyes.","“Yes, and he came with the samsara beads.” A white-haired elder nodded.","“How dare he!” The Samsara Sect Master cursed in his heart, “I heard that Heavenly Sword Marquis made a bet with the Light King in the Blood Wave Realm. One of the bets was the samsara beads, and it ended up in his hands. But I didn’t expect him to actually dare to take the Samsara beads into the","Samsara Sect!”","The Samsara Heaven Realm was left behind by the Samsara Grandmaster, and it had always been under the control of the Samsara Sect. The Samsara Sect had also been paying close attention to the samsara beads that the Samsara Grandmaster had refined. The bet between Jian Wushuang and the Light","King in the Blood Wave Realm...the samsara bead was one of the wagers. Perhaps the other sects would not care too much about it, but the Samsara Sect definitely knew about it and attached great importance to it.","According to the words of the Samsara Grandmaster, anyone who came with the samsara bead could enter the Samsara Heaven Realm to cultivate and comprehend. However, the current Samsara Sect Master was obviously very angry at Jian Wushuang’s arrival.","“Did Heavenly Sword Marquis come alone, or was there another expert with him?” Samsara Sect Master asked again.","“According to the reports from the disciples at the entrance, there is another person with him. That person’s aura is well hidden, so we can’t tell whether it’s real or not. But if we’re not mistaken, it should be a Principles Master,” said the white-haired elder.","“Humph, he wants to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm with just a Principles Master? In his dreams!” The Samsara Sect Master’s face turned cold. “Let’s go, call the elders and follow me to meet this super monster from the Divine Beginning Realm!”","Soon, with the Samsara Sect Master in the lead, nearly ten elders at the Principles Master level of the Samsara Sect walked toward the entrance aggressively.","At the entrance of the secret realm, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo looked relaxed. They did not have any hostility toward the Samsara Sect, and in their opinion, the Samsara Sect should not have any hostility toward them.","Not long after, they saw a group of more than a dozen people rushing out of the secret realm. Their auras were extremely dense, and more than half of them had reached the level of Principles Masters, especially the two leaders, one was the Principles Master of the Samsara Sect, and the other was the","great elder of the Samsara Sect. The auras they emitted were clearly at the peak of the four void realms.","Seeing this lineup, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo immediately looked strange.","“Two peak of the four void realms and nearly ten Principles Masters. This lineup is extraordinary,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“although I’m very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm, I don’t have any friendship with the Samsara Sect. The Samsara Sect wouldn’t send such a lineup to welcome me, right?","“But if the Samsara Sect sent such a force to make an enemy out of me, there’s no reason for it?","“I don’t remember offending the Samsara Sect.” Jian Wushuang looked puzzled.","Many experts of the Samsara Sect had already appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Are you Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Samsara Sect Master stared at Jian Wushuang coldly.","“Yes, Iam. You must be Dark Chaos Sect Master of Samsara Sect, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, I am.” Samsara Sect Master nodded. “I heard that you came here with the Samsara bead today? Let me see it.”","Although Jian Wushuang noticed that Samsara Sect Master’s expression and the surrounding people were a little strange, he did not think too much about it. He directly gave the samsara bead to Samsara Sect Master.","Samsara Sect Master took the bead and played with it for a while. He nodded slightly and said, “It is indeed the samsara bead. Well, thank you for returning it. Now you can leave.”","‘As soon as he said this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed, “Sect Master, what you said is wrong. I came to Samsara Sect with the samsara bead. According to the principles set by the Samsara Grandmaster, I can enter the Samsara Heaven Realm with the samsara bead to comprehend the Samsara principles.”","“That’s true.” The Samsara Sect Master did not deny it. “If someone else came with the Samsara bead, the Samsara Sect would bring him into the Samsara Heaven Realm, but you can’t!”","The Samsara Sect Master’s voice was full of coldness. He looked at Jian Wushuang with cold eyes.","Jian Wushuang was confused, but he still asked in a low voice, “Sect Master, if I remember correctly, there is no enmity between the Samsara Sect and me, right? Why are you deliberately making things difficult for me?”","“No enmity? Haha, you still have the nerve to say that there is no enmity between you and the Samsara Sect.” The Samsara Sect Master smiled coldly, then he shouted in a low voice, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, I ask you, do you still remember the expert you met in the Blood Wave Realm named Dujiu?”","“Dujiu?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. He quickly thought about it and quickly remembered, “I met an Invincible Saint named Dujiu in the Blood Wave Realm, During the fight for the Blood Wave Token, I tried to assassinate him in order to get the Blood Wave Token. I destroyed his divine body and he was","Killed by the Saints who surrounded him. As for the Blood Wave Token, it fell into my hands. But what does Dujiu’s death have to do with your Samsara Sect?”","Jian Wushuang did not understand.","Back then, he had killed Dujiu in order to fight for the Blood Wave Token. However, he had read Dujiu’s information before. According to the information, Dujiu was a solitary expert with no background, how could he be related to the Samsara Sect now?","“Humph, what does Dujiu have to do with the Samsara Sect? Well, let me tell you now. Dujiu is my son!” The Samsara Sect Master said with bloodshot eyes.","“What?”","}ian Wushuang was completely stunned.","Beside him, Demon Master Chenhuo was also stunned.","Dujiu was the biological son of the Samsara Sect Master?","How could this be?","“Sect Master, are you sure you’re not joking?","“In the information collected by the Temporal Temple, Dujiu is clearly a solitary expert with no background. How could he be your biological son?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","“Humph, how could I lie to you?” The Samsara Sect Master gnashed his teeth. “My rebellious son is rebellious and disobedient. Many years ago, he left the Samsara Sect and went on his own. He even changed his name and had nothing to do with me or the Samsara Sect. However, no matter how he tried,","he was still my son and a member of the Samsara Sect. Yet, you killed him indirectly in the Blood Wave Realm!”"]},{"number":3390,"title":"Chapter 3390 - Overpowering the Samsara Sect","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you and I have a feud over the death of our son. We can not live under the same sky, but we are in the Blood Wave Realm after all. In order to fight for the Blood Wave Token, life and death are in the hands of the heavens. Therefore, we can only put down our hatred and never","seek revenge on you. Yet, you still dare to appear in front of us. Do you really think that we, the Samsara Sect, are easy to bully?” The Samsara Sect Master was furious.","The experts of the Samsara Sect also stared at Jian Wushuang in shock and anger.","Hearing the words of the Samsara Sect Master, Jian Wushuang’s expression became very strange.","He had thought that there was no enmity between him and the Samsara Sect, but it was not the case. Not only did he have enmity with the Samsara Sect, but the enmity was also not small. Moreover, the enmity came from a person he had killed in the Blood Wave Realm, he had killed a random person in","order to obtain the Blood Wave Token.","It was such a person that Jian Wushuang did not care about at all. Now, he had brought a lot of trouble to Jian Wushuang.","“Sect Master, I can only apologize for what happened to Dujiu. After all, all the experts who enter the Blood Wave Realm are aiming for the Blood Wave Token. Countless experts have died because of the Blood Wave Token. Although Dujiu died largely because of me, he can only blame himself for being","weak. He can’t blame me,” Jian Wushuang said.","‘What he said was true. Every time the Blood Wave Realm opened, there would be a huge massacre. Countless experts would fight for the Blood Wave Token, and of course, countless experts would die, if these fallen experts all wanted to hold a grudge, the Divine Beginning Realm would have been in","complete chaos.","Therefore, no matter who killed these experts in the Blood Wave Realm, they could not blame others. They could only blame themselves for being weak, which was recognized by everyone in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Now, I can bring the samsara bead to your Samsara Sect. According to the rules set by the Samsara Grandmaster, your Samsara Sect should allow me to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Humph, that’s right. The Grandmaster did say that as long as you can bring the Samsara Bead, you can enter the Samsara Heaven Realm. However, you only know one thing, but you don’t know the other. When the Grandmaster said this, he also said that if you have a great enmity with our Samsara Sect,","you are an exception!","“In other words, as long as you are an enemy of the Samsara Sect, even if you bring the bead, you are not qualified to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm!","“As for you, Heavenly Sword Marquis, you killed my son. Aren’t you an enemy of the Samsara Sect?” The Samsara Sect Master’s voice was cold. It was obvious that he did not want Jian Wushuang to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm.","Understanding this, Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold.","“Since you won’t let me enter the Samsara Heaven Realm, I’ll have to resort to extreme measures,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","“Extreme measures? Heavenly Sword Marquis, what do you want to do?” The Samsara Sect Master looked at Jian Wushuang coldly. “This is the entrance of the Samsara Sect. It’s not for a mere Saint like you to behave atrociously.”","“Really?” Jian Wushuang smiled disdainfully, but he glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo beside him. “Chenhuo, do it!”","“It’s really troublesome to follow you around. There are enemies everywhere.” Demon Master Chenhuo complained, but he still made his move at the first moment.","Boom!","Demon Master Chenhuo’s aura, which had been hidden all this time, suddenly burst out like a tsunami.","In an instant, the world-destroying aura suppressed the entire area.","“Six states of the Void!”","‘When the experts of the Samsara Sect felt this aura, their expressions changed drastically,","however, Demon Master Chenhuo had already turned into a gray stream of light and appeared directly in front of the Samsara Sect Master and the first elder.","These two were experts at the peak of the fourth state of the Void and were the two strongest people in the Samsara Sect. And now, Demon Master Chenhuo’s target was the two of them.","“Be careful!” The Samsara Sect Master shouted, the moment he saw the Demon Master Chenhuo make his move, he and the first elder beside him immediately reacted. The two instantly unleashed their strongest strength, joining hands to block the Demon Master Chenhuo.","But in the end...the Demon Master Chenhuo only casually waved his palm, and the terrifying power of the peak void sixth level directly crushed the Samsara Sect Master and the first elder’s attack, the majestic power also directly covered the two of them.","The two figures immediately retreated in a sorry state.","“They can’t withstand a single blow!”","The Demon Master curled his lips and charged forward again.","The expressions of the Samsara Sect Master and the great elder changed drastically when they saw this. They hurriedly blocked the attack of the Demon Master.","On the other side, Jian Wushuang also attacked!","The two strongest four void realm experts of the Samsara sect were completely crushed by Demon Master Chenhuo. Although there were still many Principles Masters left, the strongest rule masters were only in the three void realm, moreover, there were no experts who specialized in the soul. Jian","‘Wushuang directly used shadowless escape technique against these Principles Masters.","Buzz!","He suddenly appeared behind the Principles Masters silently.","The principles Masters in the second and third realms of the void could not sense his exact location. They could not react in time to Jian Wushuang’s bloody sword skill.","Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi!","The scarlet sword light easily penetrated the divine bodies of the Principles Masters.","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang had penetrated the divine bodies of four Principles Masters. Although they did not die because of their immortal bodies, they immediately consumed about 30 to 40 percent of their divine power.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang continued to assassinate them.","Ina short while, the Principles Masters of the Samsara Sect were completely terrified.","“Stop, stop!”","‘The Samsara Sect Master, who had been completely crushed by Demon Master Chenhuo, began to shout as his divine power was being consumed by Demon Master Chenhuo’s attacks.","Jian Wushuang’s Blood Mountain Sword pierced through the divine body of a Principles Master for the ninth time. At that moment, he heard the Samsara Sect Master’s shout and immediately stopped.","“Dark Chaos Sect Master, can I enter the Samsara Heaven Realm now?” Jian Wushuang’s gaze was cold, and there was a hint of killing intent in the depths of his eyes.","This hint of killing intent caused the Samsara Sect Master’s heart to tremble. It was as if if he dared to say no, these Principles Masters of the Samsara Sect would be completely killed by the other party.","The short fierce battle just now had fully demonstrated that Jian Wushuang indeed possessed such strength.","As long as there were no experts of the void fourth realm or above to interfere, Jian Wushuang could indeed kill the Principles Masters of the void second and third realms with his shadowless escape art, as for Samsara Sect Master and the great elder of the Samsara Sect, these two experts of the void","fourth realm, even if they joined hands to face Demon Master Chenhuo, they would be completely crushed. Even if Demon Master Chenhuo attacked with his full strength...both of their lives were in danger."]},{"number":3391,"title":"Chapter 3391 - In the Samsara Sect","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis is only at the saint level, but I didn’t expect him to be so powerful that even a void third stage expert couldn’t do anything against his assassination!”","“Also, what is the background of this person in front of me? He is a powerful expert of the six states of the Void, and he has probably reached the peak of the six states of the Void. How could he follow Heavenly Sword Marquis and listen to his orders?” The Samsara Sect Master looked at Demon Master","Chenhuo in shock.","Although they had only exchanged blows for a short period of time, the strength of the Demon Master Chenhuo had completely frightened him.","“If I don’t agree to let him enter the Samsara Sect, with their strength, they will definitely be able to kill all the Principles Masters of the Samsara Sect. Even I might not have a chance to survive. Even if we hide in the sect and use the sect protecting formation to block them, if they are blocked outside, the","powerful disciples of the Samsara Sect will never be able to leave again.”","After thinking for a while, the Samsara Sect Master made up his mind. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, I can take you to the Samsara Heaven Realm, but you must leave the Samsara Sect as soon as you come out of the Samsara Heaven Realm. You must never step into the Samsara Sect again!”","“Humph, if it weren’t for the Samsara Heaven Realm, I wouldn’t be interested in your Samsara Sect at all.” Jian Wushuang snorted. “Lead the way.”","‘The Samsara Sect Master restrained his aura and took a deep look at Jian Wushuang, then began to lead the way.","As for the Principles Masters of the Samsara Sect, although they felt very aggrieved, they could only suppress their anger when they thought of the strength of Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo. As the saying goes, a wise man submits to circumstances, since the Samsara Sect was able to stand","up until now, they knew their limits.","In the face of absolute strength, they could only bow their heads.","Soon, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo entered the Samsara Sect.","The huge sect was magnificent and grand. Compared to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, it was indeed majestic and grand. However, this was mainly because the sect of the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley mainly focused on peace and tranquility, they did not pursue the sect’s imposing","manner.","After entering the Samsara Sect, Jian Wushuang immediately sensed the vast power of reincarnation in the center of the secret land of heaven and earth, which attracted him deeply.","“The Samsara Sect mainly focuses on comprehending the Samsara principles. The power of the Samsara principles in the sect is much denser than in other places, but the power of the Samsara principles gathered in the center is dozens of times denser than in other places in the Samsara Sect...”","“The power of the Samsara principles is so strong. Is it the location of the Samsara Heaven Realm?” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","Sure enough, the Samsara Sect Master soon brought Jian Wushuang to the center of the secret land of heaven and earth, where the power of the Samsara principles that Jian Wushuang sensed was the strongest.","“This is the Samsara Heaven Realm.”","The Samsara Sect Master looked at the vast territory covered by the restriction and said slowly, “The Samsara Heaven Realm was created by the founder of the Samsara Sect. It’s the best Saint Realm for comprehending the Samsara principles. However, since the founding of the Samsara Heaven Realm by","the ancestor, the Samsara Heaven Realm has been covered by the restriction. This restriction is indestructible. Even a master of the Saint Realm would not be able to break it by force!”","“For hundreds of millions of years, only those who have the samsara bead are qualified to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm. As for others, even the genius disciples of the Samsara Sect and even the Sect Master of the Samsara Sect, they can’t enter the Samsara Heaven Realm without the samsara bead.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the territory in front of him, but his heart was extremely shocked.","After all, he had sensed the power of the principles of reincarnation in this territory when he just entered the Samsara Sect. It was dozens of times stronger than other places, but he did not expect it to be covered by a restriction.","If he really entered the Samsara Heaven Realm, how strong would the power of the principles of reincarnation be?","It was probably far beyond his imagination.","And the effect of comprehending the principles of reincarnation in a place with such a strong power of the principles of reincarnation was naturally much better than other places.","Of course, the Samsara Heaven Realm was certainly more beneficial to a cultivator comprehending the samsara principles.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, I can only take you so far. Here’s the samsara bead. You can go in by yourself.” The Samsara Sect Master returned the samsara bead to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took it and nodded slightly. Then he glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo and said, “Chenhuo, wait for me here.”","Demon Master Chenhuo shrugged.","Jian Wushuang immediately rushed toward the area covered by the restriction. Because of the samsara bead, the restriction did not hinder Jian Wushuang, so he easily entered the Samsara Heaven Realm.","Many experts of the Samsara Sect were upset when they saw Jian Wushuang enter the Samsara Heaven Realm.","“He is the enemy of the Samsara Sect, but we can only watch him enter the Samsara Heaven Realm!”","“There’s nothing we can do. His strength is too strong.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is still okay. Although his assassination skills are excellent, as long as an expert of the void fourth realm appears, we have a chance to deal with him. But the key is this man...”","Many of the Principles Masters of the Samsara Sect could not help but look at Demon Master Chenhuo.","Indeed, although Jian Wushuang’s strength and skills made them very difficult to deal with, it was not enough to make the entire Samsara Sect afraid. But Demon Master Chenhuo..his strength alone was enough to make the Samsara Sect tremble, after all, there was no one in the Samsara Sect who could","contend with Demon Master Chenhuo, not even one or two experts who could barely deal with him.","“Sir, as far as I know, although there are many experts in the Temporal Temple, I don’t think you are one of them, am I right?” The Samsara Sect Master came to the front of the Demon Master Chenhuo and asked, his attitude was rather humble.","“did not have any connection with the Temporal Temple, but not long ago, I became one of the worshippers of the Temporal Temple,” the Demon Master Chenhuo said coldly.","“Worshippers?” The Samsara Sect Master was stunned. He did not know that the Temporal Temple had such a position. He smiled, the Samsara Sect Master continued, “Heavenly Sword Marquis took the samsara bead and entered the Samsara Heaven Realm. Under normal circumstances, he could stay in","the Samsara Heaven Realm for a month. He would only come out after a month. Although this month is not long, it would be too boring if you were to wait here. Why don’t you come with me to my Samsara Sect?”","While the Samsara Sect Master was in awe of a super powerhouse like the Demon Master Chenhuo, he also wanted to befriend him.","“There’s no need. I’ll wait here.” The Demon Master Chenhuo rejected him directly.","“In that case, please make yourself at home.” The Samsara Sect Master laughed dryly and did not say anything else. Instead, he left with the Samsara Sect’s Principles Masters."]},{"number":3392,"title":"Chapter 3392 - Revenge","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Magnificent Palace of the Samsara Sect, many experts of the Samsara Sect were gathered here.","“Sect Master, are we going to watch Heavenly Sword Marquis do whatever he wants in the Samsara sect?” The first elder of the Samsara Sect asked in a low voice. The others also looked at the Samsara Sect Master.","In fact, the other experts of the Samsara Sect did not have any great enmity against Jian Wushuang, The key was the Sect Master.","He had killed his son with Jian Wushuang. This enmity was extremely great.","“Idon’t want to, but my skills are inferior to his!” The Samsara Sect Master clenched his hands and his body trembled slightly. “It’s one thing for Heavenly Sword Marquis to have great strength, but I didn’t expect him to have such a terrifying figure by his side. An expert at the peak of the sixth void realm","is not someone the Samsara Sect can afford to offend.”","Hearing this, everyone felt helpless.","The Samsara Sect’s first elder spoke, “There are very few Principles Masters in the six levels of the Void realm in the entire Divine Beginning Realm. Any one of them can become the ruler of some transcendent powers or even their strongest trump card. For example, the four famous divine clans in the","third heaven only have six levels of the void realm as their strongest experts. It’s unknown if there are any sixth level void realm experts in the Eight Directions Heavenly Sect.”","“Twonder where this Heavenly Sword Marquis got an expert at the peak of the six states of the Void as a helper. What is the background of this expert at the peak of the six states of the Void?”","“Twanted to invite that person over just now and ask him about his background, but he rejected me,” said the Samsara Sect Master. They were curious about the background of the Demon Master Chenhuo.","After all, although the Divine Beginning Realm was vast, there were very few experts at the six states of the Void. There were only a few of them, so it was surprising that such a powerful expert at the peak of the six states of the Void had appeared.","“Oh right, I heard that Heavenly Sword Marquis called this person Chenhuo,” an elder suddenly said.","“Yes, I heard it too,” another elder said.","“Chenhuo?” Samsara Sect Master frowned slightly. “This name sounds familiar. I should have heard of it before.”","Samsara Sect Master tried hard to recall, but he could not recall it for a moment.","But at this moment, the eyes of the first elder beside him suddenly shrank, “Chenhuo...could it be Demon Master Chenhuo?”","“The Demon Master Chenhuo?” The Samsara Sect Master immediately looked over.","“Nearly 200 million years ago, there was an overlord sect in the Second Heaven, the Amethyst Demon Sect. At that time, there was a very famous genius elder in the Amethyst Demon Sect, the Demon Master Chenhuo. Could it be this person?” The first elder said in a deep voice.","As soon as he said this, there was a commotion in the hall, but the Samsara Sect Master immediately said, “No wonder I find it familiar. It’s the Demon Master Chenhuo from the Amethyst Demon Sect.”","“Te heard of this genius elder before. However, the Amethyst Demon Sect has been destroyed for nearly 200 million years. That genius elder should have died by now. As for this mysterious expert, although his name is also Chenhuo, he might not be the same Demon Master Chenhuo from before. After","all, there are too many repetitions of his name and reputation in this world.”","“We will know soon if it is the Demon Master Chenhuo.” The first elder immediately began to search for information about the Amethyst Demon Sect.","In just a moment, the first elder raised his head again.","“It’s confirmed. The expert at the peak of the sixth level of the void in our Samsara Sect is the Amethyst Demon Sect’s genius elder, the Demon Master Chenhuo!” The first elder said seriously.","“What?”","“It’s true!”","“It’s really Demon Master Chenhuo?”","“I’s been almost 200 million years, and this genius elder is still alive?”","The Samsara Sect’s Principles Masters were all shocked.","The Samsara Sect Master was pleasantly surprised. “Demon Master Chenhuo, it’s really Demon Master Chenhuo. Haha, the Heavens are helping me!”","“Sect Master?” The first elder and the rest looked at the Samsara Sect Master in confusion.","The Samsara Sect Master’s laughter stopped, he said coldly, “The Demon Master Chenhuo is from the Amethyst Demon Sect and he is extremely talented. However, don’t forget that the Amethyst Demon sect was destroyed by the Flame Saint Realm. It can be said that the Flame Saint Realm is the Demon","Master Chenhuo’s greatest enemy. If this Demon Master Chenhuo has the chance, he will definitely take revenge on the Flame Saint Realm without hesitation. Similarly, once the Flame Saint Realm knows that the Demon Master Chenhuo is still alive and that he has reached the peak of the six states of","the void, he will definitely treat the Demon Master Chenhuo as a great threat and will definitely think of a way to kill him!”","Hearing this, the experts of the Samsara Sect understood what the Samsara Sect Master meant.","“Sect Master, are you trying to tell the Flame Saint Realm that the Demon Master Chenhuo is still alive?” The first elder looked over.","“That’s right, the Flame Saint Realm has always been high and mighty. They will not allow a powerful enemy with extraordinary talent who has already reached the peak of the six states of the Void to remain alive. As long as I tell the Flame Saint Realm about this, the Flame Saint Realm will likely send","their experts over immediately. Even the Flame Saint Master will personally come. In addition, the hatred between the Heavenly Sword Marquis and the Flame Saint Realm is even greater. When that time comes, the Flame Saint Master might attack both of them at the same time!” Samsara Master","laughed coldly.","“Of course, Heavenly Sword Marquis’ life-saving skills are heaven-defying, and he is highly regarded by the Temporal Temple Master. Now that he dares to venture into the Third Heaven, he must have enough support and not be worried that the three Saint Realms will attack him. Therefore, even if","Flame Saint Realm arrives, it will be difficult for him to kill Heavenly Sword Marquis. However, Flame Saint Master is absolutely confident that he can kill Demon Master Chenhuo!”","“As long as I kill Demon Master Chenhuo and make Heavenly Sword Marquis lose a big helper, I’ll be able to ease the hatred in my heart!”","After hearing the Samsara Sect Master’s words, the Principles Masters of the Samsara Sect looked at each other in dismay and nodded secretly.","Indeed, Jian Wushuang was very difficult to kill. This had been proven on the Saha Island. Now, even if the three Saint Realms came together again, they might not be able to kill Jian Wushuang.","However, although Demon Master Chenhuo was stronger than Jian Wushuang, his life-saving ability was not that great. The Flame Saint Master was definitely capable of killing him.","“”TIl contact the Flame Saint Realm now.”","Samsara Sect Master immediately began to contact him. In just a moment, he had informed the Saint Realm of the news that Demon Master Chenhuo was still alive and had reached the peak of the sixth void realm, of course, he also told them that Demon Master Chenhuo was with Jian Wushuang.","After sending the message, Samsara Sect Master began to look forward to it.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you have great means and the support of the Temporal Temple. I don’t dare to seek revenge on you, but the Flame Saint Realm does. I’d like to see how the Flame Saint Master killed your helper when he came in person!”"]},{"number":3393,"title":"Chapter 3393 - Do Not Provoke","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Flame Saint Realm, at the peak of a vast sea of fire, there was a Flame Saint Palace. This Flame Saint Palace was where Flame Saint Master lived.","“You are saying that there are still people from the Amethyst Demon Sect that I personally destroyed, and they have already reached the pinnacle of the six stages of the Void?” Flame Saint Master’s entire body was covered in flames, controlling the endless sea of fire around him, there seemed to be flames","burning in his eyes as well.","Right below Flame Saint Master, a purple-robed elder was kneeling respectfully. When he heard Flame Saint Master’s words...he immediately replied respectfully, “Saint Master, this news was personally transmitted by the Samsara Sect’s Sect Master. It shouldn’t be fake. And the Demon Master Chenhuo","that he mentioned was a genius elder of the Amethyst Demon Sect back then. His talent was extremely high, and our Flame Saint Master did not kill him when we destroyed the Amethyst Demon Sect.”","“In addition, not long ago, there was news from the Xiaoyao Mansion that they met an expert left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect in the Amethyst Fog Sea. Even Marquis Xiaoyao was easily defeated by him. If I’m not mistaken, it should be this Demon Master Chenhuo.”","“Who would have thought that after such a long time, there would still be survivors from the Amethyst Demon Sect?” Flame Saint Master’s expression was cold, and his eyes were filled with shocking killing intent.","“Saint Master, this Demon Master Chenhuo himself is a super genius with incredible talent. According to the news from Xiaoyao Mansion, he has been staying in a heaven and earth secret realm within the Amethyst Fog Sea all these years. He hasn’t had any contact with the outside world, hasn’t","experienced anything, and hasn’t obtained any opportunities. He has purely relied on himself to blindly cultivate, yet he has still raised his strength to the peak of the sixth level of the void. With such ability, our Flame Saint Realm has no choice but to guard against him.” The violet-robed old man said.","“He could reach the peak of the sixth level of the Void realm just by blindly cultivating. His talent is indeed extraordinary. Now that he has come out of the heaven and earth secret realm, with his talent, he might have a chance to break through to the ruler level. Once he reaches that level, he would pose a","great threat to the Flame Saint Realm.” Flame Saint Realm nodded slightly.","“However, with his current strength alone, I’m afraid that no one within my Flame Saint Realm has the ability to kill him unless I personally take action.”","“That’s right. That’s why I’ve come to ask Saint Master to personally take action.” The purple-robed elder said respectfully, “In addition, after this Demon Master Chenhuo left the Amethyst Fog Sea, he established a relationship with the Temporal Temple. Now, he’s been following Heavenly Sword Marquis","like a guard.”","“What did you say?” Flame Saint Master was finally moved. “This Demon Master Chenhuo is following Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“Yes.” The purple-robed elder nodded.","Flame Saint Realm fell silent.","This silence lasted for a long while before he spoke, “Have people keep an eye on Heavenly Sword Marquis and Demon Master Chenhuo. Remember, just keep an eye on them. There is no need for any other actions. Our Flame Saint Realm will not provoke them for now.”","“Not provoke them?” The purple-robed elder was stunned. He asked subconsciously, “Is it because of Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","“Yes.” Flame Saint Realm did not hide it. “During the battle on the Saha Island, Heavenly Sword Marquis displayed an extremely powerful technique. Although his strength does not belong to him and he will not have such strength in the future, after that battle, the Temporal Temple Master will definitely","give him other life-saving methods. With the strength of the three Saint Realms, we have no chance to kill him.”","“Since I can’t kill him, I won’t provoke him for now. When I have absolute confidence in the future, it won’t be too late to attack him!”","“As for the Demon Master Chenhuo... Even though he is extremely talented, he has wasted so many years in the process. I’m afraid that he has wasted a lot of his talent. Even if he is extremely lucky in the future and can break through to the ruler-level, it won’t be a big deal.”","“A mere ruler-level has no influence on the situation of the Divine Beginning Realm. Although he can pose a threat to the Flame Saint Realm, it’s impossible for him to threaten the position of the Flame Saint Realm!”","“To put it bluntly, what the Flame Saint Realm should really pay attention to is the Heavenly Sword Marquis. He is the enemy that can seriously threaten the position of the Flame Saint Realm and the three great Saint Realms. As for the Demon Master Chenhuo, he is far from the Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“Understood, your subordinate will take his leave!” The purple-robed old man immediately bowed and left.","After the purple-robed old man left, the Flame Saint Master was the only one left in the huge Flame Divine Hall.","At this moment, a large amount of raging flames surged around the Flame Saint Master’s body, and his gaze was extremely scorching.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis...the three great Saint Realms can’t do anything to you now, but just you wait. Before long, your doomsday will come, just like your Master Xuan Yi from countless years ago!”","“If he dies, you will die too! As for the Temporal Temple and the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, anyone who dares to stand on your side will die!”","“Hahaha!”","Wild laughter echoed throughout the entire Flame Temple. The laughter stirred up the surrounding sea of fire, making it even more vigorous.","In the Samsara Heaven Realm of the Samsara Sect!","Jian Wushuang had already entered the Samsara Heaven Realm. When he actually appeared in the Samsara Heaven Realm, Jian Wushuang could sense how vast and rich the power of the Samsara principles was!","“The power of the Samsara principles on such a scale is probably hundreds of times richer than in the outside world. If I meditate on the Samsara principles here, my speed will be dozens of times faster than in the outside world,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","While sensing the strong power of the law of reincarnation around him, Jian Wushuang also took in the Samsara Heaven Realm in front of him.","From the outside, the Samsara Heaven Realm looked like a vast territory. However, after entering, Jian Wushuang saw nothing but darkness and desolation.","There was no life in the void in his eyes. It was filled with a dead aura that almost filled the entire sky.","“The aura of death is so dense?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. “The aura of death is ethereal, but why does it give me an unfathomable feeling, as if it’s an extremely special power that even I haven’t touched yet?”","“Yes, it’s power.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled, and then a smile appeared on his lips, “It’s said that the Samsara Heaven Realm is an excellent place to meditate on the Samsara principles, but what I’m seeing right now clearly doesn’t meet this requirement. However, the aura of death I’m sensing is extraordinary. I’d like","to see where the source of this aura of death is.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and immediately sent his consciousness toward the surrounding aura of death."]},{"number":3394,"title":"Chapter 3394 - The Power of Death and the Power of Life","paragraphs":["The aura of death was cold, gloomy, suffocating, and could even annihilate all living beings!","Moreover, the aura of death was extraordinarily vast. As Jian Wushuang’s consciousness covered it, he could not completely cover it. He could only continue to explore along the aura of death, as a result, the aura of death became more and more extensive.","Jian Wushuang finally realized that the aura of death he sensed before was only the tip of the iceberg of the Samsara Heaven Realm.","The aura of death in the Samsara Heaven Realm was so extensive that the entire Samsara Heaven Realm could not accommodate it.","“Underground!”","“The source of this aura of death is very deep underground, and its range is very vast. The secret realm of heaven and earth where the Samsara Sect is located is actually covered by this aura of death. Even outside the secret realm of heaven and earth, the underground of a large territory is filled with this aura of death!”","“However, because this aura of death is hidden too deep underground, it’s almost impossible to find it. Only by slowly exploring the aura of death in the Samsara Heaven Realm can I sense the existence of this vast aura of death.” Jian Wushuang was secretly shocked.","He originally thought that the Samsara Heaven Realm was as big as he could see with the naked eye, but in fact, the coverage of the entire Samsara Heaven Realm was far beyond his imagination.","The area covered by the vast aura of death that he sensed was already very shocking, but he still could not sense the source of the aura of death.","Suppressing his shock, Jian Wushuang continued to sense along the aura of death. Slowly, he sensed a huge sea of aura of death, and at the end of the Sea of aura of death... Jian Wushuang suddenly felt a completely different power.","“This is...the power of life?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He felt the death aura in the Samsara Heaven Realm, and along the death aura, he sensed a huge sea of death aura. However, at the other end of the sea of death aura, there was a huge amount of power of life?","The power of life contained vigorous vitality, which was completely opposite to the death aura.","“What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang frowned, full of doubts.","But at this moment...","“Little guy, you’re lucky.” A wicked voice suddenly sounded.","Jian Wushuang suddenly woke up and opened his eyes.","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang looked around but did not see any human figure. He immediately realized that the voice did not seem to come from the outside world, but through his consciousness, it directly reached his heart.","And his consciousness was in the sea of Death","Qi.","As expected, as Jian Wushuang’s consciousness fell silent again, he saw a hazy figure on the other side of the sea of Death Qi. The hazy figure looked like an old man in a gray-white robe, there was a strange smile at the corner of his mouth.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang asked with his consciousness.","“I’m Gu Deng, but people in the outside world usually call me the Samsara Grandmaster,” the blurry figure said with a smile. “Samsara Grandmaster?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed immediately. “You’re the founder of the Samsara Sect, the Samsara Grandmaster?”","“Yes.” The blurry figure nodded slightly. “But what you see now is just a strand of my consciousness. As for my original body, it has long gone to explore the depths of the universe battlefield.”","Jian Wushuang understood that if it was the original body of the Samsara Grandmaster, it would not have been able to stay in the Samsara Heaven Realm forever. However, it was still very easy for him to leave his consciousness behind.","“The reason why I left a strand of my consciousness here is actually to wait for a fated person,” the Samsara Grandmaster said with a smile.","“Fated person? What fated person?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“A fated person who can completely excavate this treasure, or rather, this treasure,” the Samsara Grandmaster said with a smile, “Little guy, you must have used the aura of death from the Samsara Heaven Realm to extend your consciousness here, right?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “I’m afraid you still don’t know what secrets are hidden in the Samsara Heaven Realm,” the Samsara Grandmaster said with a strange expression. “Tell me about your understanding of the Samsara Heaven Realm first.” “I know that the Samsara Heaven Realm was created by you personally and is an excellent Saint Realm for meditating on the Samsara principles. Any expert who meditates on the Samsara principles can gain a lot by entering the Samsara Heaven Realm. In addition, after you created the Samsara Heaven Realm, you refined hundreds of samsara beads and spread them around the Divine Beginning Realm. You even set a rule that only those who have the samsara beads are qualified to enter the Samsara Heaven Realm!” Jian Wushuang told him everything he knew.","“As expected, even though so many years have passed, the outside world’s understanding of the Samsara Heaven Realm is still the same.” The Samsara Grandmaster laughed, “Kid, I’ll tell you the truth. Although I established the Samsara Heaven Realm, all I did was cover it with a magic array and refine the samsara beads. As for the wonders of the Samsara Heaven Realm, it has nothing to do with me!”","“I was lucky to find this territory by chance. Like you, I found a big secret hidden under the ground through the death aura I sensed at the beginning “There is endless power of death and endless power of life under the ground!","“Both the power of death and the power of life are extremely powerful and opposite. However, the power of death and the power of life coexist under the ground and have been perfectly combined to form a huge Life and Death Whirlpool!”","“The Whirlpool of Life and Death?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted, and his consciousness continued to spread.","As expected, on the other end of the power of death was the endless power of life. The power of death and the power of life had long been perfectly combined to form a huge Whirlpool of Life and Death. The moment he felt this Whirlpool of Life and Death, even Jian Wushuang had a deep-seated fear in his soul.","“The Whirlpool of Life and Death!”","“What is such a huge Whirlpool of Life and Death?” Jian Wushuang asked in shock.","“You don’t know what it is?” Samsara Grandmaster smiled strangely. “The power of life and the power of death. When the two are combined, the first thing that people think of is the rule of life and death. But in fact, when the power of life reaches its peak and combines with the power of death, the thing that is formed is beyond the scope of the rule of life and death. It is...the Samsara of life and death!","“In other words, the huge vortex of life and death that you see now is a complete and huge Samsara of life and death.”","“The Samsara of life and death?” Jian Wushuang was completely shocked."]},{"number":3395,"title":"Chapter 3395 - The Big Secret","paragraphs":["–","–","The Samsara of life and death was a legendary supreme existence! Legend had it that after billions of creatures in this world died, their souls would enter the Samsara of life and death. Their memories would be forcefully erased and they would be reincarnated.","Even those experts in the Divine Beginning Realm who were extremely powerful and had reached the level of Saints or Principles Masters, although they used their souls as the foundation, once they died, their souls would be destroyed, however, the Samsara could still reassemble their destroyed souls and continue the reincarnation without stopping.","In his previous life, Jian Wushuang’s master, Xuan Yi, had used a shocking method to forcefully open the reincarnation passage and send Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang into the reincarnation, at that time, Jian Wushuang did not know much about the reincarnation passage. When he reached a certain level in the Divine Beginning Realm, he finally understood what an incredible method it was.","The reincarnation passage was to activate the Samsara of life and death and to change the order of the Samsara of life and death. It was incredible.","But now, the legendary Samsara of life and death appeared in front of him?","Jian Wushuang was shocked!","“The Samsara of life and death, what a supreme existence. When I found this samsara of life and death, I was shocked. Then I saw an unprecedented opportunity.” Samsara Grandmaster’s eyes were filled with excitement. “I was thinking, the Samsara of life and death is right in front of me. If I can refine it and take it for myself, what would it be like?”","Jian Wushuang could not help but be stunned.","Refine the Samsara of life and death?","Such a transcendent Samsara of life and death, which only existed in legends, had incredible abilities. If a cultivator really refined the Samsara of life and death and took it for himself...Jian Wushuang also could not believe it.","“When I first thought of it, I could no longer control myself. From that moment on, I stayed around this samsara and tried to refine it. However, I spent 300 million years, but there was no progress at all. I also understand that it’s almost impossible for me to refine this samsara by myself!”","“There’s nothing I can do. I can only give up.” At this point, the Samsara Grandmaster could not help but sigh. Refining the Samsara of life and death was absolutely an unimaginable thing. Once he completed it, no one knew what level he would reach.","But he understood that the Samsara of life and death was something that even rulers were far from qualified to touch. It had even exceeded the scope of the Divine Beginning Realm. Once he really refined the Samsara of life and death, there was one thing...at the very least, the three great saint domains were nothing in front of him.","However, it was a pity that he did not succeed in the end.","“Although I have already given up on refining this Samsara of life and death, this Samsara of life and death is still right in front of me. Even if I can’t obtain such an incredible opportunity, I can’t bear to let it continue to be buried. That’s why I created the Samsara Sect in the shortest amount of time, right above this Samsara of life and death. Afterward, I deliberately covered this place with a magic array and spread the word that this Samsara Heaven Realm is also very useful to cultivators who comprehend the principles of samsara...”","“This is also a fact. A complete Samsara of life and death is hidden here. This is naturally extremely useful to experts who have comprehended the principles of samsara. As for my purpose in doing this, it is actually very simple. This is because even though I have not been able to refine this Samsara of life and death during my 300 million years of exploration, I have come to a conclusion that only cultivators who have comprehended the principles of Samsara have the hope of refining this Samsara of life and death!”","“The old me has spread the samsara bead. It is not limited to just one Samsara Sect. I hope that all the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm who are extremely talented in the principles of samsara will have the chance to come to this Samsara Heaven Realm. When they arrive here, they will be able to sense the existence of this Samsara of life and death through that aura of death. However, most people will only be able to sense the power of death for the first time. They will not be able to sense the power of life! “Since they can’t even sense the power of life, they can’t sense the entire Samsara of life and death. Therefore, these people also have no hope of refining the Samsara of life and death!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang had a general understanding. “So you left your consciousness in that part of the power of life. Only when someone comes to the Samsara Heaven Realm and senses the existence of the power of death and the power of life through the aura of death will your consciousness appear and tell you everything?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","“That’s right.” Samsara Grandmaster smiled slightly. “Although I can’t refine the samsara, I hope someone can refine it. However, I don’t want to spread the news of the existence of the Samsara here. If everyone knows about it, it might attract some existences in the universe battlefield. Therefore, I’m looking for some fated people in this way!”","“Now that you have sensed the existence of the power of death and the power of life through the aura of death, you can naturally sense the entire samsara of life and death. Therefore, my consciousness appeared to tell you all this, and you are naturally one of the fated ones. Before You, although many experts came to the Samsara Heaven Realm through the samsara beads, only three people were qualified to sense the power of life and let my consciousness appear. You are the fourth.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood.","“Boy, you can sense the existence of the Samsara of life and death when you first came to the Samsara Heaven Realm. Moreover, you are just an Immortal Saint. When you grow stronger, you will have a chance to refine the Samsara of life and death. Just cultivate well.” Samsara Grandmaster said.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Well, I’ve told you the secret of the Samsara Heaven Realm. You can keep it to yourself, but don’t spread it. It won’t do you any good. As for whether you can succeed in the future, it depends on your luck.”","“Also, the samsara bead can only allow you to stay in the Samsara Heaven Realm for a month. During this month, you only need to improve your comprehension of the Samsara principles. You don’t need to think about refining the Samsara of life and death. When your strength increases and you have the ability to directly break the restriction I’ve set up around the Samsara Heaven Realm, you can try to refine the Samsara of life and death without relying on the samsara bead.”","Samsara Grandmaster smiled faintly. After he finished speaking, the hazy figure formed by his consciousness disappeared, and the voice of Samsara Grandmaster did not ring in Jian Wushuang’s heart anymore."]},{"number":3396,"title":"Chapter 3396 - The Rules of Reincarnation","paragraphs":["Seeing the Samsara Grandmaster’s figure disappear, Jian Wushuang understood that the reason why the Samsara Grandmaster’s consciousness appeared was to tell him the secret of the Samsara Heaven Realm. Now that he had told him, his consciousness naturally fell silent again.","“The Samsara of life and death...if it really is the legendary Samsara of life and death, then this opportunity is too great.” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in his heart, but at the same time, he also understood that if it really was the Samsara of life and death, it would be as difficult as ascending to heaven to refine it.","For example, the Samsara Grandmaster himself was extremely powerful. He created the Samsara Sect with great means. Although he might not have reached the overlord level, his strength and his understanding of the Samsara principles...among the experts born in the Divine Beginning Realm who were good at the Samsara principles, there were definitely few who were good at it.","However, such an expert, who was extremely talented in Samsara principles, had studied it for 300 million years without making any progress. One could imagine how difficult it was to refine and master the Samsara of life and death.","“Such a great fortune is placed in front of me, but I’m afraid I won’t be able to enjoy it.” Jian Wushuang shook his head secretly.","Perhaps in the future, when he grew up and reached the peak level that the Samsara Grandmaster had mentioned, he would try to break the restrictions around the Samsara Heaven Realm, but now...Jian Wushuang would not waste a month’s time refining the Samsara.","“The Samsara is a complete Samsara. I will meditate in it. It will definitely help me to master the Samsara principles. I wonder if I have the chance to improve the Samsara principles and master the Samsara principles in this month.” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands.","Once the Samsara principles was improved, his strength would also be greatly enhanced.","“Let’s begin.”","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and sat down cross-legged in the Samsara Heaven Realm. His consciousness still covered the entire Samsara with the death aura. He carefully observed and felt the Samsara.","He felt the power of life and death in the Samsara and the complete Samsara principles.","“The combination of life and death is perfect!","“The power of life and death is connected with the power of Samsara.”","Many thoughts suddenly appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","In the Samsara Heaven Realm, he had seen the Samsara principles too clearly through the Samsara.","Soon, he found the part of the Samsara principles that he had not mastered yet. Then, he began to meditate.","Time passed quietly.","A month passed quickly. The Samsara Heaven Realm was still filled with the power of the Samsara principles. Even Jian Wushuang’s body was filled with the rich Samsara principles.","However, as Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes, the power of the Samsara principles on his body and around him instantly disappeared.","Jian Wushuang sat there with his legs crossed. He looked calm and unremarkable in the Samsara Heaven Realm. It was as if he belonged to a part of the Samsara Heaven Realm, or it could be said that the Samsara Heaven Realm was filled with a part of the Samsara principles.","“The Samsara Heaven Realm did not disappoint me. After a month, I have completely grasped the Samsara principles.” Jian Wushuang smiled, at this moment, he could already feel the complete power of the Samsara principles.","After he had gathered the space-time principles, he had finally completely comprehended the second principle.","After comprehending the Samsara principles, Jian Wushuang immediately gained another portion of the power of his will. Originally, because he had comprehended the space-time principles and the combination of the space-time principles and the Samsara principles, he had already mastered two portions of the power of his will. Now that he had also comprehended the Samsara principles, he had mastered three portions of the power of his will","Three parts of the power of the will were already at the level of an ordinary expert in the third realm of the Void. However, Jian Wushuang had cultivated the life divine power, so it was equivalent to having one more part of the power of the will, as well as the heaven-cleaving skill, one part of the power of the will could also be comparable to one part of the power of the will.","If all these were calculated, he now had the power of five parts of the power of the will, which was already at the level of an expert in the fifth realm of the Void!","The Principles Masters of the five void realms were almost at the top level in the Divine Beginning Realm. After all, apart from those masters of the Saint Realm or experts who had reached the ruler level, there should be less than 20 experts of the six void realms in the Divine Beginning Realm, and those below the six void realms were the Principles Masters of the five void realms, they were the Principles Masters of the five void realms.","“Unfortunately, although I have mastered the third part of the power of the will, I still don’t feel the slightest sign of a breakthrough.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","After all, he was still an Immortal Saint.","Although he had reached the peak of the Immortal Saint and met all the requirements for an ordinary cultivator to break through to the Principles Master level, and even exceeded them by a lot, a perfect life-level cultivator...it was already much more difficult than other cultivators to break through from the Immortal Saint Realm to the Principles Master Realm.","Even though he had mastered three portions of the power of the will, he still could not break through.","“Temporal Temple Master said before that master seemed to have fused three principles before he broke through to the Principles Master Realm. I’ve only fused two principles now, and I’m still far from master’s level,” Jian Wushuang muttered, “I can’t rush it. I have to take it step by step. After fusing two principles, I’ll have to figure out a way to comprehend the third principle. The third principle should be...the destruction principles!”","The destruction principles had a higher affinity than the reincarnation principles, which was comparable to the space-time principles. Jian Wushuang would definitely choose the destruction principles as his next principle to comprehend. However, he had not really comprehended the destruction principles before, so he had to start from scratch. It would definitely take a lot of time, if he could have some opportunities or treasures to help him, his progress would be faster.","“The one-month deadline is up. The Samsara Heaven Realm is already rejecting me. I’d better go out first.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then stood up and slowly walked out of the Heaven Realm.","Before leaving, Jian Wushuang stopped with some reluctance. His consciousness once again activated the aura of death and felt the complete Samsara of life and death.","“Samsara...I don’t know if someone really has the ability to completely refine you. If that person really exists, I hope it’s me.”","With a sigh, Jian Wushuang left the Samsara Heaven Realm."]},{"number":3397,"title":"Chapter 3397 - Another Enemy?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After coming out of the Samsara Heaven Realm, Jian Wushuang immediately met up with Demon Master Chenhuo who was guarding outside.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, how’s your harvest in the Samsara Heaven Realm?” Demon Master Chenhuo asked casually.","“Not bad.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but he was very satisfied.","Indeed, although he had only stayed in the Samsara Heaven Realm for a month, he had completely comprehended the Samsara principles and mastered the third part of the power of the will, at the same time, he also learned a shocking secret contained in the Samsara Heaven Realm!","If this secret was spread out, it would definitely cause a huge wave in the Divine Beginning Realm. Not only in the Divine Beginning Realm, but even in the universe battlefield, it would probably be shocked.","Such a harvest was worthy of Jian Wushuang’s rejoicing.","“The trip to the Samsara Heaven Realm has ended. There’s no need for us to stay in the Samsara Sect anymore. Let’s just leave,” Jian Wushuang said.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo planned to leave.","Before leaving, of course, he met with the Samsara Sect Master and the others.","“Sect Master, take good care of the Samsara Sect and the Samsara Heaven Realm. Don’t let the Samsara Heaven Realm suffer any losses. Maybe I’ll go back to the Samsara Heaven Realm in the future,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile. He was telling the truth, after learning the secret of the Samsara","Heaven Realm, as long as his strength grew, he would definitely enter the Samsara Heaven Realm again to try to refine the Samsara.","“Humph.” The Samsara Sect Master snorted coldly, but did not say a word. In his heart, the Samsara Sect Master was puzzled.","One month ago, when Jian Wushuang had just entered the Samsara Heaven Realm, he had informed the Flame Saint Realm of the whereabouts of Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo. He had thought that the Flame Saint Realm would make a move, the Flame Saint Realm had even personally","descended.","However, a month had passed, and the Flame Saint Realm had not made a single move.","This made him feel very strange, but he did not dare to ask why. Now that Jian Wushuang had come out of the Samsara Heaven Realm, he could only obediently let Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo leave.","“What on earth is the Flame Saint Realm doing?” Samsara Sect Master could only curse in his heart.","If the Flame Saint Realm did not show up, he could not avenge Dujiu with the strength of the Samsara Sect alone.","Jian Wushuang and the Demon Master Chenhuo left the Samsara Sect without any obstacles or trouble.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to return to the patrol team temporarily, the old master, Ma Yi, personally sent a message to him.","“My friend, I’ve encountered some trouble. I’m afraid I can’t invite my good friend here to perform the soul peeling.” Ma Yi’s voice sounded a little melancholic.","“Senior, what’s going on?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He needed the help of a void sixth realm expert who was very good at soul peeling to ensure that the soul peeling would not cause great harm to Leng Rushuang, he could ensure that Leng Rushuang’s soul could be restored in the future.","But how could Ma Yi fail to invite this expert of the six realms of void who was very good at soul manipulation?","“To tell you the truth, after you left the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, I immediately tried to contact my good friend. Although she is still in seclusion, I first contacted the people around her and wanted to ask when she would come out of seclusion. But during this contact, I learned something!” Ma","Yi said.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang asked immediately.","“Iknow that my good friend has a grudge with you, so once my good friend finds out that it’s your wife who will be stripped of her soul, she will never agree,” Ma Yi said.","“A huge grudge with me?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “Why do you have a grudge with me again? I admit that I have offended many experts during my rise, but I don’t think they are everywhere.”","Jian Wushuang was a little angry.","He had met the Samsara Sect Master in the Samsara Sect, and he had indirectly killed his son, Dujiu.","But now, the expert in the sixth realm of the Void realm that Ma Yi had mentioned had a grudge against him?","“Senior, who is your good friend?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Her name is Da Yi, and she is the current grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan, one of the four divine clans,” Ma Yi said.","Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then a bitter smile appeared on his face.","“No wonder you said you have a grudge against me. So It’s her?” Jian Wushuang had already understood.","In fact, he should have guessed it long ago. There was only one expert of the six void realms who was good at soul manipulation, not to mention the three Saint Realms.","The Nine-tailed Clan was good at soul manipulation and charm. They were well-known in the Divine Beginning Realm and were exceptionally powerful.","Jian Wushuang had killed the Nine-temple Saintess in the Blood Wave Realm, who was the daughter of the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan. After Jian Wushuang left the Blood Wave Realm, the three Saint Realms set up an inescapable net to kill him, during this process, the Nine-tail Clan also sent","experts to kill him.","At that time, Jian Wushuang met the two sisters of the Nine-temple Saintess, but the clan leader of the Nine-tail Clan did not show up.","Now Jian Wushuang knew that the clan leader, the mother of the Nine-temple Saintes, had been in closed-door cultivation all these years and had no contact with the outside world. Even if the Nine-temple Saintess died, she did not show up, but that did not mean that she did not care about her","daughter’s life.","Once the grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan came out of seclusion, the first thing he would do would be to kill Jian Wushuang. On this basis, Jian Wushuang still wanted the grandmaster to strip his wife’s soul?","Was that possible?","Even if the grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan and Ma Yi were good friends and had an extraordinary relationship, the grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan would definitely not tolerate Jian Wushuang, who killed her daughter.","“The clan leader of the Nine-tail Clan has a great enmity with me. It’s impossible for me to rely on her to peel off my wife’s soul. It seems that I’ll have to find another expert,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","“Tm sorry, my young friend. I thought that my good friend would help, but now...” Ma Yi sent a message.","“You can’t blame me for this. You can only blame me for provoking too many enemies.” Jian Wushuang shrugged, then he asked, “Senior, do you know of any other experts in the sixth realm of the Void who are good at soul manipulation?”","“Ido know two of them, but they are very old. Whether they are still in the Divine Beginning Realm is not the same. I can try to find them, but you’d better not pin all your hopes on me. You can ask the Temporal Temple to look for them. Maybe you can find them,” said Ma Yi.."]},{"number":3398,"title":"Chapter 3398 - The Ninth Ancestor","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Thank you, senior.”","Jian Wushuang understood what Ma Yi meant. After communicating with Ma Yi, he immediately took out Temple Master Bai Xing’s message token.","“An expert of the sixth realm of the void who specializes in the soul?” Temple Master Bai Xing was a little surprised. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, why are you asking this?”","“Of course it’s something very important. Do you know about it, Temple Master Bai Xing?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“There are not many experts of the six realms of the void in the Divine Beginning Realm, and those who specialize in the soul are even rarer. One of them is the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“Forget about the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan. I killed her daughter. There’s no way to resolve the enmity between us,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Aside from the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, there’s only one person I know who can fulfill your request,” Temple Master Bai Xing said.","“Who is it?” Jian Wushuang asked immediately.","“It’s spirit ancestor from the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect!” Temple Master Bai Xing said seriously, “The Divine Ancestor Daoist sect is one of the three Freedom Alliances like our Temporal Temple. Its overall strength is huge, and there are many top experts. Spirit ancestor is one of the top experts in the","Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect!”","“This spirit ancestor has long reached the level of the six states of the Void, and it is said that she has already reached the peak of the six states of the void. and her best technique is soul attacks. Her attainments in the aspect of the soul are definitely one of the best in the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","Even compared to the Nine-tailed Clan’s grandmaster, she is probably on par.","“She should be able to satisfy your request. However, this spirit ancestor has an extremely cold and aloof personality. She does not care about the affairs of the world. She is clearly one of the top experts of the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect and has a very high status in the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect.","She has even obtained the title of ‘ancestor’. However, there are no experts under her command. Therefore, among the nine ancestors of the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect, the spirit ancestor is the weakest. She is basically an empty shell.","“It will be difficult for you to ask her for help.”","Hearing Temple Master Bai Xing’s words, Jian Wushuang smiled. “It’s difficult, but it doesn’t mean that there’s no hope. It just so happens that I have some conflicts with the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. I had planned to go to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect when I had time, but now it’s just in time. In that","case, I’ll go to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect now.”","Jian Wushuang did have some connection with the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect.","‘When Jian Wushuang was just a Divine Master in the endless territories, he entered the secret realm of a mysterious expert by chance! Is the Heavenly Ancestor Taoist Temple Blood Clan line under the rule of the Master Xue Bei!","In the secret realm of heaven and earth of Xue Bei, Jian Wushuang had a great opportunity. Even the Peerless Sword Manual was created in the secret realm of heaven and earth of Xue Bei. He had promised Xue Bei that he would go to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect on his behalf.","However, for various reasons, he had not gone before. This time, it was obvious that he had to go.","“Temple Master Bai Xing, please send me the information of the sects and experts of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Wait a moment.”","In just a moment, Temple Master Bai Xing sent a large amount of information, and Jian Wushuang immediately began to browse through it.","“It’s also one of the three Freedom Alliances, but there are so many factions in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect?” Jian Wushuang looked at the information and was secretly amazed.","Although most of the forces or sects appeared to be an iron bucket, in fact, there were some internal struggles for benefits.","It was the same for the sects of the weaker forces, but the internal struggles for benefits were even greater for the top forces and sects.","For example, the three Saint Realms often fought against each other, but did the three Saint Realms not usually compete and kill each other?","In the three Freedom Alliances, the Temporal Temple had too few experts and was always more united, so it was a bit special. It was only a competition for some small benefits, and there were no factions.","But the other two Freedom Alliances, like the Heaven -cleaving Alliance!","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance also had two great factions. One of the great factions was led by the three Palace Masters of the Heaven-cleaving Palace, while the other great faction was led by the two famous heaven severing divine generals of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, it was said that the two","Heaven-cleaving divine generals were both top experts at the sixth realm of the void. They also had many resources under their command. They could completely contend with the three Palace Masters of the Heaven-cleaving Palace.","As for the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect, there were even more factions!","Among them, the famous nine ancestors were the nine largest factions!","For these nine ancestors to be able to be called ‘ancestors’, each of them had astonishing strength. The weakest were usually experts at the peak of the fifth level of the void, and a few of them had even reached the sixth level of the void.","A total of nine great factions coexisted, and it was very difficult to achieve absolute fairness in the distribution of some of the resources within the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect. Thus, naturally, they had to compete and fight.","Only the sect that was like spirit ancestor, which did not care about worldly affairs and did not have any experts under it, was special. The other eight sects fought fiercely, including Xue Bei’s Blood Ancestor Sect.","“Among the nine sects of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, four of them are the strongest and have experts of the six void realms overseeing them. The Blood Ancestor Sect is one of them.” Jian Wushuang read the message sent by Temple Master Bai Xing. “If I want to go to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect","and ask for the help of the spirit ancestor, I can go to the blood ancestor’s branch and finish what Xue Bei asked me to do.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. Then he took out another token, which belonged to his good friend Jiu Luo.","“Brother Heavenly Marquis, when did you remember me?” Jiu Luo replied.","“Jiu Luo, you should be a disciple of the Dao Palace now, right?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Jiu Luo came to the Third Heaven with him through the white bone field. Later, because of Jiu Luo, Jian Wushuang had some dealings with the people of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect.","“Tam. Although I am not a top-level disciple of the Dao Palace, my status is not bad,” Jiu Luo said with a smile.","“Then you should be able to contact Bai Jue for me, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course. Why? Do you need something from Master Bai Jue?” Jiu Luo asked, puzzled.","“Yes, I need something from him. Give him the message token for me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Wait a moment, then.” Jiu Luo quickly went to find Bai Jue.","Bai Jue was a Principles Master of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. He was also in charge of some matters of the Dao Palace. His status in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect was not low. Jian Wushuang had not had much contact with the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect before. Among the only people he had","interacted with...Bai Jue was the strongest among them.","Before long, Jiu Luo found Bai Jue and handed him the message token.."]},{"number":3399,"title":"Chapter 3399 - Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Haha, my dear Heavenly Marquis, it’s hard to imagine that you would come to me with your current strength and status. What can I do for you?” Bai Jue was very humble and humble.","He always remembered that when Jian Wushuang had just reached the first heaven, he was just a little guy who had just entered the true Saint Realm. Although he was very talented, he thought highly of him, however, he thought that Jian Wushuang would at most have a chance to challenge the","Principles Master.","Unexpectedly, as time passed, Jian Wushuang’s growth rate became more and more astonishing, and his fame in the Divine Beginning Realm also grew. Especially the battle on the Saha Island not long ago, which completely shocked the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","Until now, not to mention an ordinary Principles Master like him, even in the entire Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, no one would dare to underestimate Jian Wushuang at all.","Bai Jue was both delighted and proud that such a peerless genius had taken the initiative to send a message to him.","Obviously, Jian Wushuang remembered him.","“Mr. Bai Jue, I do have something to trouble you with,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Just say it. As long as I can do it, I won’t refuse,” Bai Jue said.","“It’s like this. For some special reasons, I need to go to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect to meet one of the nine ancestors, Spirit Ancestor, and ask her to help me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You want to meet Spirit Ancestor? You need Spirit Ancestor’s help?” Bai Jue was stunned.","“Why? Is there a problem?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, there is.” Bai Jue said in a deep voice, “My dear Heavenly Marquis, you may have heard that Spirit Ancestor is the most cold and difficult person to get along with when the nine ancestors of the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect are present. Sometimes, she is completely unreasonable. With your current","status and status, I’m afraid that no one dares to ignore you. However, Spirit Ancestor doesn’t care who you are. No one can say for sure whether she will see you or not.”","“Tknow, but I have to try anyway,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Well, how about this? I can go to the Spirit Ancestor’s branch for you and see if the Spirit Ancestor is willing to meet you,” Bai Jue said.","“No need.” Jian Wushuang shook his head. “In addition to meeting the Spirit Ancestor, I have to go to the blood ancestor’s branch for some other things. So I’m going to the divine ancestor’s Dao field no matter what. The reason I’m sending you a message now is that I hope you can tell the people of the","blood ancestor’s branch for me. Don’t let me be turned away when I come to see you.”","Jian Wushuang had already been rejected twice, and each time, he had been rejected directly.","But he could not keep fighting his way in, could he?","“That’s easy.” Bai Jue smiled and said, “How about this, my friend, you can come to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect now. I will inform the blood ancestor lineage in advance, and then I will personally lead you to visit the blood clan.”","“Thank you for your help,” Jian Wushuang said gratefully.","After the transmission was cut off, Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo and asked, “Chenhuo, are you interested in following me to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect?”","“Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect?” Demon Master Chenhuo’s expression changed. “It’s said that the nine ancestors of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect are all super experts. When the Amethyst Demon Sect was alive, I had always yearned to fight with one of the nine ancestors, but I never had the chance. Now","that I have the chance, of course, I have to go. It would be even better if I could fight one or two of the nine ancestors in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect.”","“Haha, let’s go then.”","Jian Wushuang laughed heartily and immediately left with Chenhuo.","The three Freedom Alliances of the Divine Beginning Realm were widely recognized as the three overlords of ambition. To a certain extent, even the three Saint Realms were extremely fearful of the three Freedom Alliances.","The three Freedom Alliances’ lairs were also quite special.","For example, the Heaven-cleaving Alliance directly occupied two huge stars as their lairs. Moreover, these two stars were forcefully refined by someone with great methods. They were not born naturally in the Divine Beginning Realm.","The Temporal Temple was synonymous with mystery. No one knew the exact location of their lairs. Even the experts of the Temporal Temple could only rely on special methods to enter their lairs.","As for the appearance of the Heavenly Ancestor, his lair was also very unique. It was located on a floating piece of land outside the Third Heaven.","This piece of land was a huge battlefield. Many years ago, the leader of the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect, the heavenly ancestor, had transferred it from the Cosmic Battlefield. In other words, this piece of land did not belong to the Divine Beginning Realm, it belonged to the vast universe.","Naturally, this land was very different from the other places in the Divine Beginning Realm. The conditions for cultivation were much better than the other places in the Divine Beginning Realm.","The huge floating land was completely covered by a magnificent formation. At the front of the formation, besides many guards standing at the entrance, there were also two figures emitting magnificent auras standing there.","They were both Principles Masters. One of them was Bai Jue, who Jian Wushuang had sent a message to, and the other was Master Ku!","Back in the Blood Wave Realm, countless Immortal Saints fought for the opportunity of the Blood Wave Realm. Master Ku was the strongest Immortal Saint in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. He had also received a Blood Wave Token, from then on, he broke through to become the Principles Master in the","Blood Wave Realm.","“My young friend, the Heavenly Marquis, has already sent me a message. He will arrive soon,” said Bai Jue.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis...” Hearing this name again, Master Ku’s expression was extremely complicated. “Previously in the Blood Wave Realm, this Heavenly Sword Marquis was on equal footing with me. In the beginning, he was even much weaker than me. But now, although he is still an Immortal","Saint, his strength has long surpassed mine. I really don’t know how he cultivated.”","“You don’t have to be discouraged. I heard from your blood clan that you have already opened the heaven and earth secret realm. I’m afraid that it won’t take long for you to complete it. Once you open the heaven and earth secret realm, you will gain another portion of the power of your will. That will be","the ruler of the principles of the second realm of the void. Compared to my little friend, the difference isn’t too big,” Bai Jue said.","“How can it not be too different? Four hundred years ago, on the Saha Island, this Heavenly Sword Marquis could already fight against experts at the four void realms. Now that four hundred years have passed, he must be even stronger.” Master Ku curled his lips.","Beside him, the guards of the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect watched in astonishment as these two leisurely chatted.","They were well aware of their strength and status in the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect.","“Lord Hundred Absolute and Master Ku are standing here at the same time. Clearly, they are waiting for someone. But who is it that made these two lords wait here?” Those guards were extremely curious.","Not long after, two human figures rushed over from the void in front of them."]},{"number":3400,"title":"Chapter 3400 - The Bloodline of the Blood Ancestor","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Coming.”","Bai Jue and Master Ku raised their heads. When they saw the two figures in front of them, they immediately went up to greet them.","“Haha, Heavenly Marqui:","“s good to see you again.” Bai Jue laughed heartily.","“Brother Heavenly Marquis, how have you been?” Master Ku also looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Master Ku?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“My dear Heavenly Marquis, Master Ku happens to be a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. He has also interacted with you in the Blood Wave Realm. Therefore, when I told the experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline about this, the blood ancestor’s bloodline sent him to welcome you,” Bai Jue said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“My young friend, May I know who’s next to you?” Bai Jue glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“He’s my guard,” Jian Wushuang said straightforwardly and did not introduce him too much.","“Guard?” Bai Jue and Master Ku looked at Demon Master Chenhuo seriously. Although the latter did not emit any aura, as an expert, their instincts told them that, they could barely sense the enormous pressure emitted by Demon Master Chenhuo.","The one who could give them such great pressure was undoubtedly a very powerful expert.","“By the way, is the blood ancestor in the Divine Ancestor Dao Field?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The blood ancestor has been wandering in the universe battlefield for years and has not returned for some time. Now, the Master Ancient Wheel is in charge of many matters in the blood ancestor branch. After learning that you are coming to visit the blood ancestor branch, the Master Ancient Wheel has","made preparations. Now, follow me to the blood ancestor branch to see the Master Ancient Wheel,” Master Ku said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo entered the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect under the guidance of Master Ku. They headed toward the location of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. As for Bai Jue, he followed along.","The nine ancestors of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect were one of the nine major sects. Each sect had a place to live in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. The blood ancestor’s bloodline lived in a continuous mountain range with more than ten towering peaks in the middle.","Master Ku led Jian Wushuang to the largest peak.","“Brother Heavenly Marquis, that’s where the blood ancestor lineage usually meets. The Master Ancient Wheel is already waiting inside. Let’s go down,” Master Ku said as he pointed to a towering palace below.","Jian Wushuang nodded and followed Master Ku into the towering palace.","In the palace, all the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor had gathered here, including Master Ku, because they knew that Heavenly Sword Marquis, who was very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm, had come to pay a visit, there were eight Principles Masters in total, led by a middle-aged man","with a handlebar mustache and a green robe.","“Brother Heavenly Marquis, this is the Master Ancient Wheel,” Master Ku introduced.","“Hello, Master Ancient Wheel,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Haha, I’ve long heard that you’re the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm, but I’ve never had the chance to meet you. But today, I’m finally fortunate enough to meet you.” Master Ancient Wheel smiled, but his voice was a bit rough.","“Master Ancient Wheel, you’re too polite. To be honest, I came here today because I promised someone that I would pass some things to an expert of the blood ancestor’s bloodline for him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Oh?” Master Ancient Wheel’s expression changed. “I wonder who the person that you promised is?”","“His name is Xue Bei. If I’m not mistaken, he should also be the Principles Master of your blood ancestor’s bloodline,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Xue Bei?”","“Master Xue Bei?”","In the hall, the Principles Masters of the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline instantly became restless.","“Master Xue Bei, are you saying that the Master Xue Bei asked you to come to our blood ancestor’s bloodline? Have you met Xue Bei?” Master Ancient Wheel was obviously a little anxious.","“Yes, I’ve met him, but I’ve only seen his consciousness. As for his original body, it’s already dead,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Dead?”","Master Ancient Wheel and the others were not surprised by this result.","Many years ago, when they received Xue Bei’s last message, they had guessed that Xue Bei had died. However, they did not know that Xue Bei had left a consciousness behind.","“Xue Bei is one of the top combat strength of our blood ancestor’s lineage. In terms of strength, he has already grasped a total of five portions of the power of will. Even among the principles of the five levels of the void, he can be considered relatively strong, Back then, he even dared to venture into the","universe battlefield alone and even obtained many opportunities from it.","“However, he seemed to have obtained some special fortuitous encounter during his adventure in the universe battlefield, which led to him being targeted. When he returned to the Divine Beginning Realm, he was immediately surrounded and killed by a mysterious expert. He was also killed during that","encirclement. Although my blood ancestor lineage received his distress message at the first moment, because he chose to enter the Divine Beginning Realm from a remote location, he arrived in the endless territory after arriving in the Divine Beginning Realm...”","“The endless territory is too big and far away from the Third Heaven. Even if the Heaven Ancestor Dao Sect sent experts to rescue him as soon as possible, we still couldn’t save him in time,” Master Ancient Wheel sighed.","‘The Principles Masters of the Heaven Ancestor Dao Sect also had ugly expressions on their faces.","Xue Bei’s death was a great loss to the Heaven Ancestor Dao Sect. It was a great loss even to the entire Heaven Ancestor Dao Field.","Jian Wushuang also knew that Xue Bei had indeed obtained a special opportunity in the universe battlefield. He had also discovered a special space-time that was extremely mysterious. Even with Xue Bei’s strength, he could not see much of it, it was very likely that there would be a great opportunity","during the period.","Xue Bei had recorded the location of the special space-time with a star map, and Xue Bei had given the star map to Jian Wushuang on the spot.","After hearing what the Master Ancient Wheel said, Jian Wushuang could not help but guess that it was because of the star map that Xue Bei was targeted and killed.","“Master Ancient Wheel, I did see Xue Bei’s secret realm in the endless territory, and I also saw his consciousness. At the same time, I also got some opportunities from him. As a condition, I promised him to give this interspatial ring to the experts of the blood ancestor lineage.” Jian Wushuang reached out","his hand, he took out an interspatial ring.","This interspatial ring was given to him by Xue Bei. Jian Wushuang had guessed that it was Xue Bei’s life’s accumulation, but he did not take the initiative to look at it.","Even though he could easily break the seal Xue Bei left in the interspatial ring with his current strength, Jian Wushuang did not break the seal. After all...the interspatial ring was left by Xue Bei to the blood ancestor bloodline. Jian Wushuang did not have the slightest intention of coveting it.","Even if there was a world-shaking supreme treasure inside, he would not be tempted.."]}]);
